#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:24
msgid ""
"You want to make a self-contained libguestfs appliance that can be copied to "
"another machine or platform that doesn't support L<supermin(1)>."
msgstr ""
"Vēlaties izveidot pašpietiekamu libguestfs palīgsistēmu, ko var nokopēt uz "
"citu datoru vai platformu, kas neatbalsta L<supermin(1)>."

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:30
msgid ""
"You have multiple users on the same machine and want to avoid the storage "
"duplication and start-up overhead of having multiple cached copies of the "
"appliance."
msgstr ""
"Vienā datorā ir vairāki lietotāji, un vēlaties izvairīties no krātuves "
"dublēšanās un palaišanas papildslodzes, ko rada vairākas kešotas "
"palīgsistēmas kopijas."

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:36
msgid ""
"You want to have very predictable performance from libguestfs (see "
"L<guestfs-performance(1)>)."
msgstr ""
"Vēlaties ļoti paredzamu libguestfs veiktspēju (skatiet L<guestfs-performance"
"(1)>)."

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:41
msgid ""
"For deeper understanding of why you might need this tool, read "
"L<guestfs-internals(1)/FIXED APPLIANCE>."
msgstr ""
"Lai dziļāk saprastu, kāpēc šis rīks varētu būt vajadzīgs, lasiet L<guestfs-"
"internals(1)/FIKSĒTA PALĪGSISTĒMA>."

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:44
msgid ""
"Instead of running this tool, you can download fixed appliances from "
"L<http://libguestfs.org/download/binaries/appliance/>.  These appliances "
"were made using this tool."
msgstr ""
"Šī rīka izpildes vietā fiksētas palīgsistēmas var lejupielādēt no L<http://"
"libguestfs.org/download/binaries/appliance/>.  Šīs palīgsistēmas tika "
"izveidotas ar šo rīku."

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:48
msgid "There are two ways to use this tool."
msgstr "Šo rīku var izmantot divos veidos."

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:54
msgid "Specify an output directory, for example:"
msgstr "Norādiet izvades direktoriju, piemēram:"

#. type: verbatim
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance /usr/local/lib/guestfs/appliance\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance /usr/local/lib/guestfs/appliance\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:58
msgid ""
"The output directory is created if it does not exist.  Four files are "
"created in this directory:"
msgstr ""
"Izvades direktorija tiek izveidota, ja tā neeksistē.  Šajā direktorijā tiek "
"izveidoti četri faili:"

#. type: verbatim
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:61
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" <OUTPUTDIR>/kernel\n"
" <OUTPUTDIR>/initrd\n"
" <OUTPUTDIR>/root\n"
" <OUTPUTDIR>/README.fixed\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" <OUTPUTDIR>/kernel\n"
" <OUTPUTDIR>/initrd\n"
" <OUTPUTDIR>/root\n"
" <OUTPUTDIR>/README.fixed\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:66
msgid ""
"Note that C<I<OUTPUTDIR>/root> is a sparse file, so take care when copying "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Ņemiet vērā, ka C<I<OUTPUTDIR>/root> ir retināts fails, tāpēc kopējiet to "
"uzmanīgi."

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:69
msgid ""
"You can then run libguestfs (possibly after copying this directory to "
"another machine) by setting the environment variable LIBGUESTFS_PATH to "
"C<OUTPUTDIR>."
msgstr ""
"Pēc tam libguestfs var izpildīt (iespējams, pēc šīs direktorijas nokopēšanas "
"uz citu datoru), iestatot vides mainīgo LIBGUESTFS_PATH uz C<OUTPUTDIR>."

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:75
msgid ""
"The alternative method is to use the I<--xz> option to create a compressed "
"tarball:"
msgstr ""
"Alternatīvā metode ir izmantot opciju I<--xz>, lai izveidotu saspiestu tar "
"arhīvu:"

#. type: verbatim
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:78
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance --xz\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance --xz\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:80
msgid "This creates a tarball in the I<current> directory called:"
msgstr "Tas izveido tar arhīvu I<pašreizējā> direktorijā ar nosaukumu:"

#. type: verbatim
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:82
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" appliance-<VERSION>.tar.xz\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" appliance-<VERSION>.tar.xz\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:84
msgid ""
"(where C<VERSION> is the version of libguestfs).  The tarball contains the "
"four files:"
msgstr "(kur C<VERSION> ir libguestfs versija).  Tar arhīvā ir četri faili:"

#. type: verbatim
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:87
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" appliance/kernel\n"
" appliance/initrd\n"
" appliance/root\n"
" appliance/README.fixed\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" appliance/kernel\n"
" appliance/initrd\n"
" appliance/root\n"
" appliance/README.fixed\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:92
msgid "Note that C<appliance/root> is a sparse file, so take care when copying it."
msgstr ""
"Ņemiet vērā, ka C<appliance/root> ir retināts fails, tāpēc kopējiet to "
"uzmanīgi."

#. type: =head1
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:97 daemon/guestfsd.pod:43
#: fish/guestfish.pod:145 fish/virt-copy-in.pod:37 fish/virt-copy-out.pod:32
#: fish/virt-tar-in.pod:34 fish/virt-tar-out.pod:34 fuse/guestmount.pod:156
#: fuse/guestunmount.pod:70 rescue/virt-rescue.pod:86
#: test-tool/libguestfs-test-tool.pod:34
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr "OPCIJAS"

#. type: =item
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:101 daemon/guestfsd.pod:49
#: fish/guestfish.pod:149 fuse/guestmount.pod:239 fuse/guestunmount.pod:79
#: rescue/virt-rescue.pod:90 test-tool/libguestfs-test-tool.pod:38
msgid "B<--help>"
msgstr "B<--help>"

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:103
#: test-tool/libguestfs-test-tool.pod:40
msgid "Display short usage information and exit."
msgstr "Parādīt īsu lietošanas informāciju un iziet."

#. type: =item
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:105 fish/guestfish.pod:417
#: fuse/guestmount.pod:372 fuse/guestunmount.pod:105 rescue/virt-rescue.pod:277
#: test-tool/libguestfs-test-tool.pod:59
msgid "B<-V>"
msgstr "B<-V>"

#. type: =item
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:107 fish/guestfish.pod:419
#: fuse/guestmount.pod:374 fuse/guestunmount.pod:107 rescue/virt-rescue.pod:279
#: test-tool/libguestfs-test-tool.pod:61
msgid "B<--version>"
msgstr "B<--version>"

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:109
msgid "Display the version number and exit."
msgstr "Parādīt versijas numuru un iziet."

#. type: =item
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:111
msgid "B<--xz>"
msgstr "B<--xz>"

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:113
msgid ""
"Instead of creating the appliance in an output directory, create a "
"compressed tarball of the appliance in the current directory called "
"F<appliance-I<VERSION>.tar.xz> where C<VERSION> is the version of "
"libguestfs."
msgstr ""
"Palīgsistēmas izveides izvades direktorijā vietā izveidot saspiestu "
"palīgsistēmas tar arhīvu pašreizējā direktorijā ar nosaukumu F<appliance-"
"I<VERSION>.tar.xz>, kur C<VERSION> ir libguestfs versija."

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:118
msgid ""
"Using I<--xz> can take some time.  If working normally, the tool is "
"completely silent when it is running."
msgstr ""
"I<--xz> izmantošana var aizņemt kādu laiku.  Ja viss notiek normāli, rīks "
"darbības laikā ir pilnīgi kluss."

#. type: =head1
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:123
msgid "LICENSING"
msgstr "LICENCĒŠANA"

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:125
msgid ""
"The fixed appliance is a complete Linux binary distro.  If you distribute "
"it, you may need to distribute corresponding source files to remain in legal "
"compliance with the licenses of the software in the appliance (such as the "
"GNU General Public License)."
msgstr ""
"Fiksētā palīgsistēma ir pilna Linux bināra distribūcija.  Ja to izplatāt, "
"iespējams, būs jāizplata atbilstošie pirmkoda faili, lai ievērotu "
"palīgsistēmā esošās programmatūras licences (piemēram, GNU General Public "
"License)."

#. type: =head1
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:130 daemon/guestfsd.pod:99
#: fish/guestfish.pod:1373 fuse/guestmount.pod:417 fuse/guestunmount.pod:124
#: test-tool/libguestfs-test-tool.pod:168
msgid "EXIT STATUS"
msgstr "IZEJAS STATUSS"

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:132
msgid ""
"libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance returns I<0> if the appliance was built "
"without errors."
msgstr ""
"libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance atgriež I<0>, ja palīgsistēma uzbūvēta bez "
"kļūdām."

#. type: =head1
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:135 fish/guestfish.pod:1378
#: fuse/guestunmount.pod:113 lib/guestfs.pod:3101 rescue/virt-rescue.pod:472
#: test-tool/libguestfs-test-tool.pod:173
msgid "ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES"
msgstr "VIDES MAINĪGIE"

#. type: textblock
#: appliance/libguestfs-make-fixed-appliance.pod:137
#: test-tool/libguestfs-test-tool.pod:175
msgid ""
"For the full list of environment variables which may affect libguestfs, "
"please see the L<guestfs(3)> manual page."
msgstr ""
"Pilnu to vides mainīgo sarakstu, kas var ietekmēt libguestfs, skatiet "
"L<guestfs(3)> rokasgrāmatas lapā."

