#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:837
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.32.pod:501
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.34.pod:726
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:555
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.38.pod:609
