msgid "AUTHOR"
msgstr "AUTORS"

#. type: textblock
#: daemon/guestfsd.pod:150 rescue/virt-rescue.pod:508
msgid "Richard W.M. Jones L<http://people.redhat.com/~rjones/>"
msgstr "Richard W.M. Jones L<http://people.redhat.com/~rjones/>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:3
msgid "guestfs-building - How to build libguestfs from source"
msgstr "guestfs-building - kā uzbūvēt libguestfs no pirmkoda"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:7
msgid "This manual page describes how to build libguestfs from source."
msgstr "Šajā rokasgrāmatas lapā aprakstīts, kā uzbūvēt libguestfs no pirmkoda."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:9
msgid "The main steps are:"
msgstr "Galvenie soļi ir:"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:15
msgid "Install the requirements."
msgstr "Instalēt prasības."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:19
msgid "Build, either from the git repository or from a tarball."
msgstr "Uzbūvēt — vai nu no git repozitorija, vai no tar arhīva."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:23
msgid "Run the tests."
msgstr "Izpildīt testus."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:27
msgid "Run the tools from the source directory, or install."
msgstr "Izpildīt rīkus no pirmkoda direktorijas vai instalēt."

#. type: =head1
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:31
msgid "REQUIREMENTS"
msgstr "PRASĪBAS"

#. type: =head2
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:33
msgid "Short cut for Fedora or Red Hat Enterprise Linux (RHEL) users"
msgstr "Īsceļš Fedora vai Red Hat Enterprise Linux (RHEL) lietotājiem"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:35
msgid "On Fedora, use L<dnf(8)> to install all the requirements:"
msgstr "Fedorā visu prasību instalēšanai izmantojiet L<dnf(8)>:"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:37
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" dnf builddep libguestfs\n"
" dnf install autoconf automake libtool gettext-devel\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" dnf builddep libguestfs\n"
" dnf install autoconf automake libtool gettext-devel\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:40
msgid "On systems still using L<yum(8)>, do:"
msgstr "Sistēmās, kas joprojām izmanto L<yum(8)>, izpildiet:"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" yum-builddep libguestfs\n"
" yum install autoconf automake libtool gettext-devel\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" yum-builddep libguestfs\n"
" yum install autoconf automake libtool gettext-devel\n"
"\n"

#. type: =head2
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:45
msgid "Short cut for Debian or Ubuntu users"
msgstr "Īsceļš Debian vai Ubuntu lietotājiem"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:47
msgid "Use APT to install all the requirements:"
msgstr "Visu prasību instalēšanai izmantojiet APT:"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" apt-get build-dep libguestfs\n"
" apt-get install autoconf automake libtool-bin gettext\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" apt-get build-dep libguestfs\n"
" apt-get install autoconf automake libtool-bin gettext\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:52
msgid ""
"If that command doesn't work, take a look at the Debian source package "
"L<http://packages.debian.org/source/libguestfs>, at the list of "
"C<build-depends> and C<build-depends-indep>, and install everything listed "
"there."
msgstr ""
"Ja šī komanda nedarbojas, apskatiet Debian pirmkoda pakotni L<http://"
"packages.debian.org/source/libguestfs>, tās C<build-depends> un C<build-"
"depends-indep> sarakstu un instalējiet visu tur uzskaitīto."

#. type: =head2
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:57
msgid "Full list of requirements"
msgstr "Pilns prasību saraksts"

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:61
msgid "F<appliance/packagelist.in>"
msgstr "F<appliance/packagelist.in>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:63
msgid ""
"Install as many package names found in this file as possible.  (It is not "
"strictly required to install all of them)."
msgstr ""
"Instalējiet pēc iespējas vairāk šajā failā atrodamo pakotņu nosaukumu.  "
"(Stingri ņemot, visas instalēt nav obligāti.)"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:66
msgid ""
"I<Note>: If you build libguestfs followed by installing appliance packages, "
"the build will not pick them up automatically, even if you do S<C<make "
"clean>>.  You have to do this command to clean the old supermin appliance "
"and force a new one to be prepared:"
msgstr ""
"I<Piezīme>: ja uzbūvējat libguestfs un pēc tam instalējat palīgsistēmas "
"pakotnes, būvēšana tās automātiski neuztvers, pat ja izpildāt S<C<make "
"clean>>.  Jāizpilda šī komanda, lai iztīrītu veco supermin palīgsistēmu un "
"piespiestu sagatavot jaunu:"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:71
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" make -C appliance clean-supermin-appliance\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" make -C appliance clean-supermin-appliance\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:73
msgid "qemu E<ge> 7.2.0"
msgstr "qemu E<ge> 7.2.0"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:75 docs/guestfs-building.pod:79
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:121 docs/guestfs-building.pod:134
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:138 docs/guestfs-building.pod:142
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:146 docs/guestfs-building.pod:154
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:158 docs/guestfs-building.pod:162
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:171 docs/guestfs-building.pod:175
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:179
msgid "I<Required>."
msgstr "I<Obligāts>."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:77
msgid "qemu-img E<ge> 7.2.0"
msgstr "qemu-img E<ge> 7.2.0"

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:81
msgid "kernel E<ge> 2.6.34"
msgstr "kernel E<ge> 2.6.34"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:83
msgid ""
"I<Required>.  The following features must be enabled: C<virtio-pci>, "
"C<virtio-serial>, C<virtio-block>, C<virtio-net>."
msgstr ""
"I<Obligāts>.  Jābūt iespējotiem šādiem līdzekļiem: C<virtio-pci>, C<virtio-"
"serial>, C<virtio-block>, C<virtio-net>."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:86
msgid "supermin E<ge> 5.1.18"
msgstr "supermin E<ge> 5.1.18"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:88
msgid ""
"I<Required>.  For alternatives, see L</USING A PREBUILT BINARY APPLIANCE> "
"below."
msgstr ""
"I<Obligāts>.  Alternatīvas skatiet L</IEPRIEKŠ UZBŪVĒTAS BINĀRĀS "
"PALĪGSISTĒMAS IZMANTOŠANA> tālāk."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:91
msgid "XDR (tirpc, glibc or other)"
msgstr "XDR (tirpc, glibc vai cits)"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:93
msgid ""
"I<Required>.  We use the XDR implementation from C<E<lt>rpc/xdr.hE<gt>>, "
"which may come from glibc, tirpc or another library."
msgstr ""
"I<Obligāts>.  Mēs izmantojam XDR realizāciju no C<E<lt>rpc/xdr.hE<gt>>, kas "
"var nākt no glibc, tirpc vai citas bibliotēkas."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:97
msgid ""
"The C<rpcgen> tool is optional, except if you want to compile from git "
"and/or patch libguestfs with new APIs."
msgstr ""
"Rīks C<rpcgen> nav obligāts, izņemot gadījumu, ja vēlaties kompilēt no git "
"un/vai ielāpot libguestfs ar jaunām API."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:100
msgid "Gcc or Clang"
msgstr "Gcc vai Clang"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:102
msgid ""
"I<Required>.  We use C<__attribute__((cleanup))> which is a GCC extension "
"also supported by Clang."
msgstr ""
"I<Obligāts>.  Mēs izmantojam C<__attribute__((cleanup))>, kas ir GCC "
"paplašinājums, ko atbalsta arī Clang."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:105
msgid "Perl"
msgstr "Perl"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:107
msgid ""
"I<Required>.  Various build steps and tests are written in Perl.  Perl is "
"not needed at runtime except if you need to run a small number of virt tools "
"which are still written in Perl."
msgstr ""
"I<Obligāts>.  Dažādi būvēšanas soļi un testi ir rakstīti Perl.  Izpildlaikā "
"Perl nav vajadzīgs, izņemot gadījumu, ja jāizpilda daži virt rīki, kas "
"joprojām rakstīti Perl."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:111
msgid "Perl C<Pod::Man>"
msgstr "Perl C<Pod::Man>"

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:113
msgid "Perl C<Pod::Simple>"
msgstr "Perl C<Pod::Simple>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:115
msgid "I<Required>.  Part of Perl core."
msgstr "I<Obligāts>.  Daļa no Perl kodola."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:117
msgid "OCaml E<ge> 4.08"
msgstr "OCaml E<ge> 4.08"

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:119
msgid "OCaml findlib"
msgstr "OCaml findlib"

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:123
msgid "autoconf"
msgstr "autoconf"

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:125
msgid "automake"
msgstr "automake"

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:127
msgid "gettext"
msgstr "gettext"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:129 docs/guestfs-building.pod:183
msgid "I<Required> if compiling from git.  Optional if compiling from tarball."
msgstr "I<Obligāts>, ja kompilē no git.  Neobligāts, ja kompilē no tar arhīva."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:132
msgid "cpio"
msgstr "cpio"

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:136
msgid "gperf"
msgstr "gperf"

#. type: =head2
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:140 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7999
msgid "realpath"
msgstr "realpath"

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-building.pod:144
