msgid "For libguestfs E<lt> 1.26, after installing libguestfs you need to do:"
msgstr "Libguestfs E<lt> 1.26 pēc libguestfs instalēšanas jāizpilda:"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-faq.pod:287
