"sektoru):"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/guestfs-recipes.pod:497
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" guestfish --rw -a disk.img run : hexedit /dev/sda 0x200\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" guestfish --rw -a disk.img run : hexedit /dev/sda 0x200\n"
"\n"

#. type: =head1
#: docs/guestfs-recipes.pod:499
msgid "Install packages (RPMs, Debian packages) in a guest"
msgstr "Pakotņu (RPM, Debian pakotņu) instalēšana viesī"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-recipes.pod:501
msgid ""
"Since libguestfs 1.26, L<virt-builder(1)>, L<virt-customize(1)> and "
"L<virt-sysprep(1)> have an I<--install> option for installing packages in "
"Linux guests.  (Use virt-customize if you have an existing guest, or "
"virt-builder if you want to create a guest from scratch)."
msgstr ""
"Kopš libguestfs 1.26 L<virt-builder(1)>, L<virt-customize(1)> un L<virt-"
"sysprep(1)> ir opcija I<--install> pakotņu instalēšanai Linux viesos.  "
"(Izmantojiet virt-customize, ja jums ir esošs viesis, vai virt-builder, ja "
"vēlaties izveidot viesi no nulles.)"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/guestfs-recipes.pod:508
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" virt-builder fedora-20 --install emacs\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" virt-builder fedora-20 --install emacs\n"
"\n"

#. type: =head1
#: docs/guestfs-recipes.pod:510
msgid "Install packages from an alternate repository"
msgstr "Pakotņu instalēšana no alternatīva repozitorija"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-recipes.pod:512
msgid ""
"Since libguestfs 1.26, you can use L<virt-builder(1)>, L<virt-customize(1)> "
"or L<virt-sysprep(1)> I<--edit> option to edit repository metadata before "
"installing packages"
msgstr ""
"Kopš libguestfs 1.26 varat izmantot L<virt-builder(1)>, L<virt-customize(1)> "
"vai L<virt-sysprep(1)> opciju I<--edit>, lai pirms pakotņu instalēšanas "
"rediģētu repozitorija metadatus"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-recipes.pod:516
msgid ""
"For example this would install packages from the updates-testing repository "
"in Fedora:"
msgstr ""
"Piemēram, šis instalētu pakotnes no Fedora repozitorija updates-testing:"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/guestfs-recipes.pod:519
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" virt-builder fedora-20 \\\n"
"   --edit '/etc/yum.repos.d/fedora-updates-testing.repo:\n"
"             s/enabled=0/enabled=1/' \\\n"
"   --install emacs\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" virt-builder fedora-20 \\\n"
"   --edit '/etc/yum.repos.d/fedora-updates-testing.repo:\n"
"             s/enabled=0/enabled=1/' \\\n"
"   --install emacs\n"
"\n"

#. type: =head1
#: docs/guestfs-recipes.pod:524
msgid "Install SYSLINUX bootloader in a guest"
msgstr "SYSLINUX sāknēšanas ielādētāja instalēšana viesī"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-recipes.pod:526
msgid ""
"SYSLINUX is a small, easy to configure bootloader for Linux and Windows "
"guests.  If your guest is not bootable, you can install the SYSLINUX "
"bootloader using either the guestfish commands C<syslinux> (for FAT-based "
"guests) or C<extlinux> (for ext2/3/4 and btrfs-based guests)."
msgstr ""
"SYSLINUX ir neliels, viegli konfigurējams sāknēšanas ielādētājs Linux un "
"Windows viesiem.  Ja jūsu viesis nav sāknējams, SYSLINUX sāknēšanas "
"ielādētāju var instalēt ar guestfish komandām C<syslinux> (viesiem ar FAT) "
"vai C<extlinux> (viesiem ar ext2/3/4 un btrfs)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-recipes.pod:532
msgid ""
"This guide assumes a Linux guest where F</dev/sda1> is F</boot>, "
"F</boot/vmlinuz> is the guest kernel, and F</dev/sda3> is the root "
"partition.  For a Windows guest you would need a FAT-formatted boot "
"partition and you would need to use the C<syslinux> command instead."
msgstr ""
"Šis ceļvedis pieņem Linux viesi, kurā F</dev/sda1> ir F</boot>, F</boot/"
"vmlinuz> ir viesa kodols un F</dev/sda3> ir saknes nodalījums.  Windows "
"viesim būtu vajadzīgs FAT formatēts sāknēšanas nodalījums un tā vietā būtu "
"jāizmanto komanda C<syslinux>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-recipes.pod:537
msgid ""
"Create a F<syslinux.cfg> configuration file.  You should check the SYSLINUX "
"documentation at L<http://www.syslinux.org> but it may look something like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"Izveidojiet konfigurācijas failu F<syslinux.cfg>.  Jums vajadzētu pārbaudīt "
"SYSLINUX dokumentāciju L<http://www.syslinux.org>, taču tas var izskatīties "
"apmēram šādi:"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/guestfs-recipes.pod:541
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" DEFAULT linux\n"
" LABEL linux\n"
"   SAY Booting the kernel\n"
"   KERNEL vmlinuz\n"
"   INITRD initrd\n"
"   APPEND ro root=/dev/sda3\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" DEFAULT linux\n"
" LABEL linux\n"
"   SAY Booting the kernel\n"
"   KERNEL vmlinuz\n"
"   INITRD initrd\n"
"   APPEND ro root=/dev/sda3\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-recipes.pod:548
msgid ""
"Locate the syslinux master boot record (a file called something like "
"F</usr/share/syslinux/mbr.bin>)."
msgstr ""
"Atrodiet syslinux galveno sāknēšanas ierakstu (failu ar nosaukumu, piemēram, "
"F</usr/share/syslinux/mbr.bin>)."

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/guestfs-recipes.pod:551
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" guestfish -a disk.img -i\n"
" # Upload the master boot record and configuration file:\n"
" ><fs> upload ..../mbr.bin /boot/mbr.bin\n"
" ><fs> upload ..../syslinux.cfg /boot/syslinux.cfg\n"
" # Put the MBR into the boot sector:\n"
" ><fs> copy-file-to-device /boot/mbr.bin /dev/sda size:440\n"
" # Install syslinux on the first partition:\n"
" ><fs> extlinux /boot\n"
" # Set the first partition as bootable:\n"
" ><fs> part-set-bootable /dev/sda 1 true\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" guestfish -a disk.img -i\n"
" # Upload the master boot record and configuration file:\n"
" ><fs> upload ..../mbr.bin /boot/mbr.bin\n"
" ><fs> upload ..../syslinux.cfg /boot/syslinux.cfg\n"
" # Put the MBR into the boot sector:\n"
" ><fs> copy-file-to-device /boot/mbr.bin /dev/sda size:440\n"
" # Install syslinux on the first partition:\n"
" ><fs> extlinux /boot\n"
" # Set the first partition as bootable:\n"
" ><fs> part-set-bootable /dev/sda 1 true\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-recipes.pod:562
msgid ""
"See also: "
"L<http://rwmj.wordpress.com/2013/04/04/new-in-libguestfs-use-syslinux-or-extlinux-to-make-bootable-guests/#content>"
msgstr ""
"Skatīt arī: L<http://rwmj.wordpress.com/2013/04/04/new-in-libguestfs-use-"
"syslinux-or-extlinux-to-make-bootable-guests/#content>"

