#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:159
msgid ""
"The febootstrap tool has now been renamed to \"supermin\".  Libguestfs can "
"use either, but now prefers \"supermin\".  "
"L<http://people.redhat.com/~rjones/supermin/>"
msgstr ""
"Rīks febootstrap tagad ir pārdēvēts par „supermin”.  Libguestfs var izmantot "
"jebkuru, bet tagad dod priekšroku „supermin”.  L<http://people.redhat.com/"
"~rjones/supermin/>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:163
msgid "libxml2 is required to build libguestfs."
msgstr "Libguestfs būvēšanai nepieciešams libxml2."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:165
msgid "The hivexregedit program (from hivex) is required to build from git."
msgstr "Būvēšanai no git nepieciešama programma hivexregedit (no hivex)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:167
msgid ""
"Internal functions can no longer be used unless the caller defines "
"C<-DGUESTFS_PRIVATE=1>."
msgstr ""
"Iekšējās funkcijas vairs nevar izmantot, ja vien izsaucējs nedefinē C<-"
"DGUESTFS_PRIVATE=1>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:170
msgid "Enable C compiler warnings in Python, Ruby bindings."
msgstr "Iespējoti C kompilatora brīdinājumi Python, Ruby saistījumos."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:172
msgid ""
"Fail early and clearly if libvirt does not support qemu/KVM (eg. if default "
"libvirt connection is to Xen)."
msgstr ""
"Neizdoties agri un skaidri, ja libvirt neatbalsta qemu/KVM (piem., ja "
"noklusējuma libvirt savienojums ir ar Xen)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:175
msgid "C<make print-subdirs> rule, useful for selectively running tests."
msgstr "Kārtula C<make print-subdirs>, noderīga testu selektīvai izpildei."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:177
msgid "Multiple fixes to allow separated (sourcedir != builddir) builds."
msgstr "Vairāki labojumi, lai atļautu atdalītas (sourcedir != builddir) būves."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:179
msgid "Multiple fixes to Haskell bindings."
msgstr "Vairāki labojumi Haskell saistījumos."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:181
msgid "C<ln> and C<ln-f> APIs now capture C<errno> correctly."
msgstr "API C<ln> un C<ln-f> tagad pareizi tver C<errno>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:183
msgid ""
"Language binding tests use (mostly) a standard numbering scheme and aim to "
"test the same range of features in each language.  Also the number of "
"launches required has been reduced so these tests should run much more "
"quickly."
msgstr ""
"Valodu saistījumu testi izmanto (pārsvarā) standarta numerācijas shēmu, un "
"to mērķis ir testēt vienu un to pašu līdzekļu klāstu katrā valodā.  Turklāt "
"ir samazināts nepieciešamo palaišanu skaits, tāpēc šiem testiem vajadzētu "
"izpildīties daudz ātrāk."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:188
msgid ""
"Library code internally uses GCC C<__attribute__((cleanup))> (if available) "
"to simplify memory allocation."
msgstr ""
"Bibliotēkas kods iekšēji izmanto GCC C<__attribute__((cleanup))> (ja "
"pieejams), lai vienkāršotu atmiņas piešķiršanu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:191
msgid ""
"Internal header files have been reorganized.  See the comments in "
"F<src/guestfs-internal*.h>"
msgstr ""
"Iekšējie galvenes faili ir pārkārtoti.  Skatiet komentārus F<src/guestfs-"
"internal*.h>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:194
msgid ""
"Internal code shared between the library and certain tools is now located in "
"a static C<libutils> library."
msgstr ""
"Iekšējais kods, kas tiek koplietots starp bibliotēku un dažiem rīkiem, tagad "
"atrodas statiskā bibliotēkā C<libutils>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:197
msgid ""
"Almost all subdirectories can now use parallel builds, although note that "
"the top-level directories still build in series."
msgstr ""
"Gandrīz visas apakšdirektorijas tagad var izmantot paralēlu būvēšanu, lai "
"gan ņemiet vērā, ka augšējā līmeņa direktorijas joprojām tiek būvētas secīgi."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:200
msgid "Use of C<PATH_MAX> and C<NAME_MAX> has been eliminated from the code."
msgstr "No koda ir izslēgta C<PATH_MAX> un C<NAME_MAX> izmantošana."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:202
msgid "The Java API now requires JVM E<ge> 1.6."
msgstr "Java API tagad nepieciešams JVM E<ge> 1.6."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:204
msgid "Force use of C<serial-tests> with automake E<ge> 1.12."
msgstr "Ar automake E<ge> 1.12 tiek piespiedu kārtā izmantoti C<serial-tests>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:206
msgid ""
"Use of sockets in the library protocol layer is abstracted, allowing other "
"non-POSIX layers to be added in future (see F<src/conn-socket.c>)."
msgstr ""
"Ligzdu izmantošana bibliotēkas protokola slānī ir abstrahēta, ļaujot nākotnē "
"pievienot citus, ne-POSIX slāņus (skatiet F<src/conn-socket.c>)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:210
msgid ""
"C<qemu-img info --output json> is used if available, for more secure parsing "
"of the output of this command."
msgstr ""
"Ja pieejams, tiek izmantots C<qemu-img info --output json> šīs komandas "
"izvades drošākai parsēšanai."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:213
msgid ""
"Distros can now use C<make INSTALLDIRS=vendor install> to place Ruby "
"bindings in vendordir.  This eliminates a non-upstream patch carried by both "
"Fedora and Debian."
msgstr ""
"Distribūcijas tagad var izmantot C<make INSTALLDIRS=vendor install>, lai "
"ievietotu Ruby saistījumus vendordir.  Tas novērš ne-augšteces ielāpu, ko "
"uzturēja gan Fedora, gan Debian."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:217
msgid "Valgrind log files are now written to F<tmp/valgrind-I<DATE>-I<PID>.log>"
msgstr ""
"Valgrind žurnālu faili tagad tiek rakstīti F<tmp/valgrind-I<DATE>-I<PID>.log>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:219
msgid "C<make clean> cleans the local C<tmp/> directory."
msgstr "C<make clean> iztīra lokālo direktoriju C<tmp/>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.22.pod:221
msgid ""
"The C API tests have been rewritten using a more flexible generator language "
"that allows arbitrary C code to be executing during tests."
msgstr ""
"C API testi ir pārrakstīti, izmantojot elastīgāku ģeneratora valodu, kas "
"ļauj testu laikā izpildīt patvaļīgu C kodu."

