#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.24.pod:155
msgid ""
"New C<make check-*> rules replace C<make extra-tests>.  See C<make help> and "
"L<guestfs(3)> for details."
msgstr ""
"Jaunas kārtulas C<make check-*> aizstāj C<make extra-tests>.  Sīkāk skatiet "
"C<make help> un L<guestfs(3)>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.24.pod:158
msgid "Perl code can now be valgrinded."
msgstr "Perl kodu tagad var pārbaudīt ar valgrind."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.24.pod:160
msgid "Inspection code is now fuzz-tested."
msgstr "Inspicēšanas kods tagad tiek testēts ar nejaušiem datiem (fuzz)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.24.pod:162
msgid ""
"C<make> no longer recurses into the generator directory in every other "
"directory.  This reduces the overhead of builds considerably."
msgstr ""
"C<make> vairs neiedziļinās ģeneratora direktorijā katrā citā direktorijā.  "
"Tas ievērojami samazina būvēšanas papildizmaksas."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.24.pod:165
msgid "Additional tests for Augeas, hivex."
msgstr "Papildu testi Augeas, hivex."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.24.pod:167
msgid "Add a launch timeout of 20 minutes waiting for the appliance to start up."
msgstr ""
"Pievienota 20 minūšu palaišanas noildze, gaidot palīgsistēmas startēšanu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.24.pod:170
msgid ""
"Add a timeout (4 hours) to all tests so we can catch the case where qemu or "
"other components hang."
msgstr ""
"Visiem testiem pievienota noildze (4 stundas), lai varētu notvert gadījumu, "
"kad qemu vai citi komponenti uzkaras."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.24.pod:173
msgid ""
"Use kvmclock and C<-cpu host>.  This improves clock stability and overall "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"Izmanto kvmclock un C<-cpu host>.  Tas uzlabo pulksteņa stabilitāti un "
"kopējo veiktspēju."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.24.pod:176
msgid "C<./configure --enable-packet-dump> mode is fixed."
msgstr "Režīms C<./configure --enable-packet-dump> ir izlabots."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.24.pod:178
msgid ""
"C<./configure --enable-valgrind-daemon> mode has been rewritten.  It is now "
"feasible for developers to keep this flag enabled at all times."
msgstr ""
"Režīms C<./configure --enable-valgrind-daemon> ir pārrakstīts.  Tagad "
"izstrādātājiem ir iespējams šo karogu turēt iespējotu visu laiku."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.24.pod:181
msgid ""
"Backends have been refactored to be modular (although they are not actually "
"loadable modules)."
msgstr ""
"Aizmugursistēmas ir pārveidotas, lai būtu modulāras (lai gan tās faktiski "
"nav ielādējami moduļi)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.24.pod:184
msgid ""
"When enabled, the network now uses resolver configuration "
"(ie. /etc/resolv.conf) from the host."
msgstr ""
"Kad iespējots, tīkls tagad izmanto resursdatora atrisinātāja konfigurāciju "
"(t. i., /etc/resolv.conf)."

