#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.26.pod:180
msgid "The following extra packages are required to build libguestfs 1.26:"
msgstr "Libguestfs 1.26 būvēšanai nepieciešamas šīs papildu pakotnes:"

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.26.pod:184
msgid "supermin E<ge> 5"
msgstr "supermin E<ge> 5"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.26.pod:186
msgid "Supermin version 5 is required to build this version of libguestfs."
msgstr "Šīs libguestfs versijas būvēšanai nepieciešama supermin 5. versija."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.26.pod:188
msgid "flex, bison"
msgstr "flex, bison"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.26.pod:190
msgid ""
"Virt-builder now uses a real parser to parse its metadata file, so these "
"tools are required."
msgstr ""
"Virt-builder tagad izmanto īstu parsētāju metadatu faila parsēšanai, tāpēc "
"šie rīki ir nepieciešami."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.26.pod:195
msgid ""
"This is now a required build dependency, where previously it was (in theory) "
"optional."
msgstr ""
"Tagad šī ir obligāta būvēšanas atkarība, lai gan iepriekš tā bija "
"(teorētiski) neobligāta."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.26.pod:202
msgid "PO message extraction rewritten to be more robust.  (Pino Toscano)"
msgstr "PO ziņojumu izgūšana pārrakstīta, lai būtu robustāka.  (Pino Toscano)"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.26.pod:205
msgid ""
"C<podwrapper> gives an error if the I<--insert> or I<--verbatim> argument "
"pattern is not found."
msgstr ""
"C<podwrapper> dod kļūdu, ja argumenta I<--insert> vai I<--verbatim> šablons "
"netiek atrasts."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.26.pod:208
msgid ""
"Libguestfs now passes the qemu I<-enable-fips> option to enable FIPS, if "
"qemu supports it."
msgstr ""
"Libguestfs tagad nodod qemu opciju I<-enable-fips>, lai iespējotu FIPS, ja "
"qemu to atbalsta."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.26.pod:211
msgid ""
"C<./configure --without-qemu> can be used if you don't want to specify a "
"default hypervisor."
msgstr ""
"C<./configure --without-qemu> var izmantot, ja nevēlaties norādīt "
"noklusējuma hipervizoru."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.26.pod:214
msgid ""
"Copy-on-write [COW] overlays, used for example for read-only drives, are now "
"created through an internal backend API (C<.create_cow_overlay>)."
msgstr ""
"Kopēšanas-rakstīšanas [COW] pārklājumi, ko izmanto, piemēram, tikai lasāmiem "
"diskiem, tagad tiek veidoti caur iekšēju aizmugursistēmas API "
"(C<.create_cow_overlay>)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.26.pod:217
msgid ""
"Libvirt backend uses some funky C macros to generate XML.  These are simpler "
"and safer."
msgstr ""
"Libvirt aizmugursistēma izmanto dažus jocīgus C makro XML ģenerēšanai.  Tie "
"ir vienkāršāki un drošāki."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.26.pod:220
msgid ""
"The ChangeLog file format has changed.  It is now just the same as C<git "
"log>, instead of using a custom format."
msgstr ""
"Mainīts ChangeLog faila formāts.  Tagad tas ir tāds pats kā C<git log>, "
"nevis pielāgots formāts."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.26.pod:223
msgid "Appliance start-up has changed:"
msgstr "Palīgsistēmas palaišana ir mainījusies:"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.26.pod:229
msgid ""
"The libguestfs appliance now initializes LVM the same way as it is done on "
"physical machines."
msgstr ""
"Libguestfs palīgsistēma tagad inicializē LVM tāpat, kā tas tiek darīts "
"fiziskos datoros."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.26.pod:234
msgid ""
"The libguestfs appliance does not write an empty string to "
"F</proc/sys/kernel/hotplug> when starting up."
msgstr ""
"Libguestfs palīgsistēma palaišanas laikā neraksta tukšu virkni F</proc/sys/"
"kernel/hotplug>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.26.pod:237
msgid ""
"Note that you B<must> configure your kernel to have "
"C<CONFIG_UEVENT_HELPER_PATH=\"\"> otherwise you will get strange LVM errors "
"(this applies as much to any Linux machine, not just libguestfs).  (Peter "
"Rajnoha)"
msgstr ""
"Ņemiet vērā, ka kodols B<jākonfigurē> ar C<CONFIG_UEVENT_HELPER_PATH=\"\">, "
"citādi saņemsiet dīvainas LVM kļūdas (tas attiecas uz jebkuru Linux datoru, "
"ne tikai libguestfs).  (Peter Rajnoha)"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.26.pod:245
msgid ""
"Libguestfs can now be built on arches that have L<ocamlc(1)> but not "
"L<ocamlopt(1)>.  (Hilko Bengen, Olaf Hering)"
msgstr ""
"Libguestfs tagad var būvēt arhitektūrās, kurām ir L<ocamlc(1)>, bet nav "
"L<ocamlopt(1)>.  (Hilko Bengen, Olaf Hering)"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.26.pod:249
msgid ""
"You cannot use C<./configure --disable-daemon --enable-appliance>.  It made "
"no sense anyway.  Now it is expressly forbidden by the configure script."
msgstr ""
"Nevar izmantot C<./configure --disable-daemon --enable-appliance>.  Tam tik "
"un tā nebija jēgas.  Tagad configure skripts to skaidri aizliedz."

