#. type: =head1
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:5
msgid "RELEASE NOTES FOR LIBGUESTFS 1.30"
msgstr "LIBGUESTFS 1.30 LAIDIENA PIEZĪMES"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:7
msgid ""
"These release notes only cover the differences from the previous stable/dev "
"branch split (1.28.0).  For detailed changelogs, please see the git "
"repository, or the ChangeLog file distributed in the tarball."
msgstr ""
"Šīs laidiena piezīmes aptver tikai atšķirības kopš iepriekšējās stabilā/"
"izstrādes zara atdalīšanas (1.28.0).  Detalizētus izmaiņu žurnālus skatiet "
"git repozitorijā vai arhīvā izplatītajā failā ChangeLog."

#. type: =head3
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:13
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.32.pod:13
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.34.pod:27
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:13
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.38.pod:13
msgid "New tools"
msgstr "Jauni rīki"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:15
msgid ""
"L<virt-dib(1)> is a secure and safe alternative to the OpenStack "
"\"diskimage-builder\" tool.  It is compatible with diskimage-builder "
"elements.  (Pino Toscano)"
msgstr ""
"L<virt-dib(1)> ir droša alternatīva OpenStack rīkam „diskimage-builder”.  "
"Tas ir saderīgs ar diskimage-builder elementiem.  (Pino Toscano)"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:19
msgid ""
"L<virt-get-kernel(1)> extracts the kernel and ramdisk from a disk image.  "
"Previously this functionality was part of L<virt-builder(1)>, but the new "
"tool is more featureful.  (Pino Toscano)"
msgstr ""
"L<virt-get-kernel(1)> izgūst kodolu un ramdisku no diska attēla.  Iepriekš "
"šī funkcionalitāte bija daļa no L<virt-builder(1)>, taču jaunais rīks ir "
"bagātāks ar līdzekļiem.  (Pino Toscano)"

#. type: =head3
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:23
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.32.pod:19
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.34.pod:32
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:18
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.38.pod:21
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:13
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.42.pod:46
msgid "New features in existing tools"
msgstr "Jauni līdzekļi esošajos rīkos"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:25
msgid ""
"L<virt-v2v(1)> I<-i ova> mode can now read a wider range of OVA files, and "
"also unpacked files (directories)."
msgstr ""
"L<virt-v2v(1)> režīms I<-i ova> tagad var lasīt plašāku OVA failu klāstu, kā "
"arī izpakotus failus (direktorijas)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:28
msgid ""
"virt-v2v now securely passes options to curl, so passwords, cookies and so "
"on cannot be seen by users with shell access on the same machine."
msgstr ""
"virt-v2v tagad droši nodod opcijas curl, tāpēc paroles, sīkdatnes u. tml. "
"nevar redzēt lietotāji ar čaulas piekļuvi tajā pašā datorā."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:32
msgid ""
"virt-v2v has a new I<--password-file> option to allow you to securely pass "
"in a password, and to avoid an interactive prompt."
msgstr ""
"virt-v2v ir jauna opcija I<--password-file>, kas ļauj droši nodot paroli un "
"izvairīties no interaktīvas uzvednes."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:35
msgid ""
"virt-v2v disables Windows autoreboot, making debugging conversion failures "
"on Windows easier."
msgstr ""
"virt-v2v atspējo Windows automātisko pārsāknēšanu, atvieglojot pārveidošanas "
"kļūmju atkļūdošanu Windows."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:38
msgid ""
"virt-v2v now comes with an extensive external test suite.  See "
"L<virt-v2v-test-harness(1)>."
msgstr ""
"virt-v2v tagad nāk ar plašu ārēju testu komplektu.  Skatiet L<virt-v2v-test-"
"harness(1)>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:41
msgid ""
"virt-v2v allows virtio drivers to come from any location (Roman Kagan), and "
"drivers can be read directly from the virtio ISO."
msgstr ""
"virt-v2v ļauj virtio draiveriem nākt no jebkuras vietas (Roman Kagan), un "
"draiverus var nolasīt tieši no virtio ISO."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:44
msgid ""
"virt-v2v supports conversion of Windows E<ge> 8.  Note this is experimental, "
"and possibly broken.  Use with caution."
msgstr ""
"virt-v2v atbalsta Windows E<ge> 8 pārveidošanu.  Ņemiet vērā, ka tas ir "
"eksperimentāls un, iespējams, bojāts.  Lietojiet piesardzīgi."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:47
msgid "virt-v2v can now convert UEFI guests."
msgstr "virt-v2v tagad var pārveidot UEFI viesus."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:49
msgid "L<virt-p2v(1)> adds a network configuration dialog."
msgstr "L<virt-p2v(1)> pievieno tīkla konfigurācijas dialoglodziņu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:51
msgid ""
"virt-p2v now has C<p2v.pre>, C<p2v.post> and C<p2v.fail> triggers, allowing "
"arbitrary scripts for preparing the host for conversion and tidying up "
"post-conversion."
msgstr ""
"virt-p2v tagad ir trigeri C<p2v.pre>, C<p2v.post> un C<p2v.fail>, kas ļauj "
"izmantot patvaļīgus skriptus resursdatora sagatavošanai pārveidošanai un "
"sakopšanai pēc pārveidošanas."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:55
msgid ""
"virt-p2v now uses the more advanced metacity window manager (instead of "
"matchbox)."
msgstr ""
"virt-p2v tagad izmanto uzlaboto logu pārvaldnieku metacity (nevis matchbox)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:58
msgid ""
"L<virt-sysprep(1)> will remove C</var/spool/mail/username> for non-root "
"accounts (Hu Tao)."
msgstr ""
"L<virt-sysprep(1)> noņems C</var/spool/mail/username> ne-root kontiem (Hu "
"Tao)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.30.pod:61
msgid ""
"L<virt-customize(1)>, L<virt-builder(1)> and virt-sysprep have the following "
"new options:"
msgstr ""
"L<virt-customize(1)>, L<virt-builder(1)> un virt-sysprep ir šādas jaunas "
"opcijas:"

