#. type: =head1
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:5
msgid "RELEASE NOTES FOR LIBGUESTFS 1.36"
msgstr "LIBGUESTFS 1.36 LAIDIENA PIEZĪMES"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:7
msgid ""
"These release notes only cover the differences from the previous stable/dev "
"branch split (1.34.0).  For detailed changelogs, please see the git "
"repository, or the ChangeLog file distributed in the tarball."
msgstr ""
"Šīs laidiena piezīmes aptver tikai atšķirības kopš iepriekšējās stabilā/"
"izstrādes zara atdalīšanas (1.34.0).  Detalizētus izmaiņu žurnālus skatiet "
"git repozitorijā vai arhīvā izplatītajā failā ChangeLog."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:15
msgid ""
"Virt-tail is a new tool for following (tailing) log files within a guest, "
"similar to the regular C<tail -f> command."
msgstr ""
"Virt-tail ir jauns rīks žurnālu failu sekošanai (tail) viesī, līdzīgi "
"parastajai komandai C<tail -f>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:20
msgid ""
"Virt-customize, virt-get-kernel, virt-sparsify and virt-sysprep can now "
"handle encrypted guests (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Virt-customize, virt-get-kernel, virt-sparsify un virt-sysprep tagad var "
"apstrādāt šifrētus viesus (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:23
msgid ""
"Virt-builder and virt-customize now support I<--append-line>, which is "
"useful for adding lines to the end of configuration files."
msgstr ""
"Virt-builder un virt-customize tagad atbalsta I<--append-line>, kas noder "
"rindu pievienošanai konfigurācijas failu beigās."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:26
msgid "Virt-resize can now shrink and expand swap partitions (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Virt-resize tagad var samazināt un paplašināt maiņatmiņas nodalījumus (Pino "
"Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:28
msgid "Virt-resize can now output to non-local disks (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr "Virt-resize tagad var izvadīt uz ne-lokāliem diskiem (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:30
msgid ""
"Virt-sysprep has a new operation called C<backup-files> for removing editor "
"backups, and C<passwd-backups> for removing F</etc/passwd-> and similar."
msgstr ""
"Virt-sysprep ir jauna darbība C<backup-files> redaktoru dublējumu noņemšanai "
"un C<passwd-backups> F</etc/passwd-> u. tml. noņemšanai."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:34
msgid ""
"Virt-dib can now create checksums using the new I<--checksum> option (Pino "
"Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Virt-dib tagad var izveidot kontrolsummas, izmantojot jauno opciju I<--"
"checksum> (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:37
msgid ""
"Virt-dib can now create tgz files.  In addition, extended attributes and "
"SELinux labels are preserved in the output tar file (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Virt-dib tagad var izveidot tgz failus.  Turklāt izvades tar failā tiek "
"saglabāti paplašinātie atribūti un SELinux etiķetes (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:41
msgid "Virt-dib can now create squashfs files (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr "Virt-dib tagad var izveidot squashfs failus (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:43
msgid ""
"Bash tab-completion is now available in every command line tool that is "
"shipped."
msgstr ""
"Bash tabulēšanas pabeigšana tagad pieejama katrā piegādātajā komandrindas "
"rīkā."

#. type: =head3
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:46
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.38.pod:53
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:44
msgid "virt-v2v and virt-p2v"
msgstr "virt-v2v un virt-p2v"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:48
msgid ""
"Conversions of Debian (6+) and Ubuntu (10.04+) guests are now supported "
"(Tomáš Golembiovský, Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Tagad tiek atbalstīta Debian (6+) un Ubuntu (10.04+) viesu pārveidošana "
"(Tomáš Golembiovský, Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:51
msgid ""
"Conversions from SUSE Xen hypervisor have now been tested (Cédric "
"Bosdonnat)."
msgstr "Tagad testēta pārveidošana no SUSE Xen hipervizora (Cédric Bosdonnat)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:54
msgid ""
"Windows conversions may now install a program C<pnp_wait.exe> which prevents "
"conflicts between the Windows Plug-and-Play Manager and our own scripts that "
"install virtio device drivers.  Enabling this requires the C<pnp_wait.exe> "
"program to be built separately (Roman Kagan)."
msgstr ""
"Windows pārveidošana tagad var instalēt programmu C<pnp_wait.exe>, kas "
"novērš konfliktus starp Windows Plug-and-Play pārvaldnieku un mūsu pašu "
"skriptiem, kas instalē virtio ierīču draiverus.  Lai to iespējotu, programma "
"C<pnp_wait.exe> jāuzbūvē atsevišķi (Roman Kagan)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:60
msgid "OVA files exported from AWS can now be converted (Shahar Havivi)."
msgstr "Tagad var pārveidot no AWS eksportētus OVA failus (Shahar Havivi)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:62
msgid ""
"When converting OVA files, in some circumstances virt-v2v can now read disk "
"images directly from the OVA input file instead of needing to unpack the OVA "
"file to a temporary directory.  This can save large amounts of disk space, "
"and is quicker (Tomáš Golembiovský)."
msgstr ""
"Pārveidojot OVA failus, dažos apstākļos virt-v2v tagad var nolasīt disku "
"attēlus tieši no OVA ievades faila, nevis izpakot OVA failu pagaidu "
"direktorijā.  Tas var ietaupīt daudz diska vietas un ir ātrāk (Tomáš "
"Golembiovský)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:67
msgid ""
"Virt-p2v can now be built on RHEL 5 (2007-era) Linux and RHEL 6, which means "
"that 32 bit and hardware with ancient fakeraid disks can be virtualized.  "
"Binaries of virt-p2v based on these old versions of RHEL can be found at "
"http://oirase.annexia.org/virt-p2v/"
msgstr ""
"Virt-p2v tagad var būvēt RHEL 5 (2007. gada laikmeta) Linux un RHEL 6, kas "
"nozīmē, ka var virtualizēt 32 bitu aparatūru un aparatūru ar seniem fakeraid "
"diskiem.  Uz šīm vecajām RHEL versijām balstīti virt-p2v binārie faili "
"atrodami http://oirase.annexia.org/virt-p2v/"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:72
msgid ""
"Virt-p2v can now use nbdkit (an NBD server) as an alternative to qemu-nbd.  "
"In addition, virt-p2v can use \"socket activation\" which is a more robust "
"method for opening the NBD listening socket.  Socket activation works with "
"qemu-nbd or nbdkit, but requires the most up to date versions."
msgstr ""
"Virt-p2v tagad var izmantot nbdkit (NBD serveri) kā alternatīvu qemu-nbd.  "
"Turklāt virt-p2v var izmantot „ligzdas aktivizēšanu”, kas ir robustāka "
"metode NBD klausīšanās ligzdas atvēršanai.  Ligzdas aktivizēšana darbojas ar "
"qemu-nbd vai nbdkit, bet nepieciešamas jaunākās versijas."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:78
msgid ""
"To prevent timeouts during P2V conversions, virt-p2v inhibits power saving "
"on the physical machine, and also sends ping packets over the ssh control "
"and data connections."
msgstr ""
"Lai novērstu noildzes P2V pārveidošanas laikā, virt-p2v neļauj fiziskajam "
"datoram pāriet enerģijas taupīšanas režīmā un arī sūta ping paketes pa ssh "
"vadības un datu savienojumiem."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:82
msgid ""
"Virt-v2v no longer removes the C<Processor> and C<Intelppm> nodes from the "
"Windows Registry."
msgstr ""
"Virt-v2v vairs nenoņem mezglus C<Processor> un C<Intelppm> no Windows "
"reģistra."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:85
msgid ""
"Xen and vCenter conversions can now be done using the libvirt backend, "
"provided libvirt E<ge> 2.1.0 is used."
msgstr ""
"Xen un vCenter pārveidošanu tagad var veikt, izmantojot libvirt "
"aizmugursistēmu, ja tiek izmantots libvirt E<ge> 2.1.0."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:88
msgid "F</dev/srX> (SCSI CD-ROM) devices are ignored (Tomáš Golembiovský)."
msgstr "Ierīces F</dev/srX> (SCSI CD-ROM) tiek ignorētas (Tomáš Golembiovský)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:90
msgid ""
"When converting SUSE Linux guests, use F</etc/modprobe.conf.local> if it "
"exists."
msgstr ""
"Pārveidojot SUSE Linux viesus, izmantot F</etc/modprobe.conf.local>, ja tas "
"eksistē."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:93
msgid ""
"Removing VMware tools from Linux guests should now work reliably (Pino "
"Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"VMware rīku noņemšanai no Linux viesiem tagad vajadzētu darboties uzticami "
"(Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:96
msgid ""
"When converting OVA files, virt-v2v now checks the disk image hash contained "
"in the manifest file, whereas previously it was ignored because of a mistake "
"in the code.  In addition, SHA256 hashes are now supported (Tomáš "
"Golembiovský)."
msgstr ""
"Pārveidojot OVA failus, virt-v2v tagad pārbauda manifesta failā esošo diska "
"attēla jaucējvērtību, turpretī iepriekš tā tika ignorēta kļūdas dēļ kodā.  "
"Turklāt tagad tiek atbalstītas SHA256 jaucējvērtības (Tomáš Golembiovský)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:101
msgid ""
"When converting OVA files that contain compressed disk images, we now trust "
"the C<ovf:compression> attribute from the metadata instead of using content "
"sniffing on the disk image (Tomáš Golembiovský)."
msgstr ""
"Pārveidojot OVA failus ar saspiestiem disku attēliem, tagad uzticamies "
"metadatu atribūtam C<ovf:compression>, nevis izmantojam diska attēla satura "
"ošņāšanu (Tomáš Golembiovský)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:105
msgid ""
"A new flag I<--vdsm-compat> has been added to I<-o vdsm> mode, allowing more "
"efficient qcow2 images to be generated."
msgstr ""
"Režīmam I<-o vdsm> pievienots jauns karogs I<--vdsm-compat>, kas ļauj "
"ģenerēt efektīvākus qcow2 attēlus."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:108
msgid ""
"Since the RHEV product [commercially supported version of oVirt] has now "
"been renamed to RHV, \"RHEV\" was changed to \"RHV\" throughout the "
"tooling.  In particular, I<-o rhev> becomes I<-o rhv>, although the old name "
"can be used for backwards compatibility."
msgstr ""
"Tā kā RHEV produkts [komerciāli atbalstītā oVirt versija] tagad ir pārdēvēts "
"par RHV, visos rīkos „RHEV” tika mainīts uz „RHV”.  It īpaši, I<-o rhev> "
"kļūst par I<-o rhv>, lai gan atpakaļsaderībai var izmantot veco nosaukumu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:113
msgid ""
"The C<RHEV-APT> utility is only installed when the output hypervisor is "
"oVirt or RHV."
msgstr ""
"Utilīta C<RHEV-APT> tiek instalēta tikai tad, ja izvades hipervizors ir "
"oVirt vai RHV."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:116
msgid ""
"A problem with virt-v2v running out of memory when doing an SELinux relabel "
"of the guest filesystem should now be resolved."
msgstr ""
"Problēmai, kad virt-v2v pietrūkst atmiņas, veicot viesa failu sistēmas "
"SELinux etiķešu atkārtotu piešķiršanu, tagad vajadzētu būt atrisinātai."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:121
msgid ""
"Setting C<EXTRA_JAVAC_FLAGS> before F<./configure> allows you to add "
"arbitrary flags to C<javac> when compiling the Java bindings."
msgstr ""
"C<EXTRA_JAVAC_FLAGS> iestatīšana pirms F<./configure> ļauj pievienot "
"patvaļīgus karogus C<javac>, kompilējot Java saistījumus."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:124
msgid ""
"Use of any libguestfs API which returned a single struct, from Perl or Java "
"bindings, would have leaked memory.  This has now been fixed (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Jebkuras libguestfs API, kas atgrieza vienu struktūru, izmantošana no Perl "
"vai Java saistījumiem izraisīja atmiņas noplūdi.  Tagad tas ir izlabots "
"(Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:130
msgid ""
"Inspection of Windows guests with mildly corrupted Windows Registry hives "
"should now work instead of failing with an error.  This feature requires "
"hivex E<ge> 1.3.14 (Dawid Zamirski)."
msgstr ""
"Windows viesu ar nedaudz bojātiem Windows reģistra stropiem inspicēšanai "
"tagad vajadzētu darboties, nevis neizdoties ar kļūdu.  Šim līdzeklim "
"nepieciešams hivex E<ge> 1.3.14 (Dawid Zamirski)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:134
msgid ""
"For Debian guests, we can now read the URL, source name, summary and full "
"description of installed packages.  For RPM-based guests we can read the "
"URL, summary and description (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Debian viesiem tagad varam nolasīt instalēto pakotņu URL, avota nosaukumu, "
"kopsavilkumu un pilnu aprakstu.  Uz RPM balstītiem viesiem varam nolasīt "
"URL, kopsavilkumu un aprakstu (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:138
msgid ""
"Inspection of guest operating systems that use a separate F</usr> partition "
"should now work more reliably (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Viesu operētājsistēmu, kas izmanto atsevišķu F</usr> nodalījumu, "
"inspicēšanai tagad vajadzētu darboties uzticamāk (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:141
msgid ""
"When parsing guest F</etc/fstab>, paths are reduced to a canonical form "
"(eg. C<\"///usr//local//\"> → C<\"/usr/local\">)."
msgstr ""
"Parsējot viesa F</etc/fstab>, ceļi tiek reducēti kanoniskā formā (piem., "
"C<\"///usr//local//\"> → C<\"/usr/local\">)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:144
msgid ""
"Inspection of btrfs subvolumes now works where the F</etc/fstab> options "
"field contains commas."
msgstr ""
"Btrfs apakšsējumu inspicēšana tagad darbojas, ja F</etc/fstab> opciju laukā "
"ir komati."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:147
msgid "F</dev/cdN> devices in guest F</etc/fstab> are ignored (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr "Ierīces F</dev/cdN> viesa F</etc/fstab> tiek ignorētas (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:151
msgid "Stable releases are now tested on aarch64, ppc64 and ppc64le architectures."
msgstr ""
"Stabilie laidieni tagad tiek testēti aarch64, ppc64 un ppc64le arhitektūrās."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:154
msgid ""
"The RISC-V architecture is now handled as a guest, and libguestfs will now "
"at least compile on RISC-V (but probably not work as there is no usable qemu "
"at the time of writing)."
msgstr ""
"RISC-V arhitektūra tagad tiek apstrādāta kā viesis, un libguestfs tagad "
"vismaz kompilēsies RISC-V (bet, visticamāk, nedarbosies, jo rakstīšanas "
"brīdī nav lietojama qemu)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:158
msgid "Detection of S/390 and S/390x binaries and guests is now supported."
msgstr "Tagad tiek atbalstīta S/390 un S/390x bināro failu un viesu noteikšana."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:162
msgid "ExFAT filesystems are now supported (Miles Wolbe)."
msgstr "Tagad tiek atbalstītas ExFAT failu sistēmas (Miles Wolbe)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:168
msgid ""
"There were no CVEs reported in this development cycle.  However some "
"security-related hardening was carried out as described below."
msgstr ""
"Šajā izstrādes ciklā netika ziņots par CVE.  Tomēr tika veikta daļa ar "
"drošību saistītas nostiprināšanas, kā aprakstīts tālāk."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:171
msgid ""
"Temporary filenames are now always generated using randomness from "
"F</dev/urandom> (previously the C function L<random(3)> was used in one "
"case)."
msgstr ""
"Pagaidu failu nosaukumi tagad vienmēr tiek ģenerēti, izmantojot nejaušību no "
"F</dev/urandom> (iepriekš vienā gadījumā tika izmantota C funkcija L<random"
"(3)>)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:175
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:350
msgid ""
"The C<$TERM> environment variable is now validated before passing it through "
"to the appliance kernel command line."
msgstr ""
"Vides mainīgais C<$TERM> tagad tiek validēts, pirms tas tiek nodots "
"palīgsistēmas kodola komandrindai."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:184
msgid "C<guestfs_aug_transform>"
msgstr "C<guestfs_aug_transform>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:186
msgid "Exposes the Augeas C<aug_transform> API (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr "Atklāj Augeas API C<aug_transform> (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:188
msgid "C<guestfs_find_inode>"
msgstr "C<guestfs_find_inode>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:190
msgid "Find files by inode number (Matteo Cafasso)."
msgstr "Atrast failus pēc inode numura (Matteo Cafasso)."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:192
msgid "C<guestfs_inspect_get_windows_software_hive>"
msgstr "C<guestfs_inspect_get_windows_software_hive>"

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:194
msgid "C<guestfs_inspect_get_windows_system_hive>"
msgstr "C<guestfs_inspect_get_windows_system_hive>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:196
msgid ""
"Return the path to the Windows C<HKLM\\SYSTEM> and C<HKLM\\SOFTWARE> hives "
"computed during inspection."
msgstr ""
"Atgriezt ceļu uz Windows stropiem C<HKLM\\SYSTEM> un C<HKLM\\SOFTWARE>, kas "
"aprēķināts inspicēšanas laikā."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:199
msgid "C<guestfs_mksquashfs>"
msgstr "C<guestfs_mksquashfs>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:201
msgid "Create a squashfs filesystem from a path (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr "Izveidot squashfs failu sistēmu no ceļa (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:209
msgid "C<guestfs_add_domain>"
msgstr "C<guestfs_add_domain>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:211
msgid ""
"This call now handles libvirt file-based volumes correctly, where previously "
"these would have been ignored.  Also handled are disks which require libvirt "
"authentication secrets to open (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Šis izsaukums tagad pareizi apstrādā libvirt uz failiem balstītos sējumus, "
"kas iepriekš tika ignorēti.  Tiek apstrādāti arī diski, kuru atvēršanai "
"nepieciešami libvirt autentifikācijas noslēpumi (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:215
msgid "C<guestfs_canonical_device_name>"
msgstr "C<guestfs_canonical_device_name>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:217
msgid ""
"This call will no longer incorrectly modify Linux software RAID device names "
"(like F</dev/mdX>)."
msgstr ""
"Šis izsaukums vairs nepareizi nemainīs Linux programmatūras RAID ierīču "
"nosaukumus (piemēram, F</dev/mdX>)."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:220
msgid "C<guestfs_file_architecture>"
msgstr "C<guestfs_file_architecture>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:222
msgid ""
"Previously the C<file_architecture> API could return either of the strings "
"C<i386> or C<i486> for 32 bit x86 binaries.  It now only returns C<i386> (as "
"documented)."
msgstr ""
"Iepriekš API C<file_architecture> 32 bitu x86 binārajiem failiem varēja "
"atgriezt virkni C<i386> vai C<i486>.  Tagad tā atgriež tikai C<i386> (kā "
"dokumentēts)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:226
msgid ""
"This API can now return the following new values: C<riscv32>, C<riscv64>, "
"C<riscv128>, C<s390>, C<s390x>."
msgstr ""
"Šī API tagad var atgriezt šādas jaunas vērtības: C<riscv32>, C<riscv64>, "
"C<riscv128>, C<s390>, C<s390x>."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:229
msgid "C<guestfs_hivex_open>"
msgstr "C<guestfs_hivex_open>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:231
msgid ""
"This now has an optional C<GUESTFS_HIVEX_OPEN_UNSAFE> flag which allows "
"certain corrupted Windows Registry hives to be opened.  This feature "
"requires hivex E<ge> 1.3.14 (Dawid Zamirski)."
msgstr ""
"Tam tagad ir neobligāts karogs C<GUESTFS_HIVEX_OPEN_UNSAFE>, kas ļauj atvērt "
"dažus bojātus Windows reģistra stropus.  Šim līdzeklim nepieciešams hivex "
"E<ge> 1.3.14 (Dawid Zamirski)."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:235
msgid "C<guestfs_list_partitions>"
msgstr "C<guestfs_list_partitions>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:237
msgid "This call now returns Linux software RAID partitions."
msgstr "Šis izsaukums tagad atgriež Linux programmatūras RAID nodalījumus."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:239
msgid "C<guestfs_part_to_dev>"
msgstr "C<guestfs_part_to_dev>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:241
msgid ""
"This call now correctly handles partition names which include "
"C<pE<lt>NE<gt>> (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Šis izsaukums tagad pareizi apstrādā nodalījumu nosaukumus, kas ietver "
"C<pE<lt>NE<gt>> (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:244
msgid "C<guestfs_set_label>"
msgstr "C<guestfs_set_label>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:246
msgid "This call can now change the labels of swap partitions (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Šis izsaukums tagad var mainīt maiņatmiņas nodalījumu etiķetes (Pino Toscano)"
"."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:252
msgid ""
"libmagic, the library part of the C<file> command, is now required at build "
"time (previously optional)."
msgstr ""
"Būvēšanas laikā tagad nepieciešama libmagic, komandas C<file> bibliotēkas "
"daļa (iepriekš neobligāta)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:255
msgid "GCC 7 is now supported."
msgstr "Tagad tiek atbalstīts GCC 7."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:257
msgid ""
"\"Silent rules\" are now used for OCaml programs, Java bindings.  To show "
"the full command line executed, add C<V=1> on the make command line (Pino "
"Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"OCaml programmām, Java saistījumiem tagad tiek izmantotas „klusās kārtulas"
"”.  Lai parādītu pilnu izpildīto komandrindu, make komandrindai pievienojiet "
"C<V=1> (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:261
msgid ""
"Slow testing (C<make check-slow>) now covers: firstboot scripts in Linux "
"guests; v2v conversion of a selection of real Linux guests; the "
"virt-customize I<--hostname> and I<--timezone> settings; the "
"I<--root-password> parameter; that the serial console works in virt-builder "
"guests."
msgstr ""
"Lēnā testēšana (C<make check-slow>) tagad aptver: pirmās sāknēšanas skriptus "
"Linux viesos; reālu Linux viesu izlases v2v pārveidošanu; virt-customize "
"iestatījumus I<--hostname> un I<--timezone>; parametru I<--root-password>; "
"to, ka seriālā konsole darbojas virt-builder viesos."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:267
msgid ""
"Large generated C source files, eg. the list of commands found in "
"F<fish/cmds.c> (and many more), have been split into smaller files to speed "
"parallel compilation."
msgstr ""
"Lieli ģenerēti C pirmkoda faili, piem., komandu saraksts failā F<fish/"
"cmds.c> (un daudzi citi), ir sadalīti mazākos failos, lai paātrinātu "
"paralēlo kompilēšanu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:271
msgid ""
"C<make maintainer-check-extra-dist> now checks that all generated files are "
"included in the tarball."
msgstr ""
"C<make maintainer-check-extra-dist> tagad pārbauda, vai visi ģenerētie faili "
"ir iekļauti tar arhīvā."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:274
msgid ""
"The tests no longer assume that C<.> is in Perl's C<@INC>, as it is going to "
"be removed soon (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Testi vairs nepieņem, ka C<.> ir Perl C<@INC>, jo tas drīz tiks noņemts "
"(Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:277
msgid "Debian hosts using UsrMerge are now supported (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Tagad tiek atbalstīti Debian resursdatori, kas izmanto UsrMerge (Pino "
"Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:279
msgid ""
"Header files and C structs can now have internal documentation using the "
"special C</** ... */> comments."
msgstr ""
"Galvenes failiem un C struktūrām tagad var būt iekšējā dokumentācija, "
"izmantojot īpašos komentārus C</** ... */>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:282
msgid ""
"C<@VAR@> substitutions in C<./run> are now fully quoted.  This is necessary "
"so that (eg) C<./configure PYTHON=/some/path> works robustly if "
"C</some/path> contains characters that need to be quoted (Hilko Bengen)."
msgstr ""
"C<@VAR@> aizstāšanas C<./run> tagad ir pilnībā pēdiņās.  Tas nepieciešams, "
"lai (piem.) C<./configure PYTHON=/some/path> darbotos robusti, ja C</some/"
"path> satur rakstzīmes, kas jāliek pēdiņās (Hilko Bengen)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:287
msgid "gperf E<ge> 3.1 is now supported."
msgstr "Tagad tiek atbalstīts gperf E<ge> 3.1."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:289
msgid ""
"Kraxel's old edk2 builds can no longer be used for UEFI support.  UEFI code "
"is now fully free software, so use the versions bundled with your Linux "
"distro instead."
msgstr ""
"Kraxel vecās edk2 būves vairs nevar izmantot UEFI atbalstam.  UEFI kods "
"tagad ir pilnībā brīvā programmatūra, tāpēc tā vietā izmantojiet versijas, "
"kas iekļautas jūsu Linux distribūcijā."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:293
msgid "Virt-p2v can now be compiled on RHEL 5 (2007-era) Linux with Gtk 2.10."
msgstr ""
"Virt-p2v tagad var kompilēt RHEL 5 (2007. gada laikmeta) Linux ar Gtk 2.10."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:297
msgid ""
"The generator and mllib C<Common_utils> modules are now shared from the same "
"source file."
msgstr ""
"Ģeneratora un mllib moduļi C<Common_utils> tagad tiek koplietoti no viena "
"pirmkoda faila."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:300
msgid ""
"A considerable amount of common code has been moved into the F<common> "
"directory in the source and is now compiled only once.  The mini-libraries "
"located under here are: F<common/edit>, F<common/errnostring>, "
"F<common/miniexpect>, F<common/options>, F<common/parallel>, "
"F<common/progress>, F<common/protocol>, F<common/utils>, F<common/visit>, "
"F<common/windows>."
msgstr ""
"Ievērojams daudzums kopīga koda ir pārvietots uz pirmkoda direktoriju "
"F<common> un tagad tiek kompilēts tikai vienreiz.  Šeit esošās mini "
"bibliotēkas ir: F<common/edit>, F<common/errnostring>, F<common/miniexpect>, "
"F<common/options>, F<common/parallel>, F<common/progress>, F<common/protocol>"
", F<common/utils>, F<common/visit>, F<common/windows>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:307
msgid ""
"The directory containing the main library code has moved from F<src> → "
"F<lib>."
msgstr ""
"Direktorija ar galveno bibliotēkas kodu ir pārvietota no F<src> → F<lib>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:310
msgid ""
"All tests written in shell script now use a common file of utility functions "
"(F<tests/test-functions.sh>).  There are several new utility functions, "
"mainly for skipping tests.  Also these test scripts can now use "
"autoconf-like path variables like C<$abs_top_srcdir>."
msgstr ""
"Visi čaulas skriptā rakstītie testi tagad izmanto kopīgu utilītfunkciju "
"failu (F<tests/test-functions.sh>).  Ir vairākas jaunas utilītfunkcijas, "
"galvenokārt testu izlaišanai.  Turklāt šie testu skripti tagad var izmantot "
"autoconf līdzīgus ceļu mainīgos, piemēram, C<$abs_top_srcdir>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:315
msgid "UEFI paths are now stored in the generator (F<generator/uefi.ml>)."
msgstr "UEFI ceļi tagad tiek glabāti ģeneratorā (F<generator/uefi.ml>)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:317
msgid ""
"The way the generator handles actions and procedure numbers was changed "
"quite substantially.  See F<generator/actions_*.ml> and "
"F<generator/proc_nr.ml>."
msgstr ""
"Veids, kā ģenerators apstrādā darbības un procedūru numurus, tika ievērojami "
"mainīts.  Skatiet F<generator/actions_*.ml> un F<generator/proc_nr.ml>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:321
msgid ""
"The gnulib C<getprogname> module is now used everywhere when "
"needing/printing the program name (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Gnulib modulis C<getprogname> tagad tiek izmantots visur, kur vajadzīgs/"
"jāizdrukā programmas nosaukums (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:324
msgid "F<perl/Guestfs.c> is not translatable (Nikos Skalkotos)."
msgstr "F<perl/Guestfs.c> nav tulkojams (Nikos Skalkotos)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:326
msgid ""
"Virt-builder templates moved from F<builder/website> to F<builder/templates> "
"and there is now a single unified program which can build any template."
msgstr ""
"Virt-builder veidnes pārvietotas no F<builder/website> uz F<builder/"
"templates>, un tagad ir viena vienota programma, kas var uzbūvēt jebkuru "
"veidni."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:330
msgid ""
"All Windows registry utilities used by virt-customize and virt-v2v have been "
"moved to a common module called C<Registry> under F<mllib>."
msgstr ""
"Visas Windows reģistra utilītas, ko izmanto virt-customize un virt-v2v, ir "
"pārvietotas uz kopīgu moduli C<Registry> zem F<mllib>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:333
msgid ""
"All POSIX bindings have been moved to a new module called C<Unix_utils> "
"under F<mllib>."
msgstr ""
"Visi POSIX saistījumi ir pārvietoti uz jaunu moduli C<Unix_utils> zem "
"F<mllib>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:336
msgid ""
"Inspection, virt-customize and virt-v2v no longer recompute the Windows "
"C<%systemroot%>, C<CurrentControlSet> or paths to the C<HKLM\\SYSTEM> and "
"C<HKLM\\SOFTWARE> hives in multiple places.  Instead these are all computed "
"once (during inspection) and passed to the other tools through various "
"C<guestfs_inspect_get_windows_*> APIs."
msgstr ""
"Inspicēšana, virt-customize un virt-v2v vairs nepārrēķina Windows "
"C<%systemroot%>, C<CurrentControlSet> vai ceļus uz stropiem C<HKLM\\SYSTEM> "
"un C<HKLM\\SOFTWARE> vairākās vietās.  Tā vietā tie visi tiek aprēķināti "
"vienreiz (inspicēšanas laikā) un nodoti citiem rīkiem caur dažādām API "
"C<guestfs_inspect_get_windows_*>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:342
msgid ""
"C</dev/pts> is now available inside the appliance, so any tools we run which "
"require a pty will now work (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"C</dev/pts> tagad ir pieejams palīgsistēmā, tāpēc visi izpildītie rīki, "
"kuriem vajadzīgs pty, tagad darbosies (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:345
msgid "Most OCaml warnings have been fixed."
msgstr "Lielākā daļa OCaml brīdinājumu ir izlaboti."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:347
msgid ""
"There is now a single common function for creating temporary files "
"(C<guestfs_int_make_temp_path>) (Matteo Cafasso)."
msgstr ""
"Tagad ir viena kopīga funkcija pagaidu failu izveidei "
"(C<guestfs_int_make_temp_path>) (Matteo Cafasso)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:353
msgid ""
"Useless USB and memballoon devices are no longer created in the appliance "
"(Laine Stump)."
msgstr ""
"Palīgsistēmā vairs netiek veidotas nevajadzīgas USB un memballoon ierīces "
"(Laine Stump)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:356
msgid ""
"On aarch64 we now use virtio-pci for the appliance.  This is somewhat faster "
"than virtio-mmio."
msgstr ""
"Aarch64 palīgsistēmai tagad izmantojam virtio-pci.  Tas ir nedaudz ātrāks "
"nekā virtio-mmio."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:359
msgid ""
"Use of L<srandom(3)> and L<random(3)> has been minimized.  In particular, "
"temporary filenames are no longer created based on randomness returned by "
"L<random(3)>, but F</dev/urandom> is used instead."
msgstr ""
"L<srandom(3)> un L<random(3)> izmantošana ir samazināta līdz minimumam.  It "
"īpaši, pagaidu failu nosaukumi vairs netiek veidoti, balstoties uz L<random"
"(3)> atgriezto nejaušību, bet tā vietā tiek izmantots F</dev/urandom>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.36.pod:368
msgid "https_proxy= ./bugs-in-changelog.sh v1.34.0.."
msgstr "https_proxy= ./bugs-in-changelog.sh v1.34.0.."

