#. type: =head1
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:5
msgid "RELEASE NOTES FOR LIBGUESTFS 1.40"
msgstr "LIBGUESTFS 1.40 LAIDIENA PIEZĪMES"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:7
msgid ""
"These release notes only cover the differences from the previous stable/dev "
"branch split (1.38.0).  For detailed changelogs, please see the git "
"repository, or the ChangeLog file distributed in the tarball."
msgstr ""
"Šīs laidiena piezīmes aptver tikai atšķirības kopš iepriekšējās stabilā/"
"izstrādes zara atdalīšanas (1.38.0).  Detalizētus izmaiņu žurnālus skatiet "
"git repozitorijā vai arhīvā izplatītajā failā ChangeLog."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:15
msgid ""
"Virt-inspector now displays the libosinfo short ID for guests (Pino "
"Toscano)."
msgstr "Virt-inspector tagad rāda viesu libosinfo īso ID (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:18
msgid "Guestfish I<-N> will now generate 1G disks instead of 100M disks by default."
msgstr ""
"Guestfish I<-N> tagad pēc noklusējuma ģenerēs 1G diskus, nevis 100M diskus."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:21
msgid "Virt-resize supports f2fs filesystems (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr "Virt-resize atbalsta f2fs failu sistēmas (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:23
msgid "libguestfs-test-tool now supports bash tab completion (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"libguestfs-test-tool tagad atbalsta bash tabulēšanas pabeigšanu (Pino "
"Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:26
msgid ""
"The I<--machine-readable> option now supports sending output to files or "
"stdout/stderr.  This works uniformly across most OCaml-based virt tools, "
"specifically: virt-builder, virt-builder-repository, virt-dib, "
"virt-get-kernel, virt-resize, virt-sparsify, and virt-v2v (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Opcija I<--machine-readable> tagad atbalsta izvades sūtīšanu uz failiem vai "
"stdout/stderr.  Tas vienādi darbojas lielākajā daļā uz OCaml balstīto virt "
"rīku, konkrēti: virt-builder, virt-builder-repository, virt-dib, virt-get-"
"kernel, virt-resize, virt-sparsify un virt-v2v (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:32
msgid "Virt-builder I<--uninstall> option now works on SUSE (Sebastian Meyer)."
msgstr ""
"Virt-builder opcija I<--uninstall> tagad darbojas SUSE (Sebastian Meyer)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:35
msgid ""
"Virt-builder now supports Windows.  We are not able to ship Windows "
"templates in the public repository for obvious licensing reasons, but if you "
"are an MSDN subscriber you may build your own.  See "
"L<https://rwmj.wordpress.com/2018/09/13/creating-windows-templates-for-virt-builder/>"
msgstr ""
"Virt-builder tagad atbalsta Windows.  Acīmredzamu licencēšanas iemeslu dēļ "
"nevaram piegādāt Windows veidnes publiskajā repozitorijā, taču, ja esat MSDN "
"abonents, varat uzbūvēt savas.  Skatiet L<https://rwmj.wordpress.com/2018/09/"
"13/creating-windows-templates-for-virt-builder/>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:40
msgid ""
"Many tools now support a I<--key> option allowing you to pass in decryption "
"keys for filesystems stored in local files on the host rather than having to "
"feed them in over stdin (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Daudzi rīki tagad atbalsta opciju I<--key>, kas ļauj nodot failu sistēmu "
"atšifrēšanas atslēgas, kas glabājas lokālos failos resursdatorā, nevis tās "
"padot caur stdin (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:46
msgid ""
"New I<-o rhv-upload> mode for directly uploading images to RHV, bypassing "
"the Export Storage Domain (Tomáš Golembiovský, Nir Soffer, Daniel Erez, Pino "
"Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Jauns režīms I<-o rhv-upload> attēlu tiešai augšupielādei RHV, apejot "
"eksporta krātuves domēnu (Tomáš Golembiovský, Nir Soffer, Daniel Erez, Pino "
"Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:50
msgid ""
"New I<-o openstack> mode for directly uploading images to OpenStack and "
"Cinder using OpenStack APIs."
msgstr ""
"Jauns režīms I<-o openstack> attēlu tiešai augšupielādei OpenStack un "
"Cinder, izmantojot OpenStack API."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:53
msgid ""
"Virt-v2v now has a general mechanism for input and output options: I<-io> "
"and I<-oo>."
msgstr ""
"Virt-v2v tagad ir vispārīgs mehānisms ievades un izvades opcijām: I<-io> un "
"I<-oo>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:56
msgid ""
"Virt-v2v can now install the RHV tools or QEMU GA in guests (Tomáš "
"Golembiovský)."
msgstr ""
"Virt-v2v tagad var instalēt viesos RHV rīkus vai QEMU GA (Tomáš Golembiovský)"
"."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:59
msgid ""
"The huge manual has now been split into several smaller documents and is "
"more focused on helping users to accomplish specific v2v tasks."
msgstr ""
"Milzīgā rokasgrāmata tagad ir sadalīta vairākos mazākos dokumentos un vairāk "
"vērsta uz palīdzību lietotājiem konkrētu v2v uzdevumu veikšanā."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:62
msgid ""
"Multiple improvements to the OVF metadata when converting to RHV (Tomáš "
"Golembiovský, Pino Toscano, Arik Hadas)."
msgstr ""
"Vairāki OVF metadatu uzlabojumi, pārveidojot uz RHV (Tomáš Golembiovský, "
"Pino Toscano, Arik Hadas)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:65
msgid ""
"Virt-v2v can now convert Linux guests with split kernel packages, especially "
"Ubuntu 18.04 (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Virt-v2v tagad var pārveidot Linux viesus ar sadalītām kodola pakotnēm, it "
"īpaši Ubuntu 18.04 (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:68
msgid ""
"Virt-v2v old I<--password-file> option has been replaced by I<-ip> (the old "
"option remains for backwards compatibility)."
msgstr ""
"Virt-v2v vecā opcija I<--password-file> ir aizstāta ar I<-ip> (vecā opcija "
"paliek atpakaļsaderībai)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:71
msgid "Virt-v2v now preserves the VM Generation ID."
msgstr "Virt-v2v tagad saglabā VM paaudzes ID."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:73
msgid ""
"Virt-v2v has a new I<--mac> option allowing specific NICs to be mapped "
"precisely to networks or bridges on the target."
msgstr ""
"Virt-v2v ir jauna opcija I<--mac>, kas ļauj precīzi kartēt noteiktas tīkla "
"kartes uz tīkliem vai tiltiem mērķī."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:76
msgid ""
"New virt-v2v I<--print-estimate> option to estimate the size of data that "
"virt-v2v will copy."
msgstr ""
"Jauna virt-v2v opcija I<--print-estimate>, lai novērtētu datu apjomu, ko "
"virt-v2v kopēs."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:79
msgid ""
"Virt-v2v is now usually able to remove open-vm-tools and VMware Tools from "
"the Linux guest during conversion (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Virt-v2v tagad parasti spēj pārveidošanas laikā noņemt open-vm-tools un "
"VMware Tools no Linux viesa (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:82
msgid "Virt-v2v can now support UEFI conversions to RHV (Tomáš Golembiovský)."
msgstr ""
"Virt-v2v tagad var atbalstīt UEFI pārveidošanu uz RHV (Tomáš Golembiovský)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:84
msgid ""
"Virt-p2v now prefers you to shut down instead of rebooting the machine after "
"conversion has finished (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr ""
"Virt-p2v tagad pēc pārveidošanas beigām iesaka datoru izslēgt, nevis "
"pārsāknēt (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:87
msgid ""
"Virt-v2v now writes the libosinfo short ID to the libvirt metadata when "
"using I<-o local> and I<-o libvirt> output modes (Martin Kletzander)."
msgstr ""
"Virt-v2v tagad raksta libosinfo īso ID libvirt metadatos, izmantojot izvades "
"režīmus I<-o local> un I<-o libvirt> (Martin Kletzander)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:93
msgid "OpenJDK 10+ is supported (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr "Tiek atbalstīts OpenJDK 10+ (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:95
msgid "Java bindings fixed for Gentoo host (Martin Kletzander)."
msgstr "Java saistījumi izlaboti Gentoo resursdatoram (Martin Kletzander)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:99
msgid "Support Kali Linux (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr "Kali Linux atbalsts (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:101
msgid ""
"When inspecting mountpoints, look for F</etc/mdadm/mdadm.conf> as well as "
"F</etc/mdadm.conf> (Nikolay Ivanets)."
msgstr ""
"Inspicējot montēšanas punktus, meklēt F</etc/mdadm/mdadm.conf>, kā arī F</"
"etc/mdadm.conf> (Nikolay Ivanets)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:104
msgid "Improved support for OpenSUSE Tumbleweed (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr "Uzlabots OpenSUSE Tumbleweed atbalsts (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:108
msgid "Miscellaneous macOS build fixes (Adam Robinson)."
msgstr "Dažādi macOS būvēšanas labojumi (Adam Robinson)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:112
msgid "Multiple documentation typos fixed (Yuri Chornoivan)."
msgstr "Izlabotas vairākas drukas kļūdas dokumentācijā (Yuri Chornoivan)."

#. type: =head2
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:118 docs/guestfs-security.pod:385
msgid "CVE-2018-11806"
msgstr "CVE-2018-11806"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:120
msgid ""
"Qemu's slirp (userspace networking) had several buffer overflows which could "
"be triggered from the guest or network side."
msgstr ""
"Qemu slirp (lietotāja telpas tīklošanā) bija vairākas bufera pārpildes, ko "
"varēja izraisīt no viesa vai tīkla puses."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:129
msgid "C<f2fs_expand>"
msgstr "C<f2fs_expand>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:131
msgid "Expand an f2fs filesystem (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr "Paplašināt f2fs failu sistēmu (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:133
msgid "C<inspect_get_osinfo>"
msgstr "C<inspect_get_osinfo>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:135
msgid "Get the libosinfo short ID for the inspected guest (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr "Iegūt inspicētā viesa libosinfo īso ID (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: =item
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:137
msgid "C<lvm_scan>"
msgstr "C<lvm_scan>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:139
msgid "This rescans all PVs, VGs and LVs, optionally activating them."
msgstr "Tas atkārtoti skenē visus PV, VG un LV, pēc izvēles tos aktivizējot."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:145
msgid "C<part_get_mbr_part_type> was reimplemented in OCaml (Nikolay Ivanets)."
msgstr ""
"C<part_get_mbr_part_type> tika realizēts no jauna OCaml (Nikolay Ivanets)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:148
msgid ""
"C<list_filesystems> now filters out MBR extended partitions (Nikolay "
"Ivanets)."
msgstr ""
"C<list_filesystems> tagad izfiltrē MBR paplašinātos nodalījumus (Nikolay "
"Ivanets)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:151
msgid "C<vgscan> has been deprecated.  Use the new C<lvm_scan> API in preference."
msgstr "C<vgscan> ir novecojis.  Priekšroku dodiet jaunajai API C<lvm_scan>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:156
msgid "The JSON library switched from yajl to Jansson E<ge> 2.7 (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr "JSON bibliotēka nomainīta no yajl uz Jansson E<ge> 2.7 (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:158
msgid "Support for The Sleuth Kit 4.5 (Pino Toscano)."
msgstr "The Sleuth Kit 4.5 atbalsts (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:160
msgid "Multiple improvements in the C<./configure> script (Lin Ma)."
msgstr "Vairāki uzlabojumi skriptā C<./configure> (Lin Ma)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:162
msgid "More out-of-tree build fixes (Hilko Bengen)."
msgstr "Vairāk labojumu būvēšanai ārpus koka (Hilko Bengen)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:164
msgid "Some work on reproducible builds (Bernhard M. Wiedemann)."
msgstr "Daļa darba pie reproducējamām būvēm (Bernhard M. Wiedemann)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:168
msgid ""
"lvmetad is now used unconditionally, and is started much earlier in the "
"appliance boot process.  This fixes support for certain PV types."
msgstr ""
"lvmetad tagad tiek izmantots bez nosacījumiem un tiek palaists daudz agrāk "
"palīgsistēmas sāknēšanas procesā.  Tas labo noteiktu PV tipu atbalstu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:171
msgid ""
"On Debian, dash is installed inside the appliance and in virt-rescue (Pino "
"Toscano)."
msgstr "Debian palīgsistēmā un virt-rescue tiek instalēts dash (Pino Toscano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:174
msgid ""
"The amount of RAM assigned to the appliance has been increased from 500M to "
"768M (on x86_64, other architectures have different limits).  This enables "
"use of up to 255 disks when using recent Linux kernels."
msgstr ""
"Palīgsistēmai piešķirtās RAM apjoms ir palielināts no 500M uz 768M (x86_64, "
"citām arhitektūrām ir citi ierobežojumi).  Tas ļauj izmantot līdz 255 "
"diskiem, izmantojot jaunākus Linux kodolus."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:178
msgid "Virt-v2v now models the source machine type (eg. i440FX, Q35 or virt)."
msgstr "Virt-v2v tagad modelē avota mašīnas tipu (piem., i440FX, Q35 vai virt)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:180
msgid ""
"Virt-p2v now generates configuration code automatically, also code for "
"parsing the kernel command line."
msgstr ""
"Virt-p2v tagad automātiski ģenerē konfigurācijas kodu, arī kodu kodola "
"komandrindas parsēšanai."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:183
msgid "Use C<LT_INIT> instead of C<AC_PROG_LIBTOOL>."
msgstr "Izmantot C<LT_INIT>, nevis C<AC_PROG_LIBTOOL>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:185
msgid ""
"The OCaml C<JSON> code for parsing and serializing has been unified into a "
"single abstract data type."
msgstr ""
"OCaml C<JSON> kods parsēšanai un serializēšanai ir apvienots vienā abstraktā "
"datu tipā."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:188
msgid ""
"Most OCaml tools are now built using the PIC runtime.  This has a "
"performance penalty on i686, but is relatively free on other architectures "
"and has security benefits."
msgstr ""
"Lielākā daļa OCaml rīku tagad tiek būvēta, izmantojot PIC izpildlaiku.  Tam "
"ir veiktspējas sods i686, bet citās arhitektūrās tas ir salīdzinoši bez "
"maksas un tam ir drošības priekšrocības."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:192
msgid ""
"The direct backend now queries the qemu binary for availability of KVM, "
"instead of using a heuristic based on F</dev/kvm> (Andrea Bolognani)."
msgstr ""
"Tiešā aizmugursistēma tagad vaicā qemu binārajam failam KVM pieejamību, "
"nevis izmanto heiristiku, kas balstīta uz F</dev/kvm> (Andrea Bolognani)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:196
msgid ""
"Our \"clever\" libxml2 writer macros are now used consistently across all "
"parts of the code base."
msgstr ""
"Mūsu „gudrie” libxml2 rakstītāja makro tagad konsekventi tiek izmantoti "
"visās koda bāzes daļās."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.40.pod:199
msgid ""
"Qemu dropped I<-nodefconfig> without telling us.  The equivalent "
"I<-no-user-config> option is now used instead.  Qemu also moved the "
"C<serial> option from I<-drive> to I<-device>, again without any notice, and "
"this is also fixed."
msgstr ""
"Qemu atmeta I<-nodefconfig>, mums nepasakot.  Tā vietā tagad tiek izmantota "
"līdzvērtīgā opcija I<-no-user-config>.  Qemu arī pārvietoja opciju C<serial> "
"no I<-drive> uz I<-device>, atkal bez jebkāda paziņojuma, un arī tas ir "
"izlabots."

