#. type: =head1
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:5
msgid "RELEASE NOTES FOR LIBGUESTFS 1.46"
msgstr "LIBGUESTFS 1.46 LAIDIENA PIEZĪMES"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:7
msgid ""
"The big news in this release is that the virt tools like L<virt-builder(1)>, "
"L<virt-cat(1)>, L<virt-customize(1)>, L<virt-df(1)>, and many more were "
"moved to a new project.  The temporary repository for the new guestfs-tools "
"project is here: L<https://github.com/rwmjones/guestfs-tools> while we set "
"up a permanent home for it on gitlab.  The tarballs containing the tools are "
"here: L<https://download.libguestfs.org/guestfs-tools/>"
msgstr ""
"Šī laidiena lielā ziņa ir tā, ka virt rīki, piemēram, L<virt-builder(1)>, "
"L<virt-cat(1)>, L<virt-customize(1)>, L<virt-df(1)> un daudzi citi, tika "
"pārvietoti uz jaunu projektu.  Jaunā guestfs-tools projekta pagaidu "
"repozitorijs ir šeit: L<https://github.com/rwmjones/guestfs-tools>, kamēr "
"tam veidojam pastāvīgu mājvietu gitlab.  Tar arhīvi ar rīkiem ir šeit: "
"L<https://download.libguestfs.org/guestfs-tools/>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:15
msgid ""
"Spinning out all of the tools into a new repository has made libguestfs a "
"bit easier and simpler to build and manage, and allows us to focus on just "
"being the API."
msgstr ""
"Visu rīku izdalīšana jaunā repozitorijā ir padarījusi libguestfs nedaudz "
"vieglāk un vienkāršāk būvējamu un pārvaldāmu un ļauj mums koncentrēties "
"tikai uz API."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:19
msgid ""
"Note that the tools L<guestfish(1)> (which is really a \"shell API\"), "
"L<guestmount(1)>, L<libguestfs-test-tool(1)> and L<virt-rescue(1)> are still "
"part of the libguestfs repo."
msgstr ""
"Ņemiet vērā, ka rīki L<guestfish(1)> (kas patiesībā ir „čaulas API”), "
"L<guestmount(1)>, L<libguestfs-test-tool(1)> un L<virt-rescue(1)> joprojām "
"ir libguestfs repozitorija daļa."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:23
msgid ""
"The not quite so big news is that we have moved away from FreeNode to Libera "
"Chat for IRC.  The new channel on Libera is called C<#guestfs> (thanks "
"Daniel Berrangé)."
msgstr ""
"Ne tik liela ziņa ir tā, ka IRC esam pārgājuši no FreeNode uz Libera Chat.  "
"Jaunais kanāls Libera tīklā ir C<#guestfs> (paldies Daniel Berrangé)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:29
msgid ""
"Libguestfs is now compatible with Go 1.16, and defines a Go module (thanks "
"Gianfranco Costamagna)."
msgstr ""
"Libguestfs tagad ir saderīga ar Go 1.16 un definē Go moduli (paldies "
"Gianfranco Costamagna)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:32
msgid "Memory leaks in Python APIs that returned structs are fixed (thanks 朱丹)."
msgstr ""
"Izlabotas atmiņas noplūdes Python API, kas atgrieza struktūras (paldies 朱丹)"
"."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:34
msgid "Python PyPi code has been relicensed to LGPLv2+ (from GPLv2+)."
msgstr "Python PyPi kods ir pārlicencēts uz LGPLv2+ (no GPLv2+)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:38
msgid ""
"Inspection of RPM guests now uses librpm instead of trying to parse the "
"Berkeley DB directly.  Since most RPM-based guests have replaced BDB with "
"sqlite this allows us to read these newer guests while retaining "
"compatibility with the older guests (thanks Panu Matilainen)."
msgstr ""
"RPM viesu inspicēšana tagad izmanto librpm, nevis mēģina tieši parsēt "
"Berkeley DB.  Tā kā lielākajā daļā uz RPM balstīto viesu BDB ir aizstāts ar "
"sqlite, tas ļauj mums nolasīt šos jaunākos viesus, saglabājot saderību ar "
"vecākajiem viesiem (paldies Panu Matilainen)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:43
msgid ""
"Inspection of RHEL 8+ with split /usr configuration has been made more "
"reliable."
msgstr ""
"RHEL 8+ ar sadalītu /usr konfigurāciju inspicēšana ir padarīta uzticamāka."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:46
msgid "Inspection of Windows Server 2022 should now work correctly (Yongkui Guo)."
msgstr ""
"Windows Server 2022 inspicēšanai tagad vajadzētu darboties pareizi (Yongkui "
"Guo)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:53
msgid "No new APIs were added in libguestfs 1.46."
msgstr "Libguestfs 1.46 netika pievienotas jaunas API."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:57
msgid ""
"The output of the C<guestfs_cap_get_file> API has changed slightly because "
"of changes in the underlying libcap.  This isn't strictly speaking an API "
"break because the new output is a still valid but more compact description "
"of file capabilities, but because it is different it may cause problems for "
"users of the API."
msgstr ""
"API C<guestfs_cap_get_file> izvade ir nedaudz mainījusies pamatā esošās "
"libcap izmaiņu dēļ.  Stingri ņemot, tas nav API pārrāvums, jo jaunā izvade "
"joprojām ir derīgs, bet kompaktāks failu spēju apraksts, taču, tā kā tā "
"atšķiras, tā var radīt problēmas API lietotājiem."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:63
msgid ""
"The C<guestfs_mkfs_btrfs> API now ignores the C<allocstart> parameter since "
"it was deprecated by btrfs 4.14.1 and later removed."
msgstr ""
"API C<guestfs_mkfs_btrfs> tagad ignorē parametru C<allocstart>, jo btrfs "
"4.14.1 to atzina par novecojušu un vēlāk noņēma."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:66
msgid ""
"C<guestfs_isoinfo_*> APIs now directly parse the CD Primary Volume "
"Descriptor instead of using an external tool.  The APIs should appear to "
"work exactly the same (thanks Thomas Schmitt)."
msgstr ""
"API C<guestfs_isoinfo_*> tagad tieši parsē CD primārā sējuma deskriptoru, "
"nevis izmanto ārēju rīku.  API vajadzētu šķist darbojamies tieši tāpat "
"(paldies Thomas Schmitt)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:70
msgid ""
"You can now force the appliance to use KVM or fail if not supported (Sam "
"Eiderman)."
msgstr ""
"Tagad var piespiest palīgsistēmu izmantot KVM vai neizdoties, ja tas netiek "
"atbalstīts (Sam Eiderman)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:73
msgid ""
"Because of a change to XFS in version 5, disabling lazy-counters no longer "
"works.  The API still works for earlier versions of XFS (Laszlo Ersek)."
msgstr ""
"XFS 5. versijas izmaiņu dēļ slinko skaitītāju atspējošana vairs nedarbojas.  "
"API joprojām darbojas ar vecākām XFS versijām (Laszlo Ersek)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:79
msgid "The build now uses and requires PCRE2 (instead of PCRE)."
msgstr "Būvēšana tagad izmanto un pieprasa PCRE2 (nevis PCRE)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:81
msgid "This version requires libvirt E<ge> 7.1.0, if libvirt is enabled."
msgstr "Šai versijai nepieciešams libvirt E<ge> 7.1.0, ja libvirt ir iespējots."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:83
msgid ""
"gnulib is no longer bundled with libguestfs, making builds from git much "
"simpler."
msgstr ""
"gnulib vairs netiek iekļauts libguestfs, padarot būvēšanu no git daudz "
"vienkāršāku."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:86
msgid ""
"Perl C<Sys::Virt> (libvirt bindings for Perl) are no longer required by "
"libguestfs."
msgstr ""
"Perl C<Sys::Virt> (libvirt saistījumi Perl) libguestfs vairs nav "
"nepieciešami."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:89
msgid ""
"The code has been compiled with both LTO and GCC I<-fanalyzer> and many bugs "
"and warnings fixed."
msgstr ""
"Kods ir kompilēts gan ar LTO, gan ar GCC I<-fanalyzer>, un daudzas kļūdas un "
"brīdinājumi ir izlaboti."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:92
msgid ""
"Allow projects like guestfs-tools and virt-v2v to be compiled with locally "
"built (but not installed) libguestfs (Laszlo Ersek)."
msgstr ""
"Ļaut tādus projektus kā guestfs-tools un virt-v2v kompilēt ar lokāli "
"uzbūvētu (bet neinstalētu) libguestfs (Laszlo Ersek)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:95
msgid "Tests now run in parallel (many additional fixes by Laszlo Ersek)."
msgstr ""
"Testi tagad tiek izpildīti paralēli (daudzi papildu labojumi no Laszlo Ersek)"
"."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:97
msgid "Work around RAID0 regression in Linux 3.14/5.4 (Laszlo Ersek)."
msgstr "Apiet RAID0 regresiju Linux 3.14/5.4 (Laszlo Ersek)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:99
msgid "Support for RISC-V (Heinrich Schuchardt)."
msgstr "RISC-V atbalsts (Heinrich Schuchardt)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:101
msgid "Support for building on Alma and Cloud Linux (Александр Кравченко)."
msgstr "Būvēšanas atbalsts Alma un Cloud Linux (Александр Кравченко)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:103
msgid "Fix to compile with OCaml 4.12."
msgstr "Labojums kompilēšanai ar OCaml 4.12."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:105
msgid ""
"The tarball no longer includes the F<ChangeLog> file.  To get a detailed "
"changelog, please look at the upstream git repository."
msgstr ""
"Tar arhīvā vairs nav faila F<ChangeLog>.  Lai iegūtu detalizētu izmaiņu "
"žurnālu, skatiet augšteces git repozitoriju."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:108
msgid "Don't assume bash in the F<./configure> script (Martin Kletzander)."
msgstr "Nepieņemt bash skriptā F<./configure> (Martin Kletzander)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:110
msgid "Fix F<./configure --with-distro> option (Alexandre Iooss)."
msgstr "Izlabota opcija F<./configure --with-distro> (Alexandre Iooss)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:112
msgid "Various fixes for qemu 6.1."
msgstr "Dažādi labojumi qemu 6.1."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:114
msgid "Fix creating appliance dependencies on Debian (Hilko Bengen)."
msgstr "Izlabota palīgsistēmas atkarību izveide Debian (Hilko Bengen)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:116
msgid ""
"Update appliance packages on SUSE and several other improvements to the init "
"script (Olaf Hering)."
msgstr ""
"Atjauninātas palīgsistēmas pakotnes SUSE un vairāki citi init skripta "
"uzlabojumi (Olaf Hering)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:121
msgid ""
"We now use the qemu / libvirt feature I<-cpu max> to select the best CPU to "
"run the appliance.  This should improve performance for things like "
"encrypted disks (Daniel Berrangé)."
msgstr ""
"Tagad izmantojam qemu / libvirt līdzekli I<-cpu max>, lai izvēlētos labāko "
"CPU palīgsistēmas izpildei.  Tam vajadzētu uzlabot veiktspēju tādām lietām "
"kā šifrēti diski (Daniel Berrangé)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.46.pod:125
msgid ""
"When passing the appliance filesystem UUID to supermin we now read it "
"directly out of the appliance instead of using the L<file(1)> program.  This "
"is more reliable, especially as file often breaks or changed its output."
msgstr ""
