#. type: =head1
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:5
msgid "RELEASE NOTES FOR LIBGUESTFS 1.48"
msgstr "LIBGUESTFS 1.48 LAIDIENA PIEZĪMES"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:7
msgid ""
"These are the release notes for libguestfs stable release 1.48.  This "
"describes the major changes since 1.46."
msgstr ""
"Šīs ir libguestfs stabilā laidiena 1.48 piezīmes.  Tās apraksta galvenās "
"izmaiņas kopš 1.46."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:10
msgid "Libguestfs 1.48.0 was released on B<14 March 2022>."
msgstr "Libguestfs 1.48.0 tika izlaists B<2022. gada 14. martā>."

#. type: =head2
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:12
msgid "Some features removed"
msgstr "Daži līdzekļi noņemti"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:14
msgid ""
"The following little used, experimental or unsafe features have been "
"removed:"
msgstr "Šie maz izmantotie, eksperimentālie vai nedrošie līdzekļi ir noņemti:"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:17
msgid ""
"\"Libguestfs live\" was an experimental feature that allowed you (in theory) "
"to connect to an existing instance of the libguestfs daemon in a running "
"guest.  If you want to do this we recommend installing qemu-guest-agent in "
"the guest instead and using the APIs provided by it.  The related C<unix:> "
"backend has been removed.  The L<guestfish(1)> and L<guestmount(1)> "
"I<--live> option now prints an error."
msgstr ""
"„Libguestfs live” bija eksperimentāls līdzeklis, kas (teorētiski) ļāva "
"savienoties ar esošu libguestfs dēmona instanci darbojošā viesī.  Ja "
"vēlaties to darīt, iesakām tā vietā viesī instalēt qemu-guest-agent un "
"izmantot tā nodrošinātās API.  Saistītā aizmugursistēma C<unix:> ir "
"noņemta.  L<guestfish(1)> un L<guestmount(1)> opcija I<--live> tagad izdrukā "
"kļūdu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:25
msgid ""
"The User-mode Linux (C<uml>) backend has been removed.  It was an alternate "
"hypervisor that could be used instead of qemu.  It had many limitations "
"including lack of network support, and lack of qemu native features like "
"qcow2 or network-backed disks.  In addition it was slower than KVM and "
"particular features like bulk upload/download were painfully slow.  Also the "
"UML feature of Linux that it was based on often does not work."
msgstr ""
"User-mode Linux (C<uml>) aizmugursistēma ir noņemta.  Tas bija alternatīvs "
"hipervizors, ko varēja izmantot qemu vietā.  Tam bija daudz ierobežojumu, "
"tostarp tīkla atbalsta trūkums un qemu vietējo līdzekļu, piemēram, qcow2 vai "
"tīklā balstītu disku, trūkums.  Turklāt tas bija lēnāks par KVM, un noteikti "
"līdzekļi, piemēram, lielapjoma augšupielāde/lejupielāde, bija sāpīgi lēni.  "
"Arī Linux UML līdzeklis, uz kura tas balstījās, bieži nedarbojas."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:33
msgid ""
"The 9pfs APIs C<guestfs_list_9p> and C<guestfs_mount_9p> have been "
"deprecated and now return errors.  This was related to an experimental "
"feature for passing through host filesystems to the appliance.  You had to "
"hand-hack the qemu command line for this to work and it did not fit the "
"libguestfs model very well."
msgstr ""
"9pfs API C<guestfs_list_9p> un C<guestfs_mount_9p> ir novecojušas un tagad "
"atgriež kļūdas.  Tas bija saistīts ar eksperimentālu līdzekli resursdatora "
"failu sistēmu nodošanai palīgsistēmai.  Lai tas darbotos, bija ar roku "
"jāpielāgo qemu komandrinda, un tas īpaši neiederējās libguestfs modelī."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:39
msgid ""
"C<guestfs_add_drive> no longer supports hotplugging (adding a drive after "
"launch), and C<guestfs_remove_drive> has been deprecated and now returns an "
"error.  Hotplugging was an unsuccessful feature which was complicated to "
"implement and maintain, and was slow and insecure.  It also only worked with "
"the non-default libvirt backend, and was never implemented in the default "
"\"direct\" backend."
msgstr ""
"C<guestfs_add_drive> vairs neatbalsta karsto pievienošanu (diska "
"pievienošanu pēc palaišanas), un C<guestfs_remove_drive> ir novecojis un "
"tagad atgriež kļūdu.  Karstā pievienošana bija neveiksmīgs līdzeklis, ko "
"bija sarežģīti realizēt un uzturēt, un tas bija lēns un nedrošs.  Tas arī "
"darbojās tikai ar libvirt aizmugursistēmu, kas nav noklusējuma, un nekad "
"netika realizēts noklusējuma „direct” aizmugursistēmā."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:48
msgid ""
"Fix allocation and deallocation of string lists in golang bindings (Laszlo "
"Ersek)."
msgstr ""
"Izlabota virkņu sarakstu piešķiršana un atbrīvošana golang saistījumos "
"(Laszlo Ersek)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:51
msgid ""
"Multiple fixes to the OCaml bindings: Fix warnings, move minimum version to "
"OCaml 4.04, replace various deprecated OCaml features with modern OCaml "
"features."
msgstr ""
"Vairāki labojumi OCaml saistījumos: izlaboti brīdinājumi, minimālā versija "
"pārcelta uz OCaml 4.04, dažādi novecojuši OCaml līdzekļi aizstāti ar "
"moderniem OCaml līdzekļiem."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:55
msgid ""
"Running C<make distclean> in the F<rust> directory now completely cleans the "
"cargo temporary files."
msgstr ""
"C<make distclean> izpilde direktorijā F<rust> tagad pilnībā iztīra cargo "
"pagaidu failus."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:60
msgid "Fix inspection of modern Pardus GNU/Linux (Laszlo Ersek)."
msgstr "Izlabota mūsdienu Pardus GNU/Linux inspicēšana (Laszlo Ersek)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:62
msgid "Add support for Kylin (Laszlo Ersek)."
msgstr "Pievienots Kylin atbalsts (Laszlo Ersek)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:64
msgid "Add support for Rocky Linux (Neil Hanlon)."
msgstr "Pievienots Rocky Linux atbalsts (Neil Hanlon)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:66
msgid ""
"Inspection of guests which use LUKS encryption on top of LVM logical volumes "
"should now work (Laszlo Ersek)."
msgstr ""
"Viesu, kas izmanto LUKS šifrēšanu virs LVM loģiskajiem sējumiem, "
"inspicēšanai tagad vajadzētu darboties (Laszlo Ersek)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:73
msgid "No new APIs were added in libguestfs 1.48."
msgstr "Libguestfs 1.48 netika pievienotas jaunas API."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:77
msgid ""
"C<guestfs_list_9p> and C<guestfs_mount_9p> are deprecated and now return "
"errors."
msgstr ""
"C<guestfs_list_9p> un C<guestfs_mount_9p> ir novecojušas un tagad atgriež "
"kļūdas."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:80
msgid "C<guestfs_remove_drive> has been deprecated and now returns an error."
msgstr "C<guestfs_remove_drive> ir novecojis un tagad atgriež kļūdu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:82
msgid ""
"In C<guestfs_xfs_admin> the C<lazycounter> parameter is deprecated because "
"it is no longer supported in recent versions of XFS."
msgstr ""
"C<guestfs_xfs_admin> parametrs C<lazycounter> ir novecojis, jo jaunākās XFS "
"versijās tas vairs netiek atbalstīts."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:85
msgid ""
"Partition APIs now cope with the broken MBR partition tables created by "
"dosfstools E<ge> 4.2 (Laszlo Ersek)."
msgstr ""
"Nodalījumu API tagad tiek galā ar bojātajām MBR nodalījumu tabulām, ko veido "
"dosfstools E<ge> 4.2 (Laszlo Ersek)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:88
msgid ""
"In C<guestfs_md_create> the C<chunk> parameter should not be used with RAID "
"1.  Previously it was allowed but ignored, but now it will give an error "
"(Laszlo Ersek)."
msgstr ""
"C<guestfs_md_create> parametru C<chunk> nevajadzētu izmantot ar RAID 1.  "
"Iepriekš tas bija atļauts, bet ignorēts, taču tagad tas dos kļūdu (Laszlo "
"Ersek)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:94
msgid ""
"Multiple compiler warnings fixed and/or analyzed and suppressed (Laszlo "
"Ersek)."
msgstr ""
"Vairāki kompilatora brīdinājumi izlaboti un/vai analizēti un apslāpēti "
"(Laszlo Ersek)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:97
msgid ""
"Fix detection of optional Yara library using pkg-config instead of checking "
"for library/header file (Laszlo Ersek)."
msgstr ""
"Izlabota neobligātās Yara bibliotēkas noteikšana, izmantojot pkg-config, "
"nevis pārbaudot bibliotēkas/galvenes failu (Laszlo Ersek)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:100
msgid ""
"Update valgrind suppressions for glibc 2.35, OCaml 4.13 and libvirt 7.7.  "
"C<make check-valgrind> works again."
msgstr ""
"Atjaunināti valgrind apslāpējumi glibc 2.35, OCaml 4.13 un libvirt 7.7.  "
"C<make check-valgrind> atkal darbojas."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:103
msgid ""
"If using libvirt E<ge> 3.8.0, we now use E<lt>interfaceE<gt> to create the "
"appliance network interface instead of adding qemu command line parameters "
"(Laszlo Ersek)."
msgstr ""
"Ja izmanto libvirt E<ge> 3.8.0, palīgsistēmas tīkla saskarnes izveidei tagad "
"izmantojam E<lt>interfaceE<gt>, nevis pievienojam qemu komandrindas "
"parametrus (Laszlo Ersek)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:107
msgid ""
"The L<guestfs-release-notes(1)> page was a broken link, but it has now been "
"restored as a new page that links to the release notes from each stable "
"release."
msgstr ""
"Lapa L<guestfs-release-notes(1)> bija bojāta saite, taču tagad tā ir "
"atjaunota kā jauna lapa ar saitēm uz katra stabilā laidiena piezīmēm."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.48.pod:113
msgid ""
"The libc API L<strerror_r(3)> is difficult to use correctly because of "
"differing signatures in glibc and other libc.  A wrapper "
"C<guestfs_int_strerror> has been created to hide the differences."
msgstr ""
"Libc API L<strerror_r(3)> ir grūti pareizi izmantot atšķirīgo parakstu dēļ "
"glibc un citās libc.  Lai paslēptu atšķirības, ir izveidots ietinējs "
"C<guestfs_int_strerror>."

