msgstr "LIBGUESTFS 1.50 LAIDIENA PIEZĪMES"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:7
msgid ""
"These are the release notes for libguestfs stable release 1.50.  This "
"describes the major changes since 1.48."
msgstr ""
"Šīs ir libguestfs stabilā laidiena 1.50 piezīmes.  Tās apraksta galvenās "
"izmaiņas kopš 1.48."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:10
msgid "Libguestfs 1.50.0 was released on B<7 February 2023>."
msgstr "Libguestfs 1.50.0 tika izlaists B<2023. gada 7. februārī>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:14
msgid "Fix the PHP bindings for PHP8 (Geoff Amey)."
msgstr "Izlaboti PHP saistījumi PHP8 (Geoff Amey)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:16
msgid "Fix various deprecation warnings in the GObject bindings."
msgstr "Izlaboti dažādi novecošanas brīdinājumi GObject saistījumos."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:18
msgid ""
"We no longer use the deprecated Python distutils library (thanks Miro "
"Hrončok)."
msgstr ""
"Vairs neizmantojam novecojušo Python bibliotēku distutils (paldies Miro "
"Hrončok)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:23
msgid ""
"When listing the packages in RPM-based guests, the inspection API no longer "
"checks package signatures.  This is because the newer librpm used by "
"libguestfs does not understand signatures stored in older guests, such as "
"SHA1 used by RHEL 6 (thanks Panu Matilainen)."
msgstr ""
"Uzskaitot pakotnes uz RPM balstītos viesos, inspicēšanas API vairs "
"nepārbauda pakotņu parakstus.  Tas ir tāpēc, ka jaunākā librpm, ko izmanto "
"libguestfs, nesaprot parakstus, kas glabāti vecākos viesos, piemēram, SHA1, "
"ko izmanto RHEL 6 (paldies Panu Matilainen)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:28
msgid ""
"L<guestfs(3)/guestfs_inspect_get_hostname> can now handle F</etc/hostname> "
"files containing comments (thanks Dawid Zamirski)."
msgstr ""
"L<guestfs(3)/guestfs_inspect_get_hostname> tagad var apstrādāt failus F</etc/"
"hostname> ar komentāriem (paldies Dawid Zamirski)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:31
msgid ""
"L<guestfs(3)/guestfs_file_architecture> can now parse files using zstd "
"compression."
msgstr ""
"L<guestfs(3)/guestfs_file_architecture> tagad var parsēt failus ar zstd "
"saspiešanu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:34
msgid ""
"L<guestfs(3)/guestfs_inspect_get_osinfo> now returns the correct osinfo "
"field for Windows 11.  However because of decisions made by Microsoft, these "
"guests still return product name and other strings identifying as Windows 10 "
"(thanks Yaakov Selkowitz, Yongkui Guo)."
msgstr ""
"L<guestfs(3)/guestfs_inspect_get_osinfo> tagad atgriež pareizo osinfo lauku "
"Windows 11.  Tomēr Microsoft pieņemto lēmumu dēļ šie viesi joprojām atgriež "
"produkta nosaukumu un citas virknes, kas identificējas kā Windows 10 "
"(paldies Yaakov Selkowitz, Yongkui Guo)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:43
msgid ""
"L<guestfs(3)/guestfs_device_name> is a new API to read the device name "
"associated with a drive, for example calling this with C<0> will return "
"C</dev/sda>."
msgstr ""
"L<guestfs(3)/guestfs_device_name> ir jauna API ar disku saistītā ierīces "
"nosaukuma nolasīšanai, piemēram, izsaucot to ar C<0>, tiks atgriezts C</dev/"
"sda>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:47
msgid ""
"L<guestfs(3)/guestfs_clevis_luks_unlock> is a new API for unlocking disks "
"using the Clevis/Tang network-based full disk encryption scheme.  "
"Furthermore implement this in guestfish and guestmount (Laszlo Ersek)."
msgstr ""
"L<guestfs(3)/guestfs_clevis_luks_unlock> ir jauna API disku atbloķēšanai, "
"izmantojot Clevis/Tang tīklā balstīto pilna diska šifrēšanas shēmu.  Turklāt "
"tas realizēts guestfish un guestmount (Laszlo Ersek)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:51
msgid ""
"L<guestfs(3)/guestfs_inspect_get_build_id> is a new API for reading the "
"build ID from some Linux and Windows guests.  It is not widely used on "
"Linux, but for Windows it is vital for identifying Windows 11."
msgstr ""
"L<guestfs(3)/guestfs_inspect_get_build_id> ir jauna API būvējuma ID "
"nolasīšanai no dažiem Linux un Windows viesiem.  Linux tā netiek plaši "
"izmantota, bet Windows tā ir būtiska Windows 11 identificēšanai."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:57
msgid ""
"In the L<guestfs(3)/guestfs_add_drive> API, the C<name> and C<iface> fields "
"are not used.  C<name> has not been used since around 2017, but the "
"documentation has only just been updated to reflect this.  C<iface> was "
"never allowed for the libvirt backend and didn't work reliably with the "
"direct backend (Laszlo Ersek)."
msgstr ""
"API L<guestfs(3)/guestfs_add_drive> lauki C<name> un C<iface> netiek "
"izmantoti.  C<name> nav izmantots kopš aptuveni 2017. gada, taču "
"dokumentācija tikko atjaunināta, lai to atspoguļotu.  C<iface> nekad nebija "
"atļauts libvirt aizmugursistēmai un uzticami nedarbojās ar tiešo "
"aizmugursistēmu (Laszlo Ersek)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:63
msgid ""
"L<guestfs(3)/guestfs_readdir> is no longer limited to the maximum message "
"size but can read a directory of any size (Laszlo Ersek)."
msgstr ""
"L<guestfs(3)/guestfs_readdir> vairs nav ierobežots ar maksimālo ziņojuma "
"izmēru, bet var nolasīt jebkura izmēra direktoriju (Laszlo Ersek)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:68
msgid ""
"B<Note> that the Augeas bindings for libguestfs are no longer bundled with "
"libguestfs and must be built separately.  See: "
"L<https://people.redhat.com/~rjones/augeas/> For RHEL 7+ rebuilding the "
"Fedora Rawhide package will work."
msgstr ""
"B<Ņemiet vērā>, ka libguestfs Augeas saistījumi vairs netiek iekļauti "
"libguestfs un tie jābūvē atsevišķi.  Skatiet: L<https://people.redhat.com/"
"~rjones/augeas/> RHEL 7+ darbosies Fedora Rawhide pakotnes pārbūvēšana."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:73
msgid ""
"B<Note> that libguestfs now requires minimum OCaml 4.04.  It will not "
"compile on RHEL 6."
msgstr ""
"B<Ņemiet vērā>, ka libguestfs tagad nepieciešams vismaz OCaml 4.04.  Tas "
"netiks kompilēts RHEL 6."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:76
msgid "B<Note> that zstd is now a required dependency."
msgstr "B<Ņemiet vērā>, ka zstd tagad ir obligāta atkarība."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:78
msgid ""
"OCaml gettext is no longer a dependency of libguestfs.  (Plain gettext is "
"still optionally used to translate C source files.)"
msgstr ""
"OCaml gettext vairs nav libguestfs atkarība.  (Parastais gettext joprojām "
"pēc izvēles tiek izmantots C pirmkoda failu tulkošanai.)"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:81
msgid "Add support for OCaml 4.14."
msgstr "Pievienots OCaml 4.14 atbalsts."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:83
msgid "Fix build for missing stdlib functions in OCaml 4.04."
msgstr "Izlabota būvēšana OCaml 4.04 trūkstošu stdlib funkciju dēļ."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:85
msgid ""
"Fix C<./configure --disable-ocaml>.  OCaml is still required to build "
"libguestfs, but this now correctly disables the OCaml bindings of the API."
msgstr ""
"Izlabots C<./configure --disable-ocaml>.  OCaml joprojām ir nepieciešams "
"libguestfs būvēšanai, taču tagad tas pareizi atspējo API OCaml saistījumus."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:89
msgid ""
"Add support for building on Artix, Rocky and Virtuozzo (Halil Tezcan "
"KARABULUT, Neil Hanlon, Andrey Drobyshev).  In addition when working out the "
"local distro we now look at C<$ID_LIKE> in F</etc/os-release> before C<$ID> "
"which helps on Arch (thanks S D Rausty)."
msgstr ""
"Pievienots būvēšanas atbalsts Artix, Rocky un Virtuozzo (Halil Tezcan "
"KARABULUT, Neil Hanlon, Andrey Drobyshev).  Turklāt, nosakot lokālo "
"distribūciju, tagad skatāmies C<$ID_LIKE> failā F</etc/os-release> pirms "
"C<$ID>, kas palīdz Arch (paldies S D Rausty)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:94
msgid "Add preliminary support for compiling libguestfs on macOS."
msgstr "Pievienots sākotnējs atbalsts libguestfs kompilēšanai macOS."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:96
msgid ""
"Fix website description of cloning the libguestfs repository (Kashyap "
"Chamarthy)."
msgstr ""
"Izlabots tīmekļa vietnes apraksts par libguestfs repozitorija klonēšanu "
"(Kashyap Chamarthy)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:99
msgid "We no longer use glibc custom printf."
msgstr "Vairs neizmantojam glibc pielāgoto printf."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:101
msgid ""
"We no longer use C<LD_PRELOAD=libSegFault.so> in the appliance.  This "
"feature was removed in glibc 2.35."
msgstr ""
"Palīgsistēmā vairs neizmantojam C<LD_PRELOAD=libSegFault.so>.  Šis līdzeklis "
"tika noņemts glibc 2.35."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:104
msgid "We no longer use dtrace / systemtap probes."
msgstr "Vairs neizmantojam dtrace / systemtap zondes."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:108
msgid "Fix regression tests to use correct paths (Nikolay Shirokovskiy)."
msgstr ""
"Izlaboti regresijas testi, lai izmantotu pareizos ceļus (Nikolay "
"Shirokovskiy)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:110
msgid "Various improvements to qcow2 appliance handling (Andrey Drobyshev)."
msgstr "Dažādi uzlabojumi qcow2 palīgsistēmas apstrādē (Andrey Drobyshev)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:112
msgid ""
"Disable 5-level page tables in qemu.  This avoids a bug in older versions of "
"qemu."
msgstr ""
"Atspējotas qemu 5 līmeņu lapu tabulas.  Tas ļauj izvairīties no kļūdas "
"vecākās qemu versijās."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:115
msgid ""
"Disable the LVM2 devicesfile in the appliance since it interferes with "
"cloned LVs that have the same UUID (Laszlo Ersek)."
msgstr ""
"Palīgsistēmā atspējots LVM2 devicesfile, jo tas traucē klonētiem LV ar "
"vienādu UUID (Laszlo Ersek)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:118
msgid ""
"Don't use C<-cpu max> on RISC-V as it is not yet supported by qemu's TCG "
"emulation of that architecture.  This will be re-enabled when qemu gets "
"support."
msgstr ""
"Neizmantot C<-cpu max> RISC-V, jo qemu šīs arhitektūras TCG emulācija to vēl "
"neatbalsta.  Tas tiks atkal iespējots, kad qemu iegūs atbalstu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:122
msgid ""
"Avoid a rare hang that would happen when launching the appliance.  This "
"turned out to be caused by using the unsafe call L<setenv(3)> between fork "
"and exec (thanks Siddhesh Poyarekar)."
msgstr ""
"Izvairīties no retas uzkāršanās, kas notika, palaižot palīgsistēmu.  "
"Izrādījās, ka to izraisīja nedroša izsaukuma L<setenv(3)> izmantošana starp "
"fork un exec (paldies Siddhesh Poyarekar)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.50.pod:126
msgid ""
"When running the file command inside the appliance we now disable seccomp "
"since it interferes with processing compressed files (thanks David Runge, "
"Toolybird)."
msgstr ""
"Izpildot komandu file palīgsistēmā, tagad atspējojam seccomp, jo tas traucē "
"saspiestu failu apstrādi (paldies David Runge, Toolybird)."

