#. type: =head1
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:5
msgid "RELEASE NOTES FOR LIBGUESTFS 1.52"
msgstr "LIBGUESTFS 1.52 LAIDIENA PIEZĪMES"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:7
msgid ""
"These are the release notes for libguestfs stable release 1.52.  This "
"describes the major changes since 1.50."
msgstr ""
"Šīs ir libguestfs stabilā laidiena 1.52 piezīmes.  Tās apraksta galvenās "
"izmaiņas kopš 1.50."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:10
msgid "Libguestfs 1.52.0 was released on B<5 January 2024>."
msgstr "Libguestfs 1.52.0 tika izlaists B<2024. gada 5. janvārī>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:14
msgid ""
"The Python bindings now use C<bytes> (instead of C<str>) for the event "
"callback message, since it may contain arbitrary 8 bit data (thanks Yonatan "
"Shtarkman)."
msgstr ""
"Python saistījumi tagad notikuma atzvana ziņojumam izmanto C<bytes> (nevis "
"C<str>), jo tas var saturēt patvaļīgus 8 bitu datus (paldies Yonatan "
"Shtarkman)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:18
msgid ""
"Also in the Python bindings, fix a rare crash, and avoid memory leaks in "
"event callbacks (thanks Yonatan Shtarkman, Laszlo Ersek, Eric Blake)."
msgstr ""
"Arī Python saistījumos izlabota reta avārija un novērstas atmiņas noplūdes "
"notikumu atzvanos (paldies Yonatan Shtarkman, Laszlo Ersek, Eric Blake)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:22
msgid ""
"Support for OCaml 5, and OCaml E<ge> 4.07 is now the minimum (thanks "
"Guillaume Munch-Maccagnoni, Jerry James, Josh Berdine, Jürgen Hötzel, "
"Vincent Laviron)."
msgstr ""
"OCaml 5 atbalsts; minimālā versija tagad ir OCaml E<ge> 4.07 (paldies "
"Guillaume Munch-Maccagnoni, Jerry James, Josh Berdine, Jürgen Hötzel, "
"Vincent Laviron)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:26
msgid ""
"The OCaml bindings now release the runtime lock around calls to "
"C<guestfs_close>, since that call might be long-running (for example it "
"might have to shut down the appliance and synch disks)."
msgstr ""
"OCaml saistījumi tagad atbrīvo izpildlaika slēdzeni ap C<guestfs_close> "
"izsaukumiem, jo šis izsaukums var būt ilgstošs (piemēram, tam var nākties "
"izslēgt palīgsistēmu un sinhronizēt diskus)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:32
msgid "Support OpencloudOS (cunshunxia@tencent)."
msgstr "OpencloudOS atbalsts (cunshunxia@tencent)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:36
msgid ""
"SELinux relabelling now runs in parallel, meaning it's a lot quicker (Andrey "
"Drobyshev)."
msgstr ""
"SELinux etiķešu atkārtota piešķiršana tagad notiek paralēli, t. i., daudz "
"ātrāk (Andrey Drobyshev)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:39
msgid ""
"Add support for lzma and zstd compression methods in tar APIs (like "
"C<guestfs_tar_in>) (Zixun LI)."
msgstr ""
"Pievienots lzma un zstd saspiešanas metožu atbalsts tar API (piemēram, "
"C<guestfs_tar_in>) (Zixun LI)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:42
msgid ""
"C<guestfs_pvs_full> previously didn't always return the correct device "
"names.  This has now been fixed."
msgstr ""
"C<guestfs_pvs_full> iepriekš ne vienmēr atgrieza pareizos ierīču "
"nosaukumus.  Tagad tas ir izlabots."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:45
msgid ""
"C<guestfs_btrfs_filesystem_balance> fixed so it now works with more modern "
"btrfs tools (Jürgen Hötzel)."
msgstr ""
"C<guestfs_btrfs_filesystem_balance> izlabots, lai tagad darbotos ar "
"modernākiem btrfs rīkiem (Jürgen Hötzel)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:50
msgid ""
"The L<guestfish(1)> I<--key> option now recognizes LVM names like "
"F</dev/mapper/rhel_bootp--73--75--123-root> (Laszlo Ersek)."
msgstr ""
"L<guestfish(1)> opcija I<--key> tagad atpazīst LVM nosaukumus, piemēram, F</"
"dev/mapper/rhel_bootp--73--75--123-root> (Laszlo Ersek)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:53
msgid ""
"guestfish I<--key> option also supports a new S<I<--key all:...>> selector "
"to try the same key on all devices."
msgstr ""
"Guestfish opcija I<--key> atbalsta arī jaunu atlasītāju S<I<--key all:...>>, "
"lai izmēģinātu vienu atslēgu visās ierīcēs."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:56
msgid ""
"In L<guestmount(1)> avoid calling C<fclose(NULL)> on error paths, which "
"might have caused a crash on some platforms."
msgstr ""
"L<guestmount(1)> kļūdu ceļos izvairīties no C<fclose(NULL)> izsaukšanas, kas "
"dažās platformās varēja izraisīt avāriju."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:61
msgid ""
"The C<RELEASES> file (which listed release dates) has been removed and "
"replaced with a simple C<RELEASE_DATE> macro in F<./configure>.  This should "
"simplify builds."
msgstr ""
"Fails C<RELEASES> (kurā bija uzskaitīti izdošanas datumi) ir noņemts un "
"aizstāts ar vienkāršu makro C<RELEASE_DATE> failā F<./configure>.  Tam "
"vajadzētu vienkāršot būvēšanu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:65
msgid "Optionally L<passt(1)> may be used for networking (Laszlo Ersek)."
msgstr "Tīklošanai pēc izvēles var izmantot L<passt(1)> (Laszlo Ersek)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:67
msgid "L<dhcpcd(8)> is now used in preference to dh-client on Red Hat platforms."
msgstr ""
"Red Hat platformās tagad priekšroka tiek dota L<dhcpcd(8)>, nevis dh-client."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:70
msgid ""
"Old Ruby C<MiniTest> and C<Test::Unit> dependencies replaced with new "
"C<Minitest>."
msgstr ""
"Vecās Ruby C<MiniTest> un C<Test::Unit> atkarības aizstātas ar jauno "
"C<Minitest>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:73
msgid "Fix compatibility issues with libxml2 2.12."
msgstr "Izlabotas saderības problēmas ar libxml2 2.12."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:77
msgid ""
"On x86-64 we now use the more modern q35 machine type when running the "
"appliance.  This should perform slightly better and has more development "
"attention from the qemu community.  The change should be invisible to "
"libguestfs users."
msgstr ""
"X86-64, izpildot palīgsistēmu, tagad izmantojam modernāko mašīnas tipu q35.  "
"Tam vajadzētu darboties nedaudz labāk, un tam ir lielāka qemu kopienas "
"izstrādes uzmanība.  Izmaiņām libguestfs lietotājiem jābūt nemanāmām."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:82
msgid ""
"Fix a segmentation fault when C<TERM> environment variable was set to "
"C<dumb> (Daisuke HATAYAMA)."
msgstr ""
"Izlabota segmentācijas kļūda, ja vides mainīgais C<TERM> bija iestatīts uz "
"C<dumb> (Daisuke HATAYAMA)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:85
msgid ""
"Avoid a warning on modern Fedora which does not have F</selinux> (Andrey "
"Drobyshev)."
msgstr ""
"Izvairīties no brīdinājuma modernajā Fedorā, kurā nav F</selinux> (Andrey "
"Drobyshev)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.52.pod:88
msgid ""
"Fix build on OpenSUSE LEAP 15 or other distros with a L<file(1)> command "
"which did not understand the I<-S> option (thanks Olaf Hering)."
msgstr ""
"Izlabota būvēšana OpenSUSE LEAP 15 vai citās distribūcijās ar komandu L<file"
"(1)>, kas nesaprata opciju I<-S> (paldies Olaf Hering)."

