#. type: =head1
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:5
msgid "RELEASE NOTES FOR LIBGUESTFS 1.54"
msgstr "LIBGUESTFS 1.54 LAIDIENA PIEZĪMES"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:7
msgid ""
"These are the release notes for libguestfs stable release 1.54.  This "
"describes the major changes since 1.52."
msgstr ""
"Šīs ir libguestfs stabilā laidiena 1.54 piezīmes.  Tās apraksta galvenās "
"izmaiņas kopš 1.52."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:10
msgid "Libguestfs 1.54.0 was released on B<8 October 2024>."
msgstr "Libguestfs 1.54.0 tika izlaists B<2024. gada 8. oktobrī>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:20
msgid "Add detection of Circle Linux (Bella Zhang)."
msgstr "Pievienota Circle Linux noteikšana (Bella Zhang)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:22
msgid "Add support for LoongArch (liuxiang)."
msgstr "Pievienots LoongArch atbalsts (liuxiang)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:24
msgid "Add detection of Kylin (grass-lu)."
msgstr "Pievienota Kylin noteikšana (grass-lu)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:26
msgid "Add detection of openEuler (Wang Guoquan)."
msgstr "Pievienota openEuler noteikšana (Wang Guoquan)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:28
msgid "C<PARTUUID> and C<PARTLABEL> are now resolved in guest F</etc/fstab>."
msgstr "C<PARTUUID> un C<PARTLABEL> tagad tiek atrisināti viesa F</etc/fstab>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:32
msgid ""
"B<New APIs> C<findfs_partuuid> and C<findfs_partlabel>.  These can be used "
"to efficiently look up a filesystem by its GPT partition UUID or label."
msgstr ""
"B<Jaunas API> C<findfs_partuuid> un C<findfs_partlabel>.  Tās var izmantot, "
"lai efektīvi meklētu failu sistēmu pēc tās GPT nodalījuma UUID vai etiķetes."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:36
msgid ""
"Support for the following inactive or infrequently used device types has "
"been B<removed>: Gluster, Sheepdog, TFTP."
msgstr ""
"Atbalsts šādiem neaktīviem vai reti izmantotiem ierīču tipiem ir B<noņemts>: "
"Gluster, Sheepdog, TFTP."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:39
msgid ""
"Add GOST R34.11-94 message digest algorithm to checksum APIs (Alexey "
"Shabalin)."
msgstr ""
"Kontrolsummu API pievienots GOST R34.11-94 ziņojumu īssavilkuma algoritms "
"(Alexey Shabalin)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:42
msgid ""
"Allow C<nbd+unix://> URIs (NBD over Unix domain socket) in guestfish and "
"other places."
msgstr ""
"Atļaut URI C<nbd+unix://> (NBD caur Unix domēna ligzdu) guestfish un citās "
"vietās."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:45
msgid ""
"Various C<part_*> (partition) APIs related to GPT have been reimplemented to "
"use util-linux sfdisk instead of sgdisk.  Util-linux is more widely "
"available, so this reduces dependencies in the common case.  One optional "
"API remains that still uses sgdisk.  (Thanks Yongkui Guo)."
msgstr ""
"Dažādas ar GPT saistītās C<part_*> (nodalījumu) API ir realizētas no jauna, "
"lai sgdisk vietā izmantotu util-linux sfdisk.  Util-linux ir plašāk "
"pieejams, tāpēc parastajā gadījumā tas samazina atkarības.  Paliek viena "
"neobligāta API, kas joprojām izmanto sgdisk.  (Paldies Yongkui Guo)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:51
msgid "Add C<cipher> suboption to C<cryptsetup_open> (Jonatan Pålsson)."
msgstr "C<cryptsetup_open> pievienota apakšopcija C<cipher> (Jonatan Pålsson)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:54
msgid ""
"Because of a bug, the C<part_get_gpt_attributes> API could truncate the "
"return value from 64 to 32 bits.  This has been fixed."
msgstr ""
"Kļūdas dēļ API C<part_get_gpt_attributes> varēja saīsināt atgriešanas "
"vērtību no 64 uz 32 bitiem.  Tas ir izlabots."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:65
msgid "Fix btrfs compatibility with kernel changes in Linux 6.7."
msgstr "Izlabota btrfs saderība ar kodola izmaiņām Linux 6.7."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:67
msgid ""
"Removed some compatibility code for versions of util-linux (sfdisk)  prior "
"to 2014."
msgstr ""
"Noņemta daļa saderības koda util-linux (sfdisk) versijām pirms 2014. gada."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:70
msgid ""
"Pass CFLAGS through when building the Perl bindings.  In particular this "
"means that I<-g> should be passed through correctly, enabling debugging "
"symbols."
msgstr ""
"Nodot CFLAGS tālāk, būvējot Perl saistījumus.  It īpaši tas nozīmē, ka I<-g> "
"vajadzētu pareizi nodot tālāk, iespējojot atkļūdošanas simbolus."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:74
msgid "Fix build on macOS (Antonio Caggiano)."
msgstr "Izlabota būvēšana macOS (Antonio Caggiano)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:78
msgid ""
"Libguestfs will now no longer recommend using C<LIBGUESTFS_BACKEND=direct>.  "
"This was shown previously when libvirt failed to start the appliance.  "
"However it is felt that this now does more harm than good."
msgstr ""
"Libguestfs vairs neieteiks izmantot C<LIBGUESTFS_BACKEND=direct>.  Tas "
"iepriekš tika rādīts, kad libvirt neizdevās palaist palīgsistēmu.  Tomēr "
"tiek uzskatīts, ka tagad tas nodara vairāk ļauna nekā laba."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:83
msgid "Fix generation of virt-customize I<--chown> parameter (Yongkui Guo)."
msgstr "Izlabota virt-customize parametra I<--chown> ģenerēšana (Yongkui Guo)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:85
msgid "In the appliance, reduce boot time when dhcp isn't needed (Olaf Hering)."
msgstr ""
"Palīgsistēmā samazināts sāknēšanas laiks, kad dhcp nav vajadzīgs (Olaf "
"Hering)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:88
msgid ""
"A deadlock in the appliance caused by a regression in Linux 6.11 has been "
"worked around.  The deadlock was also fixed in Linux 6.12."
msgstr ""
"Apiets palīgsistēmas strupceļš, ko izraisīja regresija Linux 6.11.  "
"Strupceļš tika izlabots arī Linux 6.12."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.54.pod:95
