#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:7
msgid ""
"These are the release notes for libguestfs stable release 1.56.  This "
"describes the major changes since 1.54."
msgstr ""
"Šīs ir libguestfs stabilā laidiena 1.56 piezīmes.  Tās apraksta galvenās "
"izmaiņas kopš 1.54."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:10
msgid "Libguestfs 1.56.0 was released on B<11th June 2025>."
msgstr "Libguestfs 1.56.0 tika izlaists B<11th June 2025>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:14
msgid "Add support for Windows 2025 (thanks Ming Xie)."
msgstr "Pievienots Windows 2025 atbalsts (paldies Ming Xie)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:16
msgid "Add support for TencentOS (Denise Cheng)."
msgstr "Pievienots TencentOS atbalsts (Denise Cheng)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:18
msgid ""
"Inspection of Ubuntu 22+ guests that use a split F</usr> configuration now "
"works properly (thanks Jaroslav Spanko, Daniel Berrange)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu 22+ viesu, kas izmanto sadalītu F</usr> konfigurāciju, inspicēšana "
"tagad darbojas pareizi (paldies Jaroslav Spanko, Daniel Berrange)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:21
msgid "Inspecting guests that have duplicated root mountpoints now works."
msgstr ""
"Viesu ar dublētiem saknes montēšanas punktiem inspicēšana tagad darbojas."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:23
msgid ""
"Inspection of SUSE Linux guests using btrfs snapshots now ignores snapshots "
"that mirror content in the root filesystem (thanks Ming Xie)."
msgstr ""
"SUSE Linux viesu, kas izmanto btrfs momentuzņēmumus, inspicēšana tagad "
"ignorē momentuzņēmumus, kas atspoguļo saknes failu sistēmas saturu (paldies "
"Ming Xie)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:27
msgid ""
"Inspection of SUSE Linux >= 15 now returns the correct osinfo short name "
"(eg. C<\"sle15\">) (thanks Ming Xie)."
msgstr ""
"SUSE Linux >= 15 inspicēšana tagad atgriež pareizo osinfo īso nosaukumu "
"(piem., C<\"sle15\">) (paldies Ming Xie)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:32
msgid ""
"New C<command_out> and C<sh_out> APIs which allow you to capture output from "
"guest commands that generate more output than the protocol limit allows."
msgstr ""
"Jaunas API C<command_out> un C<sh_out>, kas ļauj tvert izvadi no viesa "
"komandām, kuras ģenerē vairāk izvades, nekā ļauj protokola ierobežojums."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:36
msgid ""
"New C<btrfs_scrub_full> API which runs a full Btrfs scrub, synchronously.  "
"It works more like fsck for other filesystems."
msgstr ""
"Jauna API C<btrfs_scrub_full>, kas sinhroni izpilda pilnu Btrfs scrub.  Tā "
"darbojas vairāk kā fsck citām failu sistēmām."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:39
msgid ""
"The C<fstrim> API has been modified to work around several issues in "
"upstream and RHEL 9 kernels related to XFS support (Eric Sandeen, Dave "
"Chinner)."
msgstr ""
"API C<fstrim> ir mainīta, lai apietu vairākas problēmas augšteces un RHEL 9 "
"kodolos, kas saistītas ar XFS atbalstu (Eric Sandeen, Dave Chinner)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:43
msgid ""
"The existing C<e2fsck> API has a new C<FORCENO> option enabling use of the "
"command line I<-n> flag."
msgstr ""
"Esošajai API C<e2fsck> ir jauna opcija C<FORCENO>, kas ļauj izmantot "
"komandrindas karogu I<-n>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:54
msgid ""
"Previously C<-L../lib/.libs> got embedded in the distributed OCaml "
"bindings.  This has been fixed."
msgstr ""
"Iepriekš izplatītajos OCaml saistījumos tika iegults C<-L../lib/.libs>.  Tas "
"ir izlabots."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:57
msgid ""
"GObject bindings have been deprecated and will be removed in S<libguestfs "
"1.58>."
msgstr "GObject saistījumi ir novecojuši un tiks noņemti S<libguestfs 1.58>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:62
msgid ""
"json-c is now required.  This replaces Jansson which was previously used for "
"parsing JSON input files."
msgstr ""
"Tagad nepieciešams json-c.  Tas aizstāj Jansson, ko iepriekš izmantoja JSON "
"ievades failu parsēšanai."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:65
msgid "OCaml E<ge> 4.08 is now required."
msgstr "Tagad nepieciešams OCaml E<ge> 4.08."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:67
msgid "OCaml oUnit is no longer used."
msgstr "OCaml oUnit vairs netiek izmantots."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:69
msgid ""
"We now assume that C<__attribute__((cleanup))> always works.  This requires "
"gcc or Clang."
msgstr ""
"Tagad pieņemam, ka C<__attribute__((cleanup))> vienmēr darbojas.  Tam "
"vajadzīgs gcc vai Clang."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:72
msgid "Fix compatibility with L<file(1)> E<ge> 5.46."
msgstr "Izlabota saderība ar L<file(1)> E<ge> 5.46."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:74
msgid ""
"Fix compatibility with Fedora E<ge> 42 which merges F</usr/sbin> into "
"F</usr/bin>."
msgstr ""
"Izlabota saderība ar Fedora E<ge> 42, kas apvieno F</usr/sbin> ar F</usr/bin>"
"."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:77
msgid "Fix compatibility with latest Rust compiler (Jacob Reger)."
msgstr "Izlabota saderība ar jaunāko Rust kompilatoru (Jacob Reger)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:79
msgid ""
"L<lex(1)>, L<yacc(1)> and libmagic (part of L<file(1)>) have not been "
"required by libguestfs for a long time, but were still checked by the "
"F<./configure> script.  This has been fixed, they are no longer build "
"dependencies (thanks Mohamed Akram)."
msgstr ""
"L<lex(1)>, L<yacc(1)> un libmagic (daļa no L<file(1)>) libguestfs sen nav "
"bijuši vajadzīgi, taču skripts F<./configure> tos joprojām pārbaudīja.  Tas "
"ir izlabots, tās vairs nav būvēšanas atkarības (paldies Mohamed Akram)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:84
msgid ""
"When using C<./configure --disable-daemon> we no longer require augeas and "
"hivex (thanks Mohamed Akram)."
msgstr ""
"Izmantojot C<./configure --disable-daemon>, vairs nepieprasām augeas un "
"hivex (paldies Mohamed Akram)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:87
msgid ""
"C<zfs-fuse> support has been dropped.  The project is unmaintained upstream "
"(thanks Paul Bolle, Gwyn Ciesla, Timothée Ravier)."
msgstr ""
"C<zfs-fuse> atbalsts ir atmests.  Projekts augštecē netiek uzturēts (paldies "
"Paul Bolle, Gwyn Ciesla, Timothée Ravier)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:90
msgid "Fix compatibility with GNU gettext 0.25."
msgstr "Izlabota saderība ar GNU gettext 0.25."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:94
msgid ""
"The tests were modified to use a set of common functions and remove use of "
"the weird C<$TEST_FUNCTIONS> macro, similar to how we do it in nbdkit."
msgstr ""
"Testi tika mainīti, lai izmantotu kopīgu funkciju kopu un atteiktos no "
"dīvainā makro C<$TEST_FUNCTIONS>, līdzīgi kā tas darīts nbdkit."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:98
msgid "Fix dhcpcd failing on systemd-resolved stub (Thomas Wouters)."
msgstr ""
"Izlabota dhcpcd neizdošanās ar systemd-resolved aizstājēju (Thomas Wouters)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:100
msgid "Add support for dhcpcd and sfdisk on Debian (Daniel Gomez)."
msgstr "Pievienots dhcpcd un sfdisk atbalsts Debian (Daniel Gomez)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:102
msgid "Print the kernel utsname in debug output."
msgstr "Atkļūdošanas izvadē izdrukāt kodola utsname."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:104
msgid ""
"The legacy C<pvs_full>, C<vgs_full> and C<lvs_full> APIs were completely "
"rewritten in OCaml."
msgstr ""
"Mantotās API C<pvs_full>, C<vgs_full> un C<lvs_full> tika pilnībā "
"pārrakstītas OCaml."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:107
msgid "Some deprecated autoconf macros are no longer used."
msgstr "Daži novecojuši autoconf makro vairs netiek izmantoti."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:109
msgid ""
"We no longer emit a false warning about C<BLKDISCARD> when creating a block "
"device."
msgstr ""
"Veidojot bloku ierīci, vairs neizdodam aplamu brīdinājumu par C<BLKDISCARD>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:112
msgid ""
"Some internal OCaml List and String functions that we used have been "
"replaced by ones from the OCaml stdlib, reducing code maintenance."
msgstr ""
"Dažas iekšējās OCaml List un String funkcijas, ko izmantojām, ir aizstātas "
"ar OCaml standartbibliotēkas funkcijām, samazinot koda uzturēšanu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.56.pod:115
msgid ""
"If L<qemu-img(1)> commands fail during snapshot creation, make sure we "
"capture and print stderr from the qemu command (Cole Robinson)."
msgstr ""
"Ja momentuzņēmuma izveides laikā L<qemu-img(1)> komandas neizdodas, "
"nodrošināt, ka tveram un izdrukājam qemu komandas stderr (Cole Robinson)."

