#. type: =head1
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:5
msgid "RELEASE NOTES FOR LIBGUESTFS 1.58"
msgstr "LIBGUESTFS 1.58 LAIDIENA PIEZĪMES"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:7
msgid ""
"These are the release notes for libguestfs stable release 1.58.  This "
"describes the major changes since 1.56."
msgstr ""
"Šīs ir libguestfs stabilā laidiena 1.58 piezīmes.  Tās apraksta galvenās "
"izmaiņas kopš 1.56."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:10
msgid "Libguestfs 1.58.0 was released on B<5th January 2026>."
msgstr "Libguestfs 1.58.0 tika izlaists B<5th January 2026>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:14
msgid ""
"Fix inspection of SLES 15 guests that have an encrypted Btrfs filesystem, by "
"correctly parsing F</etc/crypttab> (Cole Robinson)."
msgstr ""
"Izlabota SLES 15 viesu ar šifrētu Btrfs failu sistēmu inspicēšana, pareizi "
"parsējot F</etc/crypttab> (Cole Robinson)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:17
msgid ""
"Windows named drives (like C<D:>) which point to completely blank disks are "
"now ignored instead of causing an error (thanks Ming Xie, Ameen Barakat)."
msgstr ""
"Windows nosauktie diski (piemēram, C<D:>), kas norāda uz pilnīgi tukšiem "
"diskiem, tagad tiek ignorēti, nevis izraisa kļūdu (paldies Ming Xie, Ameen "
"Barakat)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:21
msgid ""
"Existing code in virt-v2v which recognized Windows Antivirus (AV)  software "
"is now part of inspection.  The new code recognizes a wider range of AV "
"software."
msgstr ""
"Esošais virt-v2v kods, kas atpazina Windows pretvīrusu (AV) programmatūru, "
"tagad ir inspicēšanas daļa.  Jaunais kods atpazīst plašāku AV programmatūras "
"klāstu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:27
msgid ""
"C<guestfs_selinux_relabel> was deprecated, replaced by new "
"C<guestfs_setfiles>.  This new API also uses the L<setfiles(8)> I<-A> option "
"to reduce memory usage."
msgstr ""
"C<guestfs_selinux_relabel> ir novecojis, to aizstāj jaunais "
"C<guestfs_setfiles>.  Šī jaunā API atmiņas lietojuma samazināšanai izmanto "
"arī L<setfiles(8)> opciju I<-A>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:31
msgid ""
"New C<guestfs_ntfs_chmod> API which changes the permissions of Windows paths "
"(Cole Robinson)."
msgstr ""
"Jauna API C<guestfs_ntfs_chmod>, kas maina Windows ceļu atļaujas (Cole "
"Robinson)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:34
msgid ""
"In the list of structures returned by C<guestfs_inspect_get_applications2>, "
"a new C<app2_class> field has been added.  This classifies the application "
"by its primary usage, but currently only C<\"antivirus\"> can be returned "
"here for Windows AV software."
msgstr ""
"C<guestfs_inspect_get_applications2> atgriezto struktūru sarakstā pievienots "
"jauns lauks C<app2_class>.  Tas klasificē lietotni pēc tās galvenā "
"lietojuma, taču pašlaik šeit Windows AV programmatūrai var tikt atgriezts "
"tikai C<\"antivirus\">."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:40
msgid ""
"New C<guestfs_inspect_get_windows_group_policy> API which reports whether "
"Group Policy Objects were found in the Windows guest."
msgstr ""
"Jauna API C<guestfs_inspect_get_windows_group_policy>, kas ziņo, vai Windows "
"viesī tika atrasti grupas politikas objekti."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:43
msgid ""
"C<guestfs_btrfs_subvolume_show> would sometimes crash when parsing the "
"snapshots of a Btrfs subvolume.  Furthermore, in any API that returned a "
"device name associated with a Btrfs volume, the device name might not be "
"translated correctly resulting in the wrong device name being returned.  "
"(Both problems fixed by Arye Yurkovsky.)"
msgstr ""
"C<guestfs_btrfs_subvolume_show> dažreiz avarēja, parsējot Btrfs apakšsējuma "
"momentuzņēmumus.  Turklāt jebkurā API, kas atgrieza ar Btrfs sējumu saistītu "
"ierīces nosaukumu, ierīces nosaukums varēja tikt nepareizi tulkots, kā "
"rezultātā tika atgriezts nepareizs ierīces nosaukums.  (Abas problēmas "
"izlaboja Arye Yurkovsky.)"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:49
msgid "Fix a memory leak in C<guestfs_filesystem_walk> (Susant Sahani)."
msgstr "Izlabota atmiņas noplūde C<guestfs_filesystem_walk> (Susant Sahani)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:51
msgid ""
"In C<guestfs_disk_create>, when creating raw block devices, check for errors "
"in the L<close(2)> system call, ensuring we don't miss any delayed I/O "
"errors (Susant Sahani)."
msgstr ""
"C<guestfs_disk_create>, veidojot raw bloku ierīces, pārbaudīt kļūdas "
"sistēmas izsaukumā L<close(2)>, nodrošinot, ka nepalaižam garām aizkavētas I/"
"O kļūdas (Susant Sahani)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:55
msgid ""
"In several LVM-related APIs, it was possible for an internal failure to "
"happen for logical volumes which are incomplete (eg. missing a physical "
"volume).  This was fixed by skipping these LVs (Arye Yurkovsky)."
msgstr ""
"Vairākās ar LVM saistītās API loģiskajiem sējumiem, kas ir nepilnīgi (piem., "
"trūkst fiziskā sējuma), varēja notikt iekšēja kļūme.  Tas tika izlabots, "
"izlaižot šos LV (Arye Yurkovsky)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:68
msgid ""
"Note that GObject / Javascript bindings will be removed in the next release "
"of libguestfs."
msgstr ""
"Ņemiet vērā, ka GObject / Javascript saistījumi tiks noņemti nākamajā "
"libguestfs laidienā."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:71
msgid "Ruby deprecation warnings were fixed (Cole Robinson)."
msgstr "Izlaboti Ruby novecošanas brīdinājumi (Cole Robinson)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:75
msgid "Fix links to ntfs-3g documentation (Cole Robinson)."
msgstr "Izlabotas saites uz ntfs-3g dokumentāciju (Cole Robinson)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:79
msgid "libvirt E<ge> 11.10.0 with passt support is now required."
msgstr "Tagad nepieciešams libvirt E<ge> 11.10.0 ar passt atbalstu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:81
msgid "qemu E<ge> 7.2.0 is now required."
msgstr "Tagad nepieciešams qemu E<ge> 7.2.0."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:83
msgid "Fix guestmount compilation on macOS (thanks Mohamed Akram)."
msgstr "Izlabota guestmount kompilēšana macOS (paldies Mohamed Akram)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:85
msgid ""
"Basic github CI has been implemented.  Pull requests now do the equivalent "
"of C<./configure --enable-werror && make && make check> on a few common "
"platforms."
msgstr ""
"Realizēta pamata github CI.  Izvilkšanas pieprasījumi tagad dažās izplatītās "
"platformās veic līdzvērtīgu C<./configure --enable-werror && make && make "
"check>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:89
msgid ""
"Several obsolete tests were removed, and the test suite in general has been "
"fixed and made more robust against missing dependencies and other common "
"problems (Cole Robinson)."
msgstr ""
"Noņemti vairāki novecojuši testi, un testu komplekts kopumā ir izlabots un "
"padarīts robustāks pret trūkstošām atkarībām un citām bieži sastopamām "
"problēmām (Cole Robinson)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:93
msgid ""
"In test output we no longer print absolute paths for the test names (Cole "
"Robinson)."
msgstr ""
"Testu izvadē vairs neizdrukājam absolūtus ceļus testu nosaukumiem (Cole "
"Robinson)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:96
msgid ""
"C<AM_GNU_GETTEXT> usage was completely removed and replaced with a simple "
"test for LIBINTL (Cole Robinson)."
msgstr ""
"C<AM_GNU_GETTEXT> lietojums tika pilnībā noņemts un aizstāts ar vienkāršu "
"LIBINTL pārbaudi (Cole Robinson)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:99
msgid ""
"F<build-aux/config.rpath> was removed since it was no longer actually used "
"(Cole Robinson)."
msgstr ""
"F<build-aux/config.rpath> tika noņemts, jo tas faktiski vairs netika "
"izmantots (Cole Robinson)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:102
msgid ""
"Fix const-correctness issues caused by changes to the L<strchr(3)> and "
"L<strrchr(3)> functions in C23."
msgstr ""
"Izlabotas const pareizības problēmas, ko izraisīja funkciju L<strchr(3)> un "
"L<strrchr(3)> izmaiņas C23."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:107
msgid ""
"If the C<sit.ko> Linux kernel module is loaded, then a C<sit0> (a kind of "
"IPv6 tunnel) network device is created in the appliance.  Ignore this as it "
"would break appliance networking (thanks Srikanth Aithal, Stefano Brivio)."
msgstr ""
"Ja ir ielādēts Linux kodola modulis C<sit.ko>, palīgsistēmā tiek izveidota "
"tīkla ierīce C<sit0> (sava veida IPv6 tunelis).  Ignorēt to, jo tas sabojātu "
"palīgsistēmas tīklošanu (paldies Srikanth Aithal, Stefano Brivio)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:112
msgid ""
"In the direct backend we simplified probing of qemu features by assuming "
"that qemu E<ge> 7.2.0."
msgstr ""
"Tiešajā aizmugursistēmā vienkāršojām qemu līdzekļu zondēšanu, pieņemot, ka "
"qemu E<ge> 7.2.0."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:115
msgid "In the libvirt backend:"
msgstr "Libvirt aizmugursistēmā:"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:121
msgid "Fix compatibility with SeaBIOS 1.17 (thanks Gerd Hoffmann)."
msgstr "Izlabota saderība ar SeaBIOS 1.17 (paldies Gerd Hoffmann)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:125
msgid ""
"We made some changes to how errors from the libvirt call "
"C<virDomainDestroyFlags> are handled when shutting down the appliance.  If "
"there is an error, the error message is now printed when debug is enabled "
"(but it is still non-fatal).  Also we sleep between retries instead of busy "
"looping."
msgstr ""
"Mainījām, kā tiek apstrādātas libvirt izsaukuma C<virDomainDestroyFlags> "
"kļūdas, izslēdzot palīgsistēmu.  Ja ir kļūda, kļūdas ziņojums tagad tiek "
"izdrukāts, ja iespējota atkļūdošana (bet tā joprojām nav fatāla).  Turklāt "
"starp atkārtojumiem guļam, nevis aizņemti cikliski gaidām."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:133
msgid ""
"The libvirt backend now adds a virtio-rng device to the appliance "
"unconditionally so that we always have good entropy (for cryptographic "
"operations)."
msgstr ""
"Libvirt aizmugursistēma tagad palīgsistēmai bez nosacījumiem pievieno virtio-"
"rng ierīci, lai mums vienmēr būtu laba entropija (kriptogrāfiskām darbībām)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:139
msgid ""
"When running as root, remove explicit socket relabelling and allow libvirt "
"to relabel the sockets instead (Cole Robinson)."
msgstr ""
"Darbojoties kā root, noņemt eksplicītu ligzdu etiķešu atkārtotu piešķiršanu "
"un ļaut to darīt libvirt (Cole Robinson)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:144
msgid ""
"Enable sVirt for the appliance, which was sometimes accidentally disabled "
"(Cole Robinson)."
msgstr ""
"Iespējot palīgsistēmai sVirt, kas dažreiz nejauši bija atspējots (Cole "
"Robinson)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:149
msgid ""
"During inspection of Linux/Unix guests, the contents of guest F</etc/fstab> "
"and some mdadm files are written to debug output.  This can help with "
"debugging inspection issues (thanks Ming Xie)."
msgstr ""
"Linux/Unix viesu inspicēšanas laikā viesa F</etc/fstab> un dažu mdadm failu "
"saturs tiek rakstīts atkļūdošanas izvadē.  Tas var palīdzēt inspicēšanas "
"problēmu atkļūdošanā (paldies Ming Xie)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:153
msgid ""
"When the appliance starts up, if debugging is enabled, then we log "
"L<lsblk(8)> and L<blkid(8)> info to debugging output (thanks Ming Xie)."
msgstr ""
"Kad palīgsistēma startē un ir iespējota atkļūdošana, atkļūdošanas izvadē "
"žurnalējam L<lsblk(8)> un L<blkid(8)> informāciju (paldies Ming Xie)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:157
msgid ""
"In the generator C<StringList(Pathname)> was implemented for OCaml "
"functions."
msgstr "Ģeneratorā OCaml funkcijām realizēts C<StringList(Pathname)>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:160
msgid ""
"Add more debugging in Windows Registry inspection functions to make it "
"easier to track what's going on."
msgstr ""
"Pievienots vairāk atkļūdošanas Windows reģistra inspicēšanas funkcijās, lai "
"būtu vieglāk izsekot, kas notiek."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:163
msgid ""
"OCaml C<{|...|}> string literals are now used in the code for things like "
"literal Windows batch files that we inject into the guest, regular "
"expressions, and POD documentation in the generator (thanks Nicolas Ojeda "
"Bar)."
msgstr ""
"OCaml C<{|...|}> virkņu literāļi tagad tiek izmantoti kodā tādām lietām kā "
"burtiski Windows pakešfaili, ko ievietojam viesī, regulārās izteiksmes un "
"POD dokumentācija ģeneratorā (paldies Nicolas Ojeda Bar)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:168
msgid ""
"Internal calls to L<pcre2_match(3)> which return an unexpected error now "
"emit a debug message, although the error is still ignored."
msgstr ""
"Iekšējie L<pcre2_match(3)> izsaukumi, kas atgriež negaidītu kļūdu, tagad "
"izdod atkļūdošanas ziņojumu, lai gan kļūda joprojām tiek ignorēta."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:171
msgid "Multiple code cleanups throughout (Susant Sahani)."
msgstr "Vairāki koda sakopojumi visur (Susant Sahani)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:173
msgid ""
"Fix order of inclusion of Python header file because of changes in recent "
"Python 3.14."
msgstr ""
"Izlabota Python galvenes faila iekļaušanas secība jaunāko Python 3.14 "
"izmaiņu dēļ."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.58.pod:176
msgid ""
"Some test scripts which were written in Perl before have been rewritten in "
"Python (Susant Sahani)."
msgstr ""
"Daži testu skripti, kas iepriekš bija rakstīti Perl, ir pārrakstīti Python "
"(Susant Sahani)."

#. type: textblock
