#. type: =head1
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:5
msgid "RELEASE NOTES FOR LIBGUESTFS 1.60"
msgstr "LIBGUESTFS 1.60 LAIDIENA PIEZĪMES"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:7
msgid ""
"These are the release notes for libguestfs stable release 1.60.  This "
"describes the major changes since 1.58."
msgstr ""
"Šīs ir libguestfs stabilā laidiena 1.60 piezīmes.  Tās apraksta galvenās "
"izmaiņas kopš 1.58."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:10
msgid "Libguestfs 1.60.0 was released on B<9 July 2026>."
msgstr "Libguestfs 1.60.0 tika izlaists B<2026. gada 9. jūlijā>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:14
msgid "Add support for Kylin, NeoKylin and Anolis Linux distributions (grass lu)."
msgstr ""
"Pievienots Kylin, NeoKylin un Anolis Linux distribūciju atbalsts (grass lu)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:17
msgid ""
"Guests using Veritas partition tables (reusing the Sun partition type)  can "
"now be inspected."
msgstr ""
"Tagad var inspicēt viesus, kas izmanto Veritas nodalījumu tabulas (atkārtoti "
"izmantojot Sun nodalījuma tipu)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:20
msgid ""
"Windows Defender (antivirus) is now detected if present in Windows guests "
"(Susant Sahani)."
msgstr ""
"Windows Defender (pretvīruss) tagad tiek noteikts, ja tas ir Windows viesos "
"(Susant Sahani)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:25
msgid ""
"New C<guestfs_xfs_info2> API.  This is similar to the existing "
"C<guestfs_xfs_info> API but returns a flexible hashtable allowing more "
"fields to be added to the output in future."
msgstr ""
"Jauna API C<guestfs_xfs_info2>.  Tā ir līdzīga esošajai API "
"C<guestfs_xfs_info>, bet atgriež elastīgu jaucējtabulu, kas ļauj nākotnē "
"izvadei pievienot vairāk lauku."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:29
msgid "C<guestfs_get_hv> now returns the default hypervisor."
msgstr "C<guestfs_get_hv> tagad atgriež noklusējuma hipervizoru."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:31
msgid ""
"C<guestfs_tar_in> adds a new option C<keepdirlink> which controls the tar "
"I<--keep-directory-symlink> flag (Anders Roxell)."
msgstr ""
"C<guestfs_tar_in> pievieno jaunu opciju C<keepdirlink>, kas kontrolē tar "
"karogu I<--keep-directory-symlink> (Anders Roxell)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:34
msgid ""
"C<guestfs_xfs_repair> C<maxmem> option now produces better error messages if "
"maxmem is too small."
msgstr ""
"C<guestfs_xfs_repair> opcija C<maxmem> tagad dod labākus kļūdu ziņojumus, ja "
"maxmem ir pārāk mazs."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:37
msgid ""
"All functions that take LUKS key parameters may now use either C<text:...> "
"or C<base64:...> prefixes, allowing binary keys to be encoded as base64 and "
"passed to these APIs.  L<guestfish(1)> and other tools taking a key file now "
"allow a binary file to be used."
msgstr ""
"Visas funkcijas, kas pieņem LUKS atslēgu parametrus, tagad var izmantot "
"priedēkļus C<text:...> vai C<base64:...>, ļaujot binārās atslēgas kodēt kā "
"base64 un nodot šīm API.  L<guestfish(1)> un citi rīki, kas pieņem atslēgas "
"failu, tagad ļauj izmantot bināru failu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:42
msgid ""
"C<guestfs_command*> and C<guestfs_sh*> now use a bind mount to override "
"C</etc/resolv.conf> inside the guest, allowing these commands to work even "
"when this file is marked as immutable, a common change that system "
"administrators make (Srihari Parimi)."
msgstr ""
"C<guestfs_command*> un C<guestfs_sh*> tagad izmanto piesaistes montēšanu, "
"lai ignorētu C</etc/resolv.conf> viesī, ļaujot šīm komandām darboties pat "
"tad, ja šis fails ir atzīmēts kā nemaināms, kas ir bieža sistēmas "
"administratoru veikta izmaiņa (Srihari Parimi)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:49
msgid ""
"New L<guestfish(1)> C<not> subcommand, which negates the status of a "
"command."
msgstr ""
"Jauna L<guestfish(1)> apakškomanda C<not>, kas noliedz komandas statusu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:54
msgid ""
"GObject and Vala bindings were removed.  They were previously deprecated in "
"libguestfs 1.56 (Cole Robinson)."
msgstr ""
"GObject un Vala saistījumi tika noņemti.  Tie iepriekš tika atzīti par "
"novecojušiem libguestfs 1.56 (Cole Robinson)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:59
msgid ""
"All information related to firstboot scripts was moved to and consolidated "
"in L<virt-customize(1)/FIRSTBOOT> (Srihari Parimi)."
msgstr ""
"Visa ar firstboot skriptiem saistītā informācija pārvietota un apkopota "
"L<virt-customize(1)/FIRSTBOOT> (Srihari Parimi)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:62
msgid "Fix documentation of C<guestfs_copy_out> API."
msgstr "Izlabota API C<guestfs_copy_out> dokumentācija."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:66
msgid "Fix Weblate (i18n) web hooks (Rafael Fontenelle)."
msgstr "Izlaboti Weblate (i18n) tīmekļa āķi (Rafael Fontenelle)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:68
msgid "Fix build when libselinux is not available (David Runge)."
msgstr "Izlabota būvēšana, ja libselinux nav pieejams (David Runge)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:70
msgid "Github CI is now used more comprehensively (Cole Robinson)."
msgstr "Github CI tagad tiek izmantots plašāk (Cole Robinson)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:72
msgid ""
"Fix C<make dist> command when certain language bindings are disabled (Cole "
"Robinson)."
msgstr ""
"Izlabota komanda C<make dist>, ja noteikti valodu saistījumi ir atspējoti "
"(Cole Robinson)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:75
msgid "C<./configure --with-qemu> was removed."
msgstr "C<./configure --with-qemu> tika noņemts."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:77
msgid ""
"C<CFLAGS> is now prepended to the default, allowing default flags to be "
"overridden.  In addition I<-fPIC> is added to the default flags (Cole "
"Robinson)."
msgstr ""
"C<CFLAGS> tagad tiek pievienots noklusējuma karogu sākumā, ļaujot "
"noklusējuma karogus pārdefinēt.  Turklāt noklusējuma karogiem pievienots I<-"
"fPIC> (Cole Robinson)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:81
msgid ""
"Some bash completion scripts that were no longer used by libguestfs (they "
"moved to guestfs-tools) were removed.  Also new C<./configure "
"--with-bash-completion> and C<./configure --with-bash-completion-dir> "
"options were added (Christopher Byrne)."
msgstr ""
"Tika noņemti daži bash pabeigšanas skripti, ko libguestfs vairs neizmantoja "
"(tie pārvietoti uz guestfs-tools).  Pievienotas arī jaunas opcijas C<./"
"configure --with-bash-completion> un C<./configure --with-bash-completion-"
"dir> (Christopher Byrne)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:86
msgid "No longer over-link Lua bindings with libxml2 and libvirt (David Runge)."
msgstr ""
"Lua saistījumi vairs netiek pārmērīgi saistīti ar libxml2 un libvirt (David "
"Runge)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:89
msgid "Improve appliance support for Arch (David Runge)."
msgstr "Uzlabots palīgsistēmas atbalsts Arch (David Runge)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:93
msgid ""
"Simplify qemu property testing.  Most of the code was eliminated completely, "
"and also we no longer start up an empty guest when detecting if KVM is "
"available (thanks Daniel Berrange).  Also we now print stderr if qemu fails "
"to start during detection (Hilko Bengen)."
msgstr ""
"Vienkāršota qemu īpašību testēšana.  Lielākā daļa koda tika pilnībā "
"likvidēta, un, nosakot KVM pieejamību, vairs nepalaižam tukšu viesi (paldies "
"Daniel Berrange).  Turklāt tagad izdrukājam stderr, ja qemu noteikšanas "
"laikā neizdodas startēt (Hilko Bengen)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:98
msgid "Use I<-cpu max> on RISC-V (thanks Apache553)."
msgstr "Izmantot I<-cpu max> RISC-V (paldies Apache553)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:100
msgid "Very minimal support for Apple Filesystem (APFS) was added on Fedora."
msgstr "Fedorā pievienots ļoti minimāls Apple Filesystem (APFS) atbalsts."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:102
msgid ""
"Many memory and file descriptor leaks found by Claude Code were fixed "
"(shivanayak)."
msgstr ""
"Izlabotas daudzas atmiņas un failu deskriptoru noplūdes, ko atrada Claude "
"Code (shivanayak)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:105
msgid ""
"In the libguestfs appliance, increase the number of pre-process memory "
"maps.  This may allow xfs_repair to work on larger filesystems (Eric "
"Sandeen)."
msgstr ""
"Libguestfs palīgsistēmā palielināts procesa atmiņas karšu skaits.  Tas var "
"ļaut xfs_repair darboties lielākās failu sistēmās (Eric Sandeen)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:109
msgid ""
"Fix DHCP on fast machines by making it wait for an address when networking "
"is enabled.  In addition use C<dhcpcd --debug> which makes it easier to see "
"if DHCP requests are working (Cole Robinson)."
msgstr ""
"Izlabots DHCP ātros datoros, liekot tam gaidīt adresi, kad tīklošana ir "
"iespējota.  Turklāt izmantot C<dhcpcd --debug>, kas atvieglo redzēt, vai "
"DHCP pieprasījumi darbojas (Cole Robinson)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:113
msgid "Improvements to debug output (Surya Gupta, Srihari Parimi)."
msgstr "Atkļūdošanas izvades uzlabojumi (Surya Gupta, Srihari Parimi)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:115
msgid "Fix Fedora bin/sbin symlinking to be less noisy (Cole Robinson)."
msgstr ""
"Izlabota Fedora bin/sbin simbolisko saišu veidošana, lai būtu mazāk skaļa "
"(Cole Robinson)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:117
msgid "Rewrite xfs_repair and luks_* implementations in the daemon in OCaml."
msgstr "Dēmonā xfs_repair un luks_* realizācijas pārrakstītas OCaml."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.60.pod:119
msgid "Ensure fds 0, 1 and 2 are open when running subcommands."
msgstr "Nodrošināt, ka, izpildot apakškomandas, fd 0, 1 un 2 ir atvērti."

