"Read the first 256k bytes of the in_file with L<qemu-img(1)> command and "
"write them into the out_file. That may be useful to get UUID of the QCOW2 "
"disk image with C<get_root_uuid_with_file>."
msgstr ""
"Nolasīt in_file pirmos 256k baitus ar komandu L<qemu-img(1)> un ierakstīt "
"tos out_file. Tas var noderēt, lai ar C<get_root_uuid_with_file> iegūtu "
"QCOW2 diska attēla UUID."

