#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:102
msgid ""
"Construct the Linux command line passed to the appliance.  This is used by "
"the C<direct> and C<libvirt> backends, and is simply located in this file "
"because it's a convenient place for this common code."
msgstr ""
"Izveidot Linux komandrindu, ko nodod palīgsistēmai.  To izmanto "
"aizmugursistēmas C<direct> un C<libvirt>, un tā vienkārši atrodas šajā "
"failā, jo tā ir ērta vieta šim kopīgajam kodam."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:107
msgid ""
"The C<appliance> parameter is the filename of the appliance (could be NULL) "
"from which we obtain the root UUID."
msgstr ""
"Parametrs C<appliance> ir palīgsistēmas faila nosaukums (var būt NULL), no "
"kura iegūstam saknes UUID."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:110
msgid ""
"The C<flags> parameter can contain the following flags logically or'd "
"together (or 0):"
msgstr ""
"Parametrs C<flags> var saturēt šādus karogus, savienotus ar loģisko „vai” "
"(vai 0):"

#. type: =item
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:115
msgid "C<APPLIANCE_COMMAND_LINE_IS_TCG>"
msgstr "C<APPLIANCE_COMMAND_LINE_IS_TCG>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:117
msgid ""
"If we are launching a qemu TCG guest (ie. KVM is known to be disabled or "
"unavailable).  If you don't know, don't pass this flag."
msgstr ""
"Ja palaižam qemu TCG viesi (t. i., zināms, ka KVM ir atspējots vai nav "
"pieejams).  Ja nezināt, nenododiet šo karogu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:122
msgid ""
"Note that this function returns a newly allocated buffer which must be freed "
"by the caller."
msgstr ""
"Ņemiet vērā, ka šī funkcija atgriež jaunpiešķirtu buferi, kas izsaucējam "
"jāatbrīvo."

#. type: =head3
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:125
msgid "File F<lib/appliance-uefi.c>"
msgstr "Fails F<lib/appliance-uefi.c>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:127
msgid "Find the UEFI firmware needed to boot the appliance."
msgstr "Atrast UEFI programmaparatūru, kas vajadzīga palīgsistēmas sāknēšanai."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:129
msgid ""
"See also F<lib/uefi.c> (autogenerated file) containing the firmware file "
"locations."
msgstr ""
"Skatīt arī F<lib/uefi.c> (automātiski ģenerēts fails), kurā ir "
"programmaparatūras failu atrašanās vietas."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:132
msgid "Function C<lib/appliance-uefi.c:guestfs_int_get_uefi>"
msgstr "Funkcija C<lib/appliance-uefi.c:guestfs_int_get_uefi>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:134
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" int\n"
" guestfs_int_get_uefi (guestfs_h *g, char *const *firmwares,\n"
"                       const char **firmware, char **code, char **vars,\n"
"                       int *flags)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" int\n"
" guestfs_int_get_uefi (guestfs_h *g, char *const *firmwares,\n"
"                       const char **firmware, char **code, char **vars,\n"
"                       int *flags)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:139
msgid ""
"Return the location of firmware needed to boot the appliance.  This is "
"aarch64 only currently, since that's the only architecture where UEFI is "
"mandatory (and that only for RHEL)."
msgstr ""
"Atgriezt palīgsistēmas sāknēšanai vajadzīgās programmaparatūras atrašanās "
"vietu.  Pašlaik tas ir tikai aarch64, jo tā ir vienīgā arhitektūra, kur UEFI "
"ir obligāts (un tikai RHEL)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:143
msgid ""
"C<firmwares> is an optional list of allowed values for the firmware "
"autoselection of libvirt. It is C<NULL> to indicate it is not "
"supported. C<*firmware> is set to one of the strings in C<firmwares> in case "
"one can be used."
msgstr ""
"C<firmwares> ir neobligāts libvirt programmaparatūras automātiskās atlases "
"atļauto vērtību saraksts. Tas ir C<NULL>, lai norādītu, ka tas netiek "
"atbalstīts. C<*firmware> tiek iestatīts uz vienu no C<firmwares> virknēm, ja "
"kādu var izmantot."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:148
msgid ""
"C<*code> is initialized with the path to the read-only UEFI code file.  "
"C<*vars> is initialized with the path to a copy of the UEFI vars file (which "
"is cleaned up automatically on exit)."
msgstr ""
"C<*code> tiek inicializēts ar ceļu uz tikai lasāmo UEFI koda failu.  "
"C<*vars> tiek inicializēts ar ceļu uz UEFI mainīgo faila kopiju (kas tiek "
"automātiski iztīrīta, izejot)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:152
msgid ""
"In case a UEFI firmware is available, either C<*firmware> is set to a "
"non-C<NULL> value, or C<*code> and C<*vars> are."
msgstr ""
"Ja UEFI programmaparatūra ir pieejama, vai nu C<*firmware> tiek iestatīts uz "
"vērtību, kas nav C<NULL>, vai C<*code> un C<*vars>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:155
msgid ""
"C<*code> and C<*vars> should be freed by the caller, and C<*firmware> "
"B<must> not."
msgstr ""
"C<*code> un C<*vars> jāatbrīvo izsaucējam, bet C<*firmware> B<nedrīkst>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:158
msgid ""
"If the function returns C<-1> then there was a real error which should cause "
"appliance building to fail (no UEFI firmware is not an error)."
msgstr ""
"Ja funkcija atgriež C<-1>, ir notikusi īsta kļūda, kam jāizraisa "
"palīgsistēmas būvēšanas neizdošanās (UEFI programmaparatūras trūkums nav "
"kļūda)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:162
msgid "See also F<virt-v2v.git/v2v/utils.ml>:find_uefi_firmware"
msgstr "Skatīt arī F<virt-v2v.git/v2v/utils.ml>:find_uefi_firmware"

#. type: =head3
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:164
msgid "File F<lib/appliance.c>"
msgstr "Fails F<lib/appliance.c>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:166
msgid "This file deals with building the libguestfs appliance."
msgstr "Šis fails nodarbojas ar libguestfs palīgsistēmas būvēšanu."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:168
msgid "Function C<lib/appliance.c:guestfs_int_build_appliance>"
msgstr "Funkcija C<lib/appliance.c:guestfs_int_build_appliance>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:170
#, no-wrap
msgid " \n"
msgstr " \n"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:171
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" int\n"
" guestfs_int_build_appliance (guestfs_h *g,\n"
"                              char **kernel_rtn,\n"
"                              char **initrd_rtn,\n"
"                              char **appliance_rtn)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" int\n"
" guestfs_int_build_appliance (guestfs_h *g,\n"
"                              char **kernel_rtn,\n"
"                              char **initrd_rtn,\n"
"                              char **appliance_rtn)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:177
msgid "Locate or build the appliance."
msgstr "Atrast vai uzbūvēt palīgsistēmu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:179
msgid ""
"This function locates or builds the appliance as necessary, handling the "
"supermin appliance, caching of supermin-built appliances, or using either a "
"fixed or old-style appliance."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija pēc vajadzības atrod vai uzbūvē palīgsistēmu, apstrādājot "
"supermin palīgsistēmu, supermin būvēto palīgsistēmu kešošanu vai izmantojot "
"fiksētu vai vecā stila palīgsistēmu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:183
msgid ""
"The return value is C<0> = good, C<-1> = error.  Returned in "
"C<appliance.kernel> will be the name of the kernel to use, "
"C<appliance.initrd> the name of the initrd, C<appliance.image> the name of "
"the ext2 root filesystem.  C<appliance.image> can be C<NULL>, meaning that "
"we are using an old-style (non-ext2) appliance.  All three strings must be "
"freed by the caller.  However the referenced files themselves must I<not> be "
"deleted."
msgstr ""
"Atgriešanas vērtība ir C<0> = labi, C<-1> = kļūda.  C<appliance.kernel> tiks "
"atgriezts izmantojamā kodola nosaukums, C<appliance.initrd> — initrd "
"nosaukums, C<appliance.image> — ext2 saknes failu sistēmas nosaukums.  "
"C<appliance.image> var būt C<NULL>, kas nozīmē, ka izmantojam vecā stila (ne-"
"ext2) palīgsistēmu.  Visas trīs virknes jāatbrīvo izsaucējam.  Tomēr pašus "
"norādītos failus I<nedrīkst> dzēst."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:191
msgid "The process is as follows:"
msgstr "Process ir šāds:"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:197
msgid ""
"Look in C<path> which contains a supermin appliance skeleton.  If no element "
"has this, skip straight to step 3."
msgstr ""
"Meklēt C<path>, kurā ir supermin palīgsistēmas skelets.  Ja nevienā elementā "
"tā nav, pāriet tieši uz 3. soli."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:202
msgid ""
"Call C<supermin --build> to build the full appliance (if it needs to be "
"rebuilt).  If this is successful, return the full appliance."
msgstr ""
"Izsaukt C<supermin --build>, lai uzbūvētu pilnu palīgsistēmu (ja tā "
"jāpārbūvē).  Ja tas izdodas, atgriezt pilno palīgsistēmu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:207
msgid "Check C<path>, looking for a fixed appliance.  If one is found, return it."
msgstr ""
"Pārbaudīt C<path>, meklējot fiksētu palīgsistēmu.  Ja tāda atrasta, atgriezt "
"to."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:211
msgid ""
"Check C<path>, looking for an old-style appliance.  If one is found, return "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Pārbaudīt C<path>, meklējot vecā stila palīgsistēmu.  Ja tāda atrasta, "
"atgriezt to."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:216
msgid ""
"The supermin appliance cache directory lives in F<$TMPDIR/.guestfs-$UID/> "
"and consists of up to four files:"
msgstr ""
"Supermin palīgsistēmas kešatmiņas direktorija atrodas F<$TMPDIR/.guestfs-"
"$UID/> un sastāv no līdz četriem failiem:"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:219
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  $TMPDIR/.guestfs-$UID/lock            - the supermin lock file\n"
"  $TMPDIR/.guestfs-$UID/appliance.d/kernel - the kernel\n"
"  $TMPDIR/.guestfs-$UID/appliance.d/initrd - the supermin initrd\n"
"  $TMPDIR/.guestfs-$UID/appliance.d/root   - the appliance\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  $TMPDIR/.guestfs-$UID/lock            - the supermin lock file\n"
"  $TMPDIR/.guestfs-$UID/appliance.d/kernel - the kernel\n"
"  $TMPDIR/.guestfs-$UID/appliance.d/initrd - the supermin initrd\n"
"  $TMPDIR/.guestfs-$UID/appliance.d/root   - the appliance\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:224
msgid ""
"Multiple instances of libguestfs with the same UID may be racing to create "
"an appliance.  However (since supermin E<ge> 5) supermin provides a "
"I<--lock> flag and atomic update of the F<appliance.d> subdirectory."
msgstr ""
"Vairākas libguestfs instances ar vienādu UID var sacensties palīgsistēmas "
"izveidē.  Tomēr (kopš supermin E<ge> 5) supermin nodrošina karogu I<--lock> "
"un apakšdirektorijas F<appliance.d> atomisku atjaunināšanu."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:229
msgid "Function C<lib/appliance.c:locate_or_build_appliance>"
msgstr "Funkcija C<lib/appliance.c:locate_or_build_appliance>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:231
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" static int\n"
" locate_or_build_appliance (guestfs_h *g,\n"
"                            struct appliance_files *appliance,\n"
"                            const char *path)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" static int\n"
" locate_or_build_appliance (guestfs_h *g,\n"
"                            struct appliance_files *appliance,\n"
"                            const char *path)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:236
msgid ""
"Check C<path>, looking for one of appliances: supermin appliance, fixed "
"appliance or old-style appliance.  If one of the fixed appliances is found, "
"return it.  If the supermin appliance skeleton is found, build and return "
"appliance."
msgstr ""
"Pārbaudīt C<path>, meklējot kādu no palīgsistēmām: supermin palīgsistēmu, "
"fiksētu palīgsistēmu vai vecā stila palīgsistēmu.  Ja atrasta kāda no "
"fiksētajām palīgsistēmām, atgriezt to.  Ja atrasts supermin palīgsistēmas "
"skelets, uzbūvēt un atgriezt palīgsistēmu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:241 docs/internal-documentation.pod:255
msgid "Return values:"
msgstr "Atgriešanas vērtības:"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:243
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  1 = appliance is found, returns C<appliance>,\n"
"  0 = appliance not found,\n"
" -1 = error which aborts the launch process.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  1 = appliance is found, returns C<appliance>,\n"
"  0 = appliance not found,\n"
" -1 = error which aborts the launch process.\n"
"\n"

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:247
msgid "Function C<lib/appliance.c:search_appliance>"
msgstr "Funkcija C<lib/appliance.c:search_appliance>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:249
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" static int\n"
" search_appliance (guestfs_h *g, struct appliance_files *appliance)\n"
