msgid "Create the special F</dev/null> drive."
msgstr "Izveidot īpašo F</dev/null> disku."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:648
msgid ""
"Traditionally you have been able to use F</dev/null> as a filename, as many "
"times as you like.  Ancient KVM (RHEL 5) cannot handle adding F</dev/null> "
"readonly.  qemu 1.2 + virtio-scsi segfaults when you use any zero-sized file "
"including F</dev/null>."
msgstr ""
"Tradicionāli F</dev/null> varēja izmantot kā faila nosaukumu tik reižu, cik "
"vēlaties.  Senais KVM (RHEL 5) nespēj apstrādāt F</dev/null> pievienošanu "
"tikai lasīšanai.  qemu 1.2 + virtio-scsi izraisa segmentācijas kļūdu, ja "
"izmantojat jebkuru nulles izmēra failu, ieskaitot F</dev/null>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:653
msgid ""
"Because of these problems, we replace F</dev/null> with a non-zero sized "
"temporary file.  This shouldn't make any difference since users are not "
"supposed to try and access a null drive."
msgstr ""
"Šo problēmu dēļ aizstājam F</dev/null> ar pagaidu failu, kura izmērs nav "
"nulle.  Tam nevajadzētu radīt nekādu atšķirību, jo lietotājiem nav paredzēts "
"mēģināt piekļūt null diskam."

