msgstr ""
"C<guestfs_shutdown> izsauc C<shutdown_backend> ar C<check_for_errors=1>.  "
"C<guestfs_close> izsauc C<shutdown_backend> ar C<check_for_errors=0>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1207
msgid ""
"C<check_for_errors> is a hint to the backend about whether we care about "
"errors or not.  In the libvirt case it can be used to optimize the shutdown "
"for speed when we don't care."
msgstr ""
"C<check_for_errors> ir mājiens aizmugursistēmai, vai mums rūp kļūdas.  "
"Libvirt gadījumā to var izmantot izslēgšanas ātruma optimizēšanai, kad mums "
"tās nerūp."

