#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1248
msgid "Download a guest file to a local temporary file."
msgstr "Lejupielādēt viesa failu lokālā pagaidu failā."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1250
msgid ""
"The name of the temporary (downloaded) file is returned.  The caller must "
"free the pointer, but does I<not> need to delete the temporary file.  It "
"will be deleted when the handle is closed."
msgstr ""
"Tiek atgriezts pagaidu (lejupielādētā) faila nosaukums.  Izsaucējam "
"jāatbrīvo rādītājs, bet pagaidu fails I<nav> jādzēš.  Tas tiks dzēsts, kad "
"rokturis tiks aizvērts."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1254
msgid ""
"The name of the temporary file is randomly generated, but an extension can "
"be specified using C<extension> (or pass C<NULL> for none)."
msgstr ""
"Pagaidu faila nosaukums tiek ģenerēts nejauši, bet paplašinājumu var norādīt "
"ar C<extension> (vai nododiet C<NULL>, ja nav)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1257
msgid ""
"Refuse to download the guest file if it is larger than C<max_size>.  On this "
"and other errors, C<NULL> is returned."
msgstr ""
"Atteikties lejupielādēt viesa failu, ja tas ir lielāks par C<max_size>.  "
"Šajā un citās kļūdās tiek atgriezts C<NULL>."

