"\n"
msgstr ""
" static int\n"
" launch_passt (guestfs_h *g, long *passt_pid, char (*sockpath)"
"[UNIX_PATH_MAX])\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1289
msgid "Launch passt such that it daemonizes."
msgstr "Palaist passt tā, lai tas kļūst par dēmonu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1291
msgid "On error, C<-1> is returned; C<passt_pid> and C<sockpath> are not modified."
msgstr ""
"Kļūdas gadījumā tiek atgriezts C<-1>; C<passt_pid> un C<sockpath> netiek "
"mainīti."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1293
msgid ""
"On success, C<0> is returned.  C<passt_pid> contains the PID of the passt "
"background process.  C<sockpath> contains the pathname of the unix domain "
"socket where passt will accept a single connection."
msgstr ""
"Veiksmes gadījumā tiek atgriezts C<0>.  C<passt_pid> satur passt fona "
"procesa PID.  C<sockpath> satur ceļa nosaukumu Unix domēna ligzdai, kur "
"passt pieņems vienu savienojumu."

#. type: =head3
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1297
