msgstr "Fails F<lib/launch-libvirt.c>"

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1299
msgid "Function C<lib/launch-libvirt.c:get_source_format_or_autodetect>"
msgstr "Funkcija C<lib/launch-libvirt.c:get_source_format_or_autodetect>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1301
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" static char *\n"
" get_source_format_or_autodetect (guestfs_h *g, struct drive *drv)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" static char *\n"
" get_source_format_or_autodetect (guestfs_h *g, struct drive *drv)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1304
msgid "Return C<drv-E<gt>src.format>, but if it is C<NULL>, autodetect the format."
msgstr ""
"Atgriezt C<drv-E<gt>src.format>, bet, ja tas ir C<NULL>, automātiski noteikt "
"formātu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1307
msgid ""
"libvirt has disabled the feature of detecting the disk format, unless the "
"administrator sets C<allow_disk_format_probing=1> in "
"F</etc/libvirt/qemu.conf>.  There is no way to detect if this option is set, "
"so we have to do format detection here using C<qemu-img> and pass that to "
"libvirt."
msgstr ""
"Libvirt ir atspējojis diska formāta noteikšanas līdzekli, ja vien "
"administrators neiestata C<allow_disk_format_probing=1> failā F</etc/libvirt/"
"qemu.conf>.  Nav veida, kā noteikt, vai šī opcija ir iestatīta, tāpēc "
"formāta noteikšana jāveic šeit, izmantojot C<qemu-img>, un jānodod libvirt."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1313
msgid ""
"This can still be a security issue, so in most cases it is recommended the "
"users pass the format to libguestfs which will faithfully pass that straight "
"through to libvirt without doing autodetection."
msgstr ""
"Tā joprojām var būt drošības problēma, tāpēc vairumā gadījumu lietotājiem "
"ieteicams nodot formātu libguestfs, kas to uzticami nodos tieši libvirt bez "
"automātiskas noteikšanas."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1318
msgid ""
"Caller must free the returned string.  On error this function sets the error "
"in the handle and returns C<NULL>."
msgstr ""
"Izsaucējam jāatbrīvo atgrieztā virkne.  Kļūdas gadījumā šī funkcija iestata "
"kļūdu rokturī un atgriež C<NULL>."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1321
msgid "Function C<lib/launch-libvirt.c:make_qcow2_overlay>"
msgstr "Funkcija C<lib/launch-libvirt.c:make_qcow2_overlay>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1323
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" static char *\n"
" make_qcow2_overlay (guestfs_h *g, const char *backing_drive,\n"
"                     const char *format)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" static char *\n"
" make_qcow2_overlay (guestfs_h *g, const char *backing_drive,\n"
"                     const char *format)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1327
msgid ""
"Create a qcow2 format overlay, with the given C<backing_drive> (file).  The "
"C<format> parameter is the backing file format.  The C<format> parameter can "
"be NULL, in this case the backing format will be determined automatically.  "
"This is used to create the appliance overlay, and also for read-only drives."
msgstr ""
"Izveidot qcow2 formāta pārklājumu ar doto C<backing_drive> (failu).  "
"Parametrs C<format> ir pamatfaila formāts.  Parametrs C<format> var būt "
"NULL, tādā gadījumā pamatformāts tiks noteikts automātiski.  To izmanto "
"palīgsistēmas pārklājuma izveidei, kā arī tikai lasāmiem diskiem."

#. type: =head3
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1333
msgid "File F<lib/launch.c>"
msgstr "Fails F<lib/launch.c>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1335
msgid "This file implements L<guestfs(3)/guestfs_launch>."
msgstr "Šis fails realizē L<guestfs(3)/guestfs_launch>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1337
msgid ""
"Most of the work is done by the backends (see L<guestfs(3)/BACKEND>), which "
"are implemented in F<lib/launch-direct.c>, F<lib/launch-libvirt.c> etc, so "
"this file mostly passes calls through to the current backend."
msgstr ""
"Lielāko daļu darba veic aizmugursistēmas (skatiet L<guestfs(3)/"
"AIZMUGURSISTĒMA>), kas realizētas failos F<lib/launch-direct.c>, F<lib/"
"launch-libvirt.c> u. c., tāpēc šis fails galvenokārt nodod izsaukumus "
"pašreizējai aizmugursistēmai."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1342
msgid "Function C<lib/launch.c:guestfs_int_launch_send_progress>"
msgstr "Funkcija C<lib/launch.c:guestfs_int_launch_send_progress>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1344
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" void\n"
" guestfs_int_launch_send_progress (guestfs_h *g, int perdozen)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" void\n"
" guestfs_int_launch_send_progress (guestfs_h *g, int perdozen)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1347
msgid "This function sends a launch progress message."
msgstr "Šī funkcija nosūta palaišanas progresa ziņojumu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1349
msgid ""
"Launching the appliance generates approximate progress messages.  Currently "
"these are defined as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Palīgsistēmas palaišana ģenerē aptuvenus progresa ziņojumus.  Pašlaik tie "
"definēti šādi:"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1352
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   0 / 12: launch clock starts\n"
"   3 / 12: appliance created\n"
"   6 / 12: detected that guest kernel started\n"
"   9 / 12: detected that /init script is running\n"
"  12 / 12: launch completed successfully\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"   0 / 12: launch clock starts\n"
"   3 / 12: appliance created\n"
"   6 / 12: detected that guest kernel started\n"
"   9 / 12: detected that /init script is running\n"
"  12 / 12: launch completed successfully\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1364
msgid ""
"This is not a documented ABI and the behaviour may be changed or removed in "
"future."
msgstr ""
"Tas nav dokumentēts ABI, un uzvedība nākotnē var tikt mainīta vai noņemta."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1369
msgid ""
"Messages are only sent if more than 5 seconds has elapsed since the launch "
"clock started."
msgstr ""
"Ziņojumi tiek sūtīti tikai tad, ja kopš palaišanas pulksteņa starta "
"pagājušas vairāk nekā 5 sekundes."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1374
msgid "There is a hack in F<lib/proto.c> to make this work."
msgstr "Lai tas darbotos, failā F<lib/proto.c> ir triks."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1378
msgid "Function C<lib/launch.c:guestfs_int_timeval_diff>"
msgstr "Funkcija C<lib/launch.c:guestfs_int_timeval_diff>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1380
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" int64_t\n"
" guestfs_int_timeval_diff (const struct timeval *x, const struct timeval "
"*y)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" int64_t\n"
" guestfs_int_timeval_diff (const struct timeval *x, const struct timeval *y)"
"\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1383
msgid "Compute C<y - x> and return the result in milliseconds."
msgstr "Aprēķināt C<y - x> un atgriezt rezultātu milisekundēs."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1385
msgid ""
"Approximately the same as this code: "
"L<http://www.mpp.mpg.de/~huber/util/timevaldiff.c>"
msgstr ""
"Aptuveni tas pats, kas šis kods: L<http://www.mpp.mpg.de/~huber/util/"
"timevaldiff.c>"

