#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1393
msgid ""
"Unblock the C<SIGTERM> signal.  Call this after L<fork(2)> so that the "
"parent process can send C<SIGTERM> to the child process in case C<SIGTERM> "
"is blocked.  See L<https://bugzilla.redhat.com/1460338>."
msgstr ""
"Atbloķēt signālu C<SIGTERM>.  Izsauciet to pēc L<fork(2)>, lai vecākprocess "
"varētu nosūtīt bērnprocesam C<SIGTERM> gadījumā, ja C<SIGTERM> ir bloķēts.  "
"Skatiet L<https://bugzilla.redhat.com/1460338>."

