#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1433
msgid "Callers must ensure this is only called in the config state."
msgstr "Izsaucējiem jānodrošina, ka to izsauc tikai konfigurācijas stāvoklī."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1437
