#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1625
msgid ""
"This function reads a single message, file chunk, launch flag or "
"cancellation flag from the daemon.  If something was read, it returns C<0>, "
"otherwise C<-1>."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija nolasa no dēmona vienu ziņojumu, faila gabalu, palaišanas karogu "
"vai atcelšanas karogu.  Ja kaut kas tika nolasīts, tā atgriež C<0>, citādi "
"C<-1>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1629
msgid "Both C<size_rtn> and C<buf_rtn> must be passed by the caller as non-NULL."
msgstr "Izsaucējam gan C<size_rtn>, gan C<buf_rtn> jānodod kā ne-NULL."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1632
msgid ""
"C<*size_rtn> returns the size of the returned message or it may be "
"C<GUESTFS_LAUNCH_FLAG> or C<GUESTFS_CANCEL_FLAG>."
msgstr ""
"C<*size_rtn> atgriež atgrieztā ziņojuma izmēru, vai tas var būt "
"C<GUESTFS_LAUNCH_FLAG> vai C<GUESTFS_CANCEL_FLAG>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1635
msgid ""
"C<*buf_rtn> is returned containing the message (if any) or will be set to "
"C<NULL>.  C<*buf_rtn> must be freed by the caller."
msgstr ""
"C<*buf_rtn> tiek atgriezts ar ziņojumu (ja tāds ir), vai tiks iestatīts uz "
"C<NULL>.  C<*buf_rtn> jāatbrīvo izsaucējam."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1638
msgid ""
"This checks for EOF (appliance died) and passes that up through the "
"child_cleanup function above."
msgstr ""
"Tas pārbauda EOF (palīgsistēma beidza darbību) un nodod to augšup caur "
"iepriekš minēto funkciju child_cleanup."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1641
msgid "Log message, progress messages are handled transparently here."
msgstr "Žurnāla ziņojumi, progresa ziņojumi šeit tiek apstrādāti caurspīdīgi."

