"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1718
msgid "Test if the platform supports KVM."
msgstr "Pārbaudīt, vai platforma atbalsta KVM."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1720
msgid ""
"Only qemu \"knows\" this fact reliably, so we run qemu, query it using the "
"QMP \"query-kvm\" command, and parse the JSON output from that command."
msgstr ""
"Tikai qemu šo faktu „zina” uzticami, tāpēc izpildām qemu, vaicājam tam ar "
"QMP komandu „query-kvm” un parsējam šīs komandas JSON izvadi."

