#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1743
msgid "Useful function to format a drive + protocol for qemu."
msgstr "Noderīga funkcija diska + protokola formatēšanai qemu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1745
msgid ""
"Note that the qemu parameter is the bit after C<\"file=\">.  It is not "
"escaped here, but would usually be escaped if passed to qemu as part of a "
"full -drive parameter (but not for L<qemu-img(1)>)."
msgstr ""
"Ņemiet vērā, ka qemu parametrs ir daļa aiz C<\"file=\">.  Šeit tas netiek "
"atsoļots, bet parasti tiktu atsoļots, ja to nodotu qemu kā pilna -drive "
"parametra daļu (bet ne L<qemu-img(1)>)."

