"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1754
msgid ""
"Test if discard is possible with the underlying file or device.  This "
"returns C<1> if discard is possible.  It returns C<0> if not possible and "
"sets the error to the reason why."
msgstr ""
"Pārbaudīt, vai pamatā esošajam failam vai ierīcei iespējams discard.  Tas "
"atgriež C<1>, ja discard ir iespējams.  Tas atgriež C<0>, ja nav iespējams, "
"un iestata kļūdu uz iemeslu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1758
msgid "This function is called when the user set C<discard == \"enable\">."
msgstr "Šo funkciju izsauc, kad lietotājs iestatījis C<discard == \"enable\">."

