#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:1936
msgid ""
"We use C<Umask> from F</proc/self/status> for Linux E<ge> 4.7.  For older "
"Linux and other Unix, this file implements an expensive but thread-safe way "
"to get the current process's umask."
msgstr ""
"Linux E<ge> 4.7 izmantojam C<Umask> no F</proc/self/status>.  Vecākam Linux "
"un citiem Unix šis fails realizē dārgu, bet pavedienu drošu veidu, kā iegūt "
"pašreizējā procesa umask."

