msgid "Run external command and read the first line of output."
msgstr "Izpildīt ārēju komandu un nolasīt pirmo izvades rindu."

#. type: =head3
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2409
msgid "File F<common/parallel/parallel.c>"
msgstr "Fails F<common/parallel/parallel.c>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2411
msgid ""
"This file is used by C<virt-df> and some of the other tools when they need "
"to run multiple parallel libguestfs instances to operate on a large number "
"of libvirt domains efficiently."
msgstr ""
"Šo failu izmanto C<virt-df> un daži citi rīki, kad tiem jāizpilda vairākas "
"paralēlas libguestfs instances, lai efektīvi strādātu ar lielu skaitu "
"libvirt domēnu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2415
msgid ""
"It implements a multithreaded work queue.  In addition it reorders the "
"output so the output still appears in the same order as the input (ie. still "
"ordered alphabetically)."
msgstr ""
"Tas realizē vairākpavedienu darba rindu.  Turklāt tas pārkārto izvadi, lai "
"izvade joprojām parādītos tādā pašā secībā kā ievade (t. i., joprojām "
"sakārtota alfabētiski)."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2419
msgid "Function C<common/parallel/parallel.c:start_threads>"
msgstr "Funkcija C<common/parallel/parallel.c:start_threads>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2421
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" int\n"
" start_threads (size_t option_P, guestfs_h *options_handle, work_fn work)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" int\n"
" start_threads (size_t option_P, guestfs_h *options_handle, work_fn work)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2424
msgid "Run the threads and work through the global list of libvirt domains."
msgstr "Palaist pavedienus un apstrādāt globālo libvirt domēnu sarakstu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2427
msgid ""
"C<option_P> is whatever the user passed in the I<-P> option, or C<0> if the "
"user didn't use the I<-P> option (in which case the number of threads is "
"chosen heuristically)."
msgstr ""
"C<option_P> ir tas, ko lietotājs nodeva opcijā I<-P>, vai C<0>, ja lietotājs "
"neizmantoja opciju I<-P> (tādā gadījumā pavedienu skaits tiek izvēlēts "
"heiristiski)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2431
msgid ""
"C<options_handle> (which may be C<NULL>) is the global guestfs handle "
"created by the options mini-library."
msgstr ""
"C<options_handle> (kas var būt C<NULL>) ir globālais guestfs rokturis, ko "
"izveidojusi opciju mini bibliotēka."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2434
msgid ""
"The work function (C<work>) should do the work (inspecting the domain, etc.)  "
"on domain index C<i>.  However it I<must not> print out any result "
"directly.  Instead it prints anything it needs to the supplied C<FILE *>.  "
"The work function should return C<0> on success or C<-1> on error."
msgstr ""
"Darba funkcijai (C<work>) jāveic darbs (domēna inspicēšana u. c.) ar domēna "
"indeksu C<i>.  Tomēr tā I<nedrīkst> nevienu rezultātu izdrukāt tieši.  Tā "
"vietā tā visu nepieciešamo izdrukā norādītajā C<FILE *>.  Darba funkcijai "
"jāatgriež C<0> veiksmes gadījumā vai C<-1> kļūdas gadījumā."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2440
msgid ""
"The C<start_threads> function returns C<0> if all work items completed "
"successfully, or C<-1> if there was an error."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija C<start_threads> atgriež C<0>, ja visi darba vienumi tika veiksmīgi "
"pabeigti, vai C<-1>, ja bija kļūda."

