#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2616
msgid ""
"This is like C<qemuopts_add_arg> except that no quoting is done on the "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Tas ir līdzīgi C<qemuopts_add_arg>, izņemot to, ka vērtībai netiek "
"pievienotas pēdiņas."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2619
msgid ""
"For C<qemuopts_to_script> and C<qemuopts_to_channel>, this means that "
"neither shell quoting nor qemu comma quoting is done on the value."
msgstr ""
"C<qemuopts_to_script> un C<qemuopts_to_channel> tas nozīmē, ka vērtībai "
"netiek veikta ne čaulas pēdiņu, ne qemu komatu atsoļošana."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2623
msgid "For C<qemuopts_to_argv> this means that qemu comma quoting is not done."
msgstr ""
"C<qemuopts_to_argv> tas nozīmē, ka qemu komatu atsoļošana netiek veikta."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2626
msgid "C<qemuopts_to_config*> will fail."
msgstr "C<qemuopts_to_config*> neizdosies."

#. type: textblock
