#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2724
msgid "Write the qemu options to a C<FILE *fp>."
msgstr "Ierakstīt qemu opcijas C<FILE *fp>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2728
msgid ""
"Only the qemu command line is written.  The caller may need to add "
"C<#!/bin/sh> and may need to chmod the resulting file to C<0755>."
msgstr ""
"Tiek ierakstīta tikai qemu komandrinda.  Izsaucējam, iespējams, jāpievieno "
"C<#!/bin/sh> un iegūtajam failam jāiestata režīms C<0755>."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2733
