#. type: =head2
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3394
msgid "Subdirectory F<common/visit>"
msgstr "Apakšdirektorija F<common/visit>"

#. type: =head3
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3396
msgid "File F<common/visit/visit.c>"
msgstr "Fails F<common/visit/visit.c>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3398
msgid ""
"This file contains a recursive function for visiting all files and "
"directories in a guestfs filesystem."
msgstr ""
"Šis fails satur rekursīvu funkciju visu failu un direktoriju apmeklēšanai "
"guestfs failu sistēmā."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3401
msgid ""
"Adapted from "
"L<https://rwmj.wordpress.com/2010/12/15/tip-audit-virtual-machine-for-setuid-files/>"
msgstr ""
"Pielāgots no L<https://rwmj.wordpress.com/2010/12/15/tip-audit-virtual-"
"machine-for-setuid-files/>"

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3404
msgid "Function C<common/visit/visit.c:visit>"
msgstr "Funkcija C<common/visit/visit.c:visit>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3406
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" int\n"
" visit (guestfs_h *g, const char *dir, visitor_function f, void *opaque)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" int\n"
" visit (guestfs_h *g, const char *dir, visitor_function f, void *opaque)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3409
msgid "Visit every file and directory in a guestfs filesystem, starting at C<dir>."
msgstr ""
"Apmeklēt katru failu un direktoriju guestfs failu sistēmā, sākot ar C<dir>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3412
msgid ""
"C<dir> may be C<\"/\"> to visit the entire filesystem, or may be some "
"subdirectory.  Symbolic links are not followed."
msgstr ""
"C<dir> var būt C<\"/\">, lai apmeklētu visu failu sistēmu, vai kāda "
"apakšdirektorija.  Simboliskajām saitēm netiek sekots."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3415
msgid ""
"The visitor function C<f> is called once for every directory and every "
"file.  The parameters passed to C<f> include the current directory name, the "
"current file name (or C<NULL> when we're visiting a directory), the "
"C<guestfs_statns> (file permissions etc), and the list of extended "
"attributes of the file.  The visitor function may return C<-1> which causes "
"the whole recursion to stop with an error."
msgstr ""
"Apmeklētāja funkcija C<f> tiek izsaukta vienreiz katrai direktorijai un "
"katram failam.  Funkcijai C<f> nodotie parametri ietver pašreizējās "
"direktorijas nosaukumu, pašreizējā faila nosaukumu (vai C<NULL>, kad "
"apmeklējam direktoriju), C<guestfs_statns> (faila atļaujas u. c.) un faila "
"paplašināto atribūtu sarakstu.  Apmeklētāja funkcija var atgriezt C<-1>, kas "
"liek visai rekursijai apstāties ar kļūdu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3423
msgid ""
"Also passed to this function is an C<opaque> pointer which is passed through "
"to the visitor function."
msgstr ""
"Šai funkcijai tiek nodots arī rādītājs C<opaque>, kas tiek nodots tālāk "
"apmeklētāja funkcijai."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3426
msgid ""
"Returns C<0> if everything went OK, or C<-1> if there was an error.  Error "
"handling is not particularly well defined.  It will either set an error in "
"the libguestfs handle or print an error on stderr, but there is no way for "
"the caller to tell the difference."
msgstr ""
"Atgriež C<0>, ja viss noritēja labi, vai C<-1>, ja bija kļūda.  Kļūdu "
"apstrāde nav īpaši labi definēta.  Tā vai nu iestatīs kļūdu libguestfs "
"rokturī, vai izdrukās kļūdu uz stderr, taču izsaucējam nav veida, kā atšķirt."

