" static char **\n"
" split_attr_names (char *buf, size_t len)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" static char **\n"
" split_attr_names (char *buf, size_t len)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3909
msgid ""
"L<listxattr(2)> returns the string C<\"foo\\0bar\\0baz\"> of length C<len>.  "
"(The last string in the list is \\0-terminated but the \\0 is not included "
"in C<len>)."
msgstr ""
"L<listxattr(2)> atgriež virkni C<\"foo\\0bar\\0baz\"> garumā C<len>.  "
"(Pēdējā virkne sarakstā ir noslēgta ar \\0, bet \\0 nav iekļauts C<len>.)"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3913
msgid "This function splits it into a regular list of strings."
msgstr "Šī funkcija to sadala parastā virkņu sarakstā."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3915
msgid ""
"B<Note> that the returned list contains pointers to the original strings in "
"C<buf> so be careful that you do not double-free them."
msgstr ""
"B<Ņemiet vērā>, ka atgrieztais saraksts satur rādītājus uz oriģinālajām "
"virknēm C<buf>, tāpēc uzmanieties tās neatbrīvot divreiz."

