"Using POSIX L<fnmatch(3)>, find strings in the list C<pp> which match "
"pattern C<glob>.  Add strings which match to the C<ret> array.  C<*size_r> "
"is the current size of the C<ret> array, which is updated with the new size."
msgstr ""
"Izmantojot POSIX L<fnmatch(3)>, atrast sarakstā C<pp> virknes, kas atbilst "
"šablonam C<glob>.  Atbilstošās virknes pievienot masīvam C<ret>.  C<*size_r> "
"ir masīva C<ret> pašreizējais izmērs, kas tiek atjaunināts ar jauno izmēru."

