#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:27
msgid "acl-delete-def-file"
msgstr "acl-delete-def-file"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" acl-delete-def-file dir\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" acl-delete-def-file dir\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:31 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:33
msgid ""
"This function deletes the default POSIX Access Control List (ACL)  attached "
"to directory C<dir>."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija dzēš direktorijai C<dir> piesaistīto noklusējuma POSIX piekļuves "
"kontroles sarakstu (ACL)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:34 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:60
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:103
msgid "This command depends on the feature C<acl>.  See also L</feature-available>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda ir atkarīga no līdzekļa C<acl>.  Skatīt arī L</feature-available>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:37
msgid "acl-get-file"
msgstr "acl-get-file"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" acl-get-file path acltype\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" acl-get-file path acltype\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:41 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:50
msgid ""
"This function returns the POSIX Access Control List (ACL) attached to "
"C<path>.  The ACL is returned in \"long text form\" (see L<acl(5)>)."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija atgriež C<path> piesaistīto POSIX piekļuves kontroles sarakstu "
"(ACL).  ACL tiek atgriezts „garā teksta formā” (skatiet L<acl(5)>)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:44 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:70
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:53 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:88
msgid "The C<acltype> parameter may be:"
msgstr "Parametrs C<acltype> var būt:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:48 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:74
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:57 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:92
msgid "C<access>"
msgstr "C<access>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:50 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:59
msgid ""
"Return the ordinary (access) ACL for any file, directory or other filesystem "
"object."
msgstr ""
"Atgriezt parasto (piekļuves) ACL jebkuram failam, direktorijai vai citam "
"failu sistēmas objektam."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:53 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:79
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:62 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:97
msgid "C<default>"
msgstr "C<default>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:55 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:64
msgid ""
"Return the default ACL.  Normally this only makes sense if C<path> is a "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"Atgriezt noklusējuma ACL.  Parasti tam ir jēga tikai tad, ja C<path> ir "
"direktorija."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:63
msgid "acl-set-file"
msgstr "acl-set-file"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:65
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" acl-set-file path acltype acl\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" acl-set-file path acltype acl\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:67 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:85
msgid "This function sets the POSIX Access Control List (ACL) attached to C<path>."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija iestata C<path> piesaistīto POSIX piekļuves kontroles sarakstu "
"(ACL)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:76 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:94
msgid ""
"Set the ordinary (access) ACL for any file, directory or other filesystem "
"object."
msgstr ""
"Iestatīt parasto (piekļuves) ACL jebkuram failam, direktorijai vai citam "
"failu sistēmas objektam."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:81 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:99
msgid ""
"Set the default ACL.  Normally this only makes sense if C<path> is a "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"Iestatīt noklusējuma ACL.  Parasti tam ir jēga tikai tad, ja C<path> ir "
"direktorija."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:86 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:104
msgid ""
"The C<acl> parameter is the new ACL in either \"long text form\" or \"short "
"text form\" (see L<acl(5)>).  The new ACL completely replaces any previous "
"ACL on the file.  The ACL must contain the full Unix permissions "
"(eg. C<u::rwx,g::rx,o::rx>)."
msgstr ""
"Parametrs C<acl> ir jaunais ACL vai nu „garā teksta formā”, vai „īsā teksta "
"formā” (skatiet L<acl(5)>).  Jaunais ACL pilnībā aizstāj jebkuru iepriekšējo "
"faila ACL.  ACL jāsatur pilnas Unix atļaujas (piem., C<u::rwx,g::rx,o::rx>)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:91 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:109
msgid ""
"If you are specifying individual users or groups, then the mask field is "
"also required (eg. C<m::rwx>), followed by the C<u:I<ID>:...> and/or "
"C<g:I<ID>:...> field(s).  A full ACL string might therefore look like this:"
msgstr ""
"Ja norādāt atsevišķus lietotājus vai grupas, nepieciešams arī maskas lauks "
"(piem., C<m::rwx>), kam seko lauks(-i) C<u:I<ID>:...> un/vai C<g:I<ID>:...>"
".  Tādējādi pilna ACL virkne varētu izskatīties šādi:"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:96 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:114
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" u::rwx,g::rwx,o::rwx,m::rwx,u:500:rwx,g:500:rwx\n"
" \\ Unix permissions / \\mask/ \\      ACL        /\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" u::rwx,g::rwx,o::rwx,m::rwx,u:500:rwx,g:500:rwx\n"
" \\ Unix permissions / \\mask/ \\      ACL        /\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:99
msgid ""
"You should use numeric UIDs and GIDs.  To map usernames and groupnames to "
"the correct numeric ID in the context of the guest, use the Augeas functions "
"(see L</aug-init>)."
msgstr ""
"Jāizmanto skaitliski UID un GID.  Lai kartētu lietotājvārdus un grupu "
"nosaukumus uz pareizo skaitlisko ID viesa kontekstā, izmantojiet Augeas "
"funkcijas (skatiet L</aug-init>)."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:106
msgid "add-cdrom"
msgstr "add-cdrom"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:108
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" add-cdrom filename\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" add-cdrom filename\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:110 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:141
msgid "This function adds a virtual CD-ROM disk image to the guest."
msgstr "Šī funkcija viesim pievieno virtuālu CD-ROM diska attēlu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:112
msgid ""
"The image is added as read-only drive, so this function is equivalent of "
"L</add-drive-ro>."
msgstr ""
"Attēls tiek pievienots kā tikai lasāms disks, tāpēc šī funkcija ir "
"līdzvērtīga L</add-drive-ro>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:115
msgid ""
"I<This function is deprecated.> In new code, use the L</add-drive-ro> call "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"I<Šī funkcija ir novecojusi.> Jaunā kodā tā vietā izmantojiet izsaukumu L</"
"add-drive-ro>."

