msgid ""
"Deprecated functions will not be removed from the API, but the fact that "
"they are deprecated indicates that there are problems with correct use of "
"these functions."
msgstr ""
"Novecojušās funkcijas netiks noņemtas no API, taču tas, ka tās ir "
"novecojušas, norāda, ka ir problēmas ar šo funkciju pareizu izmantošanu."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:122
msgid "add-domain"
msgstr "add-domain"

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:124
msgid "domain"
msgstr "domain"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:126
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" add-domain dom [libvirturi:..] [readonly:true|false] [iface:..] "
"[live:true|false] [allowuuid:true|false] [readonlydisk:..] [cachemode:..] "
"[discard:..] [copyonread:true|false]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" add-domain dom [libvirturi:..] [readonly:true|false] [iface:..] "
"[live:true|false] [allowuuid:true|false] [readonlydisk:..] [cachemode:..] "
"[discard:..] [copyonread:true|false]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:128
msgid ""
"This function adds the disk(s) attached to the named libvirt domain C<dom>.  "
"It works by connecting to libvirt, requesting the domain and domain XML from "
"libvirt, parsing it for disks, and calling L</add-drive-opts> on each one."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija pievieno nosauktajam libvirt domēnam C<dom> pievienoto(-s) disku"
"(-s).  Tā darbojas, savienojoties ar libvirt, pieprasot no libvirt domēnu un "
"domēna XML, parsējot to, lai atrastu diskus, un katram no tiem izsaucot L</"
"add-drive-opts>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:133 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:177
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:724
msgid ""
"The number of disks added is returned.  This operation is atomic: if an "
"error is returned, then no disks are added."
msgstr ""
"Tiek atgriezts pievienoto disku skaits.  Šī darbība ir atomiska: ja tiek "
"atgriezta kļūda, neviens disks netiek pievienots."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:136 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:180
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:727
msgid ""
"This function does some minimal checks to make sure the libvirt domain is "
"not running (unless C<readonly> is true).  In a future version we will try "
"to acquire the libvirt lock on each disk."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija veic dažas minimālas pārbaudes, lai pārliecinātos, ka libvirt "
"domēns nedarbojas (ja vien C<readonly> nav true).  Nākamajā versijā "
"mēģināsim iegūt libvirt slēdzeni katram diskam."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:140 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:184
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:731
msgid ""
"Disks must be accessible locally.  This often means that adding disks from a "
"remote libvirt connection (see L<https://libvirt.org/remote.html>)  will "
"fail unless those disks are accessible via the same device path locally too."
msgstr ""
"Diskiem jābūt pieejamiem lokāli.  Tas bieži nozīmē, ka disku pievienošana no "
"attāla libvirt savienojuma (skatiet L<https://libvirt.org/remote.html>) "
"neizdosies, ja vien šie diski nav pieejami arī lokāli ar to pašu ierīces "
"ceļu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:145 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:189
msgid ""
"The optional C<libvirturi> parameter sets the libvirt URI (see "
"L<https://libvirt.org/uri.html>).  If this is not set then we connect to the "
"default libvirt URI (or one set through an environment variable, see the "
"libvirt documentation for full details)."
msgstr ""
"Neobligātais parametrs C<libvirturi> iestata libvirt URI (skatiet L<https://"
"libvirt.org/uri.html>).  Ja tas nav iestatīts, savienojamies ar noklusējuma "
"libvirt URI (vai ar vides mainīgo iestatīto, sīkāk skatiet libvirt "
"dokumentāciju)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:151 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:195
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:736
msgid "The optional C<live> flag is ignored in libguestfs E<ge> 1.48."
msgstr "Neobligātais karogs C<live> libguestfs E<ge> 1.48 tiek ignorēts."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:153 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:197
msgid ""
"If the C<allowuuid> flag is true (default is false) then a UUID I<may> be "
"passed instead of the domain name.  The C<dom> string is treated as a UUID "
"first and looked up, and if that lookup fails then we treat C<dom> as a name "
"as usual."
msgstr ""
"Ja karogs C<allowuuid> ir true (noklusējums ir false), domēna nosaukuma "
"vietā I<var> nodot UUID.  Virkne C<dom> vispirms tiek uzskatīta par UUID un "
"meklēta, un, ja šī meklēšana neizdodas, C<dom> uzskatām par nosaukumu kā "
"parasti."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:158 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:202
msgid ""
"The optional C<readonlydisk> parameter controls what we do for disks which "
"are marked E<lt>readonly/E<gt> in the libvirt XML.  Possible values are:"
msgstr ""
"Neobligātais parametrs C<readonlydisk> kontrolē, ko darām ar diskiem, kas "
"libvirt XML atzīmēti ar E<lt>readonly/E<gt>.  Iespējamās vērtības ir:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:164 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:208
msgid "readonlydisk = \"error\""
msgstr "readonlydisk = \"error\""

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:166 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:177
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:188 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:210
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:221 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:232
msgid "If C<readonly> is false:"
msgstr "Ja C<readonly> ir false:"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:168 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:212
msgid ""
"The whole call is aborted with an error if any disk with the "
"E<lt>readonly/E<gt> flag is found."
msgstr ""
"Viss izsaukums tiek pārtraukts ar kļūdu, ja atrasts jebkurš disks ar karogu "
"E<lt>readonly/E<gt>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:171 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:182
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:192 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:215
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:226 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:236
msgid "If C<readonly> is true:"
msgstr "Ja C<readonly> ir true:"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:173 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:184
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:194 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:217
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:228 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:238
msgid "Disks with the E<lt>readonly/E<gt> flag are added read-only."
msgstr "Diski ar karogu E<lt>readonly/E<gt> tiek pievienoti tikai lasīšanai."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:175 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:219
msgid "readonlydisk = \"read\""
msgstr "readonlydisk = \"read\""

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:179 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:223
msgid ""
"Disks with the E<lt>readonly/E<gt> flag are added read-only.  Other disks "
"are added read/write."
msgstr ""
"Diski ar karogu E<lt>readonly/E<gt> tiek pievienoti tikai lasīšanai.  Citi "
"diski tiek pievienoti lasīšanai/rakstīšanai."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:186 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:230
msgid "readonlydisk = \"write\" (default)"
msgstr "readonlydisk = \"write\" (noklusējums)"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:190 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:234
msgid "Disks with the E<lt>readonly/E<gt> flag are added read/write."
msgstr ""
"Diski ar karogu E<lt>readonly/E<gt> tiek pievienoti lasīšanai/rakstīšanai."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:196 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:240
msgid "readonlydisk = \"ignore\""
msgstr "readonlydisk = \"ignore\""

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:198 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:242
msgid "If C<readonly> is true or false:"
msgstr "Ja C<readonly> ir true vai false:"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:200 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:244
msgid "Disks with the E<lt>readonly/E<gt> flag are skipped."
msgstr "Diski ar karogu E<lt>readonly/E<gt> tiek izlaisti."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:204
msgid ""
"If present, the value of C<logical_block_size> attribute of "
"E<lt>blockio/E<gt> tag in libvirt XML will be passed as C<blocksize> "
"parameter to L</add-drive-opts>."
msgstr ""
"Ja ir, libvirt XML taga E<lt>blockio/E<gt> atribūta C<logical_block_size> "
"vērtība tiks nodota L</add-drive-opts> kā parametrs C<blocksize>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:208
msgid ""
"The other optional parameters are passed directly through to "
"L</add-drive-opts>."
msgstr "Pārējie neobligātie parametri tiek nodoti tieši L</add-drive-opts>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:211 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:463
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:505 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:728
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1082 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1110
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1143 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1162
