#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2388 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3123
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3651 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3687
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3927 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4542
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5159 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5176
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5203 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5220
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5238 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5262
