#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7254 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7273
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7312 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:8017
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:8154 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:8181
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:8215 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:8283
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:8452 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:8918
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9323 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9394
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9442 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9584
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9669 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9690
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:10121 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:10132
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:10206
msgid ""
"This command has one or more optional arguments.  See L</OPTIONAL "
"ARGUMENTS>."
msgstr ""
"Šai komandai ir viens vai vairāki neobligāti argumenti.  Skatiet L</"
"NEOBLIGĀTIE ARGUMENTI>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:213
msgid "add-drive"
msgstr "add-drive"

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:215
msgid "add"
msgstr "add"

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:217
msgid "add-drive-opts"
msgstr "add-drive-opts"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:219
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" add-drive filename [readonly:true|false] [format:..] [iface:..] [name:..] "
"[label:..] [protocol:..] [server:..] [username:..] [secret:..] "
"[cachemode:..] [discard:..] [copyonread:true|false] [blocksize:N]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" add-drive filename [readonly:true|false] [format:..] [iface:..] [name:..] "
"[label:..] [protocol:..] [server:..] [username:..] [secret:..] "
"[cachemode:..] [discard:..] [copyonread:true|false] [blocksize:N]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:221 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:320
msgid ""
"This function adds a disk image called F<filename> to the handle.  "
"F<filename> may be a regular host file or a host device."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija pievieno rokturim diska attēlu F<filename>.  F<filename> var būt "
"parasts resursdatora fails vai resursdatora ierīce."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:224
msgid ""
"When this function is called before L</launch> (the usual case) then the "
"first time you call this function, the disk appears in the API as "
"F</dev/sda>, the second time as F</dev/sdb>, and so on."
msgstr ""
"Ja šo funkciju izsauc pirms L</launch> (parastais gadījums), tad pirmajā "
"izsaukšanas reizē disks API parādās kā F</dev/sda>, otrajā kā F</dev/sdb> un "
"tā tālāk."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:229 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:328
msgid ""
"You don't necessarily need to be root when using libguestfs.  However you "
"obviously do need sufficient permissions to access the filename for whatever "
"operations you want to perform (ie. read access if you just want to read the "
"image or write access if you want to modify the image)."
msgstr ""
"Izmantojot libguestfs, ne vienmēr jābūt root.  Tomēr acīmredzot ir "
"vajadzīgas pietiekamas atļaujas piekļuvei faila nosaukumam jebkurām "
"darbībām, ko vēlaties veikt (t. i., lasīšanas piekļuve, ja vēlaties tikai "
"lasīt attēlu, vai rakstīšanas piekļuve, ja vēlaties attēlu mainīt)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:235 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:334
msgid "This call checks that F<filename> exists."
msgstr "Šis izsaukums pārbauda, vai F<filename> eksistē."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:237 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:336
msgid ""
"F<filename> may be the special string C<\"/dev/null\">.  See "
"L<guestfs(3)/NULL DISKS>."
msgstr ""
"F<filename> var būt īpašā virkne C<\"/dev/null\">.  Skatiet L<guestfs(3)/"
"NULL DISKI>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:240 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6663
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:8139 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9304
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:339 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:10689
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:13244 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:14988
msgid "The optional arguments are:"
msgstr "Neobligātie argumenti ir:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:244 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:343
msgid "C<readonly>"
msgstr "C<readonly>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:246 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:345
msgid ""
"If true then the image is treated as read-only.  Writes are still allowed, "
"but they are stored in a temporary snapshot overlay which is discarded at "
"the end.  The disk that you add is not modified."
msgstr ""
"Ja true, attēls tiek uzskatīts par tikai lasāmu.  Rakstīšana joprojām ir "
"atļauta, bet tā tiek glabāta pagaidu momentuzņēmuma pārklājumā, kas beigās "
"tiek atmests.  Pievienotais disks netiek mainīts."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:250 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:349
msgid "C<format>"
msgstr "C<format>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:252
msgid ""
"This forces the image format.  If you omit this (or use L</add-drive> or "
"L</add-drive-ro>) then the format is automatically detected.  Possible "
"formats include C<raw> and C<qcow2>."
msgstr ""
"Tas piespiež attēla formātu.  Ja to izlaižat (vai izmantojat L</add-drive> "
"vai L</add-drive-ro>), formāts tiek noteikts automātiski.  Iespējamie "
"formāti ietver C<raw> un C<qcow2>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:256 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:355
msgid ""
"Automatic detection of the format opens you up to a potential security hole "
"when dealing with untrusted raw-format images.  See CVE-2010-3851 and "
"RHBZ#642934.  Specifying the format closes this security hole."
msgstr ""
"Automātiska formāta noteikšana rada potenciālu drošības caurumu, strādājot "
"ar neuzticamiem raw formāta attēliem.  Skatiet CVE-2010-3851 un "
"RHBZ#642934.  Formāta norādīšana aizver šo drošības caurumu."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:261 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:360
msgid "C<iface>"
msgstr "C<iface>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:263
msgid ""
"This rarely-used option lets you emulate the behaviour of the deprecated "
"L</add-drive-with-if> call (q.v.)"
msgstr ""
"Šī reti izmantotā opcija ļauj emulēt novecojušā izsaukuma L</add-drive-with-"
"if> uzvedību (skat. tur)"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:266 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6405
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:365 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:10228
msgid "C<name>"
msgstr "C<name>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:268 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:367
msgid ""
"This field used to be passed as a hint for guest inspection, but it is no "
"longer used."
msgstr ""
"Šis lauks agrāk tika nodots kā mājiens viesa inspicēšanai, bet vairs netiek "
"izmantots."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:271 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:370
msgid "C<label>"
msgstr "C<label>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:273 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:372
msgid ""
"Give the disk a label.  The label should be a unique, short string using "
"I<only> ASCII characters C<[a-zA-Z]>.  As well as its usual name in the API "
"(such as F</dev/sda>), the drive will also be named "
"F</dev/disk/guestfs/I<label>>."
msgstr ""
"Piešķirt diskam etiķeti.  Etiķetei jābūt unikālai, īsai virknei, kurā "
"izmantotas I<tikai> ASCII rakstzīmes C<[a-zA-Z]>.  Papildus parastajam "
"nosaukumam API (piemēram, F</dev/sda>) disks tiks nosaukts arī F</dev/disk/"
"guestfs/I<label>>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:278 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:377
msgid "See L<guestfs(3)/DISK LABELS>."
msgstr "Skatiet L<guestfs(3)/DISKU ETIĶETES>."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:280 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:379
msgid "C<protocol>"
msgstr "C<protocol>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:282 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:381
msgid ""
"The optional protocol argument can be used to select an alternate source "
"protocol."
msgstr ""
"Neobligāto protokola argumentu var izmantot, lai izvēlētos alternatīvu avota "
"protokolu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:285 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:384
msgid "See also: L<guestfs(3)/REMOTE STORAGE>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī: L<guestfs(3)/ATTĀLĀ KRĀTUVE>."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:289 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:388
msgid "C<protocol = \"file\">"
msgstr "C<protocol = \"file\">"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:291 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:390
msgid ""
"F<filename> is interpreted as a local file or device.  This is the default "
"if the optional protocol parameter is omitted."
msgstr ""
"F<filename> tiek interpretēts kā lokāls fails vai ierīce.  Tas ir "
"noklusējums, ja neobligātais protokola parametrs ir izlaists."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:295 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:394
msgid "C<protocol = \"ftp\"|\"ftps\"|\"http\"|\"https\">"
msgstr "C<protocol = \"ftp\"|\"ftps\"|\"http\"|\"https\">"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:297 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:396
msgid ""
"Connect to a remote FTP or HTTP server.  The C<server> parameter must also "
"be supplied - see below."
msgstr ""
"Savienoties ar attālu FTP vai HTTP serveri.  Jānorāda arī parametrs "
"C<server> — skatiet tālāk."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:300 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:399
msgid "See also: L<guestfs(3)/FTP AND HTTP>"
msgstr "Skatīt arī: L<guestfs(3)/FTP UN HTTP>"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:302 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:401
msgid "C<protocol = \"iscsi\">"
msgstr "C<protocol = \"iscsi\">"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:304 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:403
msgid ""
"Connect to the iSCSI server.  The C<server> parameter must also be supplied "
"- see below.  The C<username> parameter may be supplied.  See below.  The "
"C<secret> parameter may be supplied.  See below."
msgstr ""
"Savienoties ar iSCSI serveri.  Jānorāda arī parametrs C<server> — skatiet "
"tālāk.  Var norādīt parametru C<username>.  Skatiet tālāk.  Var norādīt "
"parametru C<secret>.  Skatiet tālāk."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:309 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:408
msgid "See also: L<guestfs(3)/ISCSI>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī: L<guestfs(3)/ISCSI>."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:311 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:410
msgid "C<protocol = \"nbd\">"
msgstr "C<protocol = \"nbd\">"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:313 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:412
msgid ""
"Connect to the Network Block Device server.  The C<server> parameter must "
"also be supplied - see below."
msgstr ""
"Savienoties ar Network Block Device serveri.  Jānorāda arī parametrs "
"C<server> — skatiet tālāk."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:316 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:415
msgid "See also: L<guestfs(3)/NETWORK BLOCK DEVICE>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī: L<guestfs(3)/TĪKLA BLOKU IERĪCE>."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:318 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:417
msgid "C<protocol = \"rbd\">"
msgstr "C<protocol = \"rbd\">"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:320 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:419
msgid ""
"Connect to the Ceph (librbd/RBD) server.  The C<server> parameter must also "
"be supplied - see below.  The C<username> parameter may be supplied.  See "
"below.  The C<secret> parameter may be supplied.  See below."
msgstr ""
"Savienoties ar Ceph (librbd/RBD) serveri.  Jānorāda arī parametrs C<server> "
"— skatiet tālāk.  Var norādīt parametru C<username>.  Skatiet tālāk.  Var "
"norādīt parametru C<secret>.  Skatiet tālāk."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:325 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:424
msgid "See also: L<guestfs(3)/CEPH>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī: L<guestfs(3)/CEPH>."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:327 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:426
msgid "C<protocol = \"ssh\">"
msgstr "C<protocol = \"ssh\">"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:329 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:428
msgid "Connect to the Secure Shell (ssh) server."
msgstr "Savienoties ar Secure Shell (ssh) serveri."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:331 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:430
msgid ""
"The C<server> parameter must be supplied.  The C<username> parameter may be "
"supplied.  See below."
msgstr ""
"Jānorāda parametrs C<server>.  Var norādīt parametru C<username>.  Skatiet "
"tālāk."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:334 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:433
msgid "See also: L<guestfs(3)/SSH>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī: L<guestfs(3)/SSH>."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:338 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:437
msgid "C<server>"
msgstr "C<server>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:340 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:439
msgid ""
"For protocols which require access to a remote server, this is a list of "
"server(s)."
msgstr ""
"Protokoliem, kuriem nepieciešama piekļuve attālam serverim, šis ir serveru "
"saraksts."

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:343 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:442
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" Protocol       Number of servers required\n"
" --------       --------------------------\n"
" file           List must be empty or param not used at all\n"
" ftp|ftps|http|https  Exactly one\n"
" iscsi          Exactly one\n"
" nbd            Exactly one\n"
" rbd            Zero or more\n"
" ssh            Exactly one\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" Protocol       Number of servers required\n"
" --------       --------------------------\n"
" file           List must be empty or param not used at all\n"
" ftp|ftps|http|https  Exactly one\n"
" iscsi          Exactly one\n"
" nbd            Exactly one\n"
" rbd            Zero or more\n"
" ssh            Exactly one\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:352 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:451
msgid ""
"Each list element is a string specifying a server.  The string must be in "
"one of the following formats:"
msgstr ""
"Katrs saraksta elements ir virkne, kas norāda serveri.  Virknei jābūt vienā "
"no šiem formātiem:"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:355 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:454
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hostname\n"
" hostname:port\n"
" tcp:hostname\n"
" tcp:hostname:port\n"
" unix:/path/to/socket\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hostname\n"
" hostname:port\n"
" tcp:hostname\n"
" tcp:hostname:port\n"
" unix:/path/to/socket\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:361 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:460
msgid ""
"If the port number is omitted, then the standard port number for the "
"protocol is used (see F</etc/services>)."
msgstr ""
"Ja porta numurs ir izlaists, tiek izmantots protokola standarta porta numurs "
"(skatiet F</etc/services>)."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:364 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:8619
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:463 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:14001
msgid "C<username>"
msgstr "C<username>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:366 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:465
msgid ""
"For the C<ftp>, C<ftps>, C<http>, C<https>, C<iscsi>, C<rbd> and C<ssh> "
"protocols, this specifies the remote username."
msgstr ""
"Protokoliem C<ftp>, C<ftps>, C<http>, C<https>, C<iscsi>, C<rbd> un C<ssh> "
"tas norāda attālo lietotājvārdu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:369 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:468
msgid ""
"If not given, then the local username is used for C<ssh>, and no "
"authentication is attempted for ceph.  But note this sometimes may give "
"unexpected results, for example if using the libvirt backend and if the "
"libvirt backend is configured to start the qemu appliance as a special user "
"such as C<qemu.qemu>.  If in doubt, specify the remote username you want."
msgstr ""
"Ja nav norādīts, C<ssh> tiek izmantots lokālais lietotājvārds, un ceph "
"netiek mēģināta autentifikācija.  Taču ņemiet vērā, ka tas dažreiz var dot "
"negaidītus rezultātus, piemēram, ja izmanto libvirt aizmugursistēmu un "
"libvirt aizmugursistēma ir konfigurēta palaist qemu palīgsistēmu kā īpašu "
"lietotāju, piemēram, C<qemu.qemu>.  Ja šaubāties, norādiet vajadzīgo attālo "
"lietotājvārdu."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:375 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:474
msgid "C<secret>"
msgstr "C<secret>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:377 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:476
msgid ""
"For the C<rbd> protocol only, this specifies the ‘secret’ to use when "
"connecting to the remote device.  It must be base64 encoded."
msgstr ""
"Tikai protokolam C<rbd> tas norāda ‘noslēpumu’, ko izmantot, savienojoties "
"ar attālo ierīci.  Tam jābūt kodētam ar base64."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:380 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:479
msgid ""
"If not given, then a secret matching the given username will be looked up in "
"the default keychain locations, or if no username is given, then no "
"authentication will be used."
msgstr ""
"Ja nav norādīts, noklusējuma atslēgu saišķa vietās tiks meklēts noslēpums, "
"kas atbilst dotajam lietotājvārdam, vai, ja lietotājvārds nav norādīts, "
"autentifikācija netiks izmantota."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:384 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:483
msgid "C<cachemode>"
msgstr "C<cachemode>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:386 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:485
msgid ""
"Choose whether or not libguestfs will obey sync operations (safe but slow)  "
"or not (unsafe but fast).  The possible values for this string are:"
msgstr ""
"Izvēlēties, vai libguestfs ievēros sinhronizācijas darbības (droši, bet "
"lēni) vai ne (nedroši, bet ātri).  Iespējamās šīs virknes vērtības ir:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:391 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:490
msgid "C<cachemode = \"writeback\">"
msgstr "C<cachemode = \"writeback\">"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:393 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:492
msgid "This is the default."
msgstr "Tas ir noklusējums."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:395 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:494
msgid ""
"Write operations in the API do not return until a L<write(2)> call has "
"completed in the host [but note this does not imply that anything gets "
"written to disk]."
msgstr ""
"Rakstīšanas darbības API neatgriežas, kamēr resursdatorā nav pabeigts L<write"
"(2)> izsaukums [bet ņemiet vērā, ka tas nenozīmē, ka kaut kas tiek "
"ierakstīts diskā]."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:399 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:498
msgid ""
"Sync operations in the API, including implicit syncs caused by filesystem "
"journalling, will not return until an L<fdatasync(2)> call has completed in "
"the host, indicating that data has been committed to disk."
msgstr ""
"Sinhronizācijas darbības API, ieskaitot netiešas sinhronizācijas, ko izraisa "
"failu sistēmas žurnalēšana, neatgriezīsies, kamēr resursdatorā nav pabeigts "
"L<fdatasync(2)> izsaukums, norādot, ka dati ir nodoti diskam."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:404 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:503
msgid "C<cachemode = \"unsafe\">"
msgstr "C<cachemode = \"unsafe\">"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:406 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:505
msgid ""
"In this mode, there are no guarantees.  Libguestfs may cache anything and "
"ignore sync requests.  This is suitable only for scratch or temporary disks."
msgstr ""
"Šajā režīmā nav nekādu garantiju.  Libguestfs var kešot jebko un ignorēt "
"sinhronizācijas pieprasījumus.  Tas ir piemērots tikai melnraksta vai "
"pagaidu diskiem."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:412 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:511
msgid "C<discard>"
msgstr "C<discard>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:414
msgid ""
"Enable or disable discard (a.k.a. trim or unmap) support on this drive.  If "
"enabled, operations such as L</fstrim> will be able to discard / make thin / "
"punch holes in the underlying host file or device."
msgstr ""
"Iespējot vai atspējot discard (jeb trim vai unmap) atbalstu šim diskam.  Ja "
"iespējots, tādas darbības kā L</fstrim> varēs atmest / padarīt plānu / "
"izsist caurumus pamatā esošajā resursdatora failā vai ierīcē."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:419 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:518
msgid "Possible discard settings are:"
msgstr "Iespējamie discard iestatījumi ir:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:423 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:522
msgid "C<discard = \"disable\">"
msgstr "C<discard = \"disable\">"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:425 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:524
msgid "Disable discard support.  This is the default."
msgstr "Atspējot discard atbalstu.  Tas ir noklusējums."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:427 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:526
msgid "C<discard = \"enable\">"
msgstr "C<discard = \"enable\">"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:429 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:528
msgid "Enable discard support.  Fail if discard is not possible."
msgstr "Iespējot discard atbalstu.  Neizdoties, ja discard nav iespējams."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:431 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:530
msgid "C<discard = \"besteffort\">"
msgstr "C<discard = \"besteffort\">"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:433 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:532
msgid "Enable discard support if possible, but don't fail if it is not supported."
msgstr ""
"Iespējot discard atbalstu, ja iespējams, bet neizdoties, ja tas netiek "
"atbalstīts."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:436 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:535
msgid ""
"Since not all backends and not all underlying systems support discard, this "
"is a good choice if you want to use discard if possible, but don't mind if "
"it doesn't work."
msgstr ""
"Tā kā ne visas aizmugursistēmas un ne visas pamatā esošās sistēmas atbalsta "
"discard, šī ir laba izvēle, ja vēlaties izmantot discard, ja iespējams, bet "
"neiebilstat, ja tas nedarbojas."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:442 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:541
msgid "C<copyonread>"
msgstr "C<copyonread>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:444 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:543
msgid ""
"The boolean parameter C<copyonread> enables copy-on-read support.  This only "
"affects disk formats which have backing files, and causes reads to be stored "
"in the overlay layer, speeding up multiple reads of the same area of disk."
msgstr ""
"Būla parametrs C<copyonread> iespējo kopēšanas-lasīšanas atbalstu.  Tas "
"ietekmē tikai disku formātus ar pamatfailiem un liek nolasītos datus glabāt "
"pārklājuma slānī, paātrinot vienas un tās pašas diska vietas atkārtotu "
"lasīšanu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:449 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:548
msgid "The default is false."
msgstr "Noklusējums ir false."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:451 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6667
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:550 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:10693
msgid "C<blocksize>"
msgstr "C<blocksize>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:453 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:552
msgid ""
"This parameter sets the sector size of the disk.  Possible values are C<512> "
"(the default if the parameter is omitted) or C<4096>.  Use C<4096> when "
"handling an \"Advanced Format\" disk that uses 4K sector size "
"(L<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Advanced_Format>)."
msgstr ""
"Šis parametrs iestata diska sektora izmēru.  Iespējamās vērtības ir C<512> "
"(noklusējums, ja parametrs izlaists) vai C<4096>.  Izmantojiet C<4096>, "
"apstrādājot „Advanced Format” disku, kas izmanto 4K sektora izmēru "
"(L<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Advanced_Format>)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:458 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:557
msgid ""
"Only a subset of the backends support this parameter (currently only the "
"libvirt and direct backends do)."
msgstr ""
"Šo parametru atbalsta tikai daļa aizmugursistēmu (pašlaik tikai libvirt un "
"direct)."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:465
msgid "add-drive-ro"
msgstr "add-drive-ro"

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:467
msgid "add-ro"
msgstr "add-ro"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:469
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" add-drive-ro filename\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" add-drive-ro filename\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:471
msgid ""
"This function is the equivalent of calling L</add-drive-opts> with the "
"optional parameter C<GUESTFS_ADD_DRIVE_OPTS_READONLY> set to 1, so the disk "
"is added read-only, with the format being detected automatically."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija ir līdzvērtīga L</add-drive-opts> izsaukšanai ar neobligāto "
"parametru C<GUESTFS_ADD_DRIVE_OPTS_READONLY> iestatītu uz 1, tāpēc disks "
"tiek pievienots tikai lasīšanai, formātu nosakot automātiski."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:476
msgid "add-drive-ro-with-if"
msgstr "add-drive-ro-with-if"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:478
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" add-drive-ro-with-if filename iface\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" add-drive-ro-with-if filename iface\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:480
msgid ""
"This is the same as L</add-drive-ro> but it allows you to specify the QEMU "
"interface emulation to use at run time.  Both the direct and the libvirt "
"backends ignore C<iface>."
msgstr ""
"Tas ir tas pats, kas L</add-drive-ro>, bet ļauj norādīt QEMU saskarnes "
"emulāciju, ko izmantot izpildes laikā.  Gan direct, gan libvirt "
"aizmugursistēmas ignorē C<iface>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:484 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:515
msgid ""
"I<This function is deprecated.> In new code, use the L</add-drive> call "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"I<Šī funkcija ir novecojusi.> Jaunā kodā tā vietā izmantojiet izsaukumu L</"
"add-drive>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:491
msgid "add-drive-scratch"
msgstr "add-drive-scratch"

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:493
msgid "scratch"
msgstr "scratch"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:495
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" add-drive-scratch size [name:..] [label:..] [blocksize:N]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" add-drive-scratch size [name:..] [label:..] [blocksize:N]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:497 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:641
msgid ""
"This command adds a temporary scratch drive to the handle.  The C<size> "
"parameter is the virtual size (in bytes).  The scratch drive is blank "
"initially (all reads return zeroes until you start writing to it).  The "
"drive is deleted when the handle is closed."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda pievieno rokturim pagaidu melnraksta disku.  Parametrs C<size> ir "
"virtuālais izmērs (baitos).  Melnraksta disks sākotnēji ir tukšs (visas "
"lasīšanas atgriež nulles, līdz sākat tajā rakstīt).  Disks tiek dzēsts, kad "
"rokturis tiek aizvērts."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:502
msgid ""
"The optional arguments C<name>, C<label> and C<blocksize> are passed through "
"to L</add-drive-opts>."
msgstr ""
"Neobligātie argumenti C<name>, C<label> un C<blocksize> tiek nodoti tālāk uz "
"L</add-drive-opts>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:507
msgid "add-drive-with-if"
msgstr "add-drive-with-if"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:509
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" add-drive-with-if filename iface\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" add-drive-with-if filename iface\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:511
msgid ""
"This is the same as L</add-drive> but it allows you to specify the QEMU "
"interface emulation to use at run time.  Both the direct and the libvirt "
"backends ignore C<iface>."
msgstr ""
"Tas ir tas pats, kas L</add-drive>, bet ļauj norādīt QEMU saskarnes "
"emulāciju, ko izmantot izpildes laikā.  Gan direct, gan libvirt "
"aizmugursistēmas ignorē C<iface>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:522
msgid "aug-clear"
msgstr "aug-clear"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:524
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" aug-clear augpath\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" aug-clear augpath\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:526 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:781
msgid ""
"Set the value associated with C<path> to C<NULL>.  This is the same as the "
"L<augtool(1)> C<clear> command."
msgstr ""
"Iestatīt ar C<path> saistīto vērtību uz C<NULL>.  Tas ir tas pats, kas "
"L<augtool(1)> komanda C<clear>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:529
msgid "aug-close"
msgstr "aug-close"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:531
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" aug-close\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" aug-close\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:533
msgid ""
"Close the current Augeas handle and free up any resources used by it.  After "
"calling this, you have to call L</aug-init> again before you can use any "
"other Augeas functions."
msgstr ""
"Aizvērt pašreizējo Augeas rokturi un atbrīvot visus tā izmantotos resursus.  "
"Pēc šī izsaukšanas, pirms varat izmantot jebkuras citas Augeas funkcijas, "
"atkal jāizsauc L</aug-init>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:538
msgid "aug-defnode"
msgstr "aug-defnode"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:540
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" aug-defnode name expr val\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" aug-defnode name expr val\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:542 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:810
msgid "Defines a variable C<name> whose value is the result of evaluating C<expr>."
msgstr "Definē mainīgo C<name>, kura vērtība ir C<expr> izvērtēšanas rezultāts."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:545
msgid ""
"If C<expr> evaluates to an empty nodeset, a node is created, equivalent to "
"calling L</aug-set> C<expr>, C<val>.  C<name> will be the nodeset containing "
"that single node."
msgstr ""
"Ja C<expr> izvērtējas par tukšu mezglu kopu, tiek izveidots mezgls, kas ir "
"līdzvērtīgi L</aug-set> C<expr>, C<val> izsaukšanai.  C<name> būs mezglu "
"kopa, kas satur šo vienu mezglu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:549 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:817
msgid ""
"On success this returns a pair containing the number of nodes in the "
"nodeset, and a boolean flag if a node was created."
msgstr ""
"Veiksmes gadījumā tas atgriež pāri, kas satur mezglu skaitu mezglu kopā un "
"Būla karogu, vai mezgls tika izveidots."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:553
msgid "aug-defvar"
msgstr "aug-defvar"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:555
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" aug-defvar name expr\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" aug-defvar name expr\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:557 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:834
msgid ""
"Defines an Augeas variable C<name> whose value is the result of evaluating "
"C<expr>.  If C<expr> is NULL, then C<name> is undefined."
msgstr ""
"Definē Augeas mainīgo C<name>, kura vērtība ir C<expr> izvērtēšanas "
"rezultāts.  Ja C<expr> ir NULL, C<name> tiek atdefinēts."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:561 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:838
msgid ""
"On success this returns the number of nodes in C<expr>, or C<0> if C<expr> "
"evaluates to something which is not a nodeset."
msgstr ""
"Veiksmes gadījumā tas atgriež mezglu skaitu C<expr> vai C<0>, ja C<expr> "
"izvērtējas par kaut ko, kas nav mezglu kopa."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:564
msgid "aug-get"
msgstr "aug-get"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:566
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" aug-get augpath\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" aug-get augpath\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:568 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:851
msgid ""
"Look up the value associated with C<path>.  If C<path> matches exactly one "
"node, the C<value> is returned."
msgstr ""
"Meklēt ar C<path> saistīto vērtību.  Ja C<path> atbilst tieši vienam "
"mezglam, tiek atgriezta C<value>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:571
msgid "aug-init"
msgstr "aug-init"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:573
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" aug-init root flags\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" aug-init root flags\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:575 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:866
msgid ""
"Create a new Augeas handle for editing configuration files.  If there was "
"any previous Augeas handle associated with this guestfs session, then it is "
"closed."
msgstr ""
"Izveidot jaunu Augeas rokturi konfigurācijas failu rediģēšanai.  Ja ar šo "
"guestfs sesiju bija saistīts kāds iepriekšējs Augeas rokturis, tas tiek "
"aizvērts."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:579
msgid "You must call this before using any other L</aug-*> commands."
msgstr "Tas jāizsauc pirms jebkuru citu L</aug-*> komandu izmantošanas."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:582 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:873
msgid "C<root> is the filesystem root.  C<root> must not be NULL, use F</> instead."
msgstr ""
"C<root> ir failu sistēmas sakne.  C<root> nedrīkst būt NULL, tā vietā "
"izmantojiet F</>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:585 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:876
msgid ""
"The flags are the same as the flags defined in E<lt>augeas.hE<gt>, the "
"logical I<or> of the following integers:"
msgstr ""
"Karogi ir tie paši, kas definēti E<lt>augeas.hE<gt>, šādu veselu skaitļu "
"loģiskais I<vai>:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:591 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:882
msgid "C<AUG_SAVE_BACKUP> = 1"
msgstr "C<AUG_SAVE_BACKUP> = 1"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:593 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:884
msgid "Keep the original file with a C<.augsave> extension."
msgstr "Saglabāt oriģinālo failu ar paplašinājumu C<.augsave>."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:595 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:886
msgid "C<AUG_SAVE_NEWFILE> = 2"
msgstr "C<AUG_SAVE_NEWFILE> = 2"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:597 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:888
msgid ""
"Save changes into a file with extension C<.augnew>, and do not overwrite "
"original.  Overrides C<AUG_SAVE_BACKUP>."
msgstr ""
"Saglabāt izmaiņas failā ar paplašinājumu C<.augnew> un nepārrakstīt "
"oriģinālu.  Ignorē C<AUG_SAVE_BACKUP>."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:600 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:891
msgid "C<AUG_TYPE_CHECK> = 4"
msgstr "C<AUG_TYPE_CHECK> = 4"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:602 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:893
msgid "Typecheck lenses."
msgstr "Lēcu tipu pārbaude."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:604
msgid ""
"This option is only useful when debugging Augeas lenses.  Use of this option "
"may require additional memory for the libguestfs appliance.  You may need to "
"set the C<LIBGUESTFS_MEMSIZE> environment variable or call L</set-memsize>."
msgstr ""
"Šī opcija noder tikai Augeas lēcu atkļūdošanā.  Šīs opcijas izmantošanai "
"libguestfs palīgsistēmai var būt nepieciešama papildu atmiņa.  Iespējams, "
"būs jāiestata vides mainīgais C<LIBGUESTFS_MEMSIZE> vai jāizsauc L</set-"
"memsize>."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:609 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:900
msgid "C<AUG_NO_STDINC> = 8"
msgstr "C<AUG_NO_STDINC> = 8"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:611 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:902
msgid "Do not use standard load path for modules."
msgstr "Neizmantot standarta moduļu ielādes ceļu."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:613 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:904
msgid "C<AUG_SAVE_NOOP> = 16"
msgstr "C<AUG_SAVE_NOOP> = 16"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:615 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:906
msgid "Make save a no-op, just record what would have been changed."
msgstr ""
"Padarīt saglabāšanu par tukšu darbību, tikai ierakstīt, kas būtu mainīts."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:617 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:908
msgid "C<AUG_NO_LOAD> = 32"
msgstr "C<AUG_NO_LOAD> = 32"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:619
msgid "Do not load the tree in L</aug-init>."
msgstr "Neielādēt koku L</aug-init>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:623
msgid "To close the handle, you can call L</aug-close>."
msgstr "Lai aizvērtu rokturi, varat izsaukt L</aug-close>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:625 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:916
msgid "To find out more about Augeas, see L<http://augeas.net/>."
msgstr "Lai uzzinātu vairāk par Augeas, skatiet L<http://augeas.net/>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:627
msgid "aug-insert"
msgstr "aug-insert"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:629
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" aug-insert augpath label true|false\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" aug-insert augpath label true|false\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:631 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:930
msgid ""
"Create a new sibling C<label> for C<path>, inserting it into the tree before "
"or after C<path> (depending on the boolean flag C<before>)."
msgstr ""
"Izveidot C<path> jaunu blakus mezglu C<label>, ievietojot to kokā pirms vai "
"pēc C<path> (atkarībā no Būla karoga C<before>)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:635 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:934
msgid ""
"C<path> must match exactly one existing node in the tree, and C<label> must "
"be a label, ie. not contain F</>, C<*> or end with a bracketed index C<[N]>."
msgstr ""
"C<path> jāatbilst tieši vienam esošam mezglam kokā, un C<label> jābūt "
"etiķetei, t. i., tā nedrīkst saturēt F</>, C<*> vai beigties ar indeksu "
"kvadrātiekavās C<[N]>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:639
msgid "aug-label"
msgstr "aug-label"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:641
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" aug-label augpath\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" aug-label augpath\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:643 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:948
msgid ""
"The label (name of the last element) of the Augeas path expression "
"C<augpath> is returned.  C<augpath> must match exactly one node, else this "
"function returns an error."
msgstr ""
"Tiek atgriezta Augeas ceļa izteiksmes C<augpath> etiķete (pēdējā elementa "
"nosaukums).  C<augpath> jāatbilst tieši vienam mezglam, citādi šī funkcija "
"atgriež kļūdu."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:647
msgid "aug-load"
msgstr "aug-load"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:649
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" aug-load\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" aug-load\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:651 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:962
msgid "Load files into the tree."
msgstr "Ielādēt failus kokā."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:653 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:964
msgid "See C<aug_load> in the Augeas documentation for the full gory details."
msgstr "Visas drausmīgās detaļas skatiet C<aug_load> Augeas dokumentācijā."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:656
msgid "aug-ls"
msgstr "aug-ls"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:658
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" aug-ls augpath\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" aug-ls augpath\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:660
msgid ""
"This is just a shortcut for listing L</aug-match> C<path/*> and sorting the "
"resulting nodes into alphabetical order."
msgstr ""
"Tas ir tikai saīsne L</aug-match> C<path/*> uzskaitīšanai un iegūto mezglu "
"kārtošanai alfabētiskā secībā."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:663
msgid "aug-match"
msgstr "aug-match"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:665
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" aug-match augpath\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" aug-match augpath\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:667 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:992
msgid ""
"Returns a list of paths which match the path expression C<path>.  The "
"returned paths are sufficiently qualified so that they match exactly one "
"node in the current tree."
msgstr ""
"Atgriež ceļu sarakstu, kas atbilst ceļa izteiksmei C<path>.  Atgrieztie ceļi "
"ir pietiekami kvalificēti, lai tie atbilstu tieši vienam mezglam pašreizējā "
"kokā."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:671
msgid "aug-mv"
msgstr "aug-mv"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:673
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" aug-mv src dest\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" aug-mv src dest\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:675 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1009
msgid ""
"Move the node C<src> to C<dest>.  C<src> must match exactly one node.  "
"C<dest> is overwritten if it exists."
msgstr ""
"Pārvietot mezglu C<src> uz C<dest>.  C<src> jāatbilst tieši vienam mezglam.  "
"C<dest> tiek pārrakstīts, ja tas eksistē."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:678
msgid "aug-rm"
msgstr "aug-rm"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:680
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" aug-rm augpath\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" aug-rm augpath\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:682 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1022
msgid "Remove C<path> and all of its children."
msgstr "Noņemt C<path> un visus tā bērnus."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:684 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1024
msgid "On success this returns the number of entries which were removed."
msgstr "Veiksmes gadījumā tas atgriež noņemto ierakstu skaitu."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:686
msgid "aug-save"
msgstr "aug-save"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:688
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" aug-save\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" aug-save\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:690 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1035
msgid "This writes all pending changes to disk."
msgstr "Tas ieraksta diskā visas gaidošās izmaiņas."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:692
msgid ""
"The flags which were passed to L</aug-init> affect exactly how files are "
"saved."
msgstr ""
"Karogi, kas tika nodoti L</aug-init>, ietekmē, kā tieši faili tiek saglabāti."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:695
msgid "aug-set"
msgstr "aug-set"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:697
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" aug-set augpath val\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" aug-set augpath val\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:699 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1051
msgid "Set the value associated with C<augpath> to C<val>."
msgstr "Iestatīt ar C<augpath> saistīto vērtību uz C<val>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:701
msgid ""
"In the Augeas API, it is possible to clear a node by setting the value to "
"NULL.  Due to an oversight in the libguestfs API you cannot do that with "
"this call.  Instead you must use the L</aug-clear> call."
msgstr ""
"Augeas API mezglu var notīrīt, iestatot vērtību uz NULL.  Libguestfs API "
"kļūdas dēļ ar šo izsaukumu to nevar izdarīt.  Tā vietā jāizmanto izsaukums "
"L</aug-clear>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:706
msgid "aug-setm"
msgstr "aug-setm"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:708
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" aug-setm base sub val\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" aug-setm base sub val\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:710 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1070
msgid ""
"Change multiple Augeas nodes in a single operation.  C<base> is an "
"expression matching multiple nodes.  C<sub> is a path expression relative to "
"C<base>.  All nodes matching C<base> are found, and then for each node, "
"C<sub> is changed to C<val>.  C<sub> may also be C<NULL> in which case the "
"C<base> nodes are modified."
msgstr ""
"Mainīt vairākus Augeas mezglus vienā darbībā.  C<base> ir izteiksme, kas "
"atbilst vairākiem mezgliem.  C<sub> ir ceļa izteiksme attiecībā pret C<base>"
".  Tiek atrasti visi C<base> atbilstošie mezgli, un pēc tam katram mezglam "
"C<sub> tiek mainīts uz C<val>.  C<sub> var būt arī C<NULL>, tādā gadījumā "
"tiek mainīti C<base> mezgli."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:716 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1076
msgid "This returns the number of nodes modified."
msgstr "Tas atgriež mainīto mezglu skaitu."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:718
msgid "aug-transform"
msgstr "aug-transform"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:720
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" aug-transform lens file [remove:true|false]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" aug-transform lens file [remove:true|false]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:722 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1097
msgid ""
"Add an Augeas transformation for the specified C<lens> so it can handle "
"C<file>."
msgstr ""
"Pievienot Augeas transformāciju norādītajai C<lens>, lai tā varētu apstrādāt "
"C<file>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:725 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1100
msgid ""
"If C<remove> is true (C<false> by default), then the transformation is "
"removed."
msgstr ""
"Ja C<remove> ir true (pēc noklusējuma C<false>), transformācija tiek noņemta."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:730
msgid "available"
msgstr "available"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:732
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" available 'groups ...'\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" available 'groups ...'\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:734 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1137
msgid ""
"This command is used to check the availability of some groups of "
"functionality in the appliance, which not all builds of the libguestfs "
"appliance will be able to provide."
msgstr ""
"Šo komandu izmanto, lai pārbaudītu dažu funkcionalitātes grupu pieejamību "
"palīgsistēmā, ko ne visas libguestfs palīgsistēmas būves spēs nodrošināt."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:738
msgid ""
"The libguestfs groups, and the functions that those groups correspond to, "
"are listed in L<guestfs(3)/AVAILABILITY>.  You can also fetch this list at "
"runtime by calling L</available-all-groups>."
msgstr ""
"Libguestfs grupas un funkcijas, kurām šīs grupas atbilst, ir uzskaitītas "
"L<guestfs(3)/PIEEJAMĪBA>.  Šo sarakstu var iegūt arī izpildlaikā, izsaucot "
"L</available-all-groups>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:743 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1146
msgid ""
"The argument C<groups> is a list of group names, eg: C<[\"inotify\", "
"\"augeas\"]> would check for the availability of the Linux inotify functions "
"and Augeas (configuration file editing) functions."
msgstr ""
"Arguments C<groups> ir grupu nosaukumu saraksts, piem.: C<[\"inotify\", "
"\"augeas\"]> pārbaudītu Linux inotify funkciju un Augeas (konfigurācijas "
"failu rediģēšanas) funkciju pieejamību."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:748 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1151
msgid "The command returns no error if I<all> requested groups are available."
msgstr "Komanda neatgriež kļūdu, ja I<visas> pieprasītās grupas ir pieejamas."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:750 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1153
msgid ""
"It fails with an error if one or more of the requested groups is unavailable "
"in the appliance."
msgstr ""
"Tā neizdodas ar kļūdu, ja viena vai vairākas pieprasītās grupas palīgsistēmā "
"nav pieejamas."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:753 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1156
msgid ""
"If an unknown group name is included in the list of groups then an error is "
"always returned."
msgstr ""
"Ja grupu sarakstā iekļauts nezināms grupas nosaukums, vienmēr tiek atgriezta "
"kļūda."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:756 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1159
msgid "I<Notes:>"
msgstr "I<Piezīmes:>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:762
msgid ""
"L</feature-available> is the same as this call, but with a slightly simpler "
"to use API: that call returns a boolean true/false instead of throwing an "
"error."
msgstr ""
"L</feature-available> ir tas pats, kas šis izsaukums, bet ar nedaudz "
"vienkāršāk lietojamu API: tas atgriež Būla true/false, nevis izmet kļūdu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:768
msgid "You must call L</launch> before calling this function."
msgstr "Pirms šīs funkcijas izsaukšanas jāizsauc L</launch>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:770 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1173
msgid ""
"The reason is because we don't know what groups are supported by the "
"appliance/daemon until it is running and can be queried."
msgstr ""
"Iemesls ir tāds, ka nezinām, kuras grupas palīgsistēma/dēmons atbalsta, līdz "
"tas darbojas un tam var vaicāt."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:776 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1179
msgid ""
"If a group of functions is available, this does not necessarily mean that "
"they will work.  You still have to check for errors when calling individual "
"API functions even if they are available."
msgstr ""
"Ja funkciju grupa ir pieejama, tas nebūt nenozīmē, ka tās darbosies.  "
"Izsaucot atsevišķas API funkcijas, joprojām jāpārbauda kļūdas, pat ja tās ir "
"pieejamas."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:783 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1186
msgid ""
"It is usually the job of distro packagers to build complete functionality "
"into the libguestfs appliance.  Upstream libguestfs, if built from source "
"with all requirements satisfied, will support everything."
msgstr ""
"Parasti tas ir distribūciju pakotāju darbs — iebūvēt libguestfs palīgsistēmā "
"pilnu funkcionalitāti.  Augšteces libguestfs, ja būvēta no pirmkoda ar visām "
"izpildītajām prasībām, atbalstīs visu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:790
msgid ""
"This call was added in version C<1.0.80>.  In previous versions of "
"libguestfs all you could do would be to speculatively execute a command to "
"find out if the daemon implemented it.  See also L</version>."
msgstr ""
"Šis izsaukums tika pievienots versijā C<1.0.80>.  Iepriekšējās libguestfs "
"versijās vienīgais, ko varēja darīt, bija spekulatīvi izpildīt komandu, lai "
"noskaidrotu, vai dēmons to realizē.  Skatīt arī L</version>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:797
msgid "See also L</filesystem-available>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī L</filesystem-available>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:799
msgid "available-all-groups"
msgstr "available-all-groups"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:801
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" available-all-groups\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" available-all-groups\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:803
msgid ""
"This command returns a list of all optional groups that this daemon knows "
"about.  Note this returns both supported and unsupported groups.  To find "
"out which ones the daemon can actually support you have to call "
"L</available> / L</feature-available> on each member of the returned list."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda atgriež visu neobligāto grupu sarakstu, par kurām šis dēmons "
"zina.  Ņemiet vērā, ka tas atgriež gan atbalstītās, gan neatbalstītās "
"grupas.  Lai noskaidrotu, kuras dēmons faktiski var atbalstīt, katram "
"atgrieztā saraksta loceklim jāizsauc L</available> / L</feature-available>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:809
msgid ""
"See also L</available>, L</feature-available> and "
"L<guestfs(3)/AVAILABILITY>."
msgstr ""
"Skatīt arī L</available>, L</feature-available> un L<guestfs(3)/PIEEJAMĪBA>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:812
msgid "base64-in"
msgstr "base64-in"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:814
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" base64-in (base64file|-) filename\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" base64-in (base64file|-) filename\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:816 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1233
msgid "This command uploads base64-encoded data from C<base64file> to F<filename>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda augšupielādē base64 kodētus datus no C<base64file> uz F<filename>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:819 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:828
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1650 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1785
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1797 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1818
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2009 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2260
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2282 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2300
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2322 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3011
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5864 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6872
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7218 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7228
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7252 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9083
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9392 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9440
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9451 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9467
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9605 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9624
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9703 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9726
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:10239
msgid "Use C<-> instead of a filename to read/write from stdin/stdout."
msgstr ""
"Lai lasītu/rakstītu no stdin/stdout, faila nosaukuma vietā izmantojiet C<->."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:821
msgid "base64-out"
msgstr "base64-out"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:823
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" base64-out filename (base64file|-)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" base64-out filename (base64file|-)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:825 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1247
msgid ""
"This command downloads the contents of F<filename>, writing it out to local "
"file C<base64file> encoded as base64."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda lejupielādē F<filename> saturu, ierakstot to lokālā failā "
"C<base64file>, kodētu kā base64."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:830
msgid "blkdiscard"
msgstr "blkdiscard"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:832
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" blkdiscard device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" blkdiscard device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:834 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1260
msgid ""
"This discards all blocks on the block device C<device>, giving the free "
"space back to the host."
msgstr ""
"Tas atmet visus blokus bloku ierīcē C<device>, atdodot brīvo vietu "
"resursdatoram."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:837
msgid ""
"This operation requires support in libguestfs, the host filesystem, qemu and "
"the host kernel.  If this support isn't present it may give an error or even "
"appear to run but do nothing.  You must also set the C<discard> attribute on "
"the underlying drive (see L</add-drive-opts>)."
msgstr ""
"Šai darbībai nepieciešams atbalsts libguestfs, resursdatora failu sistēmā, "
"qemu un resursdatora kodolā.  Ja šī atbalsta nav, tā var dot kļūdu vai pat "
"šķietami izpildīties, bet neko nedarīt.  Jāiestata arī pamatā esošā diska "
"atribūts C<discard> (skatiet L</add-drive-opts>)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:843
msgid ""
"This command depends on the feature C<blkdiscard>.  See also "
"L</feature-available>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda ir atkarīga no līdzekļa C<blkdiscard>.  Skatīt arī L</feature-"
"available>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:846
msgid "blkdiscardzeroes"
msgstr "blkdiscardzeroes"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:848
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" blkdiscardzeroes device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" blkdiscardzeroes device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:850
msgid ""
"This call returns true if blocks on C<device> that have been discarded by a "
"call to L</blkdiscard> are returned as blocks of zero bytes when read the "
"next time."
msgstr ""
"Šis izsaukums atgriež true, ja bloki ierīcē C<device>, kas atmesti ar L</"
"blkdiscard> izsaukumu, nākamajā lasīšanas reizē tiek atgriezti kā nulles "
"baitu bloki."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:854 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1286
msgid ""
"If it returns false, then it may be that discarded blocks are read as stale "
"or random data."
msgstr ""
"Ja tas atgriež false, iespējams, ka atmestie bloki tiek nolasīti kā "
"novecojuši vai nejauši dati."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:857
msgid ""
"This command depends on the feature C<blkdiscardzeroes>.  See also "
"L</feature-available>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda ir atkarīga no līdzekļa C<blkdiscardzeroes>.  Skatīt arī L</"
"feature-available>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:860
msgid "blkid"
msgstr "blkid"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:862
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" blkid device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" blkid device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:864 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1302
msgid ""
"This command returns block device attributes for C<device>. The following "
"fields are usually present in the returned hash. Other fields may also be "
"present."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda atgriež ierīces C<device> bloku ierīces atribūtus. Atgrieztajā "
"jaucējtabulā parasti ir šādi lauki. Var būt arī citi lauki."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:869 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1307
msgid "C<UUID>"
msgstr "C<UUID>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:871 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1309
msgid "The uuid of this device."
msgstr "Šīs ierīces uuid."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:873 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1311
msgid "C<LABEL>"
msgstr "C<LABEL>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:875 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1313
msgid "The label of this device."
msgstr "Šīs ierīces etiķete."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:877 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1315
msgid "C<VERSION>"
msgstr "C<VERSION>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:879 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1317
msgid "The version of blkid command."
msgstr "Komandas blkid versija."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:881 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1319
msgid "C<TYPE>"
msgstr "C<TYPE>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:883 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1321
msgid "The filesystem type or RAID of this device."
msgstr "Šīs ierīces failu sistēmas tips vai RAID."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:885 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1323
msgid "C<USAGE>"
msgstr "C<USAGE>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:887 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1325
msgid "The usage of this device, for example C<filesystem> or C<raid>."
msgstr "Šīs ierīces lietojums, piemēram, C<filesystem> vai C<raid>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:891
msgid "blockdev-flushbufs"
msgstr "blockdev-flushbufs"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:893
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" blockdev-flushbufs device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" blockdev-flushbufs device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:895 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1343
msgid "This tells the kernel to flush internal buffers associated with C<device>."
msgstr "Tas liek kodolam izskalot ar C<device> saistītos iekšējos buferus."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:898 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:912
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:921 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:931
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:943 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:956
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:964 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:990
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:998 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1006
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1346 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1366
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1381 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1397
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1415 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1434
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1448 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1488
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1502 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1516
msgid "This uses the L<blockdev(8)> command."
msgstr "Tas izmanto komandu L<blockdev(8)>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:900
msgid "blockdev-getbsz"
msgstr "blockdev-getbsz"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:902
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" blockdev-getbsz device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" blockdev-getbsz device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:904 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1358
msgid "This returns the block size of a device."
msgstr "Tas atgriež ierīces bloka izmēru."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:906 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1360
msgid ""
"Note: this is different from both I<size in blocks> and I<filesystem block "
"size>.  Also this setting is not really used by anything.  You should "
"probably not use it for anything.  Filesystems have their own idea about "
"what block size to choose."
msgstr ""
"Piezīme: tas atšķiras gan no I<izmēra blokos>, gan no I<failu sistēmas bloka "
"izmēra>.  Turklāt šo iestatījumu īsti nekas neizmanto.  Droši vien "
"nevajadzētu to izmantot nekam.  Failu sistēmām ir savs priekšstats par to, "
"kādu bloka izmēru izvēlēties."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:914
msgid "blockdev-getro"
msgstr "blockdev-getro"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:916
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" blockdev-getro device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" blockdev-getro device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:918 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1378
msgid ""
"Returns a boolean indicating if the block device is read-only (true if "
"read-only, false if not)."
msgstr ""
"Atgriež Būla vērtību, kas norāda, vai bloku ierīce ir tikai lasāma (true, ja "
"tikai lasāma, false, ja nav)."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:923
msgid "blockdev-getsize64"
msgstr "blockdev-getsize64"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:925
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" blockdev-getsize64 device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" blockdev-getsize64 device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:927 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1393
msgid "This returns the size of the device in bytes."
msgstr "Tas atgriež ierīces izmēru baitos."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:929
msgid "See also L</blockdev-getsz>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī L</blockdev-getsz>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:933
msgid "blockdev-getss"
msgstr "blockdev-getss"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:935
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" blockdev-getss device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" blockdev-getss device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:937 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1409
msgid ""
"This returns the size of sectors on a block device.  Usually 512, but can be "
"larger for modern devices."
msgstr ""
"Tas atgriež bloku ierīces sektoru izmēru.  Parasti 512, bet modernām ierīcēm "
"var būt lielāks."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:940
msgid "(Note, this is not the size in sectors, use L</blockdev-getsz> for that)."
msgstr "(Piezīme: tas nav izmērs sektoros, tam izmantojiet L</blockdev-getsz>)."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:945
msgid "blockdev-getsz"
msgstr "blockdev-getsz"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:947
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" blockdev-getsz device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" blockdev-getsz device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:949 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1427
msgid ""
"This returns the size of the device in units of 512-byte sectors (even if "
"the sectorsize isn't 512 bytes ... weird)."
msgstr ""
"Tas atgriež ierīces izmēru 512 baitu sektoru vienībās (pat ja sektora izmērs "
"nav 512 baiti ... dīvaini)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:952
msgid ""
"See also L</blockdev-getss> for the real sector size of the device, and "
"L</blockdev-getsize64> for the more useful I<size in bytes>."
msgstr ""
"Skatīt arī L</blockdev-getss> ierīces īstajam sektora izmēram un L</blockdev-"
"getsize64> noderīgākajam I<izmēram baitos>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:958
msgid "blockdev-rereadpt"
msgstr "blockdev-rereadpt"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:960
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" blockdev-rereadpt device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" blockdev-rereadpt device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:962 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1446
msgid "Reread the partition table on C<device>."
msgstr "Atkārtoti nolasīt nodalījumu tabulu ierīcē C<device>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:966
msgid "blockdev-setbsz"
msgstr "blockdev-setbsz"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:968
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" blockdev-setbsz device blocksize\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" blockdev-setbsz device blocksize\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:970 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1469
msgid ""
"This call does nothing and has never done anything because of a bug in "
"blockdev.  B<Do not use it.>"
msgstr ""
"Šis izsaukums neko nedara un nekad nav neko darījis kļūdas dēļ blockdev.  "
"B<Neizmantojiet to.>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:973
msgid ""
"If you need to set the filesystem block size, use the C<blocksize> option of "
"L</mkfs>."
msgstr ""
"Ja jāiestata failu sistēmas bloka izmērs, izmantojiet L</mkfs> opciju "
"C<blocksize>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:976 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4458
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4852 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4868
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4884 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5657
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7005 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:8025
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1461 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:7142
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:7716 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:7738
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:7760 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:9088
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:11295 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:13049
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:16203
msgid ""
"I<This function is deprecated.> There is no replacement.  Consult the API "
"documentation in L<guestfs(3)> for further information."
msgstr ""
"I<Šī funkcija ir novecojusi.> Aizstājēja nav.  Plašāku informāciju skatiet "
"API dokumentācijā L<guestfs(3)>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:984
msgid "blockdev-setra"
msgstr "blockdev-setra"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:986
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" blockdev-setra device sectors\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" blockdev-setra device sectors\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:988 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1486
msgid "Set readahead (in 512-byte sectors) for the device."
msgstr "Iestatīt ierīces priekšlasīšanu (512 baitu sektoros)."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:992
msgid "blockdev-setro"
msgstr "blockdev-setro"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:994
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" blockdev-setro device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" blockdev-setro device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:996 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1500
msgid "Sets the block device named C<device> to read-only."
msgstr "Iestata bloku ierīci C<device> tikai lasīšanai."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1000
msgid "blockdev-setrw"
msgstr "blockdev-setrw"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1002
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" blockdev-setrw device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" blockdev-setrw device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1004 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1514
msgid "Sets the block device named C<device> to read-write."
msgstr "Iestata bloku ierīci C<device> lasīšanai un rakstīšanai."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1008
msgid "btrfs-balance-cancel"
msgstr "btrfs-balance-cancel"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1010
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-balance-cancel path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-balance-cancel path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1012 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1528
msgid "Cancel a running balance on a btrfs filesystem."
msgstr "Atcelt darbojošos līdzsvarošanu btrfs failu sistēmā."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1014 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1023
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1032 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1041
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1051 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1061
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1073 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1084
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1112 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1124
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1133 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1152
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1164 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1174
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1183 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1192
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1201 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1210
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1220 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1229
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1238 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1253
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1262 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1271
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1280 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1292
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1301 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1312
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1321 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1331
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1347 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1356
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1365 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1375
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1386 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1395
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1414 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1423
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1432 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1442
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6736
msgid ""
"This command depends on the feature C<btrfs>.  See also "
"L</feature-available>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda ir atkarīga no līdzekļa C<btrfs>.  Skatīt arī L</feature-"
"available>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1017
msgid "btrfs-balance-pause"
msgstr "btrfs-balance-pause"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1019
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-balance-pause path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-balance-pause path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1021 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1543
msgid "Pause a running balance on a btrfs filesystem."
msgstr "Pauzēt darbojošos līdzsvarošanu btrfs failu sistēmā."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1026
msgid "btrfs-balance-resume"
msgstr "btrfs-balance-resume"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1028
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-balance-resume path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-balance-resume path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1030 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1558
msgid "Resume a paused balance on a btrfs filesystem."
msgstr "Atsākt pauzētu līdzsvarošanu btrfs failu sistēmā."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1035
msgid "btrfs-balance-status"
msgstr "btrfs-balance-status"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1037
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-balance-status path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-balance-status path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1039 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1573
msgid "Show the status of a running or paused balance on a btrfs filesystem."
msgstr ""
"Parādīt darbojošās vai pauzētas līdzsvarošanas statusu btrfs failu sistēmā."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1044
msgid "btrfs-device-add"
msgstr "btrfs-device-add"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1046
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-device-add 'devices ...' fs\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-device-add 'devices ...' fs\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1048 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1591
msgid ""
"Add the list of device(s) in C<devices> to the btrfs filesystem mounted at "
"C<fs>.  If C<devices> is an empty list, this does nothing."
msgstr ""
"Pievienot ierīču sarakstu C<devices> btrfs failu sistēmai, kas montēta C<fs>"
".  Ja C<devices> ir tukšs saraksts, tas neko nedara."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1054
msgid "btrfs-device-delete"
msgstr "btrfs-device-delete"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1056
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-device-delete 'devices ...' fs\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-device-delete 'devices ...' fs\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1058 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1608
msgid ""
"Remove the C<devices> from the btrfs filesystem mounted at C<fs>.  If "
"C<devices> is an empty list, this does nothing."
msgstr ""
"Noņemt C<devices> no btrfs failu sistēmas, kas montēta C<fs>.  Ja C<devices> "
"ir tukšs saraksts, tas neko nedara."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1064
msgid "btrfs-filesystem-balance"
msgstr "btrfs-filesystem-balance"

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1066
msgid "btrfs-balance"
msgstr "btrfs-balance"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1068
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-filesystem-balance fs\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-filesystem-balance fs\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1070 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1624
msgid ""
"Balance the chunks in the btrfs filesystem mounted at C<fs> across the "
"underlying devices."
msgstr ""
"Līdzsvarot gabalus btrfs failu sistēmā, kas montēta C<fs>, pa pamatā "
"esošajām ierīcēm."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1076
msgid "btrfs-filesystem-defragment"
msgstr "btrfs-filesystem-defragment"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1078
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-filesystem-defragment path [flush:true|false] [compress:..]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-filesystem-defragment path [flush:true|false] [compress:..]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1080 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1649
msgid ""
"Defragment a file or directory on a btrfs filesystem. compress is one of "
"zlib or lzo."
msgstr ""
"Defragmentēt failu vai direktoriju btrfs failu sistēmā. compress ir zlib vai "
"lzo."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1087
msgid "btrfs-filesystem-resize"
msgstr "btrfs-filesystem-resize"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1089
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-filesystem-resize mountpoint [size:N]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-filesystem-resize mountpoint [size:N]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1091 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1694
msgid "This command resizes a btrfs filesystem."
msgstr "Šī komanda maina btrfs failu sistēmas izmēru."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1093 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1696
msgid ""
"Note that unlike other resize calls, the filesystem has to be mounted and "
"the parameter is the mountpoint not the device (this is a requirement of "
"btrfs itself)."
msgstr ""
"Ņemiet vērā, ka atšķirībā no citiem izmēra maiņas izsaukumiem failu sistēmai "
"jābūt montētai un parametrs ir montēšanas punkts, nevis ierīce (tā ir paša "
"btrfs prasība)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1097 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6320
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7287 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9514
#: fish/guestfish-prepopts.pod:35 fish/guestfish-prepopts.pod:50
#: fish/guestfish-prepopts.pod:67 fish/guestfish-prepopts.pod:86
#: fish/guestfish-prepopts.pod:103 fish/guestfish-prepopts.pod:119
#: fish/guestfish-prepopts.pod:136 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1700
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:10115 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:11887
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:15390
msgid "The optional parameters are:"
msgstr "Neobligātie parametri ir:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1101 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7291
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1704 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:11891
msgid "C<size>"
msgstr "C<size>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1103 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1706
msgid ""
"The new size (in bytes) of the filesystem.  If omitted, the filesystem is "
"resized to the maximum size."
msgstr ""
"Jaunais failu sistēmas izmērs (baitos).  Ja izlaists, failu sistēmas izmērs "
"tiek mainīts uz maksimālo."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1108 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1711
msgid "See also L<btrfs(8)>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī L<btrfs(8)>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1115
msgid "btrfs-filesystem-show"
msgstr "btrfs-filesystem-show"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1117
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-filesystem-show device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-filesystem-show device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1119 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1748
msgid "Show all the devices where the filesystems in C<device> is spanned over."
msgstr ""
"Parādīt visas ierīces, pa kurām izvērstas ierīces C<device> failu sistēmas."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1121 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1750
msgid ""
"If not all the devices for the filesystems are present, then this function "
"fails and the C<errno> is set to C<ENODEV>."
msgstr ""
"Ja nav visu failu sistēmu ierīču, šī funkcija neizdodas, un C<errno> tiek "
"iestatīts uz C<ENODEV>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1127
msgid "btrfs-filesystem-sync"
msgstr "btrfs-filesystem-sync"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1129
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-filesystem-sync fs\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-filesystem-sync fs\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1131 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1768
msgid "Force sync on the btrfs filesystem mounted at C<fs>."
msgstr "Piespiest sinhronizāciju btrfs failu sistēmā, kas montēta C<fs>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1136
msgid "btrfs-fsck"
msgstr "btrfs-fsck"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1138
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-fsck device [superblock:N] [repair:true|false]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-fsck device [superblock:N] [repair:true|false]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1140 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1799
msgid ""
"Used to check a btrfs filesystem, C<device> is the device file where the "
"filesystem is stored."
msgstr ""
"Izmanto btrfs failu sistēmas pārbaudei, C<device> ir ierīces fails, kurā "
"glabājas failu sistēma."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1145
msgid ""
"I<This function is deprecated.> In new code, use the L</btrfs-scrub-full> "
"call instead."
msgstr ""
"I<Šī funkcija ir novecojusi.> Jaunā kodā tā vietā izmantojiet izsaukumu L</"
"btrfs-scrub-full>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1155
msgid "btrfs-image"
msgstr "btrfs-image"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1157
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-image 'source ...' image [compresslevel:N]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-image 'source ...' image [compresslevel:N]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1159 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1846
msgid ""
"This is used to create an image of a btrfs filesystem.  All data will be "
"zeroed, but metadata and the like is preserved."
msgstr ""
"To izmanto btrfs failu sistēmas attēla izveidei.  Visi dati tiks aizpildīti "
"ar nullēm, bet metadati u. tml. tiek saglabāti."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1167
msgid "btrfs-qgroup-assign"
msgstr "btrfs-qgroup-assign"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1169
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-qgroup-assign src dst path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-qgroup-assign src dst path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1171 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1888
msgid ""
"Add qgroup C<src> to parent qgroup C<dst>. This command can group several "
"qgroups into a parent qgroup to share common limit."
msgstr ""
"Pievienot qgroup C<src> vecāka qgroup C<dst>. Šī komanda var grupēt vairākas "
"qgroup vecāka qgroup, lai koplietotu kopīgu ierobežojumu."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1177
msgid "btrfs-qgroup-create"
msgstr "btrfs-qgroup-create"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1179
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-qgroup-create qgroupid subvolume\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-qgroup-create qgroupid subvolume\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1181 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1905
msgid "Create a quota group (qgroup) for subvolume at C<subvolume>."
msgstr "Izveidot kvotu grupu (qgroup) apakšsējumam C<subvolume>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1186
msgid "btrfs-qgroup-destroy"
msgstr "btrfs-qgroup-destroy"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1188
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-qgroup-destroy qgroupid subvolume\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-qgroup-destroy qgroupid subvolume\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1190 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1921
msgid "Destroy a quota group."
msgstr "Iznīcināt kvotu grupu."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1195
msgid "btrfs-qgroup-limit"
msgstr "btrfs-qgroup-limit"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1197
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-qgroup-limit subvolume size\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-qgroup-limit subvolume size\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1199 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1937
msgid "Limit the size of the subvolume with path C<subvolume>."
msgstr "Ierobežot apakšsējuma ar ceļu C<subvolume> izmēru."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1204
msgid "btrfs-qgroup-remove"
msgstr "btrfs-qgroup-remove"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1206
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-qgroup-remove src dst path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-qgroup-remove src dst path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1208 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1954
msgid "Remove qgroup C<src> from the parent qgroup C<dst>."
msgstr "Noņemt qgroup C<src> no vecāka qgroup C<dst>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1213
msgid "btrfs-qgroup-show"
msgstr "btrfs-qgroup-show"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1215
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-qgroup-show path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-qgroup-show path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1217 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1969
msgid ""
"Show all subvolume quota groups in a btrfs filesystem, including their "
"usages."
msgstr ""
"Parādīt visas apakšsējumu kvotu grupas btrfs failu sistēmā, ieskaitot to "
"lietojumu."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1223
msgid "btrfs-quota-enable"
msgstr "btrfs-quota-enable"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1225
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-quota-enable fs true|false\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-quota-enable fs true|false\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1227 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1988
msgid ""
"Enable or disable subvolume quota support for filesystem which contains "
"C<path>."
msgstr ""
"Iespējot vai atspējot apakšsējumu kvotu atbalstu failu sistēmai, kas satur "
"C<path>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1232
msgid "btrfs-quota-rescan"
msgstr "btrfs-quota-rescan"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1234
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-quota-rescan fs\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-quota-rescan fs\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1236 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2003
msgid ""
"Trash all qgroup numbers and scan the metadata again with the current "
"config."
msgstr ""
"Izmest visus qgroup numurus un atkārtoti skenēt metadatus ar pašreizējo "
"konfigurāciju."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1241
msgid "btrfs-replace"
msgstr "btrfs-replace"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1243
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-replace srcdev targetdev mntpoint\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-replace srcdev targetdev mntpoint\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1245 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2020
msgid ""
"Replace device of a btrfs filesystem. On a live filesystem, duplicate the "
"data to the target device which is currently stored on the source device.  "
"After completion of the operation, the source device is wiped out and "
"removed from the filesystem."
msgstr ""
"Aizstāt btrfs failu sistēmas ierīci. Darbojošā failu sistēmā dublēt datus, "
"kas pašlaik glabājas avota ierīcē, uz mērķa ierīci.  Pēc darbības "
"pabeigšanas avota ierīce tiek notīrīta un noņemta no failu sistēmas."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1250 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2025
msgid ""
"The C<targetdev> needs to be same size or larger than the C<srcdev>. Devices "
"which are currently mounted are never allowed to be used as the "
"C<targetdev>."
msgstr ""
"C<targetdev> jābūt tāda paša izmēra vai lielākai par C<srcdev>. Ierīces, kas "
"pašlaik ir montētas, nekad nav atļauts izmantot kā C<targetdev>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1256
msgid "btrfs-rescue-chunk-recover"
msgstr "btrfs-rescue-chunk-recover"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1258
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-rescue-chunk-recover device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-rescue-chunk-recover device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1260 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2041
msgid ""
"Recover the chunk tree of btrfs filesystem by scanning the devices one by "
"one."
msgstr ""
"Atgūt btrfs failu sistēmas gabalu koku, skenējot ierīces vienu pēc otras."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1265
msgid "btrfs-rescue-super-recover"
msgstr "btrfs-rescue-super-recover"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1267
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-rescue-super-recover device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-rescue-super-recover device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1269 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2056
msgid "Recover bad superblocks from good copies."
msgstr "Atgūt bojātus superblokus no labām kopijām."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1274
msgid "btrfs-scrub-cancel"
msgstr "btrfs-scrub-cancel"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1276
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-scrub-cancel path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-scrub-cancel path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1278 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2071
msgid "Cancel a running scrub on a btrfs filesystem."
msgstr "Atcelt darbojošos scrub btrfs failu sistēmā."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1283
msgid "btrfs-scrub-full"
msgstr "btrfs-scrub-full"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1285
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-scrub-full path [readonly:true|false]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-scrub-full path [readonly:true|false]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1287 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2094
msgid ""
"Run a full scrub on a btrfs filesystem and wait for it to finish.  If the "
"filesystem has errors this will return an error."
msgstr ""
"Izpildīt pilnu scrub btrfs failu sistēmā un gaidīt, līdz tas beidzas.  Ja "
"failu sistēmā ir kļūdas, tas atgriezīs kļūdu."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1295
msgid "btrfs-scrub-resume"
msgstr "btrfs-scrub-resume"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1297
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-scrub-resume path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-scrub-resume path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1299 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2132
msgid "Resume a previously canceled or interrupted scrub on a btrfs filesystem."
msgstr "Atsākt iepriekš atceltu vai pārtrauktu scrub btrfs failu sistēmā."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1304
msgid "btrfs-scrub-start"
msgstr "btrfs-scrub-start"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1306
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-scrub-start path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-scrub-start path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1308 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2147
msgid ""
"Reads all the data and metadata on the filesystem, and uses checksums and "
"the duplicate copies from RAID storage to identify and repair any corrupt "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Nolasa visus failu sistēmas datus un metadatus un izmanto kontrolsummas un "
"RAID krātuves dublētās kopijas, lai identificētu un labotu jebkurus bojātus "
"datus."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1315
msgid "btrfs-scrub-status"
msgstr "btrfs-scrub-status"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1317
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-scrub-status path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-scrub-status path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1319 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2164
msgid "Show status of running or finished scrub on a btrfs filesystem."
msgstr "Parādīt darbojoša vai pabeigta scrub statusu btrfs failu sistēmā."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1324
msgid "btrfs-set-seeding"
msgstr "btrfs-set-seeding"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1326
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-set-seeding device true|false\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-set-seeding device true|false\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1328 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2182
msgid ""
"Enable or disable the seeding feature of a device that contains a btrfs "
"filesystem."
msgstr ""
"Iespējot vai atspējot sēšanas līdzekli ierīcei, kas satur btrfs failu "
"sistēmu."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1334
msgid "btrfs-subvolume-create"
msgstr "btrfs-subvolume-create"

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1336
msgid "btrfs-subvolume-create-opts"
msgstr "btrfs-subvolume-create-opts"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1338
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-subvolume-create dest [qgroupid:..]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-subvolume-create dest [qgroupid:..]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1340 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2219
msgid ""
"Create a btrfs subvolume.  The C<dest> argument is the destination directory "
"and the name of the subvolume, in the form F</path/to/dest/name>.  The "
"optional parameter C<qgroupid> represents the qgroup which the newly created "
"subvolume will be added to."
msgstr ""
"Izveidot btrfs apakšsējumu.  Arguments C<dest> ir mērķa direktorija un "
"apakšsējuma nosaukums formā F</path/to/dest/name>.  Neobligātais parametrs "
"C<qgroupid> norāda qgroup, kurai tiks pievienots jaunizveidotais apakšsējums."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1350
msgid "btrfs-subvolume-delete"
msgstr "btrfs-subvolume-delete"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1352
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-subvolume-delete subvolume\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-subvolume-delete subvolume\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1354 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2259
msgid "Delete the named btrfs subvolume or snapshot."
msgstr "Dzēst nosaukto btrfs apakšsējumu vai momentuzņēmumu."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1359
msgid "btrfs-subvolume-get-default"
msgstr "btrfs-subvolume-get-default"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1361
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-subvolume-get-default fs\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-subvolume-get-default fs\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1363 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2274
msgid ""
"Get the default subvolume or snapshot of a filesystem mounted at "
"C<mountpoint>."
msgstr ""
"Iegūt noklusējuma apakšsējumu vai momentuzņēmumu failu sistēmai, kas montēta "
"C<mountpoint>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1368
msgid "btrfs-subvolume-list"
msgstr "btrfs-subvolume-list"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1370
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-subvolume-list fs\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-subvolume-list fs\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1372 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2289
msgid ""
"List the btrfs snapshots and subvolumes of the btrfs filesystem which is "
"mounted at C<fs>."
msgstr ""
"Uzskaitīt btrfs momentuzņēmumus un apakšsējumus btrfs failu sistēmai, kas "
"montēta C<fs>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1378
msgid "btrfs-subvolume-set-default"
msgstr "btrfs-subvolume-set-default"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1380
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-subvolume-set-default id fs\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-subvolume-set-default id fs\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1382
msgid ""
"Set the subvolume of the btrfs filesystem C<fs> which will be mounted by "
"default.  See L</btrfs-subvolume-list> to get a list of subvolumes."
msgstr ""
"Iestatīt btrfs failu sistēmas C<fs> apakšsējumu, kas tiks montēts pēc "
"noklusējuma.  Apakšsējumu sarakstu iegūsiet ar L</btrfs-subvolume-list>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1389
msgid "btrfs-subvolume-show"
msgstr "btrfs-subvolume-show"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1391
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-subvolume-show subvolume\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-subvolume-show subvolume\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1393 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2325
msgid "Return detailed information of the subvolume."
msgstr "Atgriezt detalizētu informāciju par apakšsējumu."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1398
msgid "btrfs-subvolume-snapshot"
msgstr "btrfs-subvolume-snapshot"

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1400
msgid "btrfs-subvolume-snapshot-opts"
msgstr "btrfs-subvolume-snapshot-opts"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1402
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfs-subvolume-snapshot source dest [ro:true|false] [qgroupid:..]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfs-subvolume-snapshot source dest [ro:true|false] [qgroupid:..]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1404 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2368
msgid ""
"Create a snapshot of the btrfs subvolume C<source>.  The C<dest> argument is "
"the destination directory and the name of the snapshot, in the form "
"F</path/to/dest/name>. By default the newly created snapshot is writable, if "
"the value of optional parameter C<ro> is true, then a readonly snapshot is "
"created. The optional parameter C<qgroupid> represents the qgroup which the "
"newly created snapshot will be added to."
msgstr ""
"Izveidot btrfs apakšsējuma C<source> momentuzņēmumu.  Arguments C<dest> ir "
"mērķa direktorija un momentuzņēmuma nosaukums formā F</path/to/dest/name>. "
"Pēc noklusējuma jaunizveidotais momentuzņēmums ir rakstāms; ja neobligātā "
"parametra C<ro> vērtība ir true, tiek izveidots tikai lasāms momentuzņēmums. "
"Neobligātais parametrs C<qgroupid> norāda qgroup, kurai tiks pievienots "
"jaunizveidotais momentuzņēmums."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1417
msgid "btrfstune-enable-extended-inode-refs"
msgstr "btrfstune-enable-extended-inode-refs"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1419
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfstune-enable-extended-inode-refs device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfstune-enable-extended-inode-refs device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1421 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2413
msgid "This will Enable extended inode refs."
msgstr "Tas iespējos paplašinātās inode atsauces."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1426
msgid "btrfstune-enable-skinny-metadata-extent-refs"
msgstr "btrfstune-enable-skinny-metadata-extent-refs"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1428
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfstune-enable-skinny-metadata-extent-refs device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfstune-enable-skinny-metadata-extent-refs device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1430 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2428
msgid "This enable skinny metadata extent refs."
msgstr "Tas iespējo plānās metadatu ekstentu atsauces."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1435
msgid "btrfstune-seeding"
msgstr "btrfstune-seeding"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1437
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" btrfstune-seeding device true|false\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" btrfstune-seeding device true|false\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1439 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2444
msgid ""
"Enable seeding of a btrfs device, this will force a fs readonly so that you "
"can use it to build other filesystems."
msgstr ""
"Iespējot btrfs ierīces sēšanu; tas piespiedīs fs būt tikai lasāmai, lai to "
"varētu izmantot citu failu sistēmu būvēšanai."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1445
msgid "c-pointer"
msgstr "c-pointer"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1447
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" c-pointer\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" c-pointer\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1449
msgid ""
"In non-C language bindings, this allows you to retrieve the underlying C "
"pointer to the handle (ie. L</h *>).  The purpose of this is to allow other "
"libraries to interwork with libguestfs."
msgstr ""
"Ne-C valodu saistījumos tas ļauj iegūt pamatā esošo C rādītāju uz rokturi "
"(t. i., L</h *>).  Tā mērķis ir ļaut citām bibliotēkām sadarboties ar "
"libguestfs."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1453
msgid "canonical-device-name"
msgstr "canonical-device-name"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1455
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" canonical-device-name device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" canonical-device-name device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1457 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2473
msgid ""
"This utility function is useful when displaying device names to the user.  "
"It takes a number of irregular device names and returns them in a consistent "
"format:"
msgstr ""
"Šī utilītfunkcija noder, rādot lietotājam ierīču nosaukumus.  Tā pieņem "
"vairākus neregulārus ierīču nosaukumus un atgriež tos konsekventā formātā:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1463 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2479
msgid "F</dev/hdX>"
msgstr "F</dev/hdX>"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1465 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2481
msgid "F</dev/vdX>"
msgstr "F</dev/vdX>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1467 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2483
msgid ""
"These are returned as F</dev/sdX>.  Note this works for device names and "
"partition names.  This is approximately the reverse of the algorithm "
"described in L<guestfs(3)/BLOCK DEVICE NAMING>."
msgstr ""
"Tie tiek atgriezti kā F</dev/sdX>.  Ņemiet vērā, ka tas darbojas ierīču "
"nosaukumiem un nodalījumu nosaukumiem.  Tas ir aptuveni apgriezts "
"algoritmam, kas aprakstīts L<guestfs(3)/BLOKU IERĪČU NOSAUKUMI>."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1471 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2487
msgid "F</dev/mapper/VG-LV>"
msgstr "F</dev/mapper/VG-LV>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1475
msgid "Converted to F</dev/VG/LV> form using L</lvm-canonical-lv-name>."
msgstr "Pārveidoti formā F</dev/VG/LV>, izmantojot L</lvm-canonical-lv-name>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1479 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2495
msgid "Other strings are returned unmodified."
msgstr "Citas virknes tiek atgrieztas nemainītas."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1481
msgid "cap-get-file"
msgstr "cap-get-file"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1483
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" cap-get-file path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" cap-get-file path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1485 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2508
msgid ""
"This function returns the Linux capabilities attached to C<path>.  The "
"capabilities set is returned in text form (see L<cap_to_text(3)>)."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija atgriež C<path> piesaistītās Linux spējas.  Spēju kopa tiek "
"atgriezta teksta formā (skatiet L<cap_to_text(3)>)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1488 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2511
msgid "If no capabilities are attached to a file, an empty string is returned."
msgstr "Ja failam nav piesaistītu spēju, tiek atgriezta tukša virkne."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1490 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1501
msgid ""
"This command depends on the feature C<linuxcaps>.  See also "
"L</feature-available>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda ir atkarīga no līdzekļa C<linuxcaps>.  Skatīt arī L</feature-"
"available>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1493
msgid "cap-set-file"
msgstr "cap-set-file"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1495
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" cap-set-file path cap\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" cap-set-file path cap\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1497 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2528
msgid ""
"This function sets the Linux capabilities attached to C<path>.  The "
"capabilities set C<cap> should be passed in text form (see "
"L<cap_from_text(3)>)."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija iestata C<path> piesaistītās Linux spējas.  Spēju kopa C<cap> "
"jānodod teksta formā (skatiet L<cap_from_text(3)>)."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1504
msgid "case-sensitive-path"
msgstr "case-sensitive-path"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1506
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" case-sensitive-path path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" case-sensitive-path path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1508 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2545
msgid ""
"This can be used to resolve case insensitive paths on a filesystem which is "
"case sensitive.  The use case is to resolve paths which you have read from "
"Windows configuration files or the Windows Registry, to the true path."
msgstr ""
"To var izmantot, lai atrisinātu reģistrnejutīgus ceļus reģistrjutīgā failu "
"sistēmā.  Lietojums ir atrisināt ceļus, kas nolasīti no Windows "
"konfigurācijas failiem vai Windows reģistra, uz īsto ceļu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1513 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2550
msgid ""
"The command handles a peculiarity of the Linux ntfs-3g filesystem driver "
"(and probably others), which is that although the underlying filesystem is "
"case-insensitive, the driver exports the filesystem to Linux as "
"case-sensitive."
msgstr ""
"Komanda apstrādā Linux ntfs-3g failu sistēmas draivera (un, iespējams, citu) "
"īpatnību — lai gan pamatā esošā failu sistēma ir reģistrnejutīga, draiveris "
"eksportē failu sistēmu Linux kā reģistrjutīgu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1518 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2555
msgid ""
"One consequence of this is that special directories such as F<C:\\windows> "
"may appear as F</WINDOWS> or F</windows> (or other things) depending on the "
"precise details of how they were created.  In Windows itself this would not "
"be a problem."
msgstr ""
"Viena no sekām ir tā, ka īpašas direktorijas, piemēram, F<C:\\windows>, var "
"parādīties kā F</WINDOWS> vai F</windows> (vai citādi) atkarībā no precīzām "
"detaļām, kā tās tika izveidotas.  Pašā Windows tā nebūtu problēma."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1524 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2561
msgid ""
"Bug or feature? You decide. See the relevant entry in the ntfs-3g FAQ: "
"L<https://github.com/tuxera/ntfs-3g/wiki/NTFS-3G-FAQ>"
msgstr ""
"Kļūda vai līdzeklis? Izlemiet paši. Skatiet attiecīgo ierakstu ntfs-3g BUJ: "
"L<https://github.com/tuxera/ntfs-3g/wiki/NTFS-3G-FAQ>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1527
msgid ""
"L</case-sensitive-path> attempts to resolve the true case of each element in "
"the path. It will return a resolved path if either the full path or its "
"parent directory exists. If the parent directory exists but the full path "
"does not, the case of the parent directory will be correctly resolved, and "
"the remainder appended unmodified. For example, if the file "
"C<\"/Windows/System32/netkvm.sys\"> exists:"
msgstr ""
"L</case-sensitive-path> mēģina atrisināt katra ceļa elementa īsto reģistru. "
"Tas atgriezīs atrisinātu ceļu, ja eksistē vai nu pilnais ceļš, vai tā "
"vecākdirektorija. Ja vecākdirektorija eksistē, bet pilnais ceļš neeksistē, "
"vecākdirektorijas reģistrs tiks pareizi atrisināts, un atlikums pievienots "
"nemainīts. Piemēram, ja eksistē fails C<\"/Windows/System32/netkvm.sys\">:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1536
msgid "L</case-sensitive-path> (\"/windows/system32/netkvm.sys\")"
msgstr "L</case-sensitive-path> (\"/windows/system32/netkvm.sys\")"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1538 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2575
msgid "\"Windows/System32/netkvm.sys\""
msgstr "\"Windows/System32/netkvm.sys\""

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1540
msgid "L</case-sensitive-path> (\"/windows/system32/NoSuchFile\")"
msgstr "L</case-sensitive-path> (\"/windows/system32/NoSuchFile\")"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1542 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2579
msgid "\"Windows/System32/NoSuchFile\""
msgstr "\"Windows/System32/NoSuchFile\""

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1544
msgid "L</case-sensitive-path> (\"/windows/system33/netkvm.sys\")"
msgstr "L</case-sensitive-path> (\"/windows/system33/netkvm.sys\")"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1546 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2583
msgid "I<ERROR>"
msgstr "I<KĻŪDA>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1550
msgid ""
"I<Note>: Because of the above behaviour, L</case-sensitive-path> cannot be "
"used to check for the existence of a file."
msgstr ""
"I<Piezīme>: iepriekš aprakstītās uzvedības dēļ L</case-sensitive-path> nevar "
"izmantot faila esamības pārbaudei."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1554 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2591
msgid "I<Note>: This function does not handle drive names, backslashes etc."
msgstr ""
"I<Piezīme>: šī funkcija neapstrādā disku nosaukumus, atpakaļvērstās "
"slīpsvītras u. c."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1557
msgid "See also L</realpath>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī L</realpath>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1559
msgid "cat"
msgstr "cat"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1561
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" cat path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" cat path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1563 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7903
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2607 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12851
msgid "Return the contents of the file named C<path>."
msgstr "Atgriezt faila C<path> saturu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1565
msgid ""
"Because, in C, this function returns a C<char *>, there is no way to "
"differentiate between a C<\\0> character in a file and end of string.  To "
"handle binary files, use the L</read-file> or L</download> functions."
msgstr ""
"Tā kā C valodā šī funkcija atgriež C<char *>, nav veida, kā atšķirt C<\\0> "
"rakstzīmi failā no virknes beigām.  Bināro failu apstrādei izmantojiet "
"funkcijas L</read-file> vai L</download>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1570
msgid "checksum"
msgstr "checksum"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1572
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" checksum csumtype path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" checksum csumtype path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1574 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2626
msgid "This call computes the MD5, SHAx or CRC checksum of the file named C<path>."
msgstr "Šis izsaukums aprēķina faila C<path> MD5, SHAx vai CRC kontrolsummu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1577 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2629
msgid ""
"The type of checksum to compute is given by the C<csumtype> parameter which "
"must have one of the following values:"
msgstr ""
"Aprēķināmās kontrolsummas tipu nosaka parametrs C<csumtype>, kuram jābūt "
"vienai no šīm vērtībām:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1582 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2003
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2634 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3517
msgid "C<crc>"
msgstr "C<crc>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1584 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2636
msgid ""
"Compute the cyclic redundancy check (CRC) specified by POSIX for the "
"C<cksum> command."
msgstr ""
"Aprēķināt cikliskās redundances pārbaudi (CRC), ko POSIX nosaka komandai "
"C<cksum>."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1587 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2639
msgid "C<gost>"
msgstr "C<gost>"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1589 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2641
msgid "C<gost12>"
msgstr "C<gost12>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1591 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2643
msgid ""
"Compute the checksum using GOST R34.11-94 or GOST R34.11-2012 message "
"digest."
msgstr ""
"Aprēķināt kontrolsummu, izmantojot GOST R34.11-94 vai GOST R34.11-2012 "
"ziņojumu īssavilkumu."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1594 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2646
msgid "C<md5>"
msgstr "C<md5>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1596 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2648
msgid "Compute the MD5 hash (using the L<md5sum(1)> program)."
msgstr "Aprēķināt MD5 jaucējvērtību (izmantojot programmu L<md5sum(1)>)."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1598 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2650
msgid "C<sha1>"
msgstr "C<sha1>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1600 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2652
msgid "Compute the SHA1 hash (using the L<sha1sum(1)> program)."
msgstr "Aprēķināt SHA1 jaucējvērtību (izmantojot programmu L<sha1sum(1)>)."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1602 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2654
msgid "C<sha224>"
msgstr "C<sha224>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1604 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2656
msgid "Compute the SHA224 hash (using the L<sha224sum(1)> program)."
msgstr "Aprēķināt SHA224 jaucējvērtību (izmantojot programmu L<sha224sum(1)>)."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1606 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2658
msgid "C<sha256>"
msgstr "C<sha256>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1608 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2660
msgid "Compute the SHA256 hash (using the L<sha256sum(1)> program)."
msgstr "Aprēķināt SHA256 jaucējvērtību (izmantojot programmu L<sha256sum(1)>)."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1610 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2662
msgid "C<sha384>"
msgstr "C<sha384>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1612 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2664
msgid "Compute the SHA384 hash (using the L<sha384sum(1)> program)."
msgstr "Aprēķināt SHA384 jaucējvērtību (izmantojot programmu L<sha384sum(1)>)."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1614 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2666
msgid "C<sha512>"
msgstr "C<sha512>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1616 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2668
msgid "Compute the SHA512 hash (using the L<sha512sum(1)> program)."
msgstr "Aprēķināt SHA512 jaucējvērtību (izmantojot programmu L<sha512sum(1)>)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1620 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2672
msgid "The checksum is returned as a printable string."
msgstr "Kontrolsumma tiek atgriezta kā izdrukājama virkne."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1622
msgid "To get the checksum for a device, use L</checksum-device>."
msgstr "Lai iegūtu ierīces kontrolsummu, izmantojiet L</checksum-device>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1624
msgid "To get the checksums for many files, use L</checksums-out>."
msgstr "Lai iegūtu daudzu failu kontrolsummas, izmantojiet L</checksums-out>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1626
msgid "checksum-device"
msgstr "checksum-device"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1628
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" checksum-device csumtype device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" checksum-device csumtype device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1630
msgid ""
"This call computes the MD5, SHAx or CRC checksum of the contents of the "
"device named C<device>.  For the types of checksums supported see the "
"L</checksum> command."
msgstr ""
"Šis izsaukums aprēķina ierīces C<device> satura MD5, SHAx vai CRC "
"kontrolsummu.  Atbalstītos kontrolsummu tipus skatiet komandā L</checksum>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1634
msgid "checksums-out"
msgstr "checksums-out"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1636
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" checksums-out csumtype directory (sumsfile|-)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" checksums-out csumtype directory (sumsfile|-)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1638 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2707
msgid ""
"This command computes the checksums of all regular files in F<directory> and "
"then emits a list of those checksums to the local output file C<sumsfile>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda aprēķina visu parasto failu kontrolsummas F<directory> un pēc tam "
"izvada šo kontrolsummu sarakstu lokālajā izvades failā C<sumsfile>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1642 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2711
msgid ""
"This can be used for verifying the integrity of a virtual machine.  However "
"to be properly secure you should pay attention to the output of the checksum "
"command (it uses the ones from GNU coreutils).  In particular when the "
"filename is not printable, coreutils uses a special backslash syntax.  For "
"more information, see the GNU coreutils info file."
msgstr ""
"To var izmantot virtuālās mašīnas integritātes pārbaudei.  Tomēr, lai tas "
"būtu patiesi droši, jāpievērš uzmanība kontrolsummas komandas izvadei (tā "
"izmanto GNU coreutils komandas).  It īpaši, ja faila nosaukums nav "
"izdrukājams, coreutils izmanto īpašu atpakaļvērsto slīpsvītru sintaksi.  "
"Plašāku informāciju skatiet GNU coreutils info failā."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1652
msgid "chmod"
msgstr "chmod"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1654
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" chmod mode path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" chmod mode path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1656 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2730
msgid ""
"Change the mode (permissions) of C<path> to C<mode>.  Only numeric modes are "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"Mainīt C<path> režīmu (atļaujas) uz C<mode>.  Tiek atbalstīti tikai "
"skaitliski režīmi."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1659 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7189
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2733 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:11650
msgid ""
"I<Note>: When using this command from guestfish, C<mode> by default would be "
"decimal, unless you prefix it with C<0> to get octal, ie. use C<0700> not "
"C<700>."
msgstr ""
"I<Piezīme>: izmantojot šo komandu no guestfish, C<mode> pēc noklusējuma būtu "
"decimāls, ja vien nepievienojat priedēkli C<0>, lai iegūtu astoņnieku, t. "
"i., izmantojiet C<0700>, nevis C<700>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1663 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6649
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6810 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6826
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6842 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2737
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:10644 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:10928
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:10953 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:10978
msgid "The mode actually set is affected by the umask."
msgstr "Faktiski iestatīto režīmu ietekmē umask."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1665
msgid "chown"
msgstr "chown"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1667
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" chown owner group path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" chown owner group path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1669 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2751
msgid "Change the file owner to C<owner> and group to C<group>."
msgstr "Mainīt faila īpašnieku uz C<owner> un grupu uz C<group>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1671 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5488
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2753 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:8825
msgid ""
"Only numeric uid and gid are supported.  If you want to use names, you will "
"need to locate and parse the password file yourself (Augeas support makes "
"this relatively easy)."
msgstr ""
"Tiek atbalstīti tikai skaitliski uid un gid.  Ja vēlaties izmantot "
"nosaukumus, paroļu fails pašiem jāatrod un jāparsē (Augeas atbalsts to "
"padara salīdzinoši vieglu)."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1675
msgid "clear-backend-setting"
msgstr "clear-backend-setting"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1677
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" clear-backend-setting name\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" clear-backend-setting name\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1679 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2767
msgid ""
"If there is a backend setting string matching C<\"name\"> or beginning with "
"C<\"name=\">, then that string is removed from the backend settings."
msgstr ""
"Ja ir aizmugursistēmas iestatījuma virkne, kas atbilst C<\"name\"> vai sākas "
"ar C<\"name=\">, šī virkne tiek noņemta no aizmugursistēmas iestatījumiem."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1683 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2771
msgid ""
"This call returns the number of strings which were removed (which may be 0, "
"1 or greater than 1)."
msgstr ""
"Šis izsaukums atgriež noņemto virkņu skaitu (kas var būt 0, 1 vai lielāks "
"par 1)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1686 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3181
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3192 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:8363
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:8384 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2774
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5291 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5308
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:13644 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:13671
msgid "See L<guestfs(3)/BACKEND>, L<guestfs(3)/BACKEND SETTINGS>."
msgstr ""
"Skatiet L<guestfs(3)/AIZMUGURSISTĒMA>, L<guestfs(3)/AIZMUGURSISTĒMAS "
"IESTATĪJUMI>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1688
msgid "clevis-luks-unlock"
msgstr "clevis-luks-unlock"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1690
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" clevis-luks-unlock device mapname\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" clevis-luks-unlock device mapname\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1692 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2787
msgid ""
"This command opens a block device that has been encrypted according to the "
"Linux Unified Key Setup (LUKS) standard, using network-bound disk encryption "
"(NBDE)."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda atver bloku ierīci, kas šifrēta saskaņā ar Linux Unified Key "
"Setup (LUKS) standartu, izmantojot tīklam piesaistītu diska šifrēšanu (NBDE)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1696 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2791
msgid "C<device> is the encrypted block device."
msgstr "C<device> ir šifrētā bloku ierīce."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1698 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2793
msgid ""
"The appliance will connect to the Tang servers noted in the tree of Clevis "
"pins that is bound to a keyslot of the LUKS header.  The Clevis pin tree may "
"comprise C<sss> (redundancy) pins as internal nodes (optionally), and "
"C<tang> pins as leaves.  C<tpm2> pins are not supported.  The appliance "
"unlocks the encrypted block device by combining responses from the Tang "
"servers with metadata from the LUKS header; there is no C<key> parameter."
msgstr ""
"Palīgsistēma savienosies ar Tang serveriem, kas norādīti Clevis tapu kokā, "
"kas piesaistīts LUKS galvenes atslēgas slotam.  Clevis tapu koks var ietvert "
"C<sss> (redundances) tapas kā iekšējos mezglus (pēc izvēles) un C<tang> "
"tapas kā lapas.  C<tpm2> tapas netiek atbalstītas.  Palīgsistēma atbloķē "
"šifrēto bloku ierīci, apvienojot Tang serveru atbildes ar LUKS galvenes "
"metadatiem; parametra C<key> nav."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1706
msgid ""
"This command will fail if networking has not been enabled for the "
"appliance. Refer to L</set-network>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda neizdosies, ja palīgsistēmai nav iespējota tīklošana. Skatiet L</"
"set-network>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1709
msgid ""
"The command creates a new block device called F</dev/mapper/mapname>.  Reads "
"and writes to this block device are decrypted from and encrypted to the "
"underlying C<device> respectively.  Close the decrypted block device with "
"L</cryptsetup-close>."
msgstr ""
"Komanda izveido jaunu bloku ierīci F</dev/mapper/mapname>.  Lasīšana no šīs "
"bloku ierīces un rakstīšana tajā tiek attiecīgi atšifrēta no pamatā esošās "
"C<device> un šifrēta uz to.  Atšifrēto bloku ierīci aizveriet ar L</"
"cryptsetup-close>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1714 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2042
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2809 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3600
msgid ""
"C<mapname> cannot be C<\"control\"> because that name is reserved by "
"device-mapper."
msgstr ""
"C<mapname> nevar būt C<\"control\">, jo šo nosaukumu ir rezervējis device-"
"mapper."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1717 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2068
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6048
msgid ""
"If this block device contains LVM volume groups, then calling L</lvm-scan> "
"with the C<activate> parameter C<true> will make them visible."
msgstr ""
"Ja šajā bloku ierīcē ir LVM sējumu grupas, L</lvm-scan> izsaukšana ar "
"parametru C<activate> C<true> padarīs tās redzamas."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1721 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2072
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6052
msgid "Use L</list-dm-devices> to list all device mapper devices."
msgstr ""
"Lai uzskaitītu visas device mapper ierīces, izmantojiet L</list-dm-devices>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1723
msgid ""
"This command depends on the feature C<clevisluks>.  See also "
"L</feature-available>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda ir atkarīga no līdzekļa C<clevisluks>.  Skatīt arī L</feature-"
"available>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1726
msgid "command"
msgstr "command"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1728
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" command 'arguments ...'\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" command 'arguments ...'\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1730 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2831
msgid ""
"This call runs a command from the guest filesystem.  The filesystem must be "
"mounted, and must contain a compatible operating system (ie. something "
"Linux, with the same or compatible processor architecture)."
msgstr ""
"Šis izsaukums izpilda komandu no viesa failu sistēmas.  Failu sistēmai jābūt "
"montētai, un tajā jābūt saderīgai operētājsistēmai (t. i., kaut kam Linux ar "
"tādu pašu vai saderīgu procesora arhitektūru)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1735
msgid ""
"The single parameter is an argv-style list of arguments.  The first element "
"is the name of the program to run.  Subsequent elements are parameters.  The "
"list must be non-empty (ie. must contain a program name).  Note that the "
"command runs directly, and is I<not> invoked via the shell (see L</sh>)."
msgstr ""
"Vienīgais parametrs ir argv stila argumentu saraksts.  Pirmais elements ir "
"izpildāmās programmas nosaukums.  Nākamie elementi ir parametri.  Sarakstam "
"jābūt netukšam (t. i., jāsatur programmas nosaukums).  Ņemiet vērā, ka "
"komanda tiek izpildīta tieši un I<netiek> izsaukta caur čaulu (skatiet L</"
"sh>)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1742 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2843
msgid "The return value is anything printed to I<stdout> by the command."
msgstr "Atgriešanas vērtība ir viss, ko komanda izdrukā uz I<stdout>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1745 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2846
msgid ""
"If the command returns a non-zero exit status, then this function returns an "
"error message.  The error message string is the content of I<stderr> from "
"the command."
msgstr ""
"Ja komanda atgriež izejas statusu, kas nav nulle, šī funkcija atgriež kļūdas "
"ziņojumu.  Kļūdas ziņojuma virkne ir komandas I<stderr> saturs."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1749 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2850
msgid ""
"The C<$PATH> environment variable will contain at least F</usr/bin> and "
"F</bin>.  If you require a program from another location, you should provide "
"the full path in the first parameter."
msgstr ""
"Vides mainīgais C<$PATH> saturēs vismaz F</usr/bin> un F</bin>.  Ja "
"nepieciešama programma no citas vietas, pirmajā parametrā jānorāda pilns "
"ceļš."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1754 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2855
msgid ""
"Shared libraries and data files required by the program must be available on "
"filesystems which are mounted in the correct places.  It is the caller’s "
"responsibility to ensure all filesystems that are needed are mounted at the "
"right locations."
msgstr ""
"Programmai nepieciešamajām koplietotajām bibliotēkām un datu failiem jābūt "
"pieejamiem failu sistēmās, kas montētas pareizajās vietās.  Izsaucēja "
"atbildība ir nodrošināt, ka visas vajadzīgās failu sistēmas ir montētas "
"pareizajās vietās."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1760 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1772
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2423 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2440
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2561 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2578
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3689 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3699
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3759 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3774
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3784 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4035
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7742 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7757
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7869 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7886
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9155 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9205
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9335 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9350
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:10094 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:10276
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:10293 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:10371
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:10388 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:10424
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:10441 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2864
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2884 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4270
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4296 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4471
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4497 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6080
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6130 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6198
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6222 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6239
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6655 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12591
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12617 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12795
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12821 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:14765
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:14824 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:15049
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:15073 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:16349
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:16709 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:16735
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:16861 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:16887
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:16940 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:16966
msgid ""
"Because of the message protocol, there is a transfer limit of somewhere "
"between 2MB and 4MB.  See L<guestfs(3)/PROTOCOL LIMITS>."
msgstr ""
"Ziņojumu protokola dēļ ir pārsūtīšanas ierobežojums kaut kur starp 2MB un "
"4MB.  Skatiet L<guestfs(3)/PROTOKOLA IEROBEŽOJUMI>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1763
msgid "command-lines"
msgstr "command-lines"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1765
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" command-lines 'arguments ...'\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" command-lines 'arguments ...'\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1767
msgid "This is the same as L</command>, but splits the result into a list of lines."
msgstr "Tas ir tas pats, kas L</command>, bet sadala rezultātu rindu sarakstā."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1770
msgid "See also: L</sh-lines>"
msgstr "Skatīt arī: L</sh-lines>"

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1775
msgid "command-out"
msgstr "command-out"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1777
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" command-out 'arguments ...' (output|-)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" command-out 'arguments ...' (output|-)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1779
msgid ""
"This is the same as L</command>, but streams the output back, handling the "
"case where the output from the command is larger than the protocol limit."
msgstr ""
"Tas ir tas pats, kas L</command>, bet straumē izvadi atpakaļ, apstrādājot "
"gadījumu, kad komandas izvade ir lielāka par protokola ierobežojumu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1783
msgid "See also: L</sh-out>"
msgstr "Skatīt arī: L</sh-out>"

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1787
msgid "compress-device-out"
msgstr "compress-device-out"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1789
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" compress-device-out ctype device (zdevice|-) [level:N]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" compress-device-out ctype device (zdevice|-) [level:N]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1791 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2927
msgid ""
"This command compresses C<device> and writes it out to the local file "
"C<zdevice>."
msgstr "Šī komanda saspiež C<device> un izraksta to lokālajā failā C<zdevice>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1794
msgid ""
"The C<ctype> and optional C<level> parameters have the same meaning as in "
"L</compress-out>."
msgstr ""
"Parametriem C<ctype> un neobligātajam C<level> ir tāda pati nozīme kā L</"
"compress-out>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1801
msgid "compress-out"
msgstr "compress-out"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1803
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" compress-out ctype file (zfile|-) [level:N]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" compress-out ctype file (zfile|-) [level:N]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1805 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2979
msgid ""
"This command compresses F<file> and writes it out to the local file "
"F<zfile>."
msgstr "Šī komanda saspiež F<file> un izraksta to lokālajā failā F<zfile>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1808 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2982
msgid ""
"The compression program used is controlled by the C<ctype> parameter.  "
"Currently this includes: C<compress>, C<gzip>, C<bzip2>, C<xz> or C<lzop>.  "
"Some compression types may not be supported by particular builds of "
"libguestfs, in which case you will get an error containing the substring "
"\"not supported\"."
msgstr ""
"Izmantoto saspiešanas programmu kontrolē parametrs C<ctype>.  Pašlaik tas "
"ietver: C<compress>, C<gzip>, C<bzip2>, C<xz> vai C<lzop>.  Dažas libguestfs "
"būves var neatbalstīt dažus saspiešanas tipus, tādā gadījumā saņemsiet "
"kļūdu, kas satur apakšvirkni \"not supported\"."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1814 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2988
msgid ""
"The optional C<level> parameter controls compression level.  The meaning and "
"default for this parameter depends on the compression program being used."
msgstr ""
"Neobligātais parametrs C<level> kontrolē saspiešanas līmeni.  Šī parametra "
"nozīme un noklusējums ir atkarīgi no izmantotās saspiešanas programmas."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1822
msgid "config"
msgstr "config"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1824
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" config hvparam hvvalue\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" config hvparam hvvalue\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1826 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3029
msgid ""
"This can be used to add arbitrary hypervisor parameters of the form I<-param "
"value>.  Actually it’s not quite arbitrary - we prevent you from setting "
"some parameters which would interfere with parameters that we use."
msgstr ""
"To var izmantot, lai pievienotu patvaļīgus hipervizora parametrus formā I<-"
"param value>.  Patiesībā tas nav gluži patvaļīgi — neļaujam iestatīt dažus "
"parametrus, kas traucētu mūsu izmantotajiem parametriem."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1831 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3034
msgid "The first character of C<hvparam> string must be a C<-> (dash)."
msgstr "Virknes C<hvparam> pirmajai rakstzīmei jābūt C<-> (domuzīmei)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1833 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3036
msgid "C<hvvalue> can be NULL."
msgstr "C<hvvalue> var būt NULL."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1835
msgid "copy-attributes"
msgstr "copy-attributes"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1837
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" copy-attributes src dest [all:true|false] [mode:true|false] "
"[xattributes:true|false] [ownership:true|false]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" copy-attributes src dest [all:true|false] [mode:true|false] "
"[xattributes:true|false] [ownership:true|false]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1839 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3060
msgid ""
"Copy the attributes of a path (which can be a file or a directory)  to "
"another path."
msgstr "Kopēt ceļa (kas var būt fails vai direktorija) atribūtus uz citu ceļu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1842 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3063
msgid ""
"By default B<no> attribute is copied, so make sure to specify any (or C<all> "
"to copy everything)."
msgstr ""
"Pēc noklusējuma B<netiek> kopēts neviens atribūts, tāpēc noteikti norādiet "
"kādu (vai C<all>, lai kopētu visu)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1845 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3066
msgid "The optional arguments specify which attributes can be copied:"
msgstr "Neobligātie argumenti norāda, kurus atribūtus var kopēt:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1849 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3070
msgid "C<mode>"
msgstr "C<mode>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1851 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3072
msgid ""
"Copy part of the file mode from C<source> to C<destination>. Only the UNIX "
"permissions and the sticky/setuid/setgid bits can be copied."
msgstr ""
"Kopēt daļu faila režīma no C<source> uz C<destination>. Var kopēt tikai UNIX "
"atļaujas un sticky/setuid/setgid bitus."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1854 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3075
msgid "C<xattributes>"
msgstr "C<xattributes>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1856
msgid ""
"Copy the Linux extended attributes (xattrs) from C<source> to "
"C<destination>.  This flag does nothing if the I<linuxxattrs> feature is not "
"available (see L</feature-available>)."
msgstr ""
"Kopēt Linux paplašinātos atribūtus (xattrs) no C<source> uz C<destination>.  "
"Šis karogs neko nedara, ja līdzeklis I<linuxxattrs> nav pieejams (skatiet L</"
"feature-available>)."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1860 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3081
msgid "C<ownership>"
msgstr "C<ownership>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1862 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3083
msgid "Copy the owner uid and the group gid of C<source> to C<destination>."
msgstr "Kopēt C<source> īpašnieka uid un grupas gid uz C<destination>."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1864 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3085
msgid "C<all>"
msgstr "C<all>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1866 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3087
msgid ""
"Copy B<all> the attributes from C<source> to C<destination>. Enabling it "
"enables all the other flags, if they are not specified already."
msgstr ""
"Kopēt B<visus> atribūtus no C<source> uz C<destination>. Tā iespējošana "
"iespējo visus pārējos karogus, ja tie vēl nav norādīti."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1873
msgid "copy-device-to-device"
msgstr "copy-device-to-device"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1875
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" copy-device-to-device src dest [srcoffset:N] [destoffset:N] [size:N] "
"[sparse:true|false] [append:true|false]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" copy-device-to-device src dest [srcoffset:N] [destoffset:N] [size:N] "
"[sparse:true|false] [append:true|false]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1877
msgid ""
"The four calls L</copy-device-to-device>, L</copy-device-to-file>, "
"L</copy-file-to-device>, and L</copy-file-to-file> let you copy from a "
"source (device|file) to a destination (device|file)."
msgstr ""
"Četri izsaukumi L</copy-device-to-device>, L</copy-device-to-file>, L</copy-"
"file-to-device> un L</copy-file-to-file> ļauj kopēt no avota (ierīces|faila) "
"uz mērķi (ierīci|failu)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1884 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3146
msgid ""
"Partial copies can be made since you can specify optionally the source "
"offset, destination offset and size to copy.  These values are all specified "
"in bytes.  If not given, the offsets both default to zero, and the size "
"defaults to copying as much as possible until we hit the end of the source."
msgstr ""
"Var veikt daļējas kopijas, jo pēc izvēles var norādīt avota nobīdi, mērķa "
"nobīdi un kopējamo izmēru.  Visas šīs vērtības tiek norādītas baitos.  Ja "
"nav norādītas, abas nobīdes pēc noklusējuma ir nulle, un izmērs pēc "
"noklusējuma ir kopēt cik iespējams, līdz sasniegtas avota beigas."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1890 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3152
msgid ""
"The source and destination may be the same object.  However overlapping "
"regions may not be copied correctly."
msgstr ""
"Avots un mērķis var būt viens un tas pats objekts.  Tomēr pārklājoši "
"apgabali var netikt nokopēti pareizi."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1893 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3155
msgid ""
"If the destination is a file, it is created if required.  If the destination "
"file is not large enough, it is extended."
msgstr ""
"Ja mērķis ir fails, tas tiek izveidots, ja nepieciešams.  Ja mērķa fails nav "
"pietiekami liels, tas tiek paplašināts."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1896 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3158
msgid ""
"If the destination is a file and the C<append> flag is not set, then the "
"destination file is truncated.  If the C<append> flag is set, then the copy "
"appends to the destination file.  The C<append> flag currently cannot be set "
"for devices."
msgstr ""
"Ja mērķis ir fails un karogs C<append> nav iestatīts, mērķa fails tiek "
"saīsināts.  Ja karogs C<append> ir iestatīts, kopija tiek pievienota mērķa "
"failam.  Ierīcēm karogu C<append> pašlaik nevar iestatīt."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1901 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3163
msgid ""
"If the C<sparse> flag is true then the call avoids writing blocks that "
"contain only zeroes, which can help in some situations where the backing "
"disk is thin-provisioned.  Note that unless the target is already zeroed, "
"using this option will result in incorrect copying."
msgstr ""
"Ja karogs C<sparse> ir true, izsaukums izvairās no bloku rakstīšanas, kuros "
"ir tikai nulles, kas var palīdzēt dažās situācijās, kad pamatdisks ir plāni "
"nodrošināts.  Ņemiet vērā, ka, ja vien mērķis jau nav aizpildīts ar nullēm, "
"šīs opcijas izmantošana radīs nepareizu kopēšanu."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1909
msgid "copy-device-to-file"
msgstr "copy-device-to-file"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1911
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" copy-device-to-file src dest [srcoffset:N] [destoffset:N] [size:N] "
"[sparse:true|false] [append:true|false]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" copy-device-to-file src dest [srcoffset:N] [destoffset:N] [size:N] "
"[sparse:true|false] [append:true|false]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1913 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1922
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1931
msgid "See L</copy-device-to-device> for a general overview of this call."
msgstr "Šī izsaukuma vispārīgu pārskatu skatiet L</copy-device-to-device>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1918
msgid "copy-file-to-device"
msgstr "copy-file-to-device"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1920
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" copy-file-to-device src dest [srcoffset:N] [destoffset:N] [size:N] "
"[sparse:true|false] [append:true|false]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" copy-file-to-device src dest [srcoffset:N] [destoffset:N] [size:N] "
"[sparse:true|false] [append:true|false]\n"
"\n"

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1927
msgid "copy-file-to-file"
msgstr "copy-file-to-file"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1929
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" copy-file-to-file src dest [srcoffset:N] [destoffset:N] [size:N] "
"[sparse:true|false] [append:true|false]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" copy-file-to-file src dest [srcoffset:N] [destoffset:N] [size:N] "
"[sparse:true|false] [append:true|false]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1934
msgid ""
"This is B<not> the function you want for copying files.  This is for copying "
"blocks within existing files.  See L</cp>, L</cp-a> and L</mv> for general "
"file copying and moving functions."
msgstr ""
"Šī B<nav> funkcija, kas vajadzīga failu kopēšanai.  Tā ir paredzēta bloku "
"kopēšanai esošos failos.  Vispārīgām failu kopēšanas un pārvietošanas "
"funkcijām skatiet L</cp>, L</cp-a> un L</mv>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1941
msgid "copy-size"
msgstr "copy-size"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1943
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" copy-size src dest size\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" copy-size src dest size\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1945 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3425
msgid ""
"This command copies exactly C<size> bytes from one source device or file "
"C<src> to another destination device or file C<dest>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda kopē tieši C<size> baitus no vienas avota ierīces vai faila "
"C<src> uz citu mērķa ierīci vai failu C<dest>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1948 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3428
msgid ""
"Note this will fail if the source is too short or if the destination is not "
"large enough."
msgstr ""
"Ņemiet vērā, ka tas neizdosies, ja avots ir pārāk īss vai ja mērķis nav "
"pietiekami liels."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1951 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2097
msgid ""
"I<This function is deprecated.> In new code, use the "
"L</copy-device-to-device> call instead."
msgstr ""
"I<Šī funkcija ir novecojusi.> Jaunā kodā tā vietā izmantojiet izsaukumu L</"
"copy-device-to-device>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1958
msgid "cp"
msgstr "cp"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1960
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" cp src dest\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" cp src dest\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1962 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3447
msgid ""
"This copies a file from C<src> to C<dest> where C<dest> is either a "
"destination filename or destination directory."
msgstr ""
"Tas kopē failu no C<src> uz C<dest>, kur C<dest> ir vai nu mērķa faila "
"nosaukums, vai mērķa direktorija."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1965
msgid "cp-a"
msgstr "cp-a"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1967
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" cp-a src dest\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" cp-a src dest\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1969 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3461
msgid ""
"This copies a file or directory from C<src> to C<dest> recursively using the "
"C<cp -a> command."
msgstr ""
"Tas rekursīvi kopē failu vai direktoriju no C<src> uz C<dest>, izmantojot "
"komandu C<cp -a>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1972
msgid "cp-r"
msgstr "cp-r"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1974
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" cp-r src dest\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" cp-r src dest\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1976 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3475
msgid ""
"This copies a file or directory from C<src> to C<dest> recursively using the "
"C<cp -rP> command."
msgstr ""
"Tas rekursīvi kopē failu vai direktoriju no C<src> uz C<dest>, izmantojot "
"komandu C<cp -rP>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1979
msgid ""
"Most users should use L</cp-a> instead.  This command is useful when you "
"don't want to preserve permissions, because the target filesystem does not "
"support it (primarily when writing to DOS FAT filesystems)."
msgstr ""
"Lielākajai daļai lietotāju tā vietā jāizmanto L</cp-a>.  Šī komanda noder, "
"ja nevēlaties saglabāt atļaujas, jo mērķa failu sistēma to neatbalsta "
"(galvenokārt, rakstot DOS FAT failu sistēmās)."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1984
msgid "cpio-out"
msgstr "cpio-out"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1986
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" cpio-out directory (cpiofile|-) [format:..]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" cpio-out directory (cpiofile|-) [format:..]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1988 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3502
msgid ""
"This command packs the contents of F<directory> and downloads it to local "
"file C<cpiofile>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda iepako F<directory> saturu un lejupielādē to lokālajā failā "
"C<cpiofile>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1991 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3505
msgid ""
"The optional C<format> parameter can be used to select the format.  Only the "
"following formats are currently permitted:"
msgstr ""
"Neobligāto parametru C<format> var izmantot formāta izvēlei.  Pašlaik "
"atļauti tikai šie formāti:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1996 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3510
msgid "C<newc>"
msgstr "C<newc>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:1998 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3512
msgid ""
"New (SVR4) portable format.  This format happens to be compatible with the "
"cpio-like format used by the Linux kernel for initramfs."
msgstr ""
"Jaunais (SVR4) pārnesamais formāts.  Šis formāts gadās būt saderīgs ar cpio "
"līdzīgo formātu, ko Linux kodols izmanto initramfs."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2001 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3515
msgid "This is the default format."
msgstr "Šis ir noklusējuma formāts."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2005 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3519
msgid "New (SVR4) portable format with a checksum."
msgstr "Jaunais (SVR4) pārnesamais formāts ar kontrolsummu."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2013
msgid "cryptsetup-close"
msgstr "cryptsetup-close"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2015
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" cryptsetup-close device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" cryptsetup-close device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2017
msgid ""
"This closes an encrypted device that was created earlier by "
"L</cryptsetup-open>.  The C<device> parameter must be the name of the "
"mapping device (ie. F</dev/mapper/mapname>)  and I<not> the name of the "
"underlying block device."
msgstr ""
"Tas aizver šifrētu ierīci, kas iepriekš izveidota ar L</cryptsetup-open>.  "
"Parametram C<device> jābūt kartēšanas ierīces nosaukumam (t. i., F</dev/"
"mapper/mapname>), I<nevis> pamatā esošās bloku ierīces nosaukumam."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2022 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2080
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5967 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5987
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6002 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6015
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6029 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6065
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6085 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6094
msgid ""
"This command depends on the feature C<luks>.  See also "
"L</feature-available>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda ir atkarīga no līdzekļa C<luks>.  Skatīt arī L</feature-available>"
"."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2025
msgid "cryptsetup-open"
msgstr "cryptsetup-open"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2027
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" cryptsetup-open device mapname [readonly:true|false] [crypttype:..] "
"[cipher:..]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" cryptsetup-open device mapname [readonly:true|false] [crypttype:..] "
"[cipher:..]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2029 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3587
msgid ""
"This command opens a block device which has been encrypted according to the "
"Linux Unified Key Setup (LUKS) standard, Windows BitLocker, or some other "
"types."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda atver bloku ierīci, kas šifrēta saskaņā ar Linux Unified Key "
"Setup (LUKS) standartu, Windows BitLocker vai dažiem citiem tipiem."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2033 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6039
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3591 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:9698
msgid "C<device> is the encrypted block device or partition."
msgstr "C<device> ir šifrētā bloku ierīce vai nodalījums."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2035 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3593
msgid ""
"The caller must supply one of the keys associated with the encrypted block "
"device, in the C<key> parameter."
msgstr ""
"Izsaucējam parametrā C<key> jānorāda viena no ar šifrēto bloku ierīci "
"saistītajām atslēgām."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2038 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6044
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3596 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:9703
msgid ""
"This creates a new block device called F</dev/mapper/mapname>.  Reads and "
"writes to this block device are decrypted from and encrypted to the "
"underlying C<device> respectively."
msgstr ""
"Tas izveido jaunu bloku ierīci F</dev/mapper/mapname>.  Lasīšana no šīs "
"bloku ierīces un rakstīšana tajā tiek attiecīgi atšifrēta no pamatā esošās "
"C<device> un šifrēta uz to."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2045 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3603
msgid ""
"If the optional C<crypttype> parameter is not present then libguestfs tries "
"to guess the correct type (for example LUKS or BitLocker).  However you can "
"override this by specifying one of the following types:"
msgstr ""
"Ja neobligātā parametra C<crypttype> nav, libguestfs mēģina uzminēt pareizo "
"tipu (piemēram, LUKS vai BitLocker).  Tomēr to var ignorēt, norādot vienu no "
"šiem tipiem:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2052 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3610
msgid "C<luks>"
msgstr "C<luks>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2054 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3612
msgid "A Linux LUKS device."
msgstr "Linux LUKS ierīce."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2056 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3614
msgid "C<bitlk>"
msgstr "C<bitlk>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2058 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3616
msgid "A Windows BitLocker device."
msgstr "Windows BitLocker ierīce."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2062 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3620
msgid "The optional C<readonly> flag, if set to true, creates a read-only mapping."
msgstr ""
"Neobligātais karogs C<readonly>, ja iestatīts uz true, izveido tikai lasāmu "
"kartēšanu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2065 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3623
msgid "The optional C<cipher> parameter allows specifying which cipher to use."
msgstr "Neobligātais parametrs C<cipher> ļauj norādīt, kuru šifru izmantot."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2075 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5964
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5999 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6012
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6026 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6055
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6075
msgid ""
"This command has one or more key or passphrase parameters.  Guestfish will "
"prompt for these separately."
msgstr ""
"Šai komandai ir viens vai vairāki atslēgas vai paroles frāzes parametri.  "
"Guestfish tos pieprasīs atsevišķi."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2083
msgid "dd"
msgstr "dd"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2085
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" dd src dest\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" dd src dest\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2087 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3684
msgid ""
"This command copies from one source device or file C<src> to another "
"destination device or file C<dest>.  Normally you would use this to copy to "
"or from a device or partition, for example to duplicate a filesystem."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda kopē no vienas avota ierīces vai faila C<src> uz citu mērķa "
"ierīci vai failu C<dest>.  Parasti to izmanto kopēšanai uz ierīci vai "
"nodalījumu vai no tā, piemēram, failu sistēmas dublēšanai."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2092
msgid ""
"If the destination is a device, it must be as large or larger than the "
"source file or device, otherwise the copy will fail.  This command cannot do "
"partial copies (see L</copy-device-to-device>)."
msgstr ""
"Ja mērķis ir ierīce, tai jābūt tikpat lielai vai lielākai par avota failu "
"vai ierīci, citādi kopēšana neizdosies.  Šī komanda nevar veikt daļējas "
"kopijas (skatiet L</copy-device-to-device>)."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2104
msgid "device-index"
msgstr "device-index"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2106
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" device-index device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" device-index device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2108 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3704
msgid ""
"This function takes a device name (eg. \"/dev/sdb\") and returns the index "
"of the device in the list of devices."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija pieņem ierīces nosaukumu (piem., „/dev/sdb”) un atgriež ierīces "
"indeksu ierīču sarakstā."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2111
msgid ""
"Index numbers start from 0.  The named device must exist, for example as a "
"string returned from L</list-devices>."
msgstr ""
"Indeksu numuri sākas no 0.  Nosauktajai ierīcei jāeksistē, piemēram, kā "
"virknei, ko atgriezis L</list-devices>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2114
msgid "See also L</list-devices>, L</part-to-dev>, L</device-name>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī L</list-devices>, L</part-to-dev>, L</device-name>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2117
msgid "device-name"
msgstr "device-name"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2119
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" device-name index\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" device-name index\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2121 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3723
msgid ""
"This function takes a device index and returns the device name.  For example "
"index C<0> will return the string C</dev/sda>."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija pieņem ierīces indeksu un atgriež ierīces nosaukumu.  Piemēram, "
"indekss C<0> atgriezīs virkni C</dev/sda>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2124 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3726
msgid "The drive index must have been added to the handle."
msgstr "Diska indeksam jābūt pievienotam rokturim."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2126
msgid "See also L</list-devices>, L</part-to-dev>, L</device-index>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī L</list-devices>, L</part-to-dev>, L</device-index>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2129
msgid "df"
msgstr "df"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2131
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" df\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" df\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2133 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3741
msgid "This command runs the L<df(1)> command to report disk space used."
msgstr "Šī komanda izpilda komandu L<df(1)>, lai ziņotu izmantoto diska vietu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2135 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2146
msgid ""
"This command is mostly useful for interactive sessions.  It is I<not> "
"intended that you try to parse the output string.  Use L</statvfs> from "
"programs."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda galvenokārt noder interaktīvās sesijās.  I<Nav> paredzēts, ka "
"mēģināsiet parsēt izvades virkni.  No programmām izmantojiet L</statvfs>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2139
msgid "df-h"
msgstr "df-h"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2141
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" df-h\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" df-h\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2143 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3757
msgid ""
"This command runs the C<df -h> command to report disk space used in "
"human-readable format."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda izpilda komandu C<df -h>, lai ziņotu izmantoto diska vietu "
"cilvēkam lasāmā formātā."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2150
msgid "disk-create"
msgstr "disk-create"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2152
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" disk-create filename format size [backingfile:..] [backingformat:..] "
"[preallocation:..] [compat:..] [clustersize:N]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" disk-create filename format size [backingfile:..] [backingformat:..] "
"[preallocation:..] [compat:..] [clustersize:N]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2154 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3789
msgid ""
"Create a blank disk image called F<filename> (a host file)  with format "
"C<format> (usually C<raw> or C<qcow2>).  The size is C<size> bytes."
msgstr ""
"Izveidot tukšu diska attēlu F<filename> (resursdatora failu) formātā "
"C<format> (parasti C<raw> vai C<qcow2>).  Izmērs ir C<size> baiti."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2158 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3793
msgid ""
"If used with the optional C<backingfile> parameter, then a snapshot is "
"created on top of the backing file.  In this case, C<size> must be passed as "
"C<-1>.  The size of the snapshot is the same as the size of the backing "
"file, which is discovered automatically.  You are encouraged to also pass "
"C<backingformat> to describe the format of C<backingfile>."
msgstr ""
"Ja izmanto ar neobligāto parametru C<backingfile>, virs pamatfaila tiek "
"izveidots momentuzņēmums.  Šajā gadījumā C<size> jānodod kā C<-1>.  "
"Momentuzņēmuma izmērs ir tāds pats kā pamatfaila izmērs, kas tiek noteikts "
"automātiski.  Ieteicams nodot arī C<backingformat>, lai aprakstītu "
"C<backingfile> formātu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2165 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3800
msgid ""
"If F<filename> refers to a block device, then the device is formatted.  The "
"C<size> is ignored since block devices have an intrinsic size."
msgstr ""
"Ja F<filename> norāda uz bloku ierīci, ierīce tiek formatēta.  C<size> tiek "
"ignorēts, jo bloku ierīcēm ir raksturīgs izmērs."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2169 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3804
msgid "The other optional parameters are:"
msgstr "Pārējie neobligātie parametri ir:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2173 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3808
msgid "C<preallocation>"
msgstr "C<preallocation>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2175 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3810
msgid ""
"If format is C<raw>, then this can be either C<off> (or C<sparse>)  or "
"C<full> to create a sparse or fully allocated file respectively.  The "
"default is C<off>."
msgstr ""
"Ja formāts ir C<raw>, tas var būt vai nu C<off> (vai C<sparse>), vai C<full>"
", lai izveidotu attiecīgi retinātu vai pilnībā piešķirtu failu.  Noklusējums "
"ir C<off>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2179 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3814
msgid ""
"If format is C<qcow2>, then this can be C<off> (or C<sparse>), C<metadata> "
"or C<full>.  Preallocating metadata can be faster when doing lots of writes, "
"but uses more space.  The default is C<off>."
msgstr ""
"Ja formāts ir C<qcow2>, tas var būt C<off> (vai C<sparse>), C<metadata> vai "
"C<full>.  Metadatu iepriekšēja piešķiršana var būt ātrāka, veicot daudz "
"rakstīšanu, bet izmanto vairāk vietas.  Noklusējums ir C<off>."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2184 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3819
msgid "C<compat>"
msgstr "C<compat>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2186 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3821
msgid ""
"C<qcow2> only: Pass the string C<1.1> to use the advanced qcow2 format "
"supported by qemu E<ge> 1.1."
msgstr ""
"Tikai C<qcow2>: nododiet virkni C<1.1>, lai izmantotu uzlaboto qcow2 "
"formātu, ko atbalsta qemu E<ge> 1.1."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2190 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3825
msgid "C<clustersize>"
msgstr "C<clustersize>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2192 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3827
msgid ""
"C<qcow2> only: Change the qcow2 cluster size.  The default is 65536 (bytes) "
"and this setting may be any power of two between 512 and 2097152."
msgstr ""
"Tikai C<qcow2>: mainīt qcow2 klastera izmēru.  Noklusējums ir 65536 (baiti), "
"un šis iestatījums var būt jebkura divnieka pakāpe starp 512 un 2097152."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2198
msgid ""
"Note that this call does not add the new disk to the handle.  You may need "
"to call L</add-drive-opts> separately."
msgstr ""
"Ņemiet vērā, ka šis izsaukums nepievieno jauno disku rokturim.  Iespējams, "
"atsevišķi jāizsauc L</add-drive-opts>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2203
msgid "disk-format"
msgstr "disk-format"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2205
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" disk-format filename\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" disk-format filename\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2207 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3872
msgid ""
"Detect and return the format of the disk image called F<filename>.  "
"F<filename> can also be a host device, etc.  If the format of the image "
"could not be detected, then C<\"unknown\"> is returned."
msgstr ""
"Noteikt un atgriezt diska attēla F<filename> formātu.  F<filename> var būt "
"arī resursdatora ierīce u. c.  Ja attēla formātu nevarēja noteikt, tiek "
"atgriezts C<\"unknown\">."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2211 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3876
msgid ""
"Note that detecting the disk format can be insecure under some "
"circumstances.  See L<guestfs(3)/CVE-2010-3851>."
msgstr ""
"Ņemiet vērā, ka diska formāta noteikšana dažos apstākļos var būt nedroša.  "
"Skatiet L<guestfs(3)/CVE-2010-3851>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2214 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3879
msgid "See also: L<guestfs(3)/DISK IMAGE FORMATS>"
msgstr "Skatīt arī: L<guestfs(3)/DISKU ATTĒLU FORMĀTI>"

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2216
msgid "disk-has-backing-file"
msgstr "disk-has-backing-file"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2218
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" disk-has-backing-file filename\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" disk-has-backing-file filename\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2220 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3892
msgid "Detect and return whether the disk image F<filename> has a backing file."
msgstr "Noteikt un atgriezt, vai diska attēlam F<filename> ir pamatfails."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2223 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2233
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3895 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3911
msgid ""
"Note that detecting disk features can be insecure under some circumstances.  "
"See L<guestfs(3)/CVE-2010-3851>."
msgstr ""
"Ņemiet vērā, ka disku līdzekļu noteikšana dažos apstākļos var būt nedroša.  "
"Skatiet L<guestfs(3)/CVE-2010-3851>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2226
msgid "disk-virtual-size"
msgstr "disk-virtual-size"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2228
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" disk-virtual-size filename\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" disk-virtual-size filename\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2230 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3908
msgid ""
"Detect and return the virtual size in bytes of the disk image called "
"F<filename>."
msgstr "Noteikt un atgriezt diska attēla F<filename> virtuālo izmēru baitos."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2236
msgid "dmesg"
msgstr "dmesg"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2238
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" dmesg\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" dmesg\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2240 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3923
msgid ""
"This returns the kernel messages (L<dmesg(1)> output) from the guest "
"kernel.  This is sometimes useful for extended debugging of problems."
msgstr ""
"Tas atgriež kodola ziņojumus (L<dmesg(1)> izvadi) no viesa kodola.  Tas "
"dažreiz noder problēmu paplašinātai atkļūdošanai."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2244
msgid ""
"Another way to get the same information is to enable verbose messages with "
"L</set-verbose> or by setting the environment variable C<LIBGUESTFS_DEBUG=1> "
"before running the program."
msgstr ""
"Cits veids, kā iegūt to pašu informāciju, ir iespējot izvērstos ziņojumus ar "
"L</set-verbose> vai pirms programmas izpildes iestatot vides mainīgo "
"C<LIBGUESTFS_DEBUG=1>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2249
msgid "download"
msgstr "download"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2251
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" download remotefilename (filename|-)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" download remotefilename (filename|-)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2253 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2309
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3944 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4069
msgid ""
"Download file F<remotefilename> and save it as F<filename> on the local "
"machine."
msgstr ""
"Lejupielādēt failu F<remotefilename> un saglabāt to kā F<filename> lokālajā "
"datorā."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2256 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9699
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3947 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:15706
msgid "F<filename> can also be a named pipe."
msgstr "F<filename> var būt arī nosaukts kanāls."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2258
msgid "See also L</upload>, L</cat>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī L</upload>, L</cat>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2262
msgid "download-blocks"
msgstr "download-blocks"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2264
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" download-blocks device start stop (filename|-) [unallocated:true|false]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" download-blocks device start stop (filename|-) [unallocated:true|false]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2266 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3977
msgid ""
"Download the data units from F<start> address to F<stop> from the disk "
"partition (eg. F</dev/sda1>)  and save them as F<filename> on the local "
"machine."
msgstr ""
"Lejupielādēt datu vienības no adreses F<start> līdz F<stop> no diska "
"nodalījuma (piem., F</dev/sda1>) un saglabāt tās kā F<filename> lokālajā "
"datorā."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2270 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3981
msgid ""
"The use of this API on sparse disk image formats such as QCOW, may result in "
"large zero-filled files downloaded on the host."
msgstr ""
"Šīs API izmantošana retinātiem disku attēlu formātiem, piemēram, QCOW, var "
"radīt lielus ar nullēm aizpildītus failus, kas lejupielādēti resursdatorā."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2273 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3984
msgid ""
"The size of a data unit varies across filesystem implementations.  On NTFS "
"filesystems data units are referred as clusters while on ExtX ones they are "
"referred as fragments."
msgstr ""
"Datu vienības izmērs dažādās failu sistēmu realizācijās atšķiras.  NTFS "
"failu sistēmās datu vienības sauc par klasteriem, bet ExtX — par fragmentiem."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2277 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3988
msgid ""
"If the optional C<unallocated> flag is true (default is false), only the "
"unallocated blocks will be extracted.  This is useful to detect hidden data "
"or to retrieve deleted files which data units have not been overwritten yet."
msgstr ""
"Ja neobligātais karogs C<unallocated> ir true (noklusējums ir false), tiks "
"izgūti tikai nepiešķirtie bloki.  Tas noder slēptu datu noteikšanai vai "
"dzēstu failu atgūšanai, kuru datu vienības vēl nav pārrakstītas."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2286 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2302
msgid ""
"This command depends on the feature C<sleuthkit>.  See also "
"L</feature-available>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda ir atkarīga no līdzekļa C<sleuthkit>.  Skatīt arī L</feature-"
"available>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2289
msgid "download-inode"
msgstr "download-inode"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2291
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" download-inode device inode (filename|-)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" download-inode device inode (filename|-)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2293 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4041
msgid ""
"Download a file given its inode from the disk partition (eg. F</dev/sda1>) "
"and save it as F<filename> on the local machine."
msgstr ""
"Lejupielādēt failu pēc tā inode no diska nodalījuma (piem., F</dev/sda1>) un "
"saglabāt to kā F<filename> lokālajā datorā."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2296 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4044
msgid "It is not required to mount the disk to run this command."
msgstr "Lai izpildītu šo komandu, disks nav jāmontē."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2298 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4046
msgid "The command is capable of downloading deleted or inaccessible files."
msgstr "Komanda spēj lejupielādēt dzēstus vai nepieejamus failus."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2305
msgid "download-offset"
msgstr "download-offset"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2307
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" download-offset remotefilename (filename|-) offset size\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" download-offset remotefilename (filename|-) offset size\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2312 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4072
msgid ""
"F<remotefilename> is read for C<size> bytes starting at C<offset> (this "
"region must be within the file or device)."
msgstr ""
"No F<remotefilename> tiek nolasīti C<size> baiti, sākot no C<offset> (šim "
"apgabalam jābūt faila vai ierīces robežās)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2315
msgid ""
"Note that there is no limit on the amount of data that can be downloaded "
"with this call, unlike with L</pread>, and this call always reads the full "
"amount unless an error occurs."
msgstr ""
"Ņemiet vērā, ka atšķirībā no L</pread> datu apjomam, ko var lejupielādēt ar "
"šo izsaukumu, nav ierobežojuma, un šis izsaukums vienmēr nolasa pilnu "
"apjomu, ja vien nenotiek kļūda."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2320
msgid "See also L</download>, L</pread>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī L</download>, L</pread>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2324
msgid "drop-caches"
msgstr "drop-caches"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2326
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" drop-caches whattodrop\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" drop-caches whattodrop\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2328 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4097
msgid ""
"This instructs the guest kernel to drop its page cache, and/or dentries and "
"inode caches.  The parameter C<whattodrop> tells the kernel what precisely "
"to drop, see L<https://linux-mm.org/Drop_Caches>"
msgstr ""
"Tas liek viesa kodolam atmest savu lapu kešatmiņu un/vai dentry un inode "
"kešatmiņas.  Parametrs C<whattodrop> norāda kodolam, ko tieši atmest, "
"skatiet L<https://linux-mm.org/Drop_Caches>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2333 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4102
msgid "Setting C<whattodrop> to 3 should drop everything."
msgstr "Iestatot C<whattodrop> uz 3, vajadzētu atmest visu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2335 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4104
msgid ""
"This automatically calls L<sync(2)> before the operation, so that the "
"maximum guest memory is freed."
msgstr ""
"Pirms darbības tas automātiski izsauc L<sync(2)>, lai tiktu atbrīvots "
"maksimālais viesa atmiņas apjoms."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2338
msgid "du"
msgstr "du"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2340
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" du path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" du path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2342 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4117
msgid ""
"This command runs the C<du -s> command to estimate file space usage for "
"C<path>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda izpilda komandu C<du -s>, lai novērtētu C<path> failu vietas "
"lietojumu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2345 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4120
msgid ""
"C<path> can be a file or a directory.  If C<path> is a directory then the "
"estimate includes the contents of the directory and all subdirectories "
"(recursively)."
msgstr ""
"C<path> var būt fails vai direktorija.  Ja C<path> ir direktorija, "
"novērtējums ietver direktorijas un visu apakšdirektoriju saturu (rekursīvi)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2349 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4124
msgid "The result is the estimated size in I<kilobytes> (ie. units of 1024 bytes)."
msgstr ""
"Rezultāts ir novērtētais izmērs I<kilobaitos> (t. i., 1024 baitu vienībās)."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2352
msgid "e2fsck"
msgstr "e2fsck"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2354
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" e2fsck device [correct:true|false] [forceall:true|false] "
"[forceno:true|false]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" e2fsck device [correct:true|false] [forceall:true|false] "
"[forceno:true|false]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2356 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4152
msgid ""
"This runs the ext2/ext3 filesystem checker on C<device>.  It can take the "
"following optional arguments:"
msgstr ""
"Tas izpilda ext2/ext3 failu sistēmas pārbaudītāju ierīcei C<device>.  Tas "
"var pieņemt šādus neobligātus argumentus:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2361 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4157
msgid "C<correct>"
msgstr "C<correct>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2363 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4159
msgid ""
"Automatically repair the file system. This option will cause e2fsck to "
"automatically fix any filesystem problems that can be safely fixed without "
"human intervention."
msgstr ""
"Automātiski labot failu sistēmu. Šī opcija liks e2fsck automātiski izlabot "
"jebkuras failu sistēmas problēmas, ko var droši izlabot bez cilvēka "
"iejaukšanās."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2367 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4163
msgid ""
"This option may not be specified at the same time as the C<forceall> or "
"C<forceno> options."
msgstr ""
"Šo opciju nedrīkst norādīt vienlaikus ar opcijām C<forceall> vai C<forceno>."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2370 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4166
msgid "C<forceall>"
msgstr "C<forceall>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2372 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4168
msgid ""
"Assume an answer of ‘yes’ to all questions; allows e2fsck to be used "
"non-interactively."
msgstr ""
"Pieņemt atbildi ‘jā’ uz visiem jautājumiem; ļauj izmantot e2fsck "
"neinteraktīvi."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2375 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4171
msgid ""
"This option may not be specified at the same time as the C<correct> or "
"C<forceno> options."
msgstr ""
"Šo opciju nedrīkst norādīt vienlaikus ar opcijām C<correct> vai C<forceno>."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2378 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4174
msgid "C<forceno>"
msgstr "C<forceno>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2380 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4176
msgid ""
"Open the filesystem readonly and assume an answer of ‘no’ to all questions; "
"allows e2fsck to be used non-interactively."
msgstr ""
"Atvērt failu sistēmu tikai lasīšanai un pieņemt atbildi ‘nē’ uz visiem "
"jautājumiem; ļauj izmantot e2fsck neinteraktīvi."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2383 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4179
msgid ""
"This option may not be specified at the same time as the C<correct> or "
"C<forceall> options."
msgstr ""
"Šo opciju nedrīkst norādīt vienlaikus ar opcijām C<correct> vai C<forceall>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2390
msgid "e2fsck-f"
msgstr "e2fsck-f"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2392
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" e2fsck-f device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" e2fsck-f device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2394 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4223
msgid ""
"This runs C<e2fsck -p -f device>, ie. runs the ext2/ext3 filesystem checker "
"on C<device>, noninteractively (I<-p>), even if the filesystem appears to be "
"clean (I<-f>)."
msgstr ""
"Tas izpilda C<e2fsck -p -f device>, t. i., izpilda ext2/ext3 failu sistēmas "
"pārbaudītāju ierīcei C<device> neinteraktīvi (I<-p>), pat ja failu sistēma "
"šķiet tīra (I<-f>)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2398
msgid ""
"I<This function is deprecated.> In new code, use the L</e2fsck> call "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"I<Šī funkcija ir novecojusi.> Jaunā kodā tā vietā izmantojiet izsaukumu L</"
"e2fsck>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2405
msgid "echo-daemon"
msgstr "echo-daemon"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2407
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" echo-daemon 'words ...'\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" echo-daemon 'words ...'\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2409 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4237
msgid ""
"This command concatenates the list of C<words> passed with single spaces "
"between them and returns the resulting string."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda savieno nodoto vārdu sarakstu C<words> ar vienu atstarpi starp "
"tiem un atgriež iegūto virkni."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2412 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4240
msgid "You can use this command to test the connection through to the daemon."
msgstr "Šo komandu var izmantot, lai pārbaudītu savienojumu līdz dēmonam."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2414
msgid "See also L</ping-daemon>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī L</ping-daemon>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2416
msgid "egrep"
msgstr "egrep"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2418
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" egrep regex path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" egrep regex path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2420 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4263
msgid "This calls the external L<egrep(1)> program and returns the matching lines."
msgstr "Izsauc ārējo programmu L<egrep(1)> un atgriež atbilstošās rindas."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2426 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2443
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2564 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2581
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3702 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:10279
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:10296 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:10374
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:10391 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:10427
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:10444
msgid "I<This function is deprecated.> In new code, use the L</grep> call instead."
msgstr ""
"I<Šī funkcija ir novecojusi.> Jaunā kodā tā vietā izmantojiet izsaukumu L</"
"grep>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2433
msgid "egrepi"
msgstr "egrepi"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2435
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" egrepi regex path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" egrepi regex path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2437 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4289
msgid "This calls the external C<egrep -i> program and returns the matching lines."
msgstr "Izsauc ārējo programmu C<egrep -i> un atgriež atbilstošās rindas."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2450
msgid "equal"
msgstr "equal"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2452
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" equal file1 file2\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" equal file1 file2\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2454 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4308
msgid ""
"This compares the two files F<file1> and F<file2> and returns true if their "
"content is exactly equal, or false otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Tas salīdzina divus failus F<file1> un F<file2> un atgriež true, ja to "
"saturs ir tieši vienāds, vai citādi false."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2457 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4311
msgid "The external L<cmp(1)> program is used for the comparison."
msgstr "Salīdzināšanai tiek izmantota ārējā programma L<cmp(1)>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2459
msgid "exists"
msgstr "exists"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2461
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" exists path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" exists path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2463 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4323
msgid ""
"This returns C<true> if and only if there is a file, directory (or anything) "
"with the given C<path> name."
msgstr ""
"Tas atgriež C<true> tad un tikai tad, ja ir fails, direktorija (vai jebkas) "
"ar doto nosaukumu C<path>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2466
msgid "See also L</is-file>, L</is-dir>, L</stat>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī L</is-file>, L</is-dir>, L</stat>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2468
msgid "extlinux"
msgstr "extlinux"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2470
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" extlinux directory\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" extlinux directory\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2472
msgid ""
"Install the SYSLINUX bootloader on the device mounted at F<directory>.  "
"Unlike L</syslinux> which requires a FAT filesystem, this can be used on an "
"ext2/3/4 or btrfs filesystem."
msgstr ""
"Instalēt SYSLINUX sāknēšanas ielādētāju ierīcē, kas montēta F<directory>.  "
"Atšķirībā no L</syslinux>, kam nepieciešama FAT failu sistēma, to var "
"izmantot ext2/3/4 vai btrfs failu sistēmā."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2476 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4342
msgid ""
"The F<directory> parameter can be either a mountpoint, or a directory within "
"the mountpoint."
msgstr ""
"Parametrs F<directory> var būt montēšanas punkts vai direktorija montēšanas "
"punktā."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2479
msgid ""
"You also have to mark the partition as \"active\" (L</part-set-bootable>) "
"and a Master Boot Record must be installed (eg. using L</pwrite-device>) on "
"the first sector of the whole disk.  The SYSLINUX package comes with some "
"suitable Master Boot Records.  See the L<extlinux(1)> man page for further "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Nodalījums arī jāatzīmē kā „aktīvs” (L</part-set-bootable>), un visa diska "
"pirmajā sektorā jāinstalē galvenais sāknēšanas ieraksts (piem., ar L</pwrite-"
"device>).  SYSLINUX pakotnei ir daži piemēroti galvenie sāknēšanas "
"ieraksti.  Plašāku informāciju skatiet L<extlinux(1)> rokasgrāmatas lapā."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2486 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4352
msgid ""
"Additional configuration can be supplied to SYSLINUX by placing a file "
"called F<extlinux.conf> on the filesystem under F<directory>.  For further "
"information about the contents of this file, see L<extlinux(1)>."
msgstr ""
"SYSLINUX papildu konfigurāciju var nodrošināt, novietojot failu "
"F<extlinux.conf> failu sistēmā zem F<directory>.  Plašāku informāciju par šī "
"faila saturu skatiet L<extlinux(1)>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2491
msgid "See also L</syslinux>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī L</syslinux>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2493
msgid ""
"This command depends on the feature C<extlinux>.  See also "
"L</feature-available>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda ir atkarīga no līdzekļa C<extlinux>.  Skatīt arī L</feature-"
"available>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2496
msgid "f2fs-expand"
msgstr "f2fs-expand"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2498
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" f2fs-expand device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" f2fs-expand device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2500 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4372
msgid "This expands a f2fs filesystem to match the size of the underlying device."
msgstr ""
"Tas paplašina f2fs failu sistēmu, lai tā atbilstu pamatā esošās ierīces "
"izmēram."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2503
msgid ""
"This command depends on the feature C<f2fs>.  See also "
"L</feature-available>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda ir atkarīga no līdzekļa C<f2fs>.  Skatīt arī L</feature-available>"
"."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2506
msgid "fallocate"
msgstr "fallocate"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2508
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" fallocate path len\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" fallocate path len\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2510 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2529
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4396 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4415
msgid ""
"This command preallocates a file (containing zero bytes) named C<path> of "
"size C<len> bytes.  If the file exists already, it is overwritten."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda iepriekš piešķir failu C<path> (ar nulles baitiem) C<len> baitu "
"izmērā.  Ja fails jau eksistē, tas tiek pārrakstīts."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2514 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4400
msgid ""
"Do not confuse this with the guestfish-specific C<alloc> command which "
"allocates a file in the host and attaches it as a device."
msgstr ""
"Nejauciet to ar guestfish specifisko komandu C<alloc>, kas piešķir failu "
"resursdatorā un pievieno to kā ierīci."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2518
msgid ""
"I<This function is deprecated.> In new code, use the L</fallocate64> call "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"I<Šī funkcija ir novecojusi.> Jaunā kodā tā vietā izmantojiet izsaukumu L</"
"fallocate64>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2525
msgid "fallocate64"
msgstr "fallocate64"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2527
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" fallocate64 path len\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" fallocate64 path len\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2533
msgid ""
"Note that this call allocates disk blocks for the file.  To create a sparse "
"file use L</truncate-size> instead."
msgstr ""
"Ņemiet vērā, ka šis izsaukums failam piešķir diska blokus.  Lai izveidotu "
"retinātu failu, tā vietā izmantojiet L</truncate-size>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2536
msgid ""
"The deprecated call L</fallocate> does the same, but owing to an oversight "
"it only allowed 30 bit lengths to be specified, effectively limiting the "
"maximum size of files created through that call to 1GB."
msgstr ""
"Novecojušais izsaukums L</fallocate> dara to pašu, bet kļūdas dēļ tas ļāva "
"norādīt tikai 30 bitu garumus, faktiski ierobežojot ar šo izsaukumu veidoto "
"failu maksimālo izmēru līdz 1GB."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2541 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4427
msgid ""
"Do not confuse this with the guestfish-specific C<alloc> and C<sparse> "
"commands which create a file in the host and attach it as a device."
msgstr ""
"Nejauciet to ar guestfish specifiskajām komandām C<alloc> un C<sparse>, kas "
"izveido failu resursdatorā un pievieno to kā ierīci."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2545
msgid "feature-available"
msgstr "feature-available"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2547
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" feature-available 'groups ...'\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" feature-available 'groups ...'\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2549
msgid ""
"This is the same as L</available>, but unlike that call it returns a simple "
"true/false boolean result, instead of throwing an exception if a feature is "
"not found.  For other documentation see L</available>."
msgstr ""
"Tas ir tas pats, kas L</available>, bet atšķirībā no tā šis izsaukums "
"atgriež vienkāršu Būla true/false rezultātu, nevis izmet izņēmumu, ja "
"līdzeklis nav atrasts.  Citu dokumentāciju skatiet L</available>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2554
msgid "fgrep"
msgstr "fgrep"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2556
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" fgrep pattern path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" fgrep pattern path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2558 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4464
msgid "This calls the external L<fgrep(1)> program and returns the matching lines."
msgstr "Izsauc ārējo programmu L<fgrep(1)> un atgriež atbilstošās rindas."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2571
msgid "fgrepi"
msgstr "fgrepi"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2573
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" fgrepi pattern path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" fgrepi pattern path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2575 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4490
msgid "This calls the external C<fgrep -i> program and returns the matching lines."
msgstr "Izsauc ārējo programmu C<fgrep -i> un atgriež atbilstošās rindas."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2588
msgid "file"
msgstr "file"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2590
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" file path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" file path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2592 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4508
msgid ""
"This call uses the standard L<file(1)> command to determine the type or "
"contents of the file."
msgstr ""
"Šis izsaukums izmanto standarta komandu L<file(1)>, lai noteiktu faila tipu "
"vai saturu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2595 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4511
msgid ""
"This call will also transparently look inside various types of compressed "
"file."
msgstr ""
"Šis izsaukums arī caurspīdīgi ieskatīsies dažāda veida saspiestos failos."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2598 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4514
msgid ""
"The filename is not prepended to the output (like the file command I<-b> "
"option)."
msgstr ""
"Faila nosaukums netiek pievienots izvades sākumā (kā komandas file opcija I<-"
"b>)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2601 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4517
msgid ""
"The output depends on the output of the underlying L<file(1)> command and it "
"can change in future in ways beyond our control.  In other words, the output "
"is not guaranteed by the ABI."
msgstr ""
"Izvade ir atkarīga no pamatā esošās komandas L<file(1)> izvades, un nākotnē "
"tā var mainīties veidos, ko nevaram kontrolēt.  Citiem vārdiem, ABI izvadi "
"negarantē."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2605
msgid ""
"See also: L<file(1)>, L</vfs-type>, L</lstat>, L</is-file>, L</is-blockdev> "
"(etc), L</is-zero>."
msgstr ""
"Skatīt arī: L<file(1)>, L</vfs-type>, L</lstat>, L</is-file>, L</is-"
"blockdev> (u. c.), L</is-zero>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2608
msgid "file-architecture"
msgstr "file-architecture"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2610
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" file-architecture filename\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" file-architecture filename\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2612 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4535
msgid ""
"This detects the architecture of the binary F<filename>, and returns it if "
"known."
msgstr ""
"Tas nosaka binārā faila F<filename> arhitektūru un atgriež to, ja zināma."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2615 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4538
msgid "Currently defined architectures are:"
msgstr "Pašlaik definētās arhitektūras ir:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2619 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4542
msgid "\"aarch64\""
msgstr "\"aarch64\""

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2621 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4544
msgid "64 bit ARM."
msgstr "64 bitu ARM."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2623 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4546
msgid "\"arm\""
msgstr "\"arm\""

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2625 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4548
msgid "32 bit ARM."
msgstr "32 bitu ARM."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2627 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4550
msgid "\"i386\""
msgstr "\"i386\""

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2629 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4552
msgid ""
"This string is returned for all 32 bit i386, i486, i586, i686 binaries "
"irrespective of the precise processor requirements of the binary."
msgstr ""
"Šī virkne tiek atgriezta visiem 32 bitu i386, i486, i586, i686 binārajiem "
"failiem neatkarīgi no binārā faila precīzajām procesora prasībām."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2632 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4555
msgid "\"ia64\""
msgstr "\"ia64\""

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2634 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4557
msgid "Intel Itanium."
msgstr "Intel Itanium."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2636 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4559
msgid "\"ppc\""
msgstr "\"ppc\""

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2638 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4561
msgid "32 bit Power PC."
msgstr "32 bitu Power PC."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2640 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4563
msgid "\"ppc64\""
msgstr "\"ppc64\""

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2642 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4565
msgid "64 bit Power PC (big endian)."
msgstr "64 bitu Power PC (big endian)."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2644 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4567
msgid "\"ppc64le\""
msgstr "\"ppc64le\""

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2646 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4569
msgid "64 bit Power PC (little endian)."
msgstr "64 bitu Power PC (little endian)."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2648 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4571
msgid "\"loongarch64\""
msgstr "\"loongarch64\""

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2650 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4573
msgid "64 bit LoongArch64 (little endian)."
msgstr "64 bitu LoongArch64 (little endian)."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2652 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4575
msgid "\"riscv32\""
msgstr "\"riscv32\""

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2654 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4577
msgid "\"riscv64\""
msgstr "\"riscv64\""

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2656 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4579
msgid "\"riscv128\""
msgstr "\"riscv128\""

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2658 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4581
msgid "RISC-V 32-, 64- or 128-bit variants."
msgstr "RISC-V 32, 64 vai 128 bitu varianti."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2660 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4583
msgid "\"s390\""
msgstr "\"s390\""

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2662 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4585
msgid "31 bit IBM S/390."
msgstr "31 bitu IBM S/390."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2664 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4587
msgid "\"s390x\""
msgstr "\"s390x\""

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2666 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4589
msgid "64 bit IBM S/390."
msgstr "64 bitu IBM S/390."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2668 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4591
msgid "\"sparc\""
msgstr "\"sparc\""

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2670 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4593
msgid "32 bit SPARC."
msgstr "32 bitu SPARC."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2672 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4595
msgid "\"sparc64\""
msgstr "\"sparc64\""

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2674 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4597
msgid "64 bit SPARC V9 and above."
msgstr "64 bitu SPARC V9 un jaunāki."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2676 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4599
msgid "\"x86_64\""
msgstr "\"x86_64\""

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2678 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4601
msgid "64 bit x86-64."
msgstr "64 bitu x86-64."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2682 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4605
msgid "Libguestfs may return other architecture strings in future."
msgstr "Nākotnē libguestfs var atgriezt citas arhitektūru virknes."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2684 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4607
msgid "The function works on at least the following types of files:"
msgstr "Funkcija darbojas vismaz ar šādiem failu tipiem:"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2690 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4613
msgid "many types of Un*x and Linux binary"
msgstr "daudzu veidu Un*x un Linux binārie faili"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2694 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4617
msgid "many types of Un*x and Linux shared library"
msgstr "daudzu veidu Un*x un Linux koplietotās bibliotēkas"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2698 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4621
msgid "Windows Win32 and Win64 binaries"
msgstr "Windows Win32 un Win64 binārie faili"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2702 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4625
msgid "Windows Win32 and Win64 DLLs"
msgstr "Windows Win32 un Win64 DLL"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2704 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4627
msgid "Win32 binaries and DLLs return C<i386>."
msgstr "Win32 binārie faili un DLL atgriež C<i386>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2706 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4629
msgid "Win64 binaries and DLLs return C<x86_64>."
msgstr "Win64 binārie faili un DLL atgriež C<x86_64>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2710 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4633
msgid "Linux kernel modules"
msgstr "Linux kodola moduļi"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2714 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4637
msgid "Linux new-style initrd images"
msgstr "Linux jaunā stila initrd attēli"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2718 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4641
msgid "some non-x86 Linux vmlinuz kernels"
msgstr "daži ne-x86 Linux vmlinuz kodoli"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2722 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4645
msgid "What it can't do currently:"
msgstr "Ko tā pašlaik nevar:"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2728 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4651
msgid "static libraries (libfoo.a)"
msgstr "statiskās bibliotēkas (libfoo.a)"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2732 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4655
msgid "Linux old-style initrd as compressed ext2 filesystem (RHEL 3)"
msgstr "Linux vecā stila initrd kā saspiesta ext2 failu sistēma (RHEL 3)"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2736 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4659
msgid "x86 Linux vmlinuz kernels"
msgstr "x86 Linux vmlinuz kodoli"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2738 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4661
msgid ""
"x86 vmlinuz images (bzImage format) consist of a mix of 16-, 32- and "
"compressed code, and are horribly hard to unpack.  If you want to find the "
"architecture of a kernel, use the architecture of the associated initrd or "
"kernel module(s) instead."
msgstr ""
"x86 vmlinuz attēli (bzImage formāts) sastāv no 16, 32 bitu un saspiesta koda "
"sajaukuma, un tos ir šausmīgi grūti izpakot.  Ja vēlaties noskaidrot kodola "
"arhitektūru, tā vietā izmantojiet saistītā initrd vai kodola moduļa(-u) "
"arhitektūru."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2745
msgid "filesize"
msgstr "filesize"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2747
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" filesize file\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" filesize file\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2749 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4679
msgid "This command returns the size of F<file> in bytes."
msgstr "Šī komanda atgriež F<file> izmēru baitos."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2751
msgid ""
"To get other stats about a file, use L</stat>, L</lstat>, L</is-dir>, "
"L</is-file> etc.  To get the size of block devices, use "
"L</blockdev-getsize64>."
msgstr ""
"Lai iegūtu citu statistiku par failu, izmantojiet L</stat>, L</lstat>, L</is-"
"dir>, L</is-file> u. c.  Lai iegūtu bloku ierīču izmēru, izmantojiet L</"
"blockdev-getsize64>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2755
msgid "filesystem-available"
msgstr "filesystem-available"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2757
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" filesystem-available filesystem\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" filesystem-available filesystem\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2759 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4695
msgid ""
"Check whether libguestfs supports the named filesystem.  The argument "
"C<filesystem> is a filesystem name, such as C<ext3>."
msgstr ""
"Pārbaudīt, vai libguestfs atbalsta nosaukto failu sistēmu.  Arguments "
"C<filesystem> ir failu sistēmas nosaukums, piemēram, C<ext3>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2763
msgid "You must call L</launch> before using this command."
msgstr "Pirms šīs komandas izmantošanas jāizsauc L</launch>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2765 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4701
msgid ""
"This is mainly useful as a negative test.  If this returns true, it doesn't "
"mean that a particular filesystem can be created or mounted, since "
"filesystems can fail for other reasons such as it being a later version of "
"the filesystem, or having incompatible features, or lacking the right "
"mkfs.E<lt>I<fs>E<gt> tool."
msgstr ""
"Tas galvenokārt noder kā negatīvs tests.  Ja tas atgriež true, tas nenozīmē, "
"ka konkrēto failu sistēmu var izveidot vai montēt, jo failu sistēmas var "
"neizdoties citu iemeslu dēļ, piemēram, ja tā ir jaunāka failu sistēmas "
"versija, tai ir nesaderīgi līdzekļi vai trūkst pareizā rīka mkfs.E<lt>I<fs>"
"E<gt>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2772
msgid "See also L</available>, L</feature-available>, L<guestfs(3)/AVAILABILITY>."
msgstr ""
"Skatīt arī L</available>, L</feature-available>, L<guestfs(3)/PIEEJAMĪBA>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2775
msgid "filesystem-walk"
msgstr "filesystem-walk"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2777
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" filesystem-walk device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" filesystem-walk device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2779 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4721
msgid ""
"Walk through the internal structures of a disk partition (eg. F</dev/sda1>) "
"in order to return a list of all the files and directories stored within."
msgstr ""
"Iziet cauri diska nodalījuma (piem., F</dev/sda1>) iekšējām struktūrām, lai "
"atgrieztu visu tajā glabāto failu un direktoriju sarakstu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2783 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4725
msgid "It is not necessary to mount the disk partition to run this command."
msgstr "Lai izpildītu šo komandu, diska nodalījums nav jāmontē."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2785 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4727
msgid ""
"All entries in the filesystem are returned. This function can list deleted "
"or unaccessible files. The entries are I<not> sorted."
msgstr ""
"Tiek atgriezti visi failu sistēmas ieraksti. Šī funkcija var uzskaitīt "
"dzēstus vai nepieejamus failus. Ieraksti I<nav> sakārtoti."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2788 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4730
msgid "The C<tsk_dirent> structure contains the following fields."
msgstr "Struktūra C<tsk_dirent> satur šādus laukus."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2792 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4734
msgid "C<tsk_inode>"
msgstr "C<tsk_inode>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2794 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4736
msgid ""
"Filesystem reference number of the node. It might be C<0> if the node has "
"been deleted."
msgstr ""
"Mezgla failu sistēmas atsauces numurs. Tas var būt C<0>, ja mezgls ir dzēsts."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2797 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4739
msgid "C<tsk_type>"
msgstr "C<tsk_type>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2799 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4741
msgid "Basic file type information.  See below for a detailed list of values."
msgstr ""
"Pamata informācija par faila tipu.  Detalizētu vērtību sarakstu skatiet "
"tālāk."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2802 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4744
msgid "C<tsk_size>"
msgstr "C<tsk_size>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2804 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4746
msgid "File size in bytes. It might be C<-1> if the node has been deleted."
msgstr "Faila izmērs baitos. Tas var būt C<-1>, ja mezgls ir dzēsts."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2807 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4749
msgid "C<tsk_name>"
msgstr "C<tsk_name>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2809 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4751
msgid "The file path relative to its directory."
msgstr "Faila ceļš attiecībā pret tā direktoriju."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2811 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4753
msgid "C<tsk_flags>"
msgstr "C<tsk_flags>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2813 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4755
msgid ""
"Bitfield containing extra information regarding the entry.  It contains the "
"logical OR of the following values:"
msgstr ""
"Bitu lauks ar papildu informāciju par ierakstu.  Tas satur šādu vērtību "
"loģisko OR:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2818 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4760
msgid "0x0001"
msgstr "0x0001"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2820 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4762
msgid ""
"If set to C<1>, the file is allocated and visible within the filesystem.  "
"Otherwise, the file has been deleted.  Under certain circumstances, the "
"function C<download_inode> can be used to recover deleted files."
msgstr ""
"Ja iestatīts uz C<1>, fails ir piešķirts un redzams failu sistēmā.  Citādi "
"fails ir dzēsts.  Noteiktos apstākļos dzēstu failu atgūšanai var izmantot "
"funkciju C<download_inode>."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2825 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4767
msgid "0x0002"
msgstr "0x0002"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2827 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4769
msgid ""
"Filesystem such as NTFS and Ext2 or greater, separate the file name from the "
"metadata structure.  The bit is set to C<1> when the file name is in an "
"unallocated state and the metadata structure is in an allocated one.  This "
"generally implies the metadata has been reallocated to a new file.  "
"Therefore, information such as file type, file size, timestamps, number of "
"links and symlink target might not correspond with the ones of the original "
"deleted entry."
msgstr ""
"Tādas failu sistēmas kā NTFS un Ext2 vai jaunākas atdala faila nosaukumu no "
"metadatu struktūras.  Bits tiek iestatīts uz C<1>, ja faila nosaukums ir "
"nepiešķirtā stāvoklī, bet metadatu struktūra — piešķirtā.  Parasti tas "
"nozīmē, ka metadati ir atkārtoti piešķirti jaunam failam.  Tāpēc tāda "
"informācija kā faila tips, faila izmērs, laikspiedoli, saišu skaits un "
"simboliskās saites mērķis var neatbilst oriģinālā dzēstā ieraksta "
"informācijai."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2836 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4778
msgid "0x0004"
msgstr "0x0004"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2838 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4780
msgid ""
"The bit is set to C<1> when the file is compressed using filesystem native "
"compression support (NTFS). The API is not able to detect application level "
"compression."
msgstr ""
"Bits tiek iestatīts uz C<1>, ja fails ir saspiests, izmantojot failu "
"sistēmas vietējo saspiešanas atbalstu (NTFS). API nespēj noteikt lietotnes "
"līmeņa saspiešanu."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2844 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4786
msgid "C<tsk_atime_sec>"
msgstr "C<tsk_atime_sec>"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2846 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4788
msgid "C<tsk_atime_nsec>"
msgstr "C<tsk_atime_nsec>"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2848 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4790
msgid "C<tsk_mtime_sec>"
msgstr "C<tsk_mtime_sec>"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2850 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4792
msgid "C<tsk_mtime_nsec>"
msgstr "C<tsk_mtime_nsec>"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2852 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4794
msgid "C<tsk_ctime_sec>"
msgstr "C<tsk_ctime_sec>"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2854 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4796
msgid "C<tsk_ctime_nsec>"
msgstr "C<tsk_ctime_nsec>"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2856 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4798
msgid "C<tsk_crtime_sec>"
msgstr "C<tsk_crtime_sec>"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2858 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4800
msgid "C<tsk_crtime_nsec>"
msgstr "C<tsk_crtime_nsec>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2860 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4802
msgid ""
"Respectively, access, modification, last status change and creation time in "
"Unix format in seconds and nanoseconds."
msgstr ""
"Attiecīgi piekļuves, modificēšanas, pēdējās statusa maiņas un izveides laiks "
"Unix formātā sekundēs un nanosekundēs."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2863 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4805
msgid "C<tsk_nlink>"
msgstr "C<tsk_nlink>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2865 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4807
msgid "Number of file names pointing to this entry."
msgstr "Failu nosaukumu skaits, kas norāda uz šo ierakstu."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2867 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4809
msgid "C<tsk_link>"
msgstr "C<tsk_link>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2869 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4811
msgid ""
"If the entry is a symbolic link, this field will contain the path to the "
"target file."
msgstr "Ja ieraksts ir simboliskā saite, šis lauks saturēs ceļu uz mērķa failu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2874 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4816
msgid "The C<tsk_type> field will contain one of the following characters:"
msgstr "Lauks C<tsk_type> saturēs vienu no šīm rakstzīmēm:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2878 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7928
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4820 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12884
msgid "'b'"
msgstr "'b'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2880 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7930
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4822 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12886
msgid "Block special"
msgstr "Bloku speciālais fails"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2882 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3242
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7932 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4824
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5377 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12888
msgid "'c'"
msgstr "'c'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2884 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7934
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4826 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12890
msgid "Char special"
msgstr "Rakstzīmju speciālais fails"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2886 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3251
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7936 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4828
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5386 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12892
msgid "'d'"
msgstr "'d'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2888 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7938
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4830 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12894
msgid "Directory"
msgstr "Direktorija"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2890 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7940
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4832 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12896
msgid "'f'"
msgstr "'f'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2892 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7942
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4834 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12898
msgid "FIFO (named pipe)"
msgstr "FIFO (nosaukts kanāls)"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2894 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7944
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4836 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12900
msgid "'l'"
msgstr "'l'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2896 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7946
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4838 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12902
msgid "Symbolic link"
msgstr "Simboliskā saite"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2898 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7948
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4840 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12904
msgid "'r'"
msgstr "'r'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2900 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7950
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4842 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12906
msgid "Regular file"
msgstr "Parasts fails"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2902 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3281
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7952 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4844
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5416 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12908
msgid "'s'"
msgstr "'s'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2904 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7954
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4846 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12910
msgid "Socket"
msgstr "Ligzda"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2906 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3263
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4848 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5398
msgid "'h'"
msgstr "'h'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2908 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4850
msgid "Shadow inode (Solaris)"
msgstr "Ēnu inode (Solaris)"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2910 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4852
msgid "'w'"
msgstr "'w'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2912 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4854
msgid "Whiteout inode (BSD)"
msgstr "Whiteout inode (BSD)"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2914 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3301
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7956 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4856
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5436 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12912
msgid "'u'"
msgstr "'u'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2916 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:7958
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4858 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12914
msgid "Unknown file type"
msgstr "Nezināms faila tips"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2920 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3022
msgid ""
"This command depends on the feature C<libtsk>.  See also "
"L</feature-available>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda ir atkarīga no līdzekļa C<libtsk>.  Skatīt arī L</feature-"
"available>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2923
msgid "fill"
msgstr "fill"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2925
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" fill c len path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" fill c len path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2927 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4884
msgid ""
"This command creates a new file called C<path>.  The initial content of the "
"file is C<len> octets of C<c>, where C<c> must be a number in the range "
"C<[0..255]>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda izveido jaunu failu C<path>.  Faila sākotnējais saturs ir C<len> "
"okteti ar vērtību C<c>, kur C<c> jābūt skaitlim diapazonā C<[0..255]>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2931
msgid ""
"To fill a file with zero bytes (sparsely), it is much more efficient to use "
"L</truncate-size>.  To create a file with a pattern of repeating bytes use "
"L</fill-pattern>."
msgstr ""
"Lai aizpildītu failu ar nulles baitiem (retināti), daudz efektīvāk ir "
"izmantot L</truncate-size>.  Lai izveidotu failu ar atkārtotu baitu šablonu, "
"izmantojiet L</fill-pattern>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2936
msgid "fill-dir"
msgstr "fill-dir"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2938
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" fill-dir dir nr\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" fill-dir dir nr\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2940 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4909
msgid ""
"This function, useful for testing filesystems, creates C<nr> empty files in "
"the directory C<dir> with names C<00000000> through C<nr-1> (ie. each file "
"name is 8 digits long padded with zeroes)."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija, kas noder failu sistēmu testēšanai, izveido C<nr> tukšus failus "
"direktorijā C<dir> ar nosaukumiem no C<00000000> līdz C<nr-1> (t. i., katrs "
"faila nosaukums ir 8 ciparus garš, papildināts ar nullēm)."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2945
msgid "fill-pattern"
msgstr "fill-pattern"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2947
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" fill-pattern pattern len path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" fill-pattern pattern len path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2949
msgid ""
"This function is like L</fill> except that it creates a new file of length "
"C<len> containing the repeating pattern of bytes in C<pattern>.  The pattern "
"is truncated if necessary to ensure the length of the file is exactly C<len> "
"bytes."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija ir līdzīga L</fill>, izņemot to, ka tā izveido jaunu failu "
"garumā C<len> ar atkārtotu baitu šablonu C<pattern>.  Ja nepieciešams, "
"šablons tiek saīsināts, lai nodrošinātu, ka faila garums ir tieši C<len> "
"baiti."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2954
msgid "find"
msgstr "find"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2956
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" find directory\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" find directory\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2958 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4946
msgid ""
"This command lists out all files and directories, recursively, starting at "
"F<directory>.  It is essentially equivalent to running the shell command "
"C<find directory -print> but some post-processing happens on the output, "
"described below."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda rekursīvi uzskaita visus failus un direktorijas, sākot ar "
"F<directory>.  Būtībā tā ir līdzvērtīga čaulas komandas C<find directory -"
"print> izpildei, taču izvadei tiek veikta zināma pēcapstrāde, kas aprakstīta "
"tālāk."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2963 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4951
msgid ""
"This returns a list of strings I<without any prefix>.  Thus if the directory "
"structure was:"
msgstr ""
"Tas atgriež virkņu sarakstu I<bez jebkāda priedēkļa>.  Tādējādi, ja "
"direktoriju struktūra bija:"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2966 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4954
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" /tmp/a\n"
" /tmp/b\n"
" /tmp/c/d\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" /tmp/a\n"
" /tmp/b\n"
" /tmp/c/d\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2970
msgid "then the returned list from L</find> F</tmp> would be 4 elements:"
msgstr "tad L</find> F</tmp> atgrieztajā sarakstā būtu 4 elementi:"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2973 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4961
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" a\n"
" b\n"
" c\n"
" c/d\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" a\n"
" b\n"
" c\n"
" c/d\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2978 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4966
msgid "If F<directory> is not a directory, then this command returns an error."
msgstr "Ja F<directory> nav direktorija, šī komanda atgriež kļūdu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2981 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4969
msgid "The returned list is sorted."
msgstr "Atgrieztais saraksts ir sakārtots."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2983
msgid "find0"
msgstr "find0"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2985
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" find0 directory (files|-)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" find0 directory (files|-)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2987 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4984
msgid ""
"This command lists out all files and directories, recursively, starting at "
"F<directory>, placing the resulting list in the external file called "
"F<files>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda rekursīvi uzskaita visus failus un direktorijas, sākot ar "
"F<directory>, ievietojot iegūto sarakstu ārējā failā F<files>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2991
msgid "This command works the same way as L</find> with the following exceptions:"
msgstr "Šī komanda darbojas tāpat kā L</find> ar šādiem izņēmumiem:"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:2998 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4995
msgid "The resulting list is written to an external file."
msgstr "Iegūtais saraksts tiek ierakstīts ārējā failā."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3002 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4999
msgid ""
"Items (filenames) in the result are separated by C<\\0> characters.  See "
"L<find(1)> option I<-print0>."
msgstr ""
"Rezultāta vienumi (failu nosaukumi) ir atdalīti ar rakstzīmēm C<\\0>.  "
"Skatiet L<find(1)> opciju I<-print0>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3007 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5004
msgid "The result list is not sorted."
msgstr "Rezultātu saraksts nav sakārtots."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3013
msgid "find-inode"
msgstr "find-inode"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3015
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" find-inode device inode\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" find-inode device inode\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3017 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5019
msgid "Searches all the entries associated with the given inode."
msgstr "Meklē visus ar doto inode saistītos ierakstus."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3019 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5021
msgid ""
"For each entry, a C<tsk_dirent> structure is returned.  See "
"C<filesystem_walk> for more information about C<tsk_dirent> structures."
msgstr ""
"Katram ierakstam tiek atgriezta struktūra C<tsk_dirent>.  Plašāku "
"informāciju par struktūrām C<tsk_dirent> skatiet C<filesystem_walk>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3025
msgid "findfs-label"
msgstr "findfs-label"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3027
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" findfs-label label\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" findfs-label label\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3029 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5044
msgid ""
"This command searches the filesystems and returns the one which has the "
"given label.  An error is returned if no such filesystem can be found."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda meklē failu sistēmās un atgriež to, kurai ir dotā etiķete.  Ja "
"šāda failu sistēma nav atrodama, tiek atgriezta kļūda."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3033
msgid "To find the label of a filesystem, use L</vfs-label>."
msgstr "Lai noskaidrotu failu sistēmas etiķeti, izmantojiet L</vfs-label>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3035
msgid "findfs-partlabel"
msgstr "findfs-partlabel"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3037
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" findfs-partlabel label\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" findfs-partlabel label\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3039 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5061
msgid ""
"This command searches the partitions and returns the one which has the given "
"label.  An error is returned if no such partition can be found."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda meklē nodalījumos un atgriež to, kuram ir dotā etiķete.  Ja šāds "
"nodalījums nav atrodams, tiek atgriezta kļūda."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3043
msgid "To find the label of a partition, use L</blkid> (C<PART_ENTRY_NAME>)."
msgstr ""
"Lai noskaidrotu nodalījuma etiķeti, izmantojiet L</blkid> "
"(C<PART_ENTRY_NAME>)."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3045
msgid "findfs-partuuid"
msgstr "findfs-partuuid"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3047
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" findfs-partuuid uuid\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" findfs-partuuid uuid\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3049 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5078
msgid ""
"This command searches the partitions and returns the one which has the given "
"partition UUID.  An error is returned if no such partition can be found."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda meklē nodalījumos un atgriež to, kuram ir dotais nodalījuma "
"UUID.  Ja šāds nodalījums nav atrodams, tiek atgriezta kļūda."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3053
msgid "To find the UUID of a partition, use L</blkid> (C<PART_ENTRY_UUID>)."
msgstr ""
"Lai noskaidrotu nodalījuma UUID, izmantojiet L</blkid> (C<PART_ENTRY_UUID>)."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3055
msgid "findfs-uuid"
msgstr "findfs-uuid"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3057
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" findfs-uuid uuid\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" findfs-uuid uuid\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3059 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5095
msgid ""
"This command searches the filesystems and returns the one which has the "
"given UUID.  An error is returned if no such filesystem can be found."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda meklē failu sistēmās un atgriež to, kurai ir dotais UUID.  Ja "
"šāda failu sistēma nav atrodama, tiek atgriezta kļūda."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3063
msgid "To find the UUID of a filesystem, use L</vfs-uuid>."
msgstr "Lai noskaidrotu failu sistēmas UUID, izmantojiet L</vfs-uuid>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3065
msgid "fsck"
msgstr "fsck"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3067
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" fsck fstype device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" fsck fstype device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3069 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5113
msgid ""
"This runs the filesystem checker (fsck) on C<device> which should have "
"filesystem type C<fstype>."
msgstr ""
"Tas izpilda failu sistēmas pārbaudītāju (fsck) ierīcei C<device>, kurai "
"jābūt failu sistēmas tipam C<fstype>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3072 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5116
msgid ""
"The returned integer is the status.  See L<fsck(8)> for the list of status "
"codes from C<fsck>."
msgstr ""
"Atgrieztais vesels skaitlis ir statuss.  C<fsck> statusa kodu sarakstu "
"skatiet L<fsck(8)>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3081 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5125
msgid "Multiple status codes can be summed together."
msgstr "Vairākus statusa kodus var summēt."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3085 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5129
msgid ""
"A non-zero return code can mean \"success\", for example if errors have been "
"corrected on the filesystem."
msgstr ""
"Atgriešanas kods, kas nav nulle, var nozīmēt „veiksmi”, piemēram, ja failu "
"sistēmā ir izlabotas kļūdas."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3090 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5134
msgid "Checking or repairing NTFS volumes is not supported (by linux-ntfs)."
msgstr "NTFS sējumu pārbaude vai labošana netiek atbalstīta (ar linux-ntfs)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3095 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5139
msgid "This command is entirely equivalent to running C<fsck -a -t fstype device>."
msgstr "Šī komanda ir pilnībā līdzvērtīga C<fsck -a -t fstype device> izpildei."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3097
msgid "fstrim"
msgstr "fstrim"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3099
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" fstrim mountpoint [offset:N] [length:N] [minimumfreeextent:N]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" fstrim mountpoint [offset:N] [length:N] [minimumfreeextent:N]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3101 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5161
msgid ""
"Trim the free space in the filesystem mounted on C<mountpoint>.  The "
"filesystem must be mounted read-write."
msgstr ""
"Apgriezt brīvo vietu failu sistēmā, kas montēta C<mountpoint>.  Failu "
"sistēmai jābūt montētai lasīšanai un rakstīšanai."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3104 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5164
msgid ""
"The filesystem contents are not affected, but any free space in the "
"filesystem is \"trimmed\", that is, given back to the host device, thus "
"making disk images more sparse, allowing unused space in qcow2 files to be "
"reused, etc."
msgstr ""
"Failu sistēmas saturs netiek ietekmēts, bet jebkura brīvā vieta failu "
"sistēmā tiek „apgriezta”, t. i., atdota resursdatora ierīcei, tādējādi "
"padarot disku attēlus retinātākus, ļaujot atkārtoti izmantot neizmantoto "
"vietu qcow2 failos u. c."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3109 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5169
msgid ""
"This operation requires support in libguestfs, the mounted filesystem, the "
"host filesystem, qemu and the host kernel.  If this support isn't present it "
"may give an error or even appear to run but do nothing."
msgstr ""
"Šai darbībai nepieciešams atbalsts libguestfs, montētajā failu sistēmā, "
"resursdatora failu sistēmā, qemu un resursdatora kodolā.  Ja šī atbalsta "
"nav, tā var dot kļūdu vai pat šķietami izpildīties, bet neko nedarīt."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3114 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5174
msgid ""
"In the case where the kernel vfs driver does not support trimming, this call "
"will fail with errno set to C<ENOTSUP>.  Currently this happens when trying "
"to trim FAT filesystems."
msgstr ""
"Ja kodola vfs draiveris neatbalsta apgriešanu, šis izsaukums neizdosies ar "
"errno, kas iestatīts uz C<ENOTSUP>.  Pašlaik tas notiek, mēģinot apgriezt "
"FAT failu sistēmas."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3118
msgid ""
"See also L</zero-free-space>.  That is a slightly different operation that "
"turns free space in the filesystem into zeroes.  It is valid to call "
"L</fstrim> either instead of, or after calling L</zero-free-space>."
msgstr ""
"Skatīt arī L</zero-free-space>.  Tā ir nedaudz atšķirīga darbība, kas "
"pārvērš brīvo vietu failu sistēmā nullēs.  L</fstrim> drīkst izsaukt vai nu "
"L</zero-free-space> vietā, vai pēc tā."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3125
msgid ""
"This command depends on the feature C<fstrim>.  See also "
"L</feature-available>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda ir atkarīga no līdzekļa C<fstrim>.  Skatīt arī L</feature-"
"available>."

#. type: =head2
