"Return the additional kernel options which are added to the libguestfs "
"appliance kernel command line."
msgstr ""
"Atgriezt papildu kodola opcijas, kas tiek pievienotas libguestfs "
"palīgsistēmas kodola komandrindai."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3135 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5220
msgid "If C<NULL> then no options are added."
msgstr "Ja C<NULL>, opcijas netiek pievienotas."

