#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5267 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:13625
msgid "This handle property was previously called the \"attach method\"."
msgstr "Šo roktura īpašību iepriekš sauca par „pievienošanas metodi”."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3168
msgid "get-backend-setting"
msgstr "get-backend-setting"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3170
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" get-backend-setting name\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" get-backend-setting name\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3172 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5282
msgid ""
"Find a backend setting string which is either C<\"name\"> or begins with "
"C<\"name=\">.  If C<\"name\">, this returns the string C<\"1\">.  If "
"C<\"name=\">, this returns the part after the equals sign (which may be an "
"empty string)."
msgstr ""
"Atrast aizmugursistēmas iestatījuma virkni, kas ir vai nu C<\"name\">, vai "
"sākas ar C<\"name=\">.  Ja C<\"name\">, tas atgriež virkni C<\"1\">.  Ja "
"C<\"name=\">, tas atgriež daļu aiz vienādības zīmes (kas var būt tukša "
"virkne)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3177
msgid ""
"If no such setting is found, this function throws an error.  The errno (see "
"L</last-errno>) will be C<ESRCH> in this case."
msgstr ""
"Ja šāds iestatījums nav atrasts, šī funkcija izmet kļūdu.  Šajā gadījumā "
"errno (skatiet L</last-errno>) būs C<ESRCH>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3183
msgid "get-backend-settings"
msgstr "get-backend-settings"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3185
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" get-backend-settings\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" get-backend-settings\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3187 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5303
msgid "Return the current backend settings."
msgstr "Atgriezt pašreizējos aizmugursistēmas iestatījumus."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3189
msgid ""
"This call returns all backend settings strings.  If you want to find a "
"single backend setting, see L</get-backend-setting>."
msgstr ""
"Šis izsaukums atgriež visas aizmugursistēmas iestatījumu virknes.  Ja "
"vēlaties atrast vienu aizmugursistēmas iestatījumu, skatiet L</get-backend-"
"setting>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3194
msgid "get-cachedir"
msgstr "get-cachedir"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3196
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" get-cachedir\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" get-cachedir\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3198 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5321
msgid "Get the directory used by the handle to store the appliance cache."
msgstr ""
"Iegūt direktoriju, ko rokturis izmanto palīgsistēmas kešatmiņas glabāšanai."

#. type: =head2
