#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" get-direct\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" get-direct\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3204 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5340
msgid "Return the direct appliance mode flag."
msgstr "Atgriezt tiešās palīgsistēmas režīma karogu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3206 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:8421
msgid ""
"I<This function is deprecated.> In new code, use the "
"L</internal-get-console-socket> call instead."
msgstr ""
"I<Šī funkcija ir novecojusi.> Jaunā kodā tā vietā izmantojiet izsaukumu L</"
"internal-get-console-socket>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3213
msgid "get-e2attrs"
msgstr "get-e2attrs"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3215
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" get-e2attrs file\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" get-e2attrs file\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3217 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5352
msgid "This returns the file attributes associated with F<file>."
msgstr "Tas atgriež ar F<file> saistītos faila atribūtus."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3219 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5354
msgid ""
"The attributes are a set of bits associated with each inode which affect the "
"behaviour of the file.  The attributes are returned as a string of letters "
"(described below).  The string may be empty, indicating that no file "
"attributes are set for this file."
msgstr ""
"Atribūti ir ar katru inode saistīta bitu kopa, kas ietekmē faila uzvedību.  "
"Atribūti tiek atgriezti kā burtu virkne (aprakstīta tālāk).  Virkne var būt "
"tukša, norādot, ka šim failam nav iestatītu faila atribūtu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3225 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:8448
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5360 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:13758
msgid ""
"These attributes are only present when the file is located on an ext2/3/4 "
"filesystem.  Using this call on other filesystem types will result in an "
"error."
msgstr ""
"Šie atribūti ir tikai tad, ja fails atrodas ext2/3/4 failu sistēmā.  Šī "
"izsaukuma izmantošana citiem failu sistēmu tipiem izraisīs kļūdu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3229 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5364
msgid "The characters (file attributes) in the returned string are currently:"
msgstr "Rakstzīmes (faila atribūti) atgrieztajā virknē pašlaik ir:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3234 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5369
msgid "'A'"
msgstr "'A'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3236 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5371
msgid "When the file is accessed, its atime is not modified."
msgstr "Piekļūstot failam, tā atime netiek mainīts."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3238 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5373
msgid "'a'"
msgstr "'a'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3240 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5375
msgid "The file is append-only."
msgstr "Failu var tikai papildināt."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3244 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5379
msgid "The file is compressed on-disk."
msgstr "Fails diskā ir saspiests."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3246 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5381
msgid "'D'"
msgstr "'D'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3248 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5383
msgid ""
"(Directories only.)  Changes to this directory are written synchronously to "
"disk."
msgstr ""
"(Tikai direktorijām.)  Izmaiņas šajā direktorijā tiek sinhroni ierakstītas "
"diskā."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3253 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5388
msgid "The file is not a candidate for backup (see L<dump(8)>)."
msgstr "Fails nav dublēšanas kandidāts (skatiet L<dump(8)>)."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3255 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5390
msgid "'E'"
msgstr "'E'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3257 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5392
msgid "The file has compression errors."
msgstr "Failam ir saspiešanas kļūdas."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3259 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5394
msgid "'e'"
msgstr "'e'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3261 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5396
msgid "The file is using extents."
msgstr "Fails izmanto ekstentus."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3265 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5400
msgid ""
"The file is storing its blocks in units of the filesystem blocksize instead "
"of sectors."
msgstr ""
"Fails glabā savus blokus failu sistēmas bloka izmēra vienībās, nevis "
"sektoros."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3268 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5403
msgid "'I'"
msgstr "'I'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3270 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5405
msgid "(Directories only.)  The directory is using hashed trees."
msgstr "(Tikai direktorijām.)  Direktorija izmanto jaucējkokus."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3272 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5407
msgid "'i'"
msgstr "'i'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3274 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5409
msgid ""
"The file is immutable.  It cannot be modified, deleted or renamed.  No link "
"can be created to this file."
msgstr ""
"Fails ir nemaināms.  To nevar mainīt, dzēst vai pārdēvēt.  Uz šo failu nevar "
"izveidot saiti."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3277 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5412
msgid "'j'"
msgstr "'j'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3279 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5414
msgid "The file is data-journaled."
msgstr "Failam ir datu žurnalēšana."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3283 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5418
msgid "When the file is deleted, all its blocks will be zeroed."
msgstr "Kad fails tiek dzēsts, visi tā bloki tiks aizpildīti ar nullēm."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3285 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5420
msgid "'S'"
msgstr "'S'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3287 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5422
msgid "Changes to this file are written synchronously to disk."
msgstr "Izmaiņas šajā failā tiek sinhroni ierakstītas diskā."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3289 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5424
msgid "'T'"
msgstr "'T'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3291 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5426
msgid ""
"(Directories only.)  This is a hint to the block allocator that "
"subdirectories contained in this directory should be spread across blocks.  "
"If not present, the block allocator will try to group subdirectories "
"together."
msgstr ""
"(Tikai direktorijām.)  Tas ir mājiens bloku piešķīrējam, ka šajā direktorijā "
"esošās apakšdirektorijas jāizkliedē pa blokiem.  Ja tā nav, bloku piešķīrējs "
"mēģinās apakšdirektorijas grupēt kopā."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3296 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5431
msgid "'t'"
msgstr "'t'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3298 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5433
msgid ""
"For a file, this disables tail-merging.  (Not used by upstream "
"implementations of ext2.)"
msgstr ""
"Failam tas atspējo astes apvienošanu.  (Augšteces ext2 realizācijas to "
"neizmanto.)"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3303 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5438
msgid ""
"When the file is deleted, its blocks will be saved, allowing the file to be "
"undeleted."
msgstr "Kad fails tiek dzēsts, tā bloki tiks saglabāti, ļaujot failu atjaunot."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3306 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5441
msgid "'X'"
msgstr "'X'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3308 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5443
msgid "The raw contents of the compressed file may be accessed."
msgstr "Var piekļūt saspiestā faila neapstrādātajam saturam."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3310 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5445
msgid "'Z'"
msgstr "'Z'"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3312 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5447
msgid "The compressed file is dirty."
msgstr "Saspiestais fails ir netīrs."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3316 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5451
msgid ""
"More file attributes may be added to this list later.  Not all file "
"attributes may be set for all kinds of files.  For detailed information, "
"consult the L<chattr(1)> man page."
msgstr ""
"Šim sarakstam vēlāk var tikt pievienoti citi faila atribūti.  Ne visus faila "
"atribūtus var iestatīt visu veidu failiem.  Detalizētu informāciju skatiet "
"L<chattr(1)> rokasgrāmatas lapā."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3320
msgid "See also L</set-e2attrs>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī L</set-e2attrs>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3322
msgid "Don't confuse these attributes with extended attributes (see L</getxattr>)."
msgstr ""
"Nejauciet šos atribūtus ar paplašinātajiem atribūtiem (skatiet L</getxattr>)."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3325
msgid "get-e2generation"
msgstr "get-e2generation"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3327
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" get-e2generation file\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" get-e2generation file\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3329 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5471
msgid ""
"This returns the ext2 file generation of a file.  The generation (which used "
"to be called the \"version\") is a number associated with an inode.  This is "
"most commonly used by NFS servers."
msgstr ""
"Tas atgriež faila ext2 paaudzi.  Paaudze (ko agrāk sauca par „versiju”) ir "
