msgstr ""
" get-sockdir\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3530 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5782
msgid ""
"Get the directory used by the handle to store temporary socket and PID "
"files."
msgstr ""
"Iegūt direktoriju, ko rokturis izmanto pagaidu ligzdu un PID failu "
"glabāšanai."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3533
msgid ""
"This is different from L</get-tmpdir>, as we need shorter paths for sockets "
"(due to the limited buffers of filenames for UNIX sockets), and "
"L</get-tmpdir> may be too long for them.  Furthermore, sockets and PID files "
"must be accessible to such background services started by libguestfs that "
"may not have permission to access the temporary directory returned by "
"L</get-tmpdir>."
msgstr ""
"Tas atšķiras no L</get-tmpdir>, jo ligzdām vajadzīgi īsāki ceļi (UNIX ligzdu "
"failu nosaukumu ierobežoto buferu dēļ), un L</get-tmpdir> tām var būt pārāk "
"garš.  Turklāt ligzdām un PID failiem jābūt pieejamiem libguestfs palaistiem "
"fona pakalpojumiem, kuriem var nebūt atļaujas piekļūt L</get-tmpdir> "
"atgrieztajai pagaidu direktorijai."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3540 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5792
msgid ""
"The environment variable C<XDG_RUNTIME_DIR> controls the default value: If "
"C<XDG_RUNTIME_DIR> is set, then that is the default.  Else F</tmp> is the "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Noklusējuma vērtību kontrolē vides mainīgais C<XDG_RUNTIME_DIR>: ja "
"C<XDG_RUNTIME_DIR> ir iestatīts, tas ir noklusējums.  Citādi noklusējums ir "
"F</tmp>."

