"symlink itself, use L</lgetxattr>."
msgstr ""
"Iegūt vienu paplašināto atribūtu C<name> no faila C<path>.  Šis izsaukums "
"seko simboliskajām saitēm.  Ja vēlaties meklēt pašas simboliskās saites "
"paplašināto atribūtu, izmantojiet L</lgetxattr>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3596 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5625
msgid ""
"Normally it is better to get all extended attributes from a file in one go "
"by calling L</getxattrs>.  However some Linux filesystem implementations are "
"buggy and do not provide a way to list out attributes.  For these "
"filesystems (notably ntfs-3g)  you have to know the names of the extended "
"attributes you want in advance and call this function."
msgstr ""
"Parasti labāk ir iegūt visus faila paplašinātos atribūtus uzreiz, izsaucot "
"L</getxattrs>.  Tomēr dažas Linux failu sistēmu realizācijas ir kļūdainas un "
"nenodrošina veidu, kā uzskaitīt atribūtus.  Šādām failu sistēmām (it īpaši "
"ntfs-3g) iepriekš jāzina vajadzīgo paplašināto atribūtu nosaukumi un "
"jāizsauc šī funkcija."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3603 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5632
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5905 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:9050
msgid ""
"Extended attribute values are blobs of binary data.  If there is no extended "
"attribute named C<name>, this returns an error."
msgstr ""
"Paplašināto atribūtu vērtības ir bināro datu bloki.  Ja paplašinātā atribūta "
"C<name> nav, tas atgriež kļūdu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3606
msgid "See also: L</getxattrs>, L</lgetxattr>, L<attr(5)>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī: L</getxattrs>, L</lgetxattr>, L<attr(5)>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3608 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3623
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5637 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5648
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5841 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5874
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:6297 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:8042
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:8933
msgid ""
"This command depends on the feature C<linuxxattrs>.  See also "
"L</feature-available>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda ir atkarīga no līdzekļa C<linuxxattrs>.  Skatīt arī L</feature-"
"available>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3611
msgid "getxattrs"
msgstr "getxattrs"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3613
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" getxattrs path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" getxattrs path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3615 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5925
msgid "This call lists the extended attributes of the file or directory C<path>."
msgstr ""
"Šis izsaukums uzskaita faila vai direktorijas C<path> paplašinātos atribūtus."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3618 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5928
msgid ""
"At the system call level, this is a combination of the L<listxattr(2)> and "
"L<getxattr(2)> calls."
msgstr ""
"Sistēmas izsaukumu līmenī tā ir L<listxattr(2)> un L<getxattr(2)> izsaukumu "
"kombinācija."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3621
msgid "See also: L</lgetxattrs>, L<attr(5)>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī: L</lgetxattrs>, L<attr(5)>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3626
msgid "glob-expand"
msgstr "glob-expand"

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3628
msgid "glob-expand-opts"
msgstr "glob-expand-opts"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3630
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" glob-expand pattern [directoryslash:true|false]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" glob-expand pattern [directoryslash:true|false]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3632 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5969
msgid ""
"This command searches for all the pathnames matching C<pattern> according to "
"the wildcard expansion rules used by the shell."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda meklē visus ceļu nosaukumus, kas atbilst C<pattern> saskaņā ar "
"čaulas izmantotajām aizstājējzīmju izvēršanas kārtulām."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3636 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5973
msgid "If no paths match, then this returns an empty list (note: not an error)."
msgstr ""
"Ja neviens ceļš neatbilst, tas atgriež tukšu sarakstu (piezīme: nevis kļūdu)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3639 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5976
msgid ""
"It is just a wrapper around the C L<glob(3)> function with flags "
"C<GLOB_MARK|GLOB_BRACE>.  See that manual page for more details."
msgstr ""
"Tas ir tikai ietinējs ap C funkciju L<glob(3)> ar karogiem "
"C<GLOB_MARK|GLOB_BRACE>.  Sīkāk skatiet šo rokasgrāmatas lapu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3643 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:5980
msgid ""
"C<directoryslash> controls whether use the C<GLOB_MARK> flag for L<glob(3)>, "
"and it defaults to true.  It can be explicitly set as off to return no "
"trailing slashes in filenames of directories."
msgstr ""
"C<directoryslash> kontrolē, vai L<glob(3)> izmantot karogu C<GLOB_MARK>, un "
"pēc noklusējuma tas ir true.  To var eksplicīti izslēgt, lai direktoriju "
"failu nosaukumos neatgrieztu beigu slīpsvītras."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3647
msgid ""
"Notice that there is no equivalent command for expanding a device name "
"(eg. F</dev/sd*>).  Use L</list-devices>, L</list-partitions> etc functions "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Ņemiet vērā, ka nav līdzvērtīgas komandas ierīces nosaukuma izvēršanai "
"(piem., F</dev/sd*>).  Tā vietā izmantojiet funkcijas L</list-devices>, L</"
"list-partitions> u. c."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3653
msgid "grep"
msgstr "grep"

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3655
msgid "grep-opts"
msgstr "grep-opts"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3657
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" grep regex path [extended:true|false] [fixed:true|false] "
"[insensitive:true|false] [compressed:true|false]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" grep regex path [extended:true|false] [fixed:true|false] "
"[insensitive:true|false] [compressed:true|false]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3659 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6048
msgid "This calls the external L<grep(1)> program and returns the matching lines."
msgstr "Izsauc ārējo programmu L<grep(1)> un atgriež atbilstošās rindas."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3662 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6051
msgid "The optional flags are:"
msgstr "Neobligātie karogi ir:"

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3666 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6055
msgid "C<extended>"
msgstr "C<extended>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3668 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6057
msgid "Use extended regular expressions.  This is the same as using the I<-E> flag."
msgstr ""
"Izmantot paplašinātās regulārās izteiksmes.  Tas ir tas pats, kas karoga I<-"
"E> izmantošana."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3671 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6060
msgid "C<fixed>"
msgstr "C<fixed>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3673 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6062
msgid ""
"Match fixed (don't use regular expressions).  This is the same as using the "
"I<-F> flag."
msgstr ""
"Fiksēta atbilstība (neizmantot regulārās izteiksmes).  Tas ir tas pats, kas "
"karoga I<-F> izmantošana."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3676 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6065
msgid "C<insensitive>"
msgstr "C<insensitive>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3678 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6067
msgid "Match case-insensitive.  This is the same as using the I<-i> flag."
msgstr ""
"Reģistrnejutīga atbilstība.  Tas ir tas pats, kas karoga I<-i> izmantošana."

#. type: =item
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3680 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6069
msgid "C<compressed>"
msgstr "C<compressed>"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3682 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6071
msgid ""
"Use L<zgrep(1)> instead of L<grep(1)>.  This allows the input to be "
"compress- or gzip-compressed."
msgstr ""
"Izmantot L<zgrep(1)>, nevis L<grep(1)>.  Tas ļauj ievadei būt saspiestai ar "
"compress vai gzip."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3692
msgid "grepi"
msgstr "grepi"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3694
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" grepi regex path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" grepi regex path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3696 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6123
msgid "This calls the external C<grep -i> program and returns the matching lines."
msgstr "Izsauc ārējo programmu C<grep -i> un atgriež atbilstošās rindas."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3709
msgid "grub-install"
msgstr "grub-install"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3711
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" grub-install root device\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" grub-install root device\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3713 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6142
msgid ""
"This command installs GRUB 1 (the Grand Unified Bootloader) on C<device>, "
"with the root directory being C<root>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda instalē GRUB 1 (Grand Unified Bootloader) ierīcē C<device> ar "
"saknes direktoriju C<root>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3722 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6151
msgid ""
"There is currently no way in the API to install grub2, which is used by most "
"modern Linux guests.  It is possible to run the grub2 command from the "
"guest, although see the caveats in L<guestfs(3)/RUNNING COMMANDS>."
msgstr ""
"Pašlaik API nav veida, kā instalēt grub2, ko izmanto lielākā daļa moderno "
"Linux viesu.  Komandu grub2 iespējams izpildīt no viesa, lai gan skatiet "
"brīdinājumus L<guestfs(3)/KOMANDU IZPILDE>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3729 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6158
msgid ""
"This uses L<grub-install(8)> from the host.  Unfortunately grub is not "
"always compatible with itself, so this only works in rather narrow "
"circumstances.  Careful testing with each guest version is advisable."
msgstr ""
"Tas izmanto resursdatora L<grub-install(8)>.  Diemžēl grub ne vienmēr ir "
"saderīgs pats ar sevi, tāpēc tas darbojas tikai diezgan šauros apstākļos.  "
"Ieteicama rūpīga testēšana ar katru viesa versiju."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3736 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6165
msgid ""
"If grub-install reports the error \"No suitable drive was found in the "
"generated device map.\" it may be that you need to create a "
"F</boot/grub/device.map> file first that contains the mapping between grub "
"device names and Linux device names.  It is usually sufficient to create a "
"file containing:"
msgstr ""
"Ja grub-install ziņo kļūdu \"No suitable drive was found in the generated "
"device map.\", iespējams, vispirms jāizveido fails F</boot/grub/device.map>, "
"kas satur kartēšanu starp grub ierīču nosaukumiem un Linux ierīču "
"nosaukumiem.  Parasti pietiek izveidot failu ar šādu saturu:"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3743 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6172
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" (hd0) /dev/vda\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" (hd0) /dev/vda\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3745 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6174
msgid "replacing F</dev/vda> with the name of the installation device."
msgstr "aizstājot F</dev/vda> ar instalēšanas ierīces nosaukumu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3749
msgid ""
"This command depends on the feature C<grub>.  See also "
"L</feature-available>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda ir atkarīga no līdzekļa C<grub>.  Skatīt arī L</feature-available>"
"."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3752
msgid "head"
msgstr "head"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3754
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" head path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" head path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3756 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6191
msgid ""
"This command returns up to the first 10 lines of a file as a list of "
"strings."
msgstr "Šī komanda atgriež līdz 10 pirmajām faila rindām kā virkņu sarakstu."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3762
msgid "head-n"
msgstr "head-n"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3764
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" head-n nrlines path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" head-n nrlines path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3766 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6210
msgid ""
"If the parameter C<nrlines> is a positive number, this returns the first "
"C<nrlines> lines of the file C<path>."
msgstr ""
"Ja parametrs C<nrlines> ir pozitīvs skaitlis, tas atgriež faila C<path> "
"pirmās C<nrlines> rindas."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3769 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6213
msgid ""
"If the parameter C<nrlines> is a negative number, this returns lines from "
"the file C<path>, excluding the last C<nrlines> lines."
msgstr ""
"Ja parametrs C<nrlines> ir negatīvs skaitlis, tas atgriež faila C<path> "
"rindas, izņemot pēdējās C<nrlines> rindas."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3772 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:9348
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6216 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:15067
msgid "If the parameter C<nrlines> is zero, this returns an empty list."
msgstr "Ja parametrs C<nrlines> ir nulle, tas atgriež tukšu sarakstu."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3777
msgid "hexdump"
msgstr "hexdump"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3779
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hexdump path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hexdump path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3781 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6233
msgid ""
"This runs C<hexdump -C> on the given C<path>.  The result is the "
"human-readable, canonical hex dump of the file."
msgstr ""
"Tas izpilda C<hexdump -C> dotajam C<path>.  Rezultāts ir cilvēkam lasāma, "
"kanoniska faila heksadecimālā izmešana."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3787
msgid "hivex-close"
msgstr "hivex-close"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3789
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hivex-close\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hivex-close\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3791 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6249
msgid "Close the current hivex handle."
msgstr "Aizvērt pašreizējo hivex rokturi."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3793 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3809
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3820 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3831
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3842 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3854
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3867 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3878
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3889 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3901
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3912 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3925
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3938 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3949
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3977 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4012
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6251 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6273
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6291 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6308
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6327 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6346
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6366 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6383
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6401 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6423
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6440 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6472
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6510 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6527
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6569 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6618
msgid "This is a wrapper around the L<hivex(3)> call of the same name."
msgstr "Tas ir ietinējs ap tāda paša nosaukuma L<hivex(3)> izsaukumu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3795 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3811
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3822 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3833
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3844 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3856
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3869 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3880
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3891 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3903
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3914 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3929
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3940 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3951
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3968 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3979
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4003 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4016
msgid ""
"This command depends on the feature C<hivex>.  See also "
"L</feature-available>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda ir atkarīga no līdzekļa C<hivex>.  Skatīt arī L</feature-"
"available>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3798
msgid "hivex-commit"
msgstr "hivex-commit"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3800
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hivex-commit filename\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hivex-commit filename\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3802 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6266
msgid "Commit (write) changes to the hive."
msgstr "Iesniegt (ierakstīt) izmaiņas stropā."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3804 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6268
msgid ""
"If the optional F<filename> parameter is null, then the changes are written "
"back to the same hive that was opened.  If this is not null then they are "
"written to the alternate filename given and the original hive is left "
"untouched."
msgstr ""
"Ja neobligātais parametrs F<filename> ir null, izmaiņas tiek ierakstītas "
"atpakaļ tajā pašā stropā, kas tika atvērts.  Ja tas nav null, tās tiek "
"ierakstītas dotajā alternatīvajā failā, un oriģinālais strops paliek "
"neskarts."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3814
msgid "hivex-node-add-child"
msgstr "hivex-node-add-child"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3816
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hivex-node-add-child parent name\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hivex-node-add-child parent name\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3818 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6289
msgid "Add a child node to C<parent> named C<name>."
msgstr "Pievienot C<parent> bērnmezglu ar nosaukumu C<name>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3825
msgid "hivex-node-children"
msgstr "hivex-node-children"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3827
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hivex-node-children nodeh\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hivex-node-children nodeh\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3829 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6306
msgid "Return the list of nodes which are subkeys of C<nodeh>."
msgstr "Atgriezt mezglu sarakstu, kas ir C<nodeh> apakšatslēgas."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3836
msgid "hivex-node-delete-child"
msgstr "hivex-node-delete-child"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3838
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hivex-node-delete-child nodeh\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hivex-node-delete-child nodeh\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3840 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6325
msgid "Delete C<nodeh>, recursively if necessary."
msgstr "Dzēst C<nodeh>, ja nepieciešams, rekursīvi."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3847
msgid "hivex-node-get-child"
msgstr "hivex-node-get-child"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3849
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hivex-node-get-child nodeh name\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hivex-node-get-child nodeh name\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3851 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6343
msgid ""
"Return the child of C<nodeh> with the name C<name>, if it exists.  This can "
"return C<0> meaning the name was not found."
msgstr ""
"Atgriezt C<nodeh> bērnu ar nosaukumu C<name>, ja tāds eksistē.  Tas var "
"atgriezt C<0>, kas nozīmē, ka nosaukums netika atrasts."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3859
msgid "hivex-node-get-value"
msgstr "hivex-node-get-value"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3861
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hivex-node-get-value nodeh key\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hivex-node-get-value nodeh key\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3863 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6362
msgid ""
"Return the value attached to C<nodeh> which has the name C<key>, if it "
"exists.  This can return C<0> meaning the key was not found."
msgstr ""
"Atgriezt C<nodeh> piesaistīto vērtību ar nosaukumu C<key>, ja tāda eksistē.  "
"Tas var atgriezt C<0>, kas nozīmē, ka atslēga netika atrasta."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3872
msgid "hivex-node-name"
msgstr "hivex-node-name"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3874
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hivex-node-name nodeh\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hivex-node-name nodeh\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3876 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6381
msgid "Return the name of C<nodeh>."
msgstr "Atgriezt C<nodeh> nosaukumu."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3883
msgid "hivex-node-parent"
msgstr "hivex-node-parent"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3885
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hivex-node-parent nodeh\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hivex-node-parent nodeh\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3887 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6399
msgid "Return the parent node of C<nodeh>."
msgstr "Atgriezt C<nodeh> vecākmezglu."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3894
msgid "hivex-node-set-value"
msgstr "hivex-node-set-value"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3896
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hivex-node-set-value nodeh key t val\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hivex-node-set-value nodeh key t val\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3898 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6420
msgid ""
"Set or replace a single value under the node C<nodeh>.  The C<key> is the "
"name, C<t> is the type, and C<val> is the data."
msgstr ""
"Iestatīt vai aizstāt vienu vērtību zem mezgla C<nodeh>.  C<key> ir "
"nosaukums, C<t> ir tips, un C<val> ir dati."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3906
msgid "hivex-node-values"
msgstr "hivex-node-values"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3908
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hivex-node-values nodeh\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hivex-node-values nodeh\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3910 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6438
msgid "Return the array of (key, datatype, data) tuples attached to C<nodeh>."
msgstr ""
"Atgriezt C<nodeh> piesaistīto (atslēga, datu tips, dati) kortežu masīvu."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3917
msgid "hivex-open"
msgstr "hivex-open"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3919
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hivex-open filename [verbose:true|false] [debug:true|false] "
"[write:true|false] [unsafe:true|false]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hivex-open filename [verbose:true|false] [debug:true|false] "
"[write:true|false] [unsafe:true|false]\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3921 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6468
msgid ""
"Open the Windows Registry hive file named F<filename>.  If there was any "
"previous hivex handle associated with this guestfs session, then it is "
"closed."
msgstr ""
"Atvērt Windows reģistra stropa failu F<filename>.  Ja ar šo guestfs sesiju "
"bija saistīts kāds iepriekšējs hivex rokturis, tas tiek aizvērts."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3932
msgid "hivex-root"
msgstr "hivex-root"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3934
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hivex-root\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hivex-root\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3936 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6508
msgid "Return the root node of the hive."
msgstr "Atgriezt stropa saknes mezglu."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3943
msgid "hivex-value-key"
msgstr "hivex-value-key"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3945
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hivex-value-key valueh\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hivex-value-key valueh\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3947 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6525
msgid "Return the key (name) field of a (key, datatype, data) tuple."
msgstr "Atgriezt (atslēga, datu tips, dati) korteža atslēgas (nosaukuma) lauku."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3954
msgid "hivex-value-string"
msgstr "hivex-value-string"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3956
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hivex-value-string valueh\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hivex-value-string valueh\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3958 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3986
msgid ""
"This calls L</hivex-value-value> (which returns the data field from a hivex "
"value tuple).  It then assumes that the field is a UTF-16LE string and "
"converts the result to UTF-8 (or if this is not possible, it returns an "
"error)."
msgstr ""
"Tas izsauc L</hivex-value-value> (kas atgriež datu lauku no hivex vērtības "
"korteža).  Pēc tam tas pieņem, ka lauks ir UTF-16LE virkne, un pārvērš "
"rezultātu UTF-8 (vai, ja tas nav iespējams, atgriež kļūdu)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3963 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3991
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6548 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6596
msgid ""
"This is useful for reading strings out of the Windows registry.  However it "
"is not foolproof because the registry is not strongly-typed and fields can "
"contain arbitrary or unexpected data."
msgstr ""
"Tas noder virkņu nolasīšanai no Windows reģistra.  Tomēr tas nav nekļūdīgs, "
"jo reģistrs nav stingri tipizēts un lauki var saturēt patvaļīgus vai "
"negaidītus datus."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3971
msgid "hivex-value-type"
msgstr "hivex-value-type"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3973
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hivex-value-type valueh\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hivex-value-type valueh\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3975 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6567
msgid "Return the data type field from a (key, datatype, data) tuple."
msgstr "Atgriezt (atslēga, datu tips, dati) korteža datu tipa lauku."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3982
msgid "hivex-value-utf8"
msgstr "hivex-value-utf8"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3984
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hivex-value-utf8 valueh\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hivex-value-utf8 valueh\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:3996
msgid ""
"I<This function is deprecated.> In new code, use the L</hivex-value-string> "
"call instead."
msgstr ""
"I<Šī funkcija ir novecojusi.> Jaunā kodā tā vietā izmantojiet izsaukumu L</"
"hivex-value-string>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4006
msgid "hivex-value-value"
msgstr "hivex-value-value"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4008
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" hivex-value-value valueh\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" hivex-value-value valueh\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4010 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6616
msgid "Return the data field of a (key, datatype, data) tuple."
msgstr "Atgriezt (atslēga, datu tips, dati) korteža datu lauku."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4014
msgid "See also: L</hivex-value-utf8>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī: L</hivex-value-utf8>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4019
msgid "initrd-cat"
msgstr "initrd-cat"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4021
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" initrd-cat initrdpath filename\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" initrd-cat initrdpath filename\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4023 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6639
msgid ""
"This command unpacks the file F<filename> from the initrd file called "
"F<initrdpath>.  The filename must be given I<without> the initial F</> "
"character."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda izpako failu F<filename> no initrd faila F<initrdpath>.  Faila "
"nosaukums jānorāda I<bez> sākuma rakstzīmes F</>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4027 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6643
msgid ""
"For example, in guestfish you could use the following command to examine the "
"boot script (usually called F</init>)  contained in a Linux initrd or "
"initramfs image:"
msgstr ""
"Piemēram, guestfish varētu izmantot šo komandu, lai apskatītu sāknēšanas "
"skriptu (parasti F</init>), kas atrodas Linux initrd vai initramfs attēlā:"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4031 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6647
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" initrd-cat /boot/initrd-<version>.img init\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" initrd-cat /boot/initrd-<version>.img init\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4033
msgid "See also L</initrd-list>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī L</initrd-list>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4038
msgid "initrd-list"
msgstr "initrd-list"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4040
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" initrd-list path\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" initrd-list path\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4042 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6666
msgid "This command lists out files contained in an initrd."
msgstr "Šī komanda uzskaita initrd esošos failus."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4044 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6668
msgid ""
"The files are listed without any initial F</> character.  The files are "
"listed in the order they appear (not necessarily alphabetical).  Directory "
"names are listed as separate items."
msgstr ""
"Faili tiek uzskaitīti bez sākuma rakstzīmes F</>.  Faili tiek uzskaitīti "
"secībā, kādā tie parādās (ne obligāti alfabētiski).  Direktoriju nosaukumi "
"tiek uzskaitīti kā atsevišķi vienumi."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4048 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6672
msgid ""
"Old Linux kernels (2.4 and earlier) used a compressed ext2 filesystem as "
"initrd.  We I<only> support the newer initramfs format (compressed cpio "
"files)."
msgstr ""
"Vecie Linux kodoli (2.4 un vecāki) kā initrd izmantoja saspiestu ext2 failu "
"sistēmu.  Mēs atbalstām I<tikai> jaunāko initramfs formātu (saspiestus cpio "
"failus)."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4052
msgid "inotify-add-watch"
msgstr "inotify-add-watch"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4054
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" inotify-add-watch path mask\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" inotify-add-watch path mask\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4056 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6689
msgid "Watch C<path> for the events listed in C<mask>."
msgstr "Vērot C<path> attiecībā uz C<mask> uzskaitītajiem notikumiem."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4058 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6691
msgid ""
"Note that if C<path> is a directory then events within that directory are "
"watched, but this does I<not> happen recursively (in subdirectories)."
msgstr ""
"Ņemiet vērā, ka, ja C<path> ir direktorija, tiek vēroti notikumi šajā "
"direktorijā, taču tas I<nenotiek> rekursīvi (apakšdirektorijās)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4062 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6695
msgid ""
"Note for non-C or non-Linux callers: the inotify events are defined by the "
"Linux kernel ABI and are listed in F</usr/include/sys/inotify.h>."
msgstr ""
"Piezīme ne-C vai ne-Linux izsaucējiem: inotify notikumus definē Linux kodola "
"ABI, un tie uzskaitīti F</usr/include/sys/inotify.h>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4066 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4077
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4088 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4129
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4147 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4157
msgid ""
"This command depends on the feature C<inotify>.  See also "
"L</feature-available>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda ir atkarīga no līdzekļa C<inotify>.  Skatīt arī L</feature-"
"available>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4069
msgid "inotify-close"
msgstr "inotify-close"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4071
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" inotify-close\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" inotify-close\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4073 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6711
msgid ""
"This closes the inotify handle which was previously opened by inotify_init.  "
"It removes all watches, throws away any pending events, and deallocates all "
"resources."
msgstr ""
"Tas aizver inotify rokturi, kas iepriekš atvērts ar inotify_init.  Tas noņem "
"visas vērošanas, izmet visus gaidošos notikumus un atbrīvo visus resursus."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4080
msgid "inotify-files"
msgstr "inotify-files"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4082
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" inotify-files\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" inotify-files\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4084
msgid ""
"This function is a helpful wrapper around L</inotify-read> which just "
"returns a list of pathnames of objects that were touched.  The returned "
"pathnames are sorted and deduplicated."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija ir noderīgs ietinējs ap L</inotify-read>, kas vienkārši atgriež "
"aizskarto objektu ceļu nosaukumu sarakstu.  Atgrieztie ceļu nosaukumi ir "
"sakārtoti un bez dublikātiem."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4091
msgid "inotify-init"
msgstr "inotify-init"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4093
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" inotify-init maxevents\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" inotify-init maxevents\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4095 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6746
msgid ""
"This command creates a new inotify handle.  The inotify subsystem can be "
"used to notify events which happen to objects in the guest filesystem."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda izveido jaunu inotify rokturi.  Inotify apakšsistēmu var "
"izmantot, lai paziņotu par notikumiem, kas notiek ar objektiem viesa failu "
"sistēmā."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4099
msgid ""
"C<maxevents> is the maximum number of events which will be queued up between "
"calls to L</inotify-read> or L</inotify-files>.  If this is passed as C<0>, "
"then the kernel (or previously set)  default is used.  For Linux 2.6.29 the "
"default was 16384 events.  Beyond this limit, the kernel throws away events, "
"but records the fact that it threw them away by setting a flag "
"C<IN_Q_OVERFLOW> in the returned structure list (see L</inotify-read>)."
msgstr ""
"C<maxevents> ir maksimālais notikumu skaits, kas tiks ierindots starp L</"
"inotify-read> vai L</inotify-files> izsaukumiem.  Ja tas nodots kā C<0>, "
"tiek izmantots kodola (vai iepriekš iestatītais) noklusējums.  Linux 2.6.29 "
"noklusējums bija 16384 notikumi.  Pārsniedzot šo ierobežojumu, kodols izmet "
"notikumus, bet fiksē faktu, ka tos izmeta, iestatot karogu C<IN_Q_OVERFLOW> "
"atgrieztajā struktūru sarakstā (skatiet L</inotify-read>)."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4109
msgid ""
"Before any events are generated, you have to add some watches to the "
"internal watch list.  See: L</inotify-add-watch> and L</inotify-rm-watch>."
msgstr ""
"Pirms tiek ģenerēti jebkādi notikumi, iekšējam vērošanas sarakstam "
"jāpievieno dažas vērošanas.  Skatiet: L</inotify-add-watch> un L</inotify-rm-"
"watch>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4113
msgid ""
"Queued up events should be read periodically by calling L</inotify-read> (or "
"L</inotify-files> which is just a helpful wrapper around L</inotify-read>).  "
"If you don't read the events out often enough then you risk the internal "
"queue overflowing."
msgstr ""
"Ierindotie notikumi periodiski jānolasa, izsaucot L</inotify-read> (vai L</"
"inotify-files>, kas ir tikai noderīgs ietinējs ap L</inotify-read>).  Ja "
"notikumus nenolasāt pietiekami bieži, riskējat ar iekšējās rindas pārpildi."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4120
msgid ""
"The handle should be closed after use by calling L</inotify-close>.  This "
"also removes any watches automatically."
msgstr ""
"Pēc lietošanas rokturis jāaizver, izsaucot L</inotify-close>.  Tas arī "
"automātiski noņem visas vērošanas."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4124 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6775
msgid ""
"See also L<inotify(7)> for an overview of the inotify interface as exposed "
"by the Linux kernel, which is roughly what we expose via libguestfs.  Note "
"that there is one global inotify handle per libguestfs instance."
msgstr ""
"Skatīt arī L<inotify(7)> pārskatam par inotify saskarni, kā to atklāj Linux "
"kodols, kas aptuveni ir tas, ko atklājam caur libguestfs.  Ņemiet vērā, ka "
"katrai libguestfs instancei ir viens globāls inotify rokturis."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4132
msgid "inotify-read"
msgstr "inotify-read"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4134
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" inotify-read\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" inotify-read\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4136 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6792
msgid ""
"Return the complete queue of events that have happened since the previous "
"read call."
msgstr ""
"Atgriezt pilnu notikumu rindu, kas notikuši kopš iepriekšējā lasīšanas "
"izsaukuma."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4139 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6795
msgid "If no events have happened, this returns an empty list."
msgstr "Ja notikumu nav bijis, tas atgriež tukšu sarakstu."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4141 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6797
msgid ""
"I<Note>: In order to make sure that all events have been read, you must call "
"this function repeatedly until it returns an empty list.  The reason is that "
"the call will read events up to the maximum appliance-to-host message size "
"and leave remaining events in the queue."
msgstr ""
"I<Piezīme>: lai pārliecinātos, ka visi notikumi ir nolasīti, šī funkcija "
"jāizsauc atkārtoti, līdz tā atgriež tukšu sarakstu.  Iemesls ir tāds, ka "
"izsaukums nolasīs notikumus līdz maksimālajam palīgsistēmas-resursdatora "
"ziņojuma izmēram un atstās atlikušos notikumus rindā."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4150
msgid "inotify-rm-watch"
msgstr "inotify-rm-watch"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4152
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" inotify-rm-watch wd\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" inotify-rm-watch wd\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4154
msgid "Remove a previously defined inotify watch.  See L</inotify-add-watch>."
msgstr ""
"Noņemt iepriekš definētu inotify vērošanu.  Skatiet L</inotify-add-watch>."

#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4160
msgid "inspect-get-arch"
msgstr "inspect-get-arch"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4162
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" inspect-get-arch root\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" inspect-get-arch root\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4164
msgid ""
"This returns the architecture of the inspected operating system.  The "
"possible return values are listed under L</file-architecture>."
msgstr ""
"Tas atgriež inspicētās operētājsistēmas arhitektūru.  Iespējamās atgriešanas "
"vērtības ir uzskaitītas pie L</file-architecture>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4168 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6838
msgid ""
"If the architecture could not be determined, then the string C<unknown> is "
"returned."
msgstr "Ja arhitektūru nevarēja noteikt, tiek atgriezta virkne C<unknown>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4171 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4188
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4379 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4456
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4476 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4560
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4636 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4657
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4671 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4711
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4763 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4776
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4797 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4813
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4829 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4842
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4850 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4866
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4882 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4986
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5102 fish/guestfish-actions.pod:5136
