#. type: =head2
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4173
msgid "inspect-get-build-id"
msgstr "inspect-get-build-id"

#. type: verbatim
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4175
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" inspect-get-build-id root\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" inspect-get-build-id root\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4177 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6854
msgid ""
"This returns the build ID of the system, or the string C<\"unknown\"> if the "
"system does not have a build ID."
msgstr ""
"Tas atgriež sistēmas būvējuma ID vai virkni C<\"unknown\">, ja sistēmai nav "
"būvējuma ID."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4180 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6857
msgid ""
"For Windows, this gets the build number.  Although it is returned as a "
"string, it is (so far) always a number.  See "
"L<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Microsoft_Windows_versions> for some "
"possible values."
msgstr ""
"Windows gadījumā tas iegūst būvējuma numuru.  Lai gan tas tiek atgriezts kā "
"virkne, tas (līdz šim) vienmēr ir skaitlis.  Dažas iespējamās vērtības "
"skatiet L<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Microsoft_Windows_versions>."

#. type: textblock
#: fish/guestfish-actions.pod:4185 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:6862
msgid ""
"For Linux, this returns the C<BUILD_ID> string from F</etc/os-release>, "
"although this is not often used."
msgstr ""
"Linux gadījumā tas atgriež virkni C<BUILD_ID> no F</etc/os-release>, lai gan "
"to neizmanto bieži."

