#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:172
msgid ""
"This function adds the disk(s) attached to the named libvirt domain C<dom>.  "
"It works by connecting to libvirt, requesting the domain and domain XML from "
"libvirt, parsing it for disks, and calling C<guestfs_add_drive_opts> on each "
"one."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija pievieno nosauktajam libvirt domēnam C<dom> pievienoto(-s) disku"
"(-s).  Tā darbojas, savienojoties ar libvirt, pieprasot no libvirt domēnu un "
"domēna XML, parsējot to, lai atrastu diskus, un katram no tiem izsaucot "
"C<guestfs_add_drive_opts>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:248 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:742
msgid ""
"If present, the value of C<logical_block_size> attribute of "
"E<lt>blockio/E<gt> tag in libvirt XML will be passed as C<blocksize> "
"parameter to C<guestfs_add_drive_opts>."
msgstr ""
"Ja ir, libvirt XML taga E<lt>blockio/E<gt> atribūta C<logical_block_size> "
"vērtība tiks nodota C<guestfs_add_drive_opts> kā parametrs C<blocksize>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:252 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:746
msgid ""
"The other optional parameters are passed directly through to "
"C<guestfs_add_drive_opts>."
msgstr ""
"Pārējie neobligātie parametri tiek nodoti tieši C<guestfs_add_drive_opts>."

