msgid ""
"When this function is called before C<guestfs_launch> (the usual case) then "
"the first time you call this function, the disk appears in the API as "
"F</dev/sda>, the second time as F</dev/sdb>, and so on."
msgstr ""
"Ja šo funkciju izsauc pirms C<guestfs_launch> (parastais gadījums), tad "
"pirmajā izsaukšanas reizē disks API parādās kā F</dev/sda>, otrajā kā F</dev/"
"sdb> un tā tālāk."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:351
msgid ""
"This forces the image format.  If you omit this (or use C<guestfs_add_drive> "
"or C<guestfs_add_drive_ro>) then the format is automatically detected.  "
"Possible formats include C<raw> and C<qcow2>."
msgstr ""
"Tas piespiež attēla formātu.  Ja to izlaižat (vai izmantojat "
"C<guestfs_add_drive> vai C<guestfs_add_drive_ro>), formāts tiek noteikts "
"automātiski.  Iespējamie formāti ietver C<raw> un C<qcow2>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:362
msgid ""
"This rarely-used option lets you emulate the behaviour of the deprecated "
"C<guestfs_add_drive_with_if> call (q.v.)"
msgstr ""
"Šī reti izmantotā opcija ļauj emulēt novecojušā izsaukuma "
"C<guestfs_add_drive_with_if> uzvedību (skat. tur)"

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:513
msgid ""
"Enable or disable discard (a.k.a. trim or unmap) support on this drive.  If "
"enabled, operations such as C<guestfs_fstrim> will be able to discard / make "
"thin / punch holes in the underlying host file or device."
msgstr ""
"Iespējot vai atspējot discard (jeb trim vai unmap) atbalstu šim diskam.  Ja "
"iespējots, tādas darbības kā C<guestfs_fstrim> varēs atmest / padarīt "
"plānu / izsist caurumus pamatā esošajā resursdatora failā vai ierīcē."

