#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:717
msgid ""
"This function adds the disk(s) attached to the libvirt domain C<dom>.  It "
"works by requesting the domain XML from libvirt, parsing it for disks, and "
"calling C<guestfs_add_drive_opts> on each one."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija pievieno libvirt domēnam C<dom> pievienoto(-s) disku(-s).  Tā "
"darbojas, pieprasot no libvirt domēna XML, parsējot to, lai atrastu diskus, "
"un katram no tiem izsaucot C<guestfs_add_drive_opts>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:721
msgid ""
"In the C API we declare C<void *dom>, but really it has type C<virDomainPtr "
"dom>.  This is so we don't need E<lt>libvirt.hE<gt>."
msgstr ""
"C API deklarējam C<void *dom>, bet patiesībā tam ir tips C<virDomainPtr dom>"
".  Tas ir tāpēc, lai mums nebūtu vajadzīgs E<lt>libvirt.hE<gt>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:738
msgid ""
"The optional C<readonlydisk> parameter controls what we do for disks which "
"are marked E<lt>readonly/E<gt> in the libvirt XML.  See "
"C<guestfs_add_domain> for possible values."
msgstr ""
"Neobligātais parametrs C<readonlydisk> kontrolē, ko darām ar diskiem, kas "
"libvirt XML atzīmēti ar E<lt>readonly/E<gt>.  Iespējamās vērtības skatiet "
"C<guestfs_add_domain>."

