"\n"
msgstr ""
" int\n"
" guestfs_available (guestfs_h *g,\n"
"                    char *const *groups);\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1141
msgid ""
"The libguestfs groups, and the functions that those groups correspond to, "
"are listed in L<guestfs(3)/AVAILABILITY>.  You can also fetch this list at "
"runtime by calling C<guestfs_available_all_groups>."
msgstr ""
"Libguestfs grupas un funkcijas, kurām šīs grupas atbilst, ir uzskaitītas "
"L<guestfs(3)/PIEEJAMĪBA>.  Šo sarakstu var iegūt arī izpildlaikā, izsaucot "
"C<guestfs_available_all_groups>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1165
msgid ""
"C<guestfs_feature_available> is the same as this call, but with a slightly "
"simpler to use API: that call returns a boolean true/false instead of "
"throwing an error."
msgstr ""
"C<guestfs_feature_available> ir tas pats, kas šis izsaukums, bet ar nedaudz "
"vienkāršāk lietojamu API: tas atgriež Būla true/false, nevis izmet kļūdu."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1171
msgid "You must call C<guestfs_launch> before calling this function."
msgstr "Pirms šīs funkcijas izsaukšanas jāizsauc C<guestfs_launch>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1193
msgid ""
"This call was added in version C<1.0.80>.  In previous versions of "
"libguestfs all you could do would be to speculatively execute a command to "
"find out if the daemon implemented it.  See also C<guestfs_version>."
msgstr ""
"Šis izsaukums tika pievienots versijā C<1.0.80>.  Iepriekšējās libguestfs "
"versijās vienīgais, ko varēja darīt, bija spekulatīvi izpildīt komandu, lai "
"noskaidrotu, vai dēmons to realizē.  Skatīt arī C<guestfs_version>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1200
msgid "See also C<guestfs_filesystem_available>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī C<guestfs_filesystem_available>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1204 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3696
msgid "(Added in 1.0.80)"
msgstr "(Pievienots versijā 1.0.80)"

#. type: =head2
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1206
msgid "guestfs_available_all_groups"
msgstr "guestfs_available_all_groups"

#. type: verbatim
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1208
#, no-wrap
