" char **\n"
" guestfs_available_all_groups (guestfs_h *g);\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" char **\n"
" guestfs_available_all_groups (guestfs_h *g);\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1211
msgid ""
"This command returns a list of all optional groups that this daemon knows "
"about.  Note this returns both supported and unsupported groups.  To find "
"out which ones the daemon can actually support you have to call "
"C<guestfs_available> / C<guestfs_feature_available> on each member of the "
"returned list."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda atgriež visu neobligāto grupu sarakstu, par kurām šis dēmons "
"zina.  Ņemiet vērā, ka tas atgriež gan atbalstītās, gan neatbalstītās "
"grupas.  Lai noskaidrotu, kuras dēmons faktiski var atbalstīt, katram "
"atgrieztā saraksta loceklim jāizsauc C<guestfs_available> / "
"C<guestfs_feature_available>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1217
msgid ""
"See also C<guestfs_available>, C<guestfs_feature_available> and "
"L<guestfs(3)/AVAILABILITY>."
msgstr ""
"Skatīt arī C<guestfs_available>, C<guestfs_feature_available> un L<guestfs"
"(3)/PIEEJAMĪBA>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1224
