#. type: verbatim
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1256
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" int\n"
" guestfs_blkdiscard (guestfs_h *g,\n"
"                     const char *device);\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" int\n"
" guestfs_blkdiscard (guestfs_h *g,\n"
"                     const char *device);\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1263
msgid ""
"This operation requires support in libguestfs, the host filesystem, qemu and "
"the host kernel.  If this support isn't present it may give an error or even "
"appear to run but do nothing.  You must also set the C<discard> attribute on "
"the underlying drive (see C<guestfs_add_drive_opts>)."
msgstr ""
"Šai darbībai nepieciešams atbalsts libguestfs, resursdatora failu sistēmā, "
"qemu un resursdatora kodolā.  Ja šī atbalsta nav, tā var dot kļūdu vai pat "
"šķietami izpildīties, bet neko nedarīt.  Jāiestata arī pamatā esošā diska "
"atribūts C<discard> (skatiet C<guestfs_add_drive_opts>)."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1271
msgid ""
"This function depends on the feature C<blkdiscard>.  See also "
"L</guestfs_feature_available>."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija ir atkarīga no līdzekļa C<blkdiscard>.  Skatīt arī L</"
"guestfs_feature_available>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1274 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1294
msgid "(Added in 1.25.44)"
msgstr "(Pievienots versijā 1.25.44)"

