"                           const char *device);\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:1282
msgid ""
"This call returns true if blocks on C<device> that have been discarded by a "
"call to C<guestfs_blkdiscard> are returned as blocks of zero bytes when read "
"the next time."
msgstr ""
"Šis izsaukums atgriež true, ja bloki ierīcē C<device>, kas atmesti ar "
"C<guestfs_blkdiscard> izsaukumu, nākamajā lasīšanas reizē tiek atgriezti kā "
"nulles baitu bloki."

