#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2609
msgid ""
"Because, in C, this function returns a C<char *>, there is no way to "
"differentiate between a C<\\0> character in a file and end of string.  To "
"handle binary files, use the C<guestfs_read_file> or C<guestfs_download> "
"functions."
msgstr ""
"Tā kā C valodā šī funkcija atgriež C<char *>, nav veida, kā atšķirt C<\\0> "
"rakstzīmi failā no virknes beigām.  Bināro failu apstrādei izmantojiet "
"funkcijas C<guestfs_read_file> vai C<guestfs_download>."

