#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2801
msgid ""
"This command will fail if networking has not been enabled for the "
"appliance. Refer to C<guestfs_set_network>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda neizdosies, ja palīgsistēmai nav iespējota tīklošana. Skatiet "
"C<guestfs_set_network>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2804
msgid ""
"The command creates a new block device called F</dev/mapper/mapname>.  Reads "
"and writes to this block device are decrypted from and encrypted to the "
"underlying C<device> respectively.  Close the decrypted block device with "
"C<guestfs_cryptsetup_close>."
msgstr ""
"Komanda izveido jaunu bloku ierīci F</dev/mapper/mapname>.  Lasīšana no šīs "
"bloku ierīces un rakstīšana tajā tiek attiecīgi atšifrēta no pamatā esošās "
"C<device> un šifrēta uz to.  Atšifrēto bloku ierīci aizveriet ar "
"C<guestfs_cryptsetup_close>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2812 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3626
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:9707
msgid ""
"If this block device contains LVM volume groups, then calling "
"C<guestfs_lvm_scan> with the C<activate> parameter C<true> will make them "
"visible."
msgstr ""
"Ja šajā bloku ierīcē ir LVM sējumu grupas, C<guestfs_lvm_scan> izsaukšana ar "
"parametru C<activate> C<true> padarīs tās redzamas."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2816 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:3630
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:9711
msgid "Use C<guestfs_list_dm_devices> to list all device mapper devices."
msgstr ""
"Lai uzskaitītu visas device mapper ierīces, izmantojiet "
"C<guestfs_list_dm_devices>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2820
msgid ""
"This function depends on the feature C<clevisluks>.  See also "
"L</guestfs_feature_available>."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija ir atkarīga no līdzekļa C<clevisluks>.  Skatīt arī L</"
"guestfs_feature_available>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2823
msgid "(Added in 1.49.3)"
msgstr "(Pievienots versijā 1.49.3)"

#. type: =head2
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2825
msgid "guestfs_command"
msgstr "guestfs_command"

#. type: verbatim
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2827
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" char *\n"
" guestfs_command (guestfs_h *g,\n"
"                  char *const *arguments);\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" char *\n"
" guestfs_command (guestfs_h *g,\n"
"                  char *const *arguments);\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2836
msgid ""
"The single parameter is an argv-style list of arguments.  The first element "
"is the name of the program to run.  Subsequent elements are parameters.  The "
"list must be non-empty (ie. must contain a program name).  Note that the "
"command runs directly, and is I<not> invoked via the shell (see "
"C<guestfs_sh>)."
msgstr ""
"Vienīgais parametrs ir argv stila argumentu saraksts.  Pirmais elements ir "
"izpildāmās programmas nosaukums.  Nākamie elementi ir parametri.  Sarakstam "
"jābūt netukšam (t. i., jāsatur programmas nosaukums).  Ņemiet vērā, ka "
"komanda tiek izpildīta tieši un I<netiek> izsaukta caur čaulu (skatiet "
"C<guestfs_sh>)."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2867 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:2887
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4527
msgid "(Added in 1.9.1)"
msgstr "(Pievienots versijā 1.9.1)"

