#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4338
msgid ""
"Install the SYSLINUX bootloader on the device mounted at F<directory>.  "
"Unlike C<guestfs_syslinux> which requires a FAT filesystem, this can be used "
"on an ext2/3/4 or btrfs filesystem."
msgstr ""
"Instalēt SYSLINUX sāknēšanas ielādētāju ierīcē, kas montēta F<directory>.  "
"Atšķirībā no C<guestfs_syslinux>, kam nepieciešama FAT failu sistēma, to var "
"izmantot ext2/3/4 vai btrfs failu sistēmā."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4345
msgid ""
"You also have to mark the partition as \"active\" "
"(C<guestfs_part_set_bootable>) and a Master Boot Record must be installed "
"(eg. using C<guestfs_pwrite_device>) on the first sector of the whole disk.  "
"The SYSLINUX package comes with some suitable Master Boot Records.  See the "
"L<extlinux(1)> man page for further information."
msgstr ""
"Nodalījums arī jāatzīmē kā „aktīvs” (C<guestfs_part_set_bootable>), un visa "
"diska pirmajā sektorā jāinstalē galvenais sāknēšanas ieraksts (piem., ar "
"C<guestfs_pwrite_device>).  SYSLINUX pakotnei ir daži piemēroti galvenie "
"sāknēšanas ieraksti.  Plašāku informāciju skatiet L<extlinux(1)> "
"rokasgrāmatas lapā."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4357
msgid "See also C<guestfs_syslinux>."
msgstr "Skatīt arī C<guestfs_syslinux>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:4361
msgid ""
"This function depends on the feature C<extlinux>.  See also "
"L</guestfs_feature_available>."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija ir atkarīga no līdzekļa C<extlinux>.  Skatīt arī L</"
"guestfs_feature_available>."

