#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:7523
msgid ""
"This function is a convenient way to get the list of root devices, as "
"returned from a previous call to C<guestfs_inspect_os>, but without redoing "
"the whole inspection process."
msgstr ""
