#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:8022
msgid ""
"You can pass the root string(s) returned to other C<guestfs_inspect_get_*> "
"functions in order to query further information about each operating system, "
"such as the name and version."
msgstr ""
"Atgriezto(-ās) saknes virkni(-es) varat nodot citām C<guestfs_inspect_get_*> "
"funkcijām, lai vaicātu papildu informāciju par katru operētājsistēmu, "
"piemēram, nosaukumu un versiju."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:8027
msgid ""
"This function uses other libguestfs features such as C<guestfs_mount_ro> and "
"C<guestfs_umount_all> in order to mount and unmount filesystems and look at "
"the contents.  This should be called with no disks currently mounted.  The "
"function may also use Augeas, so any existing Augeas handle will be closed."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija izmanto citus libguestfs līdzekļus, piemēram, "
"C<guestfs_mount_ro> un C<guestfs_umount_all>, lai montētu un atmontētu failu "
"sistēmas un apskatītu saturu.  To jāizsauc, kad neviens disks nav montēts.  "
"Funkcija var izmantot arī Augeas, tāpēc jebkurš esošs Augeas rokturis tiks "
"aizvērts."

