#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:8799
msgid ""
"Do not call C<guestfs_launch> twice on the same handle.  Although it will "
"not give an error (for historical reasons), the precise behaviour when you "
"do this is not well defined.  Handles are very cheap to create, so create a "
"new one for each launch."
msgstr ""
"Neizsauciet C<guestfs_launch> divreiz vienam rokturim.  Lai gan tas "
"(vēsturisku iemeslu dēļ) nedos kļūdu, precīzā uzvedība šādā gadījumā nav "
"labi definēta.  Rokturus ir ļoti lēti izveidot, tāpēc katrai palaišanai "
"izveidojiet jaunu."

#. type: =head2
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:8813
