#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:9151
msgid ""
"The returned list contains F</dev/mapper/*> devices, eg. ones created by a "
"previous call to C<guestfs_luks_open>."
msgstr ""
"Atgrieztais saraksts satur F</dev/mapper/*> ierīces, piem., tās, kas "
"izveidotas ar iepriekšēju C<guestfs_luks_open> izsaukumu."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:9154
msgid ""
"Device mapper devices which correspond to logical volumes are I<not> "
"returned in this list.  Call C<guestfs_lvs> if you want to list logical "
"volumes."
msgstr ""
"Device mapper ierīces, kas atbilst loģiskajiem sējumiem, šajā sarakstā "
"I<netiek> atgrieztas.  Ja vēlaties uzskaitīt loģiskos sējumus, izsauciet "
"C<guestfs_lvs>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:9162
msgid "(Added in 1.11.15)"
msgstr "(Pievienots versijā 1.11.15)"

#. type: =head2
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:9164
msgid "guestfs_list_filesystems"
msgstr "guestfs_list_filesystems"

#. type: verbatim
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:9166
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" char **\n"
" guestfs_list_filesystems (guestfs_h *g);\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" char **\n"
" guestfs_list_filesystems (guestfs_h *g);\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:9182
msgid ""
"The key is not necessarily a block device. It may also be an opaque "
"‘mountable’ string which can be passed to C<guestfs_mount>."
msgstr ""
"Atslēga ne vienmēr ir bloku ierīce. Tā var būt arī necaurredzama ‘montējamā "
"objekta’ virkne, ko var nodot C<guestfs_mount>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:9189
msgid ""
"In libguestfs E<le> 1.36 this command ran other libguestfs commands, which "
"might have included C<guestfs_mount> and C<guestfs_umount>, and therefore "
"you had to use this soon after launch and only when nothing else was "
"mounted.  This restriction is removed in libguestfs E<ge> 1.38."
msgstr ""
"Libguestfs E<le> 1.36 šī komanda izpildīja citas libguestfs komandas, kas, "
"iespējams, ietvēra C<guestfs_mount> un C<guestfs_umount>, un tāpēc to bija "
"jāizmanto drīz pēc palaišanas un tikai tad, kad nekas cits nebija montēts.  "
"Libguestfs E<ge> 1.38 šis ierobežojums ir noņemts."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:9195
msgid ""
"Not all of the filesystems returned will be mountable.  In particular, swap "
"partitions are returned in the list.  Also this command does not check that "
"each filesystem found is valid and mountable, and some filesystems might be "
"mountable but require special options.  Filesystems may not all belong to a "
"single logical operating system (use C<guestfs_inspect_os> to look for "
"OSes)."
msgstr ""
"Ne visas atgrieztās failu sistēmas būs montējamas.  It īpaši sarakstā tiek "
"atgriezti maiņatmiņas nodalījumi.  Turklāt šī komanda nepārbauda, vai katra "
"atrastā failu sistēma ir derīga un montējama, un dažas failu sistēmas var "
"būt montējamas, bet prasīt īpašas opcijas.  Failu sistēmas var nepiederēt "
"vienai loģiskai operētājsistēmai (OS meklēšanai izmantojiet "
"C<guestfs_inspect_os>)."

