#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:9462
msgid ""
"This is the same as C<guestfs_stat> except that if C<path> is a symbolic "
"link, then the link is stat-ed, not the file it refers to."
msgstr ""
"Tas ir tas pats, kas C<guestfs_stat>, izņemot to, ka, ja C<path> ir "
"simboliskā saite, stat tiek veikts saitei, nevis failam, uz kuru tā norāda."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:9468 lib/guestfs-actions.pod:14708
msgid ""
"This function returns a C<struct guestfs_stat *>, or NULL if there was an "
"error.  I<The caller must call C<guestfs_free_stat> after use>."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija atgriež C<struct guestfs_stat *> vai NULL, ja radās kļūda.  "
"I<Pēc lietošanas izsaucējam jāizsauc C<guestfs_free_stat>>."

