#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:9597
msgid ""
"This closes a LUKS device that was created earlier by C<guestfs_luks_open> "
"or C<guestfs_luks_open_ro>.  The C<device> parameter must be the name of the "
"LUKS mapping device (ie. F</dev/mapper/mapname>) and I<not> the name of the "
"underlying block device."
msgstr ""
"Tas aizver LUKS ierīci, kas iepriekš izveidota ar C<guestfs_luks_open> vai "
"C<guestfs_luks_open_ro>.  Parametram C<device> jābūt LUKS kartēšanas ierīces "
"nosaukumam (t. i., F</dev/mapper/mapname>), I<nevis> pamatā esošās bloku "
"ierīces nosaukumam."

