#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:11415
msgid ""
"This should only be called after C<guestfs_mount_local> returns "
"successfully.  The call will not return until the filesystem is unmounted."
msgstr ""
"To jāizsauc tikai pēc tam, kad C<guestfs_mount_local> ir veiksmīgi "
"atgriezies.  Izsaukums neatgriezīsies, kamēr failu sistēma nav atmontēta."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:11422
msgid ""
"You may call this from a different thread than the one which called "
"C<guestfs_mount_local>, subject to the usual rules for threads and "
"libguestfs (see L<guestfs(3)/MULTIPLE HANDLES AND MULTIPLE THREADS>)."
msgstr ""
"To var izsaukt no cita pavediena, nevis tā, kas izsauca "
"C<guestfs_mount_local>, ievērojot parastās pavedienu un libguestfs kārtulas "
"(skatiet L<guestfs(3)/VAIRĀKI ROKTURI UN VAIRĀKI PAVEDIENI>)."

