msgid ""
"This is the same as the C<guestfs_mount> command, but it mounts the "
"filesystem with the read-only (I<-o ro>) flag."
msgstr ""
"Tas ir tas pats, kas komanda C<guestfs_mount>, bet montē failu sistēmu ar "
"tikai lasīšanas (I<-o ro>) karogu."

