#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12014
msgid ""
"This command adds a partition to C<device>.  If there is no partition table "
"on the device, call C<guestfs_part_init> first."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda pievieno nodalījumu ierīcei C<device>.  Ja ierīcē nav nodalījumu "
"tabulas, vispirms izsauciet C<guestfs_part_init>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12026
msgid ""
"Creating a partition which covers the whole disk is not so easy.  Use "
"C<guestfs_part_disk> to do that."
msgstr ""
"Nodalījuma izveide, kas aptver visu disku, nav tik vienkārša.  Tam "
"izmantojiet C<guestfs_part_disk>."

