#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12057
msgid ""
"This command is simply a combination of C<guestfs_part_init> followed by "
"C<guestfs_part_add> to create a single primary partition covering the whole "
"disk."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda ir vienkārši C<guestfs_part_init> un tam sekojoša "
"C<guestfs_part_add> kombinācija, lai izveidotu vienu primāro nodalījumu, kas "
"aptver visu disku."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12061
msgid ""
"C<parttype> is the partition table type, usually C<mbr> or C<gpt>, but other "
"possible values are described in C<guestfs_part_init>."
msgstr ""
"C<parttype> ir nodalījumu tabulas tips, parasti C<mbr> vai C<gpt>, bet citas "
"iespējamās vērtības aprakstītas pie C<guestfs_part_init>."

