" guestfs_readdir (guestfs_h *g,\n"
"                  const char *dir);\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12923
msgid ""
"This function is primarily intended for use by programs.  To get a simple "
"list of names, use C<guestfs_ls>.  To get a printable directory for human "
"consumption, use C<guestfs_ll>."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija galvenokārt paredzēta programmām.  Lai iegūtu vienkāršu "
"nosaukumu sarakstu, izmantojiet C<guestfs_ls>.  Lai iegūtu cilvēkam "
"izdrukājamu direktoriju, izmantojiet C<guestfs_ll>."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:12927
msgid ""
"This function returns a C<struct guestfs_dirent_list *>, or NULL if there "
"was an error.  I<The caller must call C<guestfs_free_dirent_list> after "
"use>."
msgstr ""
"Šī funkcija atgriež C<struct guestfs_dirent_list *> vai NULL, ja radās "
"kļūda.  I<Pēc lietošanas izsaucējam jāizsauc C<guestfs_free_dirent_list>>."

