#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:13473
msgid ""
"This command creates the directory C<dir> and then fills it with files until "
"the filesystem is full, and scrubs the files as for C<guestfs_scrub_file>, "
"and deletes them.  The intention is to scrub any free space on the partition "
"containing C<dir>."
msgstr ""
"Šī komanda izveido direktoriju C<dir> un tad aizpilda to ar failiem, līdz "
"failu sistēma ir pilna, attīra failus kā C<guestfs_scrub_file> un dzēš tos.  "
"Mērķis ir attīrīt jebkuru brīvo vietu nodalījumā, kas satur C<dir>."

