#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:14162
msgid ""
"If this is called with the parameter C<false> then C<guestfs_launch> does "
"not create a recovery process.  The purpose of the recovery process is to "
"stop runaway hypervisor processes in the case where the main program aborts "
"abruptly."
msgstr ""
"Ja to izsauc ar parametru C<false>, C<guestfs_launch> neizveido atkopšanas "
"procesu.  Atkopšanas procesa mērķis ir apturēt aizbēgušus hipervizora "
"procesus gadījumā, ja galvenā programma pēkšņi pārtrauc darbību."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:14167
msgid ""
"This only has any effect if called before C<guestfs_launch>, and the default "
"is true."
msgstr ""
"Tam ir ietekme tikai tad, ja izsaukts pirms C<guestfs_launch>, un "
"noklusējums ir true."

