#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:14494
msgid ""
"This is a simplified interface to the C<guestfs_sfdisk> command, where "
"partition sizes are specified in megabytes only (rounded to the nearest "
"cylinder) and you don't need to specify the cyls, heads and sectors "
"parameters which were rarely if ever used anyway."
msgstr ""
"Šī ir vienkāršota saskarne komandai C<guestfs_sfdisk>, kur nodalījumu izmēri "
"norādīti tikai megabaitos (noapaļoti līdz tuvākajam cilindram), un nav "
"jānorāda parametri cyls, heads un sectors, kas tik un tā tika izmantoti "
"reti, ja vispār."

#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:14500
msgid ""
"See also: C<guestfs_sfdisk>, the L<sfdisk(8)> manpage and "
"C<guestfs_part_disk>"
msgstr ""
"Skatīt arī: C<guestfs_sfdisk>, L<sfdisk(8)> rokasgrāmatas lapu un "
"C<guestfs_part_disk>"

