#. type: textblock
#: lib/guestfs-actions.pod:14644
msgid ""
"This is the same as C<guestfs_sh>, but streams the output back, handling the "
"case where the output from the command is larger than the protocol limit."
msgstr ""
"Tas ir tas pats, kas C<guestfs_sh>, bet straumē izvadi atpakaļ, apstrādājot "
"gadījumu, kad komandas izvade ir lielāka par protokola ierobežojumu."

